      <data key="v_content">Dudley!&quot;He,&apos;Atta boy, Dudley!&quot; He ruffled Dudley&apos;s hair.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b4310b5bb366c27e3bd2c34a4ef5a72e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n1538">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c865626f190a8089bef7db02463a4a85</data>
      <data key="v_content">At that moment the telephone rang and Aunt Petunia went to answer it
while Harry and Uncle Vernon watched Dudley unwrap the racing bike, a
video camera, a remote control airplane, sixteen new computer games, and
a VCR.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c865626f190a8089bef7db02463a4a85</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n1539">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-40aeced59d0a5f6ddee0dd38f53a145f</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was ripping the paper off a gold wristwatch when Aunt Petunia
came back from the telephone looking both angry and worried.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-40aeced59d0a5f6ddee0dd38f53a145f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n1540">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5c47979f7916d17e172384d4839eec30</data>
      <data key="v_content">She can&apos;t
take him.&quot; She jerked her head in Harry&apos;s direction.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5c47979f7916d17e172384d4839eec30</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n1541">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3436e4bc777c1e75630e6647fb13a88b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dudley&apos;s mouth fell open in horror, but Harry&apos;s heart gave a leap.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3436e4bc777c1e75630e6647fb13a88b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n1542">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f172a21589b9d5a48b742fc5fe0d9035</data>
      <data key="v_content">Every
year on Dudley&apos;s birthday, his parents took him and a friend out for the
day, to adventure parks, hamburger restaurants, or the movies.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f172a21589b9d5a48b742fc5fe0d9035</data>
    </node>
