      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-90c893817e1c7c87f99b4f140f6e69f5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And have you really got -- you know...&quot;
He pointed at Harry&apos;s forehead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-90c893817e1c7c87f99b4f140f6e69f5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2548">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-29a38af9089d0bb7dbede733afaa9f89</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry pulled back his bangs to show the lightning scar.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-29a38af9089d0bb7dbede733afaa9f89</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2549">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5a902c8f4cda03b8bddaf40263e87b7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So that&apos;s where You-Know-Who
&quot;Yes,&quot; said Harry, &quot;but I can&apos;t remember it.&quot;
&quot;Nothing?&quot; said Ron eagerly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5a902c8f4cda03b8bddaf40263e87b7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2550">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7cb912132b1d51827ea1846ea3a7acdb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Well -- I remember a lot of green light, but nothing else.&quot;
&quot;Wow,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7cb912132b1d51827ea1846ea3a7acdb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2551">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e268dfc670a501a59934bb55b2c70b6a</data>
      <data key="v_content">He sat and stared at Harry for a few moments, then, as
though he had suddenly realized what he was doing, he looked quickly out
of the window again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e268dfc670a501a59934bb55b2c70b6a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2552">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7cd7f63602d261a1b68b48e49c3ef513</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Are all your family wizards?&quot; asked Harry, who found Ron just as
interesting as Ron found him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7cd7f63602d261a1b68b48e49c3ef513</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2553">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-be38763bd591b8b0bb4059d6c5f62b68</data>
      <data key="v_content">I,&quot;Er -- Yes, I think so,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-be38763bd591b8b0bb4059d6c5f62b68</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2554">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eb2faa8dc45ed701a681fff1027525ad</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I think Mom&apos;s got a second cousin
who&apos;s an accountant, but we never talk about him.&quot;
&quot;So you must know loads of magic already.&quot;
The Weasleys were clearly one of those old wizarding families the pale
boy in Diagon Alley had talked about.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eb2faa8dc45ed701a681fff1027525ad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2555">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa58e3a3bc21f0b086b1592804e4bb35</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I heard you went to live with Muggles,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa58e3a3bc21f0b086b1592804e4bb35</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2556">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-16d266674529823e176eb291eb6300da</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What are they like?&quot;
&quot;Horrible -well, not all of them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-16d266674529823e176eb291eb6300da</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2557">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-42d11e5d2af123fc2de5af8aac235cc1</data>
      <data key="v_content">My aunt and uncle and cousin are,
though.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-42d11e5d2af123fc2de5af8aac235cc1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2558">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d8f9d1c8eb346d858b737bd01ef6c62a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Wish I&apos;d had three wizard brothers.&quot;
79
&quot;Five,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d8f9d1c8eb346d858b737bd01ef6c62a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2559">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f9a68c35edce49e78c11be72792ea446</data>
      <data key="v_content">he,For some reason, he was looking gloomy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f9a68c35edce49e78c11be72792ea446</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2560">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-30dae9e18f7c7bd43ae2b2d82f4e12bb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;m the sixth
in our family to go to Hogwarts.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-30dae9e18f7c7bd43ae2b2d82f4e12bb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2561">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fef66cf5e2b155938826fd6391840108</data>
      <data key="v_content">You could say I&apos;ve got a lot to live up
to.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fef66cf5e2b155938826fd6391840108</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2562">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-95e5488cc21d400d7dc616ee5dc0ba94</data>
      <data key="v_content">Bill and Charlie have already left -- Bill was head boy and Charlie
was captain of Quidditch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-95e5488cc21d400d7dc616ee5dc0ba94</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2563">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-400e92fdf5e2c97f7d6527b1a42d01a7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Fred and George mess
around a lot, but they still get really good marks and everyone thinks
they&apos;re really funny.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-400e92fdf5e2c97f7d6527b1a42d01a7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2564">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-070058f469982a7a82ba0b620b74146c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Everyone expects me to do as well as the others,
but if I do, it&apos;s no big deal, because they did it first.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-070058f469982a7a82ba0b620b74146c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2565">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2cdc6c3c64eaef5d80f34ec90733074c</data>
      <data key="v_content">You never get
anything new, either, with five brothers.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2cdc6c3c64eaef5d80f34ec90733074c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2566">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-91581d7819382b2f6361f81e281c42c0</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;ve got Bill&apos;s old robes,
Charlie&apos;s old wand, and Percy&apos;s old rat.&quot;
Ron reached inside his jacket and pulled out a fat gray rat, which was
asleep.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-91581d7819382b2f6361f81e281c42c0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2567">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-48deefd6c43934f23bcfb9cde47c86c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;His name&apos;s Scabbers and he&apos;s useless, he hardly ever wakes up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-48deefd6c43934f23bcfb9cde47c86c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2568">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9ef90dd56e0138122fcf6fc761be9c1a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Percy
got an owl from my dad for being made a prefect, but they couldn&apos;t aff
-- I mean, I got Scabbers instead.&quot;
Ron&apos;s ears went pink.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9ef90dd56e0138122fcf6fc761be9c1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2569">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-83337e733100cb3ee720d0cd2142396b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He seemed to think he&apos;d said too much, because he
went back to staring out of the window.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-83337e733100cb3ee720d0cd2142396b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2570">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-454dd56d77d7c945f8127f646354be6d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry didn&apos;t think there was anything wrong with not being able to
afford an owl.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-454dd56d77d7c945f8127f646354be6d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2571">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-426219f2e8c2605959e68c1cb691615d</data>
      <data key="v_content">he&apos;dnever,After all, he&apos;d never had any money in his life until a
month ago, and he told Ron so, all about having to wear Dudley&apos;s old
clothes and never getting proper birthday presents.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-426219f2e8c2605959e68c1cb691615d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2572">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-26c3326dfdc1189d2e38379a722a763a</data>
      <data key="v_content">This seemed to cheer
Ron up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-26c3326dfdc1189d2e38379a722a763a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2573">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7119df83751870e14553a0de32bdbea6</data>
      <data key="v_content">and until Hagrid told me, I didn&apos;t know anything about be ing a
wizard or about my parents or Voldemort&quot;
Ron gasped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7119df83751870e14553a0de32bdbea6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2574">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-579244928007f6eae397200a8e6f53c3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You said You-Know-Who&apos;s name!&quot; said Ron, sounding both shocked and
impressed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-579244928007f6eae397200a8e6f53c3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2575">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a88170221ba3f610930aefbdab46a05c</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;I&apos;d have thought you, of all people --&quot;
&quot;I&apos;m not trying to be brave or anything, saying the name,&quot; said Harry, I
just never knew you shouldn&apos;t.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a88170221ba3f610930aefbdab46a05c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2576">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d5416e414e712b1a5b7a85313da56440</data>
      <data key="v_content">See what I mean? I&apos;ve got loads to
learn....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d5416e414e712b1a5b7a85313da56440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2577">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aeaeecb23fd4deacf4f54acf6d52b2b4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;headded,,I bet,&quot; he added, voicing for the first time something that
had been worrying him a lot lately, &quot;I bet I&apos;m the worst in the class.&quot;
&quot;You won&apos;t be.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aeaeecb23fd4deacf4f54acf6d52b2b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2578">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3b57dde8dcd4e352715ea63451ee4bf5</data>
      <data key="v_content">There&apos;s loads of people who come from Muggle families and
they learn quick enough.&quot;
80
While they had been talking, the train had carried them out of London.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3b57dde8dcd4e352715ea63451ee4bf5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2579">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1f5a7d5d36c09c05d43bb7e6fbdd3d2d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Now they were speeding past fields full of cows and sheep.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1f5a7d5d36c09c05d43bb7e6fbdd3d2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2580">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4c71d953f1f610419cc6f415fcfbbaf4</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were
quiet for a time, watching the fields and lanes flick past.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4c71d953f1f610419cc6f415fcfbbaf4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2581">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-afbbf7c880c35ad716d38b3e0233e6a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Around half past twelve there was a great clattering outside in the
corridor and a smiling, dimpled woman slid back their door and said,
&quot;Anything off the cart, dears?&quot;
Harry, who hadn&apos;t had any breakfast, leapt to his feet, but Ron&apos;s ears
went pink again and he muttered that he&apos;d brought sandwiches.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-afbbf7c880c35ad716d38b3e0233e6a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2582">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5f8470d2178701ce4d56c2ea048ad95d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry went
out into the corridor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5f8470d2178701ce4d56c2ea048ad95d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2583">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5403bd4ddd2e5ec8dedfdfc1884c1b1c</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had never had any money for candy with the Dursleys, and now that he
had pockets rattling with gold and silver he was ready to buy as many
Mars Bars as he could carry -- but the woman didn&apos;t have Mars Bars.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5403bd4ddd2e5ec8dedfdfc1884c1b1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2584">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6d4dd8cb1ce6d409cf3cb5524883c9ff</data>
      <data key="v_content">What
she did have were Bettie Bott&apos;s Every Flavor Beans, Drooble&apos;s Best
Blowing Gum, Chocolate Frogs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6d4dd8cb1ce6d409cf3cb5524883c9ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2585">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-62b08a52f39847270688e3fce6ee9fda</data>
      <data key="v_content">CauldronCakes,,Pumpkin Pasties, Cauldron Cakes, Licorice
Wands, and a number of other strange things Harry had never seen in his
life.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-62b08a52f39847270688e3fce6ee9fda</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2586">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-85274e22850c3e55760ae573f01536fb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Not wanting to miss anything, he got some of everything and paid
the woman eleven silver Sickles and seven bronze Knuts.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-85274e22850c3e55760ae573f01536fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2587">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4508f21542683dc70ad1dfb40b09fa97</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron stared as Harry brought it all back in to the compartment and tipped
it onto an empty seat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4508f21542683dc70ad1dfb40b09fa97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2588">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-06181034e2ce807fdf735bf3439342ec</data>
      <data key="v_content">areyou?&quot;&quot;Starving,&quot;,&quot;Hungry, are you?&quot;
&quot;Starving,&quot; said Harry, taking a large bite out of a pumpkin pasty.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-06181034e2ce807fdf735bf3439342ec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2589">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bc0f9fe34f41a3250fda7b64ef577e15</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron had taken out a lumpy package and unwrapped it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bc0f9fe34f41a3250fda7b64ef577e15</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2590">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9d65281711d6fd7e3180fa41cad538c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">He pulled one of them apart and said, &quot;She always
forgets I don&apos;t like corned beef.&quot;
&quot;Swap you for one of these,&quot; said Harry, holding up a pasty.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9d65281711d6fd7e3180fa41cad538c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2591">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-feb6c451d086909a5603dc0bdafc0591</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Go on --&quot;
&quot;You don&apos;t want this, it&apos;s all dry,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-feb6c451d086909a5603dc0bdafc0591</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2592">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-973f85a43a229a116ffe12a0c516a772</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;She hasn&apos;t got much
time,&quot; he added quickly, &quot;you know, with five of us.&quot;
&quot;Go on, have a pasty,&quot; said Harry, who had never had anything to share
before or, indeed, anyone to share it with.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-973f85a43a229a116ffe12a0c516a772</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2593">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3804d14c1a62e4717bf7e53a51bbacf1</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was a nice feeling,
sitting there with Ron, eating their way through all Harry&apos;s pasties,
cakes, and candies (the sandwiches lay forgotten).</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3804d14c1a62e4717bf7e53a51bbacf1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2594">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-17a667355bd61f6c69d6781acd6a9243</data>
      <data key="v_content">81
&quot;What are these?&quot; Harry asked Ron, holding up a pack of Chocolate Frogs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-17a667355bd61f6c69d6781acd6a9243</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2595">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-97fc74e90ac3f70f36bb8c71a4f8de05</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;They&apos;re not really frogs, are they?&quot; He was starting to feel that
nothing would surprise him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-97fc74e90ac3f70f36bb8c71a4f8de05</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2596">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bf72080e10acc85b347760b5431017b9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But see what the card is.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bf72080e10acc85b347760b5431017b9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2597">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7d79bafb37f3c8284eb9a1500e37c6b2</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;m missing Agrippa.&quot;
&quot;What?&quot;
&quot;Oh, of course, you wouldn&apos;t know -- Chocolate Frogs have cards, inside
them, you know, to collect -- famous witches and wizards.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7d79bafb37f3c8284eb9a1500e37c6b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2598">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5c996f39fe07790a1961b69482901d8e</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;ve got about
five hundred, but I haven&apos;t got Agrippa or Ptolemy.&quot;
Harry unwrapped his Chocolate Frog and picked up the card.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5c996f39fe07790a1961b69482901d8e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2599">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-268444e501c09574f7b66d453d1762e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">He wore half- moon glasses, had a long, crooked nose, and
flowing silver hair, beard, and mustache.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-268444e501c09574f7b66d453d1762e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2600">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bef1c8cd67255d473ca8717c1b321134</data>
      <data key="v_content">Underneath the picture was the
name Albus Dumbledore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bef1c8cd67255d473ca8717c1b321134</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2601">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ad9606b4cb0ac830bd330989216bd9d2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So this is Dumbledore!&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ad9606b4cb0ac830bd330989216bd9d2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2602">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-26248c3d730f890e3c567769fbc4b5da</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Don&apos;t tell me you&apos;d never heard of Dumbledore!&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-26248c3d730f890e3c567769fbc4b5da</data>
    </node>
