      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-be464564b939ec08ab3b19e1024f8193</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Can I have a
frog? I might get Agrippa -- thanks
Harry turned over his card and read:
ALBUS DUMBLEDORE
CURRENTLY HEADMASTER OF HOGWARTS
Considered by many the greatest wizard of modern times, Dumbledore is
particularly famous for his defeat of the dark wizard Grindelwald in
1945, for the discovery of the twelve uses of dragon&apos;s blood, and his
