    <node id="n2658">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-97b675342b42e3636745dbaaa51e078a</data>
      <data key="v_content">I don&apos;t know what they&apos;ll say if I&apos;m not.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-97b675342b42e3636745dbaaa51e078a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2659">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-df8ddd0d559f5b2e3f3b6a4e4cd7bc25</data>
      <data key="v_content">I
don&apos;t suppose Ravenclaw would be too bad, but imagine if they put me in
Slytherin.&quot;
&quot;That&apos;s the house Vol-, I mean, You-Know-Who was in?&quot;
&quot;Yeah,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-df8ddd0d559f5b2e3f3b6a4e4cd7bc25</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2660">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9f96a3e1ac70007d10790b08baa2b88c</data>
      <data key="v_content">He flopped back into his seat, looking depressed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9f96a3e1ac70007d10790b08baa2b88c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2661">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd1e63d75b11e176e17990c257de7298</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ithink,&quot;You know, I think the ends of Scabbers&apos; whiskers are a bit lighter,&quot;
said Harry, trying to take Ron&apos;s mind off houses.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd1e63d75b11e176e17990c257de7298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2662">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7e803b447911ad70b33d7ebcfeb097e4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So what do your
oldest brothers do now that they&apos;ve left, anyway?&quot;
Harry was wondering what a wizard did once he&apos;d finished school.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7e803b447911ad70b33d7ebcfeb097e4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2663">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-62348e5dfe640a1e4643c0b4d66e3718</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Charlie&apos;s in Romania studying dragons, and Bill&apos;s in Africa doing
something for Gringotts,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-62348e5dfe640a1e4643c0b4d66e3718</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2664">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f09a45a27e1d849fd5002d5107fb6251</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Did you hear about
Gringotts? It&apos;s been all over the Daily Prophet, but I don&apos;t suppose you
get that with the Muggles -- someone tried to rob a high security
vault.&quot;
Harry stared.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f09a45a27e1d849fd5002d5107fb6251</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2665">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6e3bdda1f79fbdcfe1a68f5b5b91e404</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Really? What happened to them?&quot;
&quot;Nothing, that&apos;s why it&apos;s such big news.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6e3bdda1f79fbdcfe1a68f5b5b91e404</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2666">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5fd5fca59aae5b97469e1e1bc13a615a</data>
      <data key="v_content">My
dad says it must&apos;ve been a powerful Dark wizard to get round Gringotts,
but they don&apos;t think they took anything, that&apos;s what&apos;s odd.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5fd5fca59aae5b97469e1e1bc13a615a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2667">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-434f76ff5a5470e03f57fa75414075a2</data>
      <data key="v_content">everyonegetsscared,&apos;Course,
everyone gets scared when something like this happens in case
You-Know-Who&apos;s behind it.&quot;
Harry turned this news over in his mind.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-434f76ff5a5470e03f57fa75414075a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2668">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-82bc3eb6097a28fcce3d283b7c8383b0</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was starting to get a
prickle of fear every time You- Know-Who was mentioned.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-82bc3eb6097a28fcce3d283b7c8383b0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2669">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2d6d346ea799af9f1c0fc0ca8d98fd42</data>
      <data key="v_content">He supposed this
was all part of entering the magical world, but it had been a lot more
comfortable saying &quot;Voldemort&quot; without worrying.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2d6d346ea799af9f1c0fc0ca8d98fd42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2670">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1a4852d1eff02c8748c3e3b09eb4a607</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What&apos;s your Quidditch team?&quot; Ron asked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1a4852d1eff02c8748c3e3b09eb4a607</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2671">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-da6236068f8e44cacdd51dbaf884044f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Er -- I don&apos;t know any,&quot; Harry confessed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-da6236068f8e44cacdd51dbaf884044f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2672">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ed2eefc995bae1836ee46d7e459d27b4</data>
      <data key="v_content">youwait,it&apos;s,&quot;Oh, you wait, it&apos;s the best game in the
86
world --&quot; And he was off, explaining all about the four balls and the
positions of the seven players, describing famous games he&apos;d been to
with his brothers and the broomstick he&apos;d like to get if he had the
money.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ed2eefc995bae1836ee46d7e459d27b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2673">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-43e93da6847c36ae8bf61a2002b0fd90</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was just taking Harry through the finer points of the game
when the compartment door slid open yet again, but it wasn&apos;t Neville the
toadless boy, or Hermione Granger this time.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-43e93da6847c36ae8bf61a2002b0fd90</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2674">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3a5a798c925f686b98030e8ff7ae0bb8</data>
      <data key="v_content">and,Three boys entered, and Harry recognized the middle one at once: it was
the pale boy from Madam Malkin&apos;s robe shop.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3a5a798c925f686b98030e8ff7ae0bb8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2675">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-260e42ef68660e44dbb9b636355ac86e</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was looking at Harry with
a lot more interest than he&apos;d shown back in Diagon Alley.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-260e42ef68660e44dbb9b636355ac86e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2676">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c500dbe36f8f89c7b08041695c5deee0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;They&apos;re saying all down the train that Harry
Potter&apos;s in this compartment.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c500dbe36f8f89c7b08041695c5deee0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2677">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b4f0c976618413c6a4060cbdf01597f3</data>
      <data key="v_content">is,So it&apos;s you, is it?&quot;
&quot;Yes,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b4f0c976618413c6a4060cbdf01597f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2678">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-48dfd6c7a333efe4a109648d7b3ce63c</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was looking at the other boys.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-48dfd6c7a333efe4a109648d7b3ce63c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2679">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2903076fa68f3774feadfe6e9e288777</data>
      <data key="v_content">Both of them were
thickset and looked extremely mean.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2903076fa68f3774feadfe6e9e288777</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2680">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-502a51e3186f2195ecaaf53687239e9a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Standing on either side of the pale
boy, they looked like bodyguards.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-502a51e3186f2195ecaaf53687239e9a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2681">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5c85d4580aab83e005b7564c9309a2f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">thisisCrabbe,&quot;Oh, this is Crabbe and this is Goyle,&quot; said the pale boy carelessly,
noticing where Harry was looking.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5c85d4580aab83e005b7564c9309a2f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2682">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eb0501e2a925a28a2607d67b0a226dc3</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;And my name&apos;s Malfoy, Draco Malfoy.&quot;
Ron gave a slight cough, which might have been hiding a snigget.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eb0501e2a925a28a2607d67b0a226dc3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2683">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-13b182a77501a69357f4390f078815e2</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Think my name&apos;s funny, do you? No need to ask who you are.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-13b182a77501a69357f4390f078815e2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2684">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-41ed98b489d5c6aaceaeed6bd447afd0</data>
      <data key="v_content">My father
told me all the Weasleys have red hair, freckles, and more children than
they can afford.&quot;
He turned back to Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-41ed98b489d5c6aaceaeed6bd447afd0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2685">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d9881a2f22623341ef2e5547a1d34076</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;ll soon find out some wizarding families
are much better than others, Potter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d9881a2f22623341ef2e5547a1d34076</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2686">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-76b13357c6be99e6ab48dc77cfb90f95</data>
      <data key="v_content">You don&apos;t want to go making friends
with the wrong sort.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-76b13357c6be99e6ab48dc77cfb90f95</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2687">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-58be97b6abbd8630d6a505685ffeab98</data>
      <data key="v_content">I can help you there.&quot;
He held out his hand to shake Harry&apos;s, but Harry didn&apos;t take it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-58be97b6abbd8630d6a505685ffeab98</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2688">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-433df82c56c0d25581d906fa729ff9eb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I think I can tell who the wrong sort are for myself, thanks,&quot; he said
coolly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-433df82c56c0d25581d906fa729ff9eb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2689">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca60fbaf2471a7e6723f8e6de33dbf72</data>
      <data key="v_content">Draco Malfoy didn&apos;t go red, but a pink tinge appeared in his pale
cheeks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca60fbaf2471a7e6723f8e6de33dbf72</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2690">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bea109be9752808fc832e323713ed17c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;d be careful if I were you, Potter,&quot; he said slowly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bea109be9752808fc832e323713ed17c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2691">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-818dc8dbeaeb98425488b9dd266cb59c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Unless you&apos;re a
bit politer you&apos;ll go the same way as your parents.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-818dc8dbeaeb98425488b9dd266cb59c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2692">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d476b4cc12a6d5fac70d103d7e84b623</data>
      <data key="v_content">They didn&apos;t know
what was good for them, either.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d476b4cc12a6d5fac70d103d7e84b623</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2693">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bca1c04206ef0ba43006e49131632b7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">You hang around with riffraff like the
87
Weasleys and that Hagrid, and it&apos;ll rub off on you.&quot;
Both Harry and Ron stood up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bca1c04206ef0ba43006e49131632b7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2694">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-23be8b8d4c31dbc15ca28a810af33949</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ron,&quot;Say that again,&quot; Ron said, his face as red as his hair.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-23be8b8d4c31dbc15ca28a810af33949</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2695">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f5dcf94ff5eed2cb90f721e387d7891f</data>
      <data key="v_content">you&apos;regoingto,&quot;Oh, you&apos;re going to fight us, are you?&quot; Malfoy sneered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f5dcf94ff5eed2cb90f721e387d7891f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2696">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa6fb97d02a54b1e9e807c35baa115b7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Unless you get out now,&quot; said Harry, more bravely than he felt, because
Crabbe and Goyle were a lot bigger than him or Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa6fb97d02a54b1e9e807c35baa115b7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2697">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-92ce43c9247778c8ea1599c5b8990db3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But we don&apos;t feet like leaving, do we, boys? We&apos;ve eaten all our food
and you still seem to have some.&quot;
Goyle reached toward the Chocolate Frogs next to Ron - Ron leapt
forward, but before he&apos;d so much as touched Goyle, Goyle let out a
horrible yell.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-92ce43c9247778c8ea1599c5b8990db3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2698">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1c05750e57d925afef2b0aecb9dbe45f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Scabbers the rat was hanging off his finger, sharp little teeth sunk
deep into Goyle&apos;s knuckle - Crabbe and Malfoy backed away as Goyle swung
Scabbers round and round, howling, and when Scabbets finally flew off
and hit the window, all three of them disappeared at once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1c05750e57d925afef2b0aecb9dbe45f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2699">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aa903ad089dcf48008c1e7976700f140</data>
      <data key="v_content">Perhaps they
thought there were more rats lurking among the sweets, or perhaps they&apos;d
heard footsteps, because a second later, Hermione Granger had come in.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aa903ad089dcf48008c1e7976700f140</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2700">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-78ca4b84ae5de5180e1715cb08571e02</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What has been going on?&quot; she said, looking at the sweets all over the
floor and Ron picking up Scabbers by his tail.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-78ca4b84ae5de5180e1715cb08571e02</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2701">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-55f99deb14b1caf5195db03fd365f4df</data>
      <data key="v_content">I think he&apos;s been knocked out,&quot; Ron said to Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-55f99deb14b1caf5195db03fd365f4df</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2702">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-de84444b32ba52c12056e5a8b1780602</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;No -- I don&apos;t believe it -- he&apos;s gone back to sleep-&quot;
And so he had.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-de84444b32ba52c12056e5a8b1780602</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2703">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-da459cc5898beb76d73cc557efa7516e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;ve met Malfoy before?&quot;
Harry explained about their meeting in Diagon Alley.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-da459cc5898beb76d73cc557efa7516e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2704">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e923aecba5b4bd7826bb95c986070013</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;ve heard of his family,&quot; said Ron darkly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e923aecba5b4bd7826bb95c986070013</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2705">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-881b7b086bd37918155a8a5c62cffac3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;They were some of the
first to come back to our side after You-Know-Who disappeared.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-881b7b086bd37918155a8a5c62cffac3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2706">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0d296904ff3827303ca9e37934305547</data>
      <data key="v_content">He says Malfoy&apos;s
father didn&apos;t need an excuse to go over to the Dark Side.&quot; He turned to
Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0d296904ff3827303ca9e37934305547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2707">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a12c0393f5d5928aeb336fc734aaddcf</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Can we help you with something?&quot;
88
&quot;You&apos;d better hurry up and put your robes on, I&apos;ve just been up to the
front to ask the conductor, and he says we&apos;re nearly there.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a12c0393f5d5928aeb336fc734aaddcf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2708">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8aa714fdabf49aacd07849919f0ac493</data>
      <data key="v_content">,You haven&apos;t
been fighting, have you? You&apos;ll be in trouble before we even get there!&quot;
&quot;Scabbers has been fighting, not us,&quot; said Ron, scowling at her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8aa714fdabf49aacd07849919f0ac493</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2709">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8958eae83f278698bd90e4aeb39bb0ae</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Would
you mind leaving while we change?&quot;
&quot;All right -- I only came in here because people outside are behaving
very childishly, racing up and down the corridors,&quot; said Hermione in a
sniffy voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8958eae83f278698bd90e4aeb39bb0ae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2710">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f21d5bf5cc675f183b1afb003c54c1d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And you&apos;ve got dirt on your nose, by the way, did you
know?&quot;
Ron glared at her as she left.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f21d5bf5cc675f183b1afb003c54c1d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2711">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e861f5cbb863c6339ec8f0b5e443c738</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry peered out of the window.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e861f5cbb863c6339ec8f0b5e443c738</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2712">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ef72422ce4911299195919cd88dd128a</data>
      <data key="v_content">He could see mountains and forests under a deep purple
sky.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ef72422ce4911299195919cd88dd128a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2713">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c4553707c4460cc58608ff825e3ab7af</data>
      <data key="v_content">The train did seem to be slowing down.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c4553707c4460cc58608ff825e3ab7af</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2714">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9f98593c4bbacbf946a20cf068f8a624</data>
      <data key="v_content">He and Ron took off their jackets and pulled on their long black robes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9f98593c4bbacbf946a20cf068f8a624</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2715">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6b4ef3554698fb6c88a443bc69fd6414</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron&apos;s were a bit short for him, you could see his sneakers underneath
them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6b4ef3554698fb6c88a443bc69fd6414</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2716">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1ede6fcde9ece8b72b6b44e02a681b8e</data>
      <data key="v_content">A voice echoed through the train: &quot;We will be reaching Hogwarts in five
minutes&apos; time.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1ede6fcde9ece8b72b6b44e02a681b8e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2717">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9bbb5967fc91a6501087f91b6c0a891a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Please leave your luggage on the train, it will be taken
to the school separately.&quot;
Harry&apos;s stomach lurched with nerves and Ron, he saw, looked pale under
his freckles.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9bbb5967fc91a6501087f91b6c0a891a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2718">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-149be410822ab51d320f7a97df0ce7d2</data>
      <data key="v_content">They crammed their pockets with the last of the sweets and
joined the crowd thronging the corridor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-149be410822ab51d320f7a97df0ce7d2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2719">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1a6caceb9548f852f1b79ed667ff2efc</data>
      <data key="v_content">The train slowed right down and finally stopped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1a6caceb9548f852f1b79ed667ff2efc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2720">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c2753be94c4ee142ac0c3d2e00b1953d</data>
      <data key="v_content">People pushed their way
toward the door and out on to a tiny, dark platform.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c2753be94c4ee142ac0c3d2e00b1953d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2721">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-68510abde56716623635181a4c15cee6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry shivered in
the cold night air.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-68510abde56716623635181a4c15cee6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2722">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-87eeedcdd4db7723642deb030c6dd922</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then a lamp came bobbing over the heads of the
students, and Harry heard a familiar voice: &quot;Firs&apos; years! Firs&apos; years
over here! All right there, Harry?&quot;
Hagrid&apos;s big hairy face beamed over the sea of heads.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-87eeedcdd4db7723642deb030c6dd922</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2723">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bac00f9d6a3a358c42bd457cc9f0bba9</data>
      <data key="v_content">followme--,&quot;C&apos;mon, follow me -- any more firs&apos; years? Mind yer step, now! Firs&apos;
years follow me!&quot;
Slipping and stumbling, they followed Hagrid down what seemed to be a
steep, narrow path.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bac00f9d6a3a358c42bd457cc9f0bba9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2724">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-00d032444ba495e55ffe21f547df40f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was so dark on either side of them that Harry
thought there must be thick trees there.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-00d032444ba495e55ffe21f547df40f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2725">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cfa09432c70ff673c44e47cc5d3aed6f</data>
      <data key="v_content">theboywho,Neville, the
boy who kept losing his toad, sniffed once or twice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cfa09432c70ff673c44e47cc5d3aed6f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2726">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a12c5c118c6841c2fc6b69d3cb6a0c25</data>
      <data key="v_content">89
&quot;Ye&apos; all get yer firs&apos; sight o&apos; Hogwarts in a sec,&quot; Hagrid called over
his shoulder, &quot;jus&apos; round this bend here.&quot;
There was a loud &quot;Oooooh!&quot;
The narrow path had opened suddenly onto the edge of a great black take.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a12c5c118c6841c2fc6b69d3cb6a0c25</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2727">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3691f5da5ee8f4c08b72afefbdf426c1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Perched atop a high mountain on the other side, its windows sparkling in
the starry sky, was a vast castle with many turrets and towers.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3691f5da5ee8f4c08b72afefbdf426c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2728">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5d986c341430c2dd885c0a684f40def5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;No more&apos;n four to a boat!&quot; Hagrid called, pointing to a fleet of little
boats sitting in the water by the shore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5d986c341430c2dd885c0a684f40def5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2729">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f4bbccd87904b77328929d8a78149395</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Ron were followed
into their boat by Neville and Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f4bbccd87904b77328929d8a78149395</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2730">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-efd259f07cf8b3ec6f1a086037b3afe9</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Everyone in?&quot; shouted Hagrid,
who had a boat to himself.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-efd259f07cf8b3ec6f1a086037b3afe9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2731">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-485feefac3009f4fdb5dffe0ece7a954</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Right then -- FORWARD!&quot;
And the fleet of little boats moved off all at once, gliding across the
lake, which was as smooth as glass.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-485feefac3009f4fdb5dffe0ece7a954</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2732">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-688b2fe756f7a1040d64dbd7ae120954</data>
      <data key="v_content">staring,Everyone was silent, staring up at
the great castle overhead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-688b2fe756f7a1040d64dbd7ae120954</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2733">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-34e5095430db4f4ecdcd187e4a7202d0</data>
      <data key="v_content">It towered over them as they sailed nearer
and nearer to the cliff on which it stood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-34e5095430db4f4ecdcd187e4a7202d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2734">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5e4378543dd09ff817eade6775ea7065</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Heads down!&quot; yelled Hagrid as the first boats reached the cliff; they
all bent their heads and the little boats carried them through a curtain
of ivy that hid a wide opening in the cliff face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5e4378543dd09ff817eade6775ea7065</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2735">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7afe1139bb8c6ed2f7309835aa5c22b4</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were carried
along a dark tunnel, which seemed to be taking them right underneath the
castle, until they reached a kind of underground harbor, where they
clambered out onto rocks and pebbles.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7afe1139bb8c6ed2f7309835aa5c22b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2736">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ede9c3f88fcfc4c46cef15e7e3e6ec10</data>
      <data key="v_content">youthere!Is,&quot;Oy, you there! Is this your toad?&quot; said Hagrid, who was checking the
boats as people climbed out of them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ede9c3f88fcfc4c46cef15e7e3e6ec10</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2737">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c0dbee1e2bca9a84e5ba498c8ae43352</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Trevor!&quot; cried Neville blissfully, holding out his hands.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c0dbee1e2bca9a84e5ba498c8ae43352</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2738">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-487f87f61476345249d0525aca4fdec6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then they
clambered up a passageway in the rock after Hagrid&apos;s lamp, coming out at
last onto smooth, damp grass right in the shadow of the castle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-487f87f61476345249d0525aca4fdec6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2739">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bab5c6d13cf8c870ee0e62abcf4a5b09</data>
      <data key="v_content">They walked up a flight of stone steps and crowded around the huge, Oak
front door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bab5c6d13cf8c870ee0e62abcf4a5b09</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2740">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-81dc06155b619b8c5c4965cb4d699183</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Everyone here? You there, still got yer toad?&quot;
Hagrid raised a gigantic fist and knocked three times on the castle
door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-81dc06155b619b8c5c4965cb4d699183</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2741">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4edec8715c25f5cad38029e22fa223dc</data>
      <data key="v_content">90
CHAPTER SEVEN
THE SORTING HAT
The door swung open at once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4edec8715c25f5cad38029e22fa223dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2742">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9ca47114a17ebdddfd29d4b687fb3b6e</data>
      <data key="v_content">black-hairedwitch,A tall, black-haired witch in emerald-green
robes stood there.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9ca47114a17ebdddfd29d4b687fb3b6e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2743">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-05bc117cecdca32661a54be7b974454e</data>
      <data key="v_content">She had a very stern face and Harry&apos;s first thought
was that this was not someone to cross.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-05bc117cecdca32661a54be7b974454e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2744">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-52e729cc2de5974d7bfd66c02ffd8f2b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor,&quot;The firs&apos; years, Professor McGonagall,&quot; said Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-52e729cc2de5974d7bfd66c02ffd8f2b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2745">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-216536e23881400595ac8061160af5d6</data>
      <data key="v_content">I will take them from here.&quot;
She pulled the door wide.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-216536e23881400595ac8061160af5d6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2746">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3236b15a73e74cf54cf19df6fc71646b</data>
      <data key="v_content">The entrance hall was so big you could have
fit the whole of the Dursleys&apos; house in it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3236b15a73e74cf54cf19df6fc71646b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2747">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d122b530781ac2b6214ebf2cbb6ed65a</data>
      <data key="v_content">The stone walls were lit
with flaming torches like the ones at Gringotts, the ceiling was too
high to make out, and a magnificent marble staircase facing them led to
the upper floors.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d122b530781ac2b6214ebf2cbb6ed65a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2748">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f0e01b03190379cc552b168496af0221</data>
      <data key="v_content">They followed Professor McGonagall across the flagged stone floor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f0e01b03190379cc552b168496af0221</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2749">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3dc2991edcf9220168c92ecffdbeed13</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry
could hear the drone of hundreds of voices from a doorway to the right
-the rest of the school must already be here -- but Professor McGonagall
showed the first years into a small, empty chamber off the hall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3dc2991edcf9220168c92ecffdbeed13</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2750">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-607aefec89c92c4480b3e9899d2250e2</data>
      <data key="v_content">standing,They
crowded in, standing rather closer together than they would usually have
done, peering about nervously.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-607aefec89c92c4480b3e9899d2250e2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2751">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d49768c9ac00f67623fed94f586acba2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;said,&quot;Welcome to Hogwarts,&quot; said Professor McGonagall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d49768c9ac00f67623fed94f586acba2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2752">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d5f6fde94fab00ef53fb75f3abaf0c88</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The start-of-term
banquet will begin shortly, but before you take your seats in the Great
Hall, you will be sorted into your houses.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d5f6fde94fab00ef53fb75f3abaf0c88</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2753">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-228fa663acd65a31759b88b4bca2b211</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Sorting is a very
important ceremony because, while you are here, your house will be
something like your family within Hogwarts.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-228fa663acd65a31759b88b4bca2b211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2754">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4325e822369bf368b408651ba7c865d8</data>
      <data key="v_content">You will have classes with
the rest of your house, sleep in your house dormitory, and spend free
time in your house common room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4325e822369bf368b408651ba7c865d8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2755">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ffa565999ddf122f32b562dd9c8d0e9a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The four houses are called Gryffindor, Hufflepuff, Ravenclaw, and
Slytherin.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ffa565999ddf122f32b562dd9c8d0e9a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2756">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-43858b8634c1c7b2dc4b615810b740c4</data>
      <data key="v_content">Each house has its own noble history and each has produced
outstanding witches and wizards.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-43858b8634c1c7b2dc4b615810b740c4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2757">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f1e54b66aa919a9b5177846a8769487b</data>
      <data key="v_content">While you are at Hogwarts, your
triumphs will earn your house points, while any rulebreaking will lose
house points.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f1e54b66aa919a9b5177846a8769487b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2758">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-92672f87f0bcf2acf7178ebf9384b718</data>
      <data key="v_content">At the end of the year, the house with the most points is
awarded the house cup, a great honor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-92672f87f0bcf2acf7178ebf9384b718</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2759">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-915435bb5496c396d4c9197abfa46397</data>
      <data key="v_content">I hope each of you will be a
credit to whichever house becomes yours.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-915435bb5496c396d4c9197abfa46397</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2760">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-294a3d643a73adfb50cef39a3882ad4b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The Sorting Ceremony will take place in a few minutes in front of the
rest of the school.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-294a3d643a73adfb50cef39a3882ad4b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2761">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bbae3aa00c802753881f93faf5cc7308</data>
      <data key="v_content">I suggest you all smarten yourselves up as much as
91
you can while you are waiting.&quot;
Her eyes lingered for a moment on Neville&apos;s cloak, which was fastened
under his left ear, and on Ron&apos;s smudged nose.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bbae3aa00c802753881f93faf5cc7308</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2762">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-128b2a3260930b395ce8b46727716f54</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry nervously tried to
flatten his hair.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-128b2a3260930b395ce8b46727716f54</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2763">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-64ba9a7785aeacc3a2a4b19bcee12067</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I shall return when we are ready for you,&quot; said Professor McGonagall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-64ba9a7785aeacc3a2a4b19bcee12067</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2764">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b9c04adcb74e746228e1709691f1d7f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Please wait quietly.&quot;
She left the chamber.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b9c04adcb74e746228e1709691f1d7f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2765">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f5056dca5674a348c97b5f109112cee1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;How exactly do they sort us into houses?&quot; he asked Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f5056dca5674a348c97b5f109112cee1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2766">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c4ba5e18e6efd4e82763d3690527cb01</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Some sort of test, I think.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c4ba5e18e6efd4e82763d3690527cb01</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2767">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-52482f6bbf520de48b3e6a6b5ef1290a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Fred said it hurts a lot, but I think he
was joking.&quot;
Harry&apos;s heart gave a horrible jolt.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-52482f6bbf520de48b3e6a6b5ef1290a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2768">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-94db655254278f0a2ecd90addef5ef1c</data>
      <data key="v_content">A test? In front of the whole
school? But he didn&apos;t know any magic yet -- what on earth would he have
to do? He hadn&apos;t expected something like this the moment they arrived.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-94db655254278f0a2ecd90addef5ef1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2769">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d7e16431a8a70d7eb274bae1664d99e0</data>
      <data key="v_content">He looked around anxiously and saw that everyone else looked terrified,
too.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d7e16431a8a70d7eb274bae1664d99e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2770">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9441140ee806130c981074084674c767</data>
      <data key="v_content">No one was talking much except Hermione Granger, who was whispering
very fast about all the spells she&apos;d learned and wondering which one
she&apos;d need.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9441140ee806130c981074084674c767</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2771">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3079e03734b0b8bf543d7b846a1c5970</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry tried hard not to listen to her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3079e03734b0b8bf543d7b846a1c5970</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2772">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f307cf36a82c886146dd26b5ac5a6424</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;d never been more
nervous, never, not even when he&apos;d had to take a school report home to
the Dursleys saying that he&apos;d somehow turned his teacher&apos;s wig blue.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f307cf36a82c886146dd26b5ac5a6424</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2773">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-faee7d144544d9982ee58d01b9ca0a97</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
kept his eyes fixed on the door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-faee7d144544d9982ee58d01b9ca0a97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2774">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-93d06ceacbd75f2d8ae8205c731673dc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor,Any second now, Professor McGonagall
would come back and lead him to his doom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-93d06ceacbd75f2d8ae8205c731673dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2775">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8eeac7056e45a99fe872ba597b8aa1ed</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then something happened that made him jump about a foot in the air --
several people behind him screamed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8eeac7056e45a99fe872ba597b8aa1ed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2776">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3d95026982d63c1d97f3474583dda93e</data>
      <data key="v_content">So did the people around him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3d95026982d63c1d97f3474583dda93e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2777">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2ce475bad5a373ee14ee5bb222b91007</data>
      <data key="v_content">About twenty ghosts had just
streamed through the back wall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2ce475bad5a373ee14ee5bb222b91007</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2778">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd393563bb226c7f63e6cf70e1089691</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Pearly-white and slightly transparent,
they glided across the room talking to one another and hardly glancing
at the first years.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd393563bb226c7f63e6cf70e1089691</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2779">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a6e43db16725aaaadc0ca45c59c418e8</data>
      <data key="v_content">What looked like a fat
little monk was saying: &quot;Forgive and forget, I say, we ought to give him
a second chance --&quot;
&quot;My dear Friar, haven&apos;t we given Peeves all the chances he deserves? He
gives us all a bad name and you know, he&apos;s not really even a ghost -- I
say, what are you all doing here?&quot;
92
A ghost wearing a ruff and tights had suddenly noticed the first years.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a6e43db16725aaaadc0ca45c59c418e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2780">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a52e59ac167a6b9f62a1c22477b2cf83</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;New students!&quot; said the Fat Friar, smiling around at them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a52e59ac167a6b9f62a1c22477b2cf83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2781">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-953b177ddad7255dc90a36d721092b0c</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;About to be
Sorted, I suppose?&quot;
A few people nodded mutely.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-953b177ddad7255dc90a36d721092b0c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2782">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-de6864d6ac60bffd6030734746e732db</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Hope to see you in Hufflepuff!&quot; said the Friar.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-de6864d6ac60bffd6030734746e732db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2783">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1d2bba466753a1023aa7c6abe7320b24</data>
      <data key="v_content">you,&quot;My old house, you
know.&quot;
&quot;Move along now,&quot; said a sharp voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1d2bba466753a1023aa7c6abe7320b24</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2784">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-73a9302d293219351a5b3efb4fc9b390</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The Sorting Ceremony&apos;s about to
start.&quot;
Professor McGonagall had returned.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-73a9302d293219351a5b3efb4fc9b390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2785">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dd3e0806ed45ca5b7366d56a7edb783b</data>
      <data key="v_content">the,One by one, the ghosts floated away
through the opposite wall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dd3e0806ed45ca5b7366d56a7edb783b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2786">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-64ac4b82ef3e5bb930d865fdc234646b</data>
      <data key="v_content">formaline,&quot;,&quot;Now, form a line,&quot; Professor McGonagall told the first years, &quot;and
follow me.&quot;
Feeling oddly as though his legs had turned to lead, Harry got into line
behind a boy with sandy hair, with Ron behind him, and they walked out
of the chamber, back across the hall, and through a pair of double doors
into the Great Hall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-64ac4b82ef3e5bb930d865fdc234646b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2787">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bfb58b90cedb8de58b1a20b82edf473d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had never even imagined such a strange and splendid place.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bfb58b90cedb8de58b1a20b82edf473d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2788">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a346cb803cd1afb18b8dc45817856ca7</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was
lit by thousands and thousands of candles that were floating in midair
over four long tables, where the rest of the students were sitting.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a346cb803cd1afb18b8dc45817856ca7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2789">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1f8b1bd25f48006ed01240f5575d41e2</data>
      <data key="v_content">These tables were laid with glittering golden plates and goblets.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1f8b1bd25f48006ed01240f5575d41e2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2790">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0a78622a4d75b0d96903d17b4a198cf4</data>
      <data key="v_content">At the
top of the hall was another long table where the teachers were sitting.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0a78622a4d75b0d96903d17b4a198cf4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2791">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-227005168e44417f150f7e9c9ebd4e1a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall led the first years up here, so that they came to a
halt in a line facing the other students, with the teachers behind them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-227005168e44417f150f7e9c9ebd4e1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2792">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7883115717aea8861b099e5da6a18874</data>
      <data key="v_content">The hundreds of faces staring at them looked like pale lanterns in the
flickering candlelight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7883115717aea8861b099e5da6a18874</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2793">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-27fedc250de696db0c9975c91f74a4b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dotted here and there among the students, the
ghosts shone misty silver.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-27fedc250de696db0c9975c91f74a4b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2794">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8714aa77256d05c9cc2d0e7733d5eb80</data>
      <data key="v_content">Mainly to avoid all the staring eyes, Harry
looked upward and saw a velvety black ceiling dotted with stars.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8714aa77256d05c9cc2d0e7733d5eb80</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2795">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ac0d58468931c89f0920750f000f7dc3</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He
heard
Hermione whisper, &quot;Its bewitched to look like the sky outside.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ac0d58468931c89f0920750f000f7dc3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2796">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-db2e4d5242f0e021d813e31c65269b32</data>
      <data key="v_content">I read
about it in Hogwarts, A History.&quot;
93
It was hard to believe there was a ceiling there at all, and that the
Great Hall didn&apos;t simply open on to the heavens.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-db2e4d5242f0e021d813e31c65269b32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2797">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a775ed23154f84064afa02325df25d96</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry quickly looked down again as Professor McGonagall silently placed
a four-legged stool in front of the first years.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a775ed23154f84064afa02325df25d96</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2798">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fe17c6fc805771b7fc55c62290640a31</data>
      <data key="v_content">On top of the stool she
put a pointed wizard&apos;s hat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fe17c6fc805771b7fc55c62290640a31</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2799">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2e33265ce7c1588cc80f2ba07784c20e</data>
      <data key="v_content">This hat was patched and frayed and
extremely dirty.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2e33265ce7c1588cc80f2ba07784c20e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2800">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8c672cccde0c12f04362ca92d50f39b9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Aunt Petunia wouldn&apos;t have let it in the house.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8c672cccde0c12f04362ca92d50f39b9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2801">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-010afd2d87fb30a76b0d80d83c800466</data>
      <data key="v_content">Maybe they had to try and get a rabbit out of it, Harry thought wildly,
that seemed the sort of thing -- noticing that everyone in the hall was
now staring at the hat, he stared at it, too.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-010afd2d87fb30a76b0d80d83c800466</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2802">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ac1b4fcdd74e2492a5f5eb0a0275689</data>
      <data key="v_content">,For a few seconds, there
was complete silence.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ac1b4fcdd74e2492a5f5eb0a0275689</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2803">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c3c249edf851c500ff9d05caea9a16a5</data>
      <data key="v_content">A rip near the brim opened
wide like a mouth -- and the hat began to sing:
&quot;Oh, you may not think I&apos;m pretty,
But don&apos;t judge on what you see,
I&apos;ll eat myself if you can find
A smarter hat than me.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c3c249edf851c500ff9d05caea9a16a5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2804">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b9beb38a14f3e561901d0236493c9d25</data>
      <data key="v_content">You can keep your bowlers black,
Your top hats sleek and tall,
For I&apos;m the Hogwarts Sorting Hat
And I can cap them all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b9beb38a14f3e561901d0236493c9d25</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2805">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c40754a6a61b5e70846368d849a54ef4</data>
      <data key="v_content">There&apos;s nothing hidden in your head
The Sorting Hat can&apos;t see,
So try me on and I will tell you
Where you ought to be.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c40754a6a61b5e70846368d849a54ef4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2806">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7761da7c00994410cbcfbfbe7f505dfa</data>
      <data key="v_content">You might belong in Gryffindor,
Where dwell the brave at heart,
Their daring, nerve, and chivalry Set Gryffindors apart;
94
You might belong in Hufflepuff,
Where they are just and loyal,
Those patient Hufflepuffis are true And unafraid of toil;
Or yet in wise old Ravenclaw,
if you&apos;ve a ready mind,
Where those of wit and learning,
Will always find their kind;
Or perhaps in Slytherin
You&apos;ll make your real friends,
Those cunning folk use any means
To achieve their ends.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7761da7c00994410cbcfbfbe7f505dfa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2807">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-57251aab39ab6d6e793d72733bd1b669</data>
      <data key="v_content">So put me on! Don&apos;t be afraid!
And don&apos;t get in a flap!
You&apos;re in safe hands (though I have none)
For I&apos;m a Thinking Cap!&quot;
The whole hall burst into applause as the hat finished its song.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-57251aab39ab6d6e793d72733bd1b669</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2808">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-27f6ea0ed20f2ec70860f089a58c4964</data>
      <data key="v_content">It
bowed to each of the four tables and then became quite still again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-27f6ea0ed20f2ec70860f089a58c4964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2809">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-45e40a54a3ba135632c22bbea3413b74</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So we&apos;ve just got to try on the hat!&quot; Ron whispered to Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-45e40a54a3ba135632c22bbea3413b74</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2810">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-58b03bfa2a9fb795d870f7ecdab92c18</data>
      <data key="v_content">he,&quot;I&apos;ll
kill Fred, he was going on about wrestling a troll.&quot;
Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-58b03bfa2a9fb795d870f7ecdab92c18</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2811">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d58b8d31b782406ab78c068250fc85e4</data>
      <data key="v_content">tryingonthe,Yes, trying on the hat was a lot better than
having to do a spell, but he did wish they could have tried it on
without everyone watching.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d58b8d31b782406ab78c068250fc85e4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2812">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8c2a89a869e956bc1e4c0460eec2a763</data>
      <data key="v_content">The hat seemed to be asking rather alot;
Harry didn&apos;t feel brave or quick-witted or any of it at the moment.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8c2a89a869e956bc1e4c0460eec2a763</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2813">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-86d4166f60e72c943937515a3789ddb2</data>
      <data key="v_content">If
only the hat had mentioned a house for people who felt a bit queasy,
that would have been the one for him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-86d4166f60e72c943937515a3789ddb2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2814">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-79c2e28709e8861061cdfa9ab0a11719</data>
      <data key="v_content">95
Professor McGonagall now stepped forward holding a long roll of
parchment.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-79c2e28709e8861061cdfa9ab0a11719</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2815">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-61c9cfb3415b5fc9d6c8dc381e522375</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;When I call your name, you will put on the hat and sit on the stool to
be sorted,&quot; she said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-61c9cfb3415b5fc9d6c8dc381e522375</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2816">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-da0f1fe1037d8fbb3e09c90465b5d3f7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hannah!&quot;Apink-faced,&quot;Abbott, Hannah!&quot;
A pink-faced girl with blonde pigtails stumbled out of line, put on the
hat, which fell right down over her eyes, and sat down.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-da0f1fe1037d8fbb3e09c90465b5d3f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2817">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9e2d00dc9c5a297742c6d51beb5bc1d4</data>
      <data key="v_content">A moments pause
--
&quot;HUFFLEPUFF!&quot; shouted the hat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9e2d00dc9c5a297742c6d51beb5bc1d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2818">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-70ce363626110535947e7efaaa18c0d5</data>
      <data key="v_content">The table on the right cheered and clapped as Hannah went to sit down at
the Hufflepuff table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-70ce363626110535947e7efaaa18c0d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2819">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d855555304c5dbfa565c13fa697c4938</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry saw the ghost of the Fat Friar waving
merrily at her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d855555304c5dbfa565c13fa697c4938</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2820">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f8754cc21b12447e044623be17af11c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Susan!&quot;&quot;HUFFLEPUFF!&quot;shouted,&quot;Bones, Susan!&quot;
&quot;HUFFLEPUFF!&quot; shouted the hat again, and Susan scuttled off to sit next
to Hannah.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f8754cc21b12447e044623be17af11c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2821">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b8816af5f64d73309f046cf7d36a62af</data>
      <data key="v_content">Terry!&quot;&quot;RAVENCLAW!&quot;The,&quot;Boot, Terry!&quot;
&quot;RAVENCLAW!&quot;
The table second from the left clapped this time; several Ravenclaws
stood up to shake hands with Terry as he joined them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b8816af5f64d73309f046cf7d36a62af</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2822">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-143f02871a8e8837f81d564ea51c0591</data>
      <data key="v_content">Mandy&quot;went,&quot; Brocklehurst, Mandy&quot; went to Ravenclaw too, but &quot;Brown, Lavender&quot;
became the first new Gryffindor, and the table on the far left exploded
with cheers; Harry could see Ron&apos;s twin brothers catcalling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-143f02871a8e8837f81d564ea51c0591</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2823">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4a4834aa9997753d443d453408de6345</data>
      <data key="v_content">Millicent&quot;thenbecame,&quot;Bulstrode, Millicent&quot; then became a Slytherin.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4a4834aa9997753d443d453408de6345</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2824">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4faf64a9a32dbbd6a8e59a5548c4ec6d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Perhaps it was Harry&apos;s
imagination, after all he&apos;d heard about Slytherin, but he thought they
looked like an unpleasant lot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4faf64a9a32dbbd6a8e59a5548c4ec6d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2825">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5bf3a8a48cbcfc6415c97fe2ad66da26</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was starting to feel definitely sick
now.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5bf3a8a48cbcfc6415c97fe2ad66da26</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2826">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5d41473dd797cc519a4569cc4040665f</data>
      <data key="v_content">He remembered being picked for teams during gym at his old school.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5d41473dd797cc519a4569cc4040665f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2827">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5a65bed3932fb94c45321da1e2df221d</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had always been last to be chosen, not because he was no good, but
because no one wanted Dudley to think they liked him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5a65bed3932fb94c45321da1e2df221d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2828">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0e6bd8d2d5f8f6298d0f2795ed2c61a9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Justin!&quot;&quot;HUFFLEPUFF!&quot;96,&quot;Finch-Fletchley, Justin!&quot;
&quot;HUFFLEPUFF!&quot;
96
Sometimes, Harry noticed, the hat shouted out the house at once, but at
others it took a little while to decide.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0e6bd8d2d5f8f6298d0f2795ed2c61a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2829">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b95e95db8c1a5818b43f9b5938acf69e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Seamus,&quot;thesandy-haired,&quot;Finnigan, Seamus,&quot; the
sandy-haired boy next to Harry in the line, sat on the stool for almost
a whole minute before the hat declared him a Gryffindor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b95e95db8c1a5818b43f9b5938acf69e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2830">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bdcaf82769fd1bd6e2b73ee959093126</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione!&quot;Hermionealmost,&quot;Granger, Hermione!&quot;
Hermione almost ran to the stool and jammed the hat eagerly on her head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bdcaf82769fd1bd6e2b73ee959093126</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2831">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-81a73f022f286a2ff0e513f761819ba5</data>
      <data key="v_content">A horrible thought struck Harry, as horrible thoughts always do when
you&apos;re very nervous.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-81a73f022f286a2ff0e513f761819ba5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2832">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-14a74e8a105781f521bc549723eb423a</data>
      <data key="v_content">What if he wasn&apos;t chosen at all? What if he just
sat there with the hat over his eyes for ages, until Professor
McGonagall jerked it off his head and said there had obviously been a
mistake and he&apos;d better get back on the train?
When Neville Longbottom, the boy who kept losing his toad, was called,
he fell over on his way to the stool.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-14a74e8a105781f521bc549723eb423a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2833">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-896988d1b418653942851dc401a4683a</data>
      <data key="v_content">The hat took a long time to decide
with Neville.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-896988d1b418653942851dc401a4683a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2834">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1c09c354e98babf84e27f5c90807a3bd</data>
      <data key="v_content">,When it finally shouted, &quot;GRYFFINDOR,&quot; Neville ran off
still wearing it, and had to jog back amid gales of laughter to give it
to &quot;MacDougal, Morag.&quot;
Malfoy swaggered forward when his name was called and got his wish at
once: the hat had barely touched his head when it screamed, &quot;SLYTHERIN!&quot;
Malfoy went to join his friends Crabbe and Goyle, looking pleased with
himself.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1c09c354e98babf84e27f5c90807a3bd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2835">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-10220992bce37d716cb0464ddf6c81c8</data>
      <data key="v_content">There weren&apos;t many people left now.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-10220992bce37d716cb0464ddf6c81c8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2836">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1253deefd9e9d1ba65ddd160122ff269</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Moon&quot; &quot;Nott&quot; &quot;Parkinson&quot; then a
pair of twin girls, &quot;Patil&quot; and &quot;Patil&quot; then &quot;Perks, Sally-Anne&quot; and
then, at last -- &quot;Potter, Harry!&quot;
As Harry stepped forward, whispers suddenly broke out like little
hissing fires all over the hall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1253deefd9e9d1ba65ddd160122ff269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2837">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2b402f1f57e4bdefa6c261849e14b528</data>
      <data key="v_content">didshesay?&quot;,&quot;Potter, did she say?&quot;
The Harry Potter?&quot;
The last thing Harry saw before the hat dropped over his eyes was the
hall full of people craning to get a good look at him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2b402f1f57e4bdefa6c261849e14b528</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2838">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c26401984a0820d99c0345f71427cd8a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Next second he
97
was looking at the black inside of the hat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c26401984a0820d99c0345f71427cd8a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2839">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-955bca5b23c28b9882fd9e3ac999dd05</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidasmall,Hmm,&quot; said a small voice in his ear.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-955bca5b23c28b9882fd9e3ac999dd05</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2840">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-63acdd0294beb1d0e3226dad8b809ffd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Amy,There&apos;s talent, A my goodness,
yes -- and a nice thirst to prove yourself, now that&apos;s interesting....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-63acdd0294beb1d0e3226dad8b809ffd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2841">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-65506760d9105f0264525456013fc547</data>
      <data key="v_content">So where shall I put you?&quot;
Harry gripped the edges of the stool and thought, Not Slytherin, not
Slytherin.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-65506760d9105f0264525456013fc547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2842">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-434136924244b33ffbd6dc289c23799c</data>
      <data key="v_content">eh?&quot;said,&quot;Not Slytherin, eh?&quot; said the small voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-434136924244b33ffbd6dc289c23799c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2843">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7530dbe78ddb09c3d793c4ff1cee176b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Are you sure? You could be
great, you know, it&apos;s all here in your head, and Slytherin will help you
on the way to greatness, no doubt about that -- no? Well, if you&apos;re sure
-- better be GRYFFINDOR!&quot;
Harry heard the hat shout the last word to the whole hall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7530dbe78ddb09c3d793c4ff1cee176b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2844">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0703c3e5da18d2a03511768be82942fe</data>
      <data key="v_content">He took off
the hat and walked shakily toward the Gryffindor table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0703c3e5da18d2a03511768be82942fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2845">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-39ab0aecdd100916b747f5bc588a6299</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was so
relieved to have been chosen and not put in Slytherin, he hardly noticed
that he was getting the loudest cheer yet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-39ab0aecdd100916b747f5bc588a6299</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2846">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dfa0059045adc3618ad8191cd89db482</data>
      <data key="v_content">Percy the Prefect got up and
shook his hand vigorously, while the Weasley twins yelled, &quot;We got
Potter! We got Potter!&quot; Harry sat down opposite the ghost in the ruff
he&apos;d seen earlier.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dfa0059045adc3618ad8191cd89db482</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2847">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-46574d47d727f48788c2cad82fa47fef</data>
      <data key="v_content">The ghost patted his arm, giving Harry the sudden,
horrible feeling he&apos;d just plunged it into a bucket of ice-cold water.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-46574d47d727f48788c2cad82fa47fef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2848">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e58fb278c88a790fc94ed5c2704f7381</data>
      <data key="v_content">He could see the High Table properly now.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e58fb278c88a790fc94ed5c2704f7381</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2849">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dd85366b194cca1a684b6f49d54527be</data>
      <data key="v_content">At the end nearest him sat
Hagrid, who caught his eye and gave him the thumbs up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dd85366b194cca1a684b6f49d54527be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2850">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-75353bc5992245df96f70101c257f73b</data>
      <data key="v_content">inthe,And there, in the center of the High Table, in a large gold chair,
sat Albus Dumbledore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-75353bc5992245df96f70101c257f73b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2851">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4ed272669f7139ba29f85b28e0e9ea4d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry recognized him at once from the card he&apos;d
gotten out of the Chocolate Frog on the train.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4ed272669f7139ba29f85b28e0e9ea4d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2852">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c61b0ed86d506e81226af5150a4a2ecc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dumbledore&apos;s silver hair
was the only thing in the whole hall that shone as brightly as the
ghosts.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c61b0ed86d506e81226af5150a4a2ecc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2853">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-624ea3501c817348c094100282519191</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Harry spotted Professor Quirtell, too, the nervous young man
from the Leaky Cauldron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-624ea3501c817348c094100282519191</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2854">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3889047412b38521ffe3188a619d50a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was looking very peculiar in a large purple
turban.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3889047412b38521ffe3188a619d50a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2855">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-58cea7b3c1da95f313af04abe163a61e</data>
      <data key="v_content">And now there were only three people left to be sorted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-58cea7b3c1da95f313af04abe163a61e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2856">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a78b1fee6c9e42547aed76b7be174222</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dean,&quot;aBlack,&quot;Thomas, Dean,&quot;
a Black boy even taller than Ron, joined Harry at the Gryffindor table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a78b1fee6c9e42547aed76b7be174222</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2857">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-689c470e1b3ca219d8726d03fa2d368d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Lisa,&quot;becamea,&quot;Turpin, Lisa,&quot; became a Ravenclaw and then it was Ron&apos;s turn.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-689c470e1b3ca219d8726d03fa2d368d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2858">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c533cbe11017a2b6328b1f6247f2343e</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was
pale green by now.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c533cbe11017a2b6328b1f6247f2343e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2859">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-08b6203bb648361aaefd71e5b0988dc3</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry crossed his fingers under the table and a
second later the hat had shouted, &quot;GRYFFINDOR!&quot;
Harry clapped loudly with the rest as Ron collapsed into the chair next
to him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-08b6203bb648361aaefd71e5b0988dc3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2860">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c37fa08cbf1c456137aa754379b62a13</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron,,98
&quot;Well done, Ron, excellent,&quot; said Percy Weasley Pompously across Harry
as &quot;Zabini, Blaise,&quot; was made a Slytherin.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c37fa08cbf1c456137aa754379b62a13</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2861">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1640539c6d10fc085b38aadb1b3b0303</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall rolled
up her scroll and took the Sorting Hat away.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1640539c6d10fc085b38aadb1b3b0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2862">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-05af6a7667da4ce4a809ae2bdd4c5502</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry looked down at his empty gold plate.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-05af6a7667da4ce4a809ae2bdd4c5502</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2863">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5ab7697e2df85cb96a10d09d6f32998d</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had only just realized how
hungry he was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5ab7697e2df85cb96a10d09d6f32998d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2864">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-61a8d238882af6b2eb16f97ba476c229</data>
      <data key="v_content">The pumpkin pasties seemed ages ago.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-61a8d238882af6b2eb16f97ba476c229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2865">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-03753e48e72e173f904ebc6b9c2425af</data>
      <data key="v_content">Albus Dumbledore had gotten to his feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-03753e48e72e173f904ebc6b9c2425af</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2866">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-52991d3f3359ce343ea13c030ba0b649</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was beaming at the students,
his arms opened wide, as if nothing could have pleased him more than to
see them all there.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-52991d3f3359ce343ea13c030ba0b649</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2867">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e1b4466c3a1ef5a758fa5a9f5e6f9e8a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Welcome to a new year at Hogwarts! Before we begin
our banquet, I would like to say a few words.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e1b4466c3a1ef5a758fa5a9f5e6f9e8a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2868">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3e3ecf819b8aba228bf5e0fee9710b09</data>
      <data key="v_content">And here they are: Nitwit!
Blubber! Oddment! Tweak!
&quot;Thank you!&quot;
He sat back down.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3e3ecf819b8aba228bf5e0fee9710b09</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2869">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7ce11b15a5c8c401f8b31cec8becc932</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry didn&apos;t know
whether to laugh or not.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7ce11b15a5c8c401f8b31cec8becc932</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2870">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-97fd583f1edcc03da3df03ae13d5ea36</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Is he -- a bit mad?&quot; he asked Percy uncertainly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-97fd583f1edcc03da3df03ae13d5ea36</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2871">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2841f3823a062034f6d63000be724cac</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He&apos;s a genius! Best wizard in the world! But
he is a bit mad, yes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2841f3823a062034f6d63000be724cac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2872">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d4df1fd6e53fc532e515320a113f33c5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry?&quot;Harry&apos;smouth,Potatoes, Harry?&quot;
Harry&apos;s mouth fell open.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d4df1fd6e53fc532e515320a113f33c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2873">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-175efc173717143ae410098f6f01b7f9</data>
      <data key="v_content">The dishes in front of him were now piled with
food.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-175efc173717143ae410098f6f01b7f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2874">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-89364ff02ef8e0f2f5844a5e1dd9f49b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had never seen so many things he liked to eat on one table:
roast beef, roast chicken, pork chops and lamb chops, sausages, bacon
and steak, boiled potatoes, roast potatoes, fries, Yorkshire pudding,
peas, carrots, gravy, ketchup, and, for some strange reason, peppermint
humbugs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-89364ff02ef8e0f2f5844a5e1dd9f49b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2875">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd033fce7004d8dd776d7921e50dd568</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Dursleys had never exactly starved Harry, but he&apos;d never been
allowed to eat as much as he liked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd033fce7004d8dd776d7921e50dd568</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2876">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f7f2fe5ca7af3507490c4d1db2184ae4</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dudley had always taken anything
that Harry really wanted, even if It made him sick.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f7f2fe5ca7af3507490c4d1db2184ae4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2877">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6915234755bf24569a5e06759145da01</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry piled his
plate with a bit of everything except the peppermints and began to eat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6915234755bf24569a5e06759145da01</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2878">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1ad931827acbe9cd3265ddd8f919ae73</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;That does look good,&quot; said the ghost in the ruff sadly, watching Harry
cut up his steak,
&quot;Can&apos;t you --?&quot;
99
I haven&apos;t eaten for nearly four hundred years,&quot; said the ghost.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1ad931827acbe9cd3265ddd8f919ae73</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2879">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6093fb7ae370f4344eebf0dcd1432c07</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;I don&apos;t
need to, of course, but one does miss it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6093fb7ae370f4344eebf0dcd1432c07</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2880">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-889cb287420be832f9948a4fa56b950e</data>
      <data key="v_content">I don&apos;t think I&apos;ve in troduced
myself? Sir Nicholas de Mimsy-Porpington at your service.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-889cb287420be832f9948a4fa56b950e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2881">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-40b4f7abc7296f194130876e8b230f92</data>
      <data key="v_content">Resident ghost
of Gryffindor Tower.&quot;
&quot;I know who you are!&quot; said Ron suddenly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-40b4f7abc7296f194130876e8b230f92</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2882">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9cc984db9799d56af8e98c04e0df821b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;My brothers told me about you
-- you&apos;re Nearly Headless Nick!&quot;
&quot;I would prefer you to call me Sir Nicholas de Mimsy --&quot; the ghost began
stiffly, but sandy-haired Seamus Finnigan interrupted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9cc984db9799d56af8e98c04e0df821b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2883">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ae17a2922a1fe60a056e6207e44c23b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Nearly Headless? How can you be nearly headless?&quot;
Sir Nicholas looked extremely miffed, as if their little chat wasn&apos;t
going at all the way he wanted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ae17a2922a1fe60a056e6207e44c23b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2884">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-00b8119cdaa65b02cdbc394f85c57a5f</data>
      <data key="v_content">He seized his left ear and pulled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-00b8119cdaa65b02cdbc394f85c57a5f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2885">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-57b2ceef136fb2ec480560c2cb252e11</data>
      <data key="v_content">His
whole head swung off his neck and fell onto his shoulder as if it was on
a hinge.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-57b2ceef136fb2ec480560c2cb252e11</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2886">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3531234c8a6b870d298f024db2eb18a7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Someone had obviously tried to behead him, but not done it
properly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3531234c8a6b870d298f024db2eb18a7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2887">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-88f70b71e2a5c431d67021954574770c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Looking pleased at the stunned looks on their faces, Nearly
Headless Nick flipped his head back onto his neck, coughed, and said,
&quot;So -- new Gryffindors! I hope you&apos;re going to help us win the house
championship this year? Gryffindors have never gone so long without
winning.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-88f70b71e2a5c431d67021954574770c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2888">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9d116e0a798717d8d38b745b5d4b0d4c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Slytherins have got the cup six years in a row! The Bloody
Baron&apos;s becoming almost unbearable -- he&apos;s the Slytherin ghost.&quot;
Harry looked over at the Slytherin table and saw a horrible ghost
sitting there, with blank staring eyes, a gaunt face, and robes stained
with silver blood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9d116e0a798717d8d38b745b5d4b0d4c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2889">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8da26ef9e50656af914351d8f71bfefd</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was right next to Malfoy who, Harry was pleased to
see, didn&apos;t look too pleased with the seating arrangements.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8da26ef9e50656af914351d8f71bfefd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2890">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-65082412beab09da9b89f58e8d9bfdc3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;How did he get covered in blood?&quot; asked Seamus with great interest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-65082412beab09da9b89f58e8d9bfdc3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2891">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d7fac840db07a50dba196809226b34c4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;said,&quot;I&apos;ve never asked,&quot; said Nearly Headless Nick delicately.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d7fac840db07a50dba196809226b34c4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2892">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-263b625924dff03729bc30c3729f72a1</data>
      <data key="v_content">When everyone had eaten as much as they could, the remains of the food
faded from the plates, leaving them sparkling clean as before.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-263b625924dff03729bc30c3729f72a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2893">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-50f9b146feadd4208f5c072b038b6449</data>
      <data key="v_content">A moment
later the desserts appeared.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-50f9b146feadd4208f5c072b038b6449</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2894">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-99abd3d1e8199a8a3ece7164916fa95e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Blocks of ice cream in every flavor you
could think of, apple pies, treacle tarts, chocolate eclairs and jam
doughnuts, trifle, strawberries, Jell-O, rice pudding -- &quot;
As Harry helped himself to a treacle tart, the talk turned to their
families.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-99abd3d1e8199a8a3ece7164916fa95e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2895">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c58b8868dabf9d5d657354ac05107431</data>
      <data key="v_content">Mom didn&apos;t tell
him she was a witch &apos;til after they were married.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c58b8868dabf9d5d657354ac05107431</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2896">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2c30adfe084a23fad63217a4bf6ff89f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Bit of a nasty shock
for him.&quot;
The others laughed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2c30adfe084a23fad63217a4bf6ff89f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2897">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-44230c4cecf8b3ef1815779a6154a714</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville?&quot;,&quot;What about you, Neville?&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-44230c4cecf8b3ef1815779a6154a714</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2898">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3d42cfa7860e1e5dc680a44f940b41dd</data>
      <data key="v_content">mygranbrought,&quot;Well, my gran brought me up and she&apos;s a witch,&quot; said Neville, &quot;but the
family thought I was all- Muggle for ages.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3d42cfa7860e1e5dc680a44f940b41dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2899">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-25ed23501b37f25769bf00fd0891dc32</data>
      <data key="v_content">My Great Uncle Algie kept
trying to catch me off my guard and force some magic out of me -- he
pushed me off the end of Blackpool pier once, I nearly drowned -- but
nothing happened until I was eight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-25ed23501b37f25769bf00fd0891dc32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2900">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-72a8a3870815843ff03f224b469b40a7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Great Uncle Algie came round for
dinner, and he was hanging me out of an upstairs window by the ankles
when my Great Auntie Enid offered him a meringue and he accidentally let
go.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-72a8a3870815843ff03f224b469b40a7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2901">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b09838d4b15089539df46806d83c6134</data>
      <data key="v_content">But I bounced -- all the way down the garden and into the road.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b09838d4b15089539df46806d83c6134</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2902">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cd1ba31275212c7bfcfce381de99c991</data>
      <data key="v_content">They
were all really pleased, Gran was crying, she was so happy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cd1ba31275212c7bfcfce381de99c991</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2903">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-39fe7b2b3faf6d40456292a5916cf79c</data>
      <data key="v_content">And you
should have seen their faces when I got in here -- they thought I might
not be magic enough to come, you see.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-39fe7b2b3faf6d40456292a5916cf79c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2904">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1b7937669c5f7e3ad6a6b4e33af740ec</data>
      <data key="v_content">Great Uncle Algie was so pleased
he bought me my toad.&quot;
On Harry&apos;s other side, Percy Weasley and Hermione were talking about
lessons (&quot;I do hope they start right away, there&apos;s so much to learn, I&apos;m
particularly interested in Transfiguration, you know, turning something
into something else, of course, it&apos;s supposed to be very difficult-&quot;;
&quot;You&apos;ll be starting small, just matches into needles and that sort of
thing -- &quot;).</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1b7937669c5f7e3ad6a6b4e33af740ec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2905">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-93e1663bff3a2fce458aaba17e5d1bb0</data>
      <data key="v_content">whowasstarting,Harry, who was starting to feel warm and sleepy, looked up at
the High Table again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-93e1663bff3a2fce458aaba17e5d1bb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2906">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aceccfc489635addce2136324fccc7d2</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid was drinking deeply from his goblet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aceccfc489635addce2136324fccc7d2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2907">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-886117b45da9b5434cabe52aec348063</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall was talking to Professor Dumbledore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-886117b45da9b5434cabe52aec348063</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2908">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e75b4d388f1c6678adc3821cd6300b06</data>
      <data key="v_content">inhis,Professor
Quirrell, in his absurd turban, was talking to a teacher with greasy
black hair, a hooked nose, and sallow skin.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e75b4d388f1c6678adc3821cd6300b06</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2909">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b6f29592845b5cd19cf5464039c69f16</data>
      <data key="v_content">The hook-nosed teacher looked past Quirrell&apos;s
turban straight into Harry&apos;s eyes -- and a sharp, hot pain shot across
the scar on Harry&apos;s forehead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b6f29592845b5cd19cf5464039c69f16</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2910">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-892a7f9b7a2253a3ef0257772de2e495</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ouch!&quot; Harry clapped a hand to his head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-892a7f9b7a2253a3ef0257772de2e495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2911">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cbd36aff2718ad76c8f4050a0483f640</data>
      <data key="v_content">101
&quot;N-nothing.&quot;
The pain had gone as quickly as it had come.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cbd36aff2718ad76c8f4050a0483f640</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2912">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-18d2d561881616fa1b0419209137d391</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harder to shake off was the
feeling Harry had gotten from the teacher&apos;s look -- a feeling that he
didn&apos;t like Harry at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-18d2d561881616fa1b0419209137d391</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2913">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-99679093d8e6681716a7e4886697a478</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Who&apos;s that teacher talking to Professor Quirrell?&quot; he asked Percy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-99679093d8e6681716a7e4886697a478</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2914">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a0931af6ba3aa18e745009378664e82</data>
      <data key="v_content">youknowQuirrell,&quot;Oh, you know Quirrell already, do you? No wonder he&apos;s looking so
nervous, that&apos;s Professor Snape.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a0931af6ba3aa18e745009378664e82</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2915">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e61627a313bf79f662751d9652d1e938</data>
      <data key="v_content">but,He teaches Potions, but he doesn&apos;t want
to -- everyone knows he&apos;s after Quirrell&apos;s job.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e61627a313bf79f662751d9652d1e938</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2916">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3e75739bffd9d56cccf41feb94e32997</data>
      <data key="v_content">Knows an awful lot about
the Dark Arts, Snape.&quot;
Harry watched Snape for a while, but Snape didn&apos;t look at him again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3e75739bffd9d56cccf41feb94e32997</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2917">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-13acc0d35184557b33b109c2ea46ce2d</data>
      <data key="v_content">thedesserts,At last, the desserts too disappeared, and Professor Dumbledore got to
his feet again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-13acc0d35184557b33b109c2ea46ce2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2918">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6c72e268f3d0bb4cb28c64e88ec6aab0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ahern -- just a few more words now that we are all fed and watered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6c72e268f3d0bb4cb28c64e88ec6aab0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2919">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a5aa2e38a3eca453a937927611cf895</data>
      <data key="v_content">I
have a few start-of-term notices to give you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a5aa2e38a3eca453a937927611cf895</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2920">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-271ae579f7e03d38083938661ca84e29</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;First years should note that the forest on the grounds is forbidden to
all pupils.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-271ae579f7e03d38083938661ca84e29</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2921">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e2afc066ec52449ee34b4579f79a0192</data>
      <data key="v_content">And a few of our older students would do well to remember
that as well.&quot;
Dumbledore&apos;s twinkling eyes flashed in the direction of the Weasley
twins.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e2afc066ec52449ee34b4579f79a0192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2922">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2ecd6ac116c97ed882318d978b70c455</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I have also been asked by Mr.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2ecd6ac116c97ed882318d978b70c455</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2923">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6efd6463753db8f9650690753a975d94</data>
      <data key="v_content">thecaretaker,to,Filch, the caretaker, to remind you all
that no magic should be used between classes in the corridors.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6efd6463753db8f9650690753a975d94</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2924">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2d77e644f023324d51bda29ee8f04696</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Quidditch trials will be held in the second week of the term.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2d77e644f023324d51bda29ee8f04696</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2925">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0929b7af6a4f8f9c1978c727eea5cc3a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Anyone
interested in playing for their house teams should contact Madam Hooch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0929b7af6a4f8f9c1978c727eea5cc3a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2926">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-00a110e51c57f668f9de435fed4cf02a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Imust,&quot;And finally, I must tell you that this year, the third-floor corridor
on the right-hand side is out of bounds to everyone who does not wish to
die a very painful death.&quot;
Harry laughed, but he was one of the few who did.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-00a110e51c57f668f9de435fed4cf02a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2927">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-564323b630b8e2f4ba361fb636a9905d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He&apos;s not serious?&quot; he muttered to Percy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-564323b630b8e2f4ba361fb636a9905d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2928">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8ccde214fa120d850f25da4f60d62762</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;said,102
&quot;Must be,&quot; said Percy, frowning at Dumbledore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8ccde214fa120d850f25da4f60d62762</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2929">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec38142f56762a6fded5ebc5b41009a2</data>
      <data key="v_content">becausehe,&quot;It&apos;s odd, because he
usually gives us a reason why we&apos;re not allowed to go somewhere -- the
forest&apos;s full of dangerous beasts, everyone knows that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec38142f56762a6fded5ebc5b41009a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2930">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4f7f642232c8723d7ba2616bb415e11d</data>
      <data key="v_content">I do think he
might have told us prefects, at least.&quot;
&quot;And now, before we go to bed, let us sing the school song!&quot; cried
Dumbledore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4f7f642232c8723d7ba2616bb415e11d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2931">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-98837e28d9e4a57e32fbecdcbc0c6f8d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry noticed that the other teachers&apos; smiles had become
rather fixed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-98837e28d9e4a57e32fbecdcbc0c6f8d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2932">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-68ad6636ffb228eee97f329a49bfd826</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dumbledore gave his wand a little flick, as if he was trying to get a
fly off the end, and a long golden ribbon flew out of it, which rose
high above the tables and twisted itself, snakelike, into words.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-68ad6636ffb228eee97f329a49bfd826</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2933">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1ad2e0950ea2b7ce420a57026b25500d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Everyone pick their favorite tune,&quot; said Dumbledore, &quot;and off we go!&quot;
And the school bellowed:
&quot;Hogwarts, Hogwarts, Hoggy Warty Hogwarts,
Teach us something please,
Whether we be old and bald
Or young with scabby knees,
Our heads could do with filling
With some interesting stuff,
For now they&apos;re bare and full of air,
Dead flies and bits of fluff,
So teach us things worth knowing,
Bring back what we&apos;ve forgot,
just do your best, we&apos;ll do the rest,
And learn until our brains all rot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1ad2e0950ea2b7ce420a57026b25500d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2934">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5f1442a464415d29e8fe58546f6365df</data>
      <data key="v_content">Everybody finished the song at different times.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5f1442a464415d29e8fe58546f6365df</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2935">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c0b0b11128869e54505ec448e398ff80</data>
      <data key="v_content">onlythe,At last, only the
Weasley twins were left singing along to a very slow funeral march.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c0b0b11128869e54505ec448e398ff80</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2936">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-54c55cfc8434611adb70eb7289ec3d5c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dumbledore conducted their last few lines with his wand and when they
103
had finished, he was one of those who clapped loudest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-54c55cfc8434611adb70eb7289ec3d5c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2937">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d66d394948c660339a2e83b0f07ddb0b</data>
      <data key="v_content">music,&quot;hesaid,,&quot;Ah, music,&quot; he said, wiping his eyes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d66d394948c660339a2e83b0f07ddb0b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2938">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-302ac003cee684472f030f67f72f780c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;A magic beyond all we do here!
And now, bedtime.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-302ac003cee684472f030f67f72f780c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2939">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eb24e36fbe7f7871e3b7c35659bccd65</data>
      <data key="v_content">Off you trot!&quot;
The Gryffindor first years followed Percy through the chattering crowds,
out of the Great Hall, and up the marble staircase.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eb24e36fbe7f7871e3b7c35659bccd65</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2940">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7d53930b0de29cc2bdb3d91a93fa6ce4</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry&apos;s legs were
like lead again, but only because he was so tired and full of food.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7d53930b0de29cc2bdb3d91a93fa6ce4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2941">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-30f463caf6f82c01503057a76e682316</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
was too sleepy even to be surprised that the people in the portraits
along the corridors whispered and pointed as they passed, or that twice
Percy led them through doorways hidden behind sliding panels and hanging
tapestries.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-30f463caf6f82c01503057a76e682316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2942">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-971f4cef81edcb3fe80ec83283ce2e7b</data>
      <data key="v_content">,They climbed more staircases, yawning and dragging their
feet, and Harry was just wondering how much farther they had to go when
they came to a sudden halt.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-971f4cef81edcb3fe80ec83283ce2e7b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2943">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-35f83eff1fa9c49a7719c2ddae7f778a</data>
      <data key="v_content">A bundle of walking sticks was floating in midair ahead of them, and as
Percy took a step toward them they started throwing themselves at him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-35f83eff1fa9c49a7719c2ddae7f778a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2944">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-314bc2be642046a3d888bdcebcd7dcad</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Percywhisperedto,&quot;Peeves,&quot; Percy whispered to the first years.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-314bc2be642046a3d888bdcebcd7dcad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2945">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2ee4faee3311d45ef0bf84b4716a58b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;A poltergeist.&quot; He raised
his voice, &quot;Peeves -- show yourself&quot;
A loud, rude sound, like the air being let out of a balloon, answered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2ee4faee3311d45ef0bf84b4716a58b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2946">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5b021d8e661961da74a479dce1586883</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Do you want me to go to the Bloody Baron?&quot;
There was a pop, and a little man with wicked, dark eyes and a wide
mouth appeared, floating cross- legged in the air, clutching the walking
sticks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5b021d8e661961da74a479dce1586883</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2947">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6d0924eb7c94baf89fb2e471590716c2</data>
      <data key="v_content">with,&quot;Oooooooh!&quot; he said, with an evil cackle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6d0924eb7c94baf89fb2e471590716c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2948">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fe35065602ccdd3f0dad49b307dcd530</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ickle Firsties! What fun!&quot;
He swooped suddenly at them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fe35065602ccdd3f0dad49b307dcd530</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2949">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9519e29dcc6dccb869131f9d64678d99</data>
      <data key="v_content">Peeves,or,&quot;Go away, Peeves, or the Baron&apos;ll hear about this, I mean it!&quot; barked
Percy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9519e29dcc6dccb869131f9d64678d99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2950">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d65e50a1d75881302e2fff81c2996658</data>
      <data key="v_content">Peeves stuck out his tongue and vanished, dropping the walking sticks on
Neville&apos;s head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d65e50a1d75881302e2fff81c2996658</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2951">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-22dc69ed191a2fd446e5d49afb395b80</data>
      <data key="v_content">They heard him zooming away, rattling coats of armor as
he passed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-22dc69ed191a2fd446e5d49afb395b80</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2952">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d3eb10635a6f35bb6319ab40d5ff0a7f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You want to watch out for Peeves,&quot; said Percy, as they set off again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d3eb10635a6f35bb6319ab40d5ff0a7f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2953">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-77f75dea7cb5b7ed06ba59e823c99a6a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The Bloody Baron&apos;s the only one who can control him, he won&apos;t even
listen to us prefects.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-77f75dea7cb5b7ed06ba59e823c99a6a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2954">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2b8ff6362c5bebeacc299c8b5f6d136f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Here we are.&quot;
104
At the very end of the corridor hung a portrait of a very fat woman in a
pink silk dress.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2b8ff6362c5bebeacc299c8b5f6d136f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2955">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8dad9b2a7815c57b75af673f568cfd10</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidPercy,,&quot;Caput Draconis,&quot; said Percy, and the portrait
swung forward to reveal a round hole in the wall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8dad9b2a7815c57b75af673f568cfd10</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2956">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-38efca78c7c2b7e8ddeff129363c08e2</data>
      <data key="v_content">They all scrambled
through it -- Neville needed a leg up -- and found themselves in the
Gryffindor common room, a cozy, round room full of squashy armchairs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-38efca78c7c2b7e8ddeff129363c08e2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2957">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-19fd31f8e4804c6651996837eee606ed</data>
      <data key="v_content">Percy directed the girls through one door to their dormitory and the
boys through another.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-19fd31f8e4804c6651996837eee606ed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2958">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-10f4cf4537d2bbb201ef28a2e36a03f4</data>
      <data key="v_content">At the top of a spiral staircase -- they were
obviously in one of the towers -- they found their beds at last: five
four-posters hung with deep red, velvet curtains.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-10f4cf4537d2bbb201ef28a2e36a03f4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2959">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-089b56bd06ad2302eed823d545f6716b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Their trunks had
already been brought up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-089b56bd06ad2302eed823d545f6716b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2960">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9da3d7b19bf6f00b103cf141b478bcad</data>
      <data key="v_content">Too tired to talk much, they pulled on their
pajamas and fell into bed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9da3d7b19bf6f00b103cf141b478bcad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2961">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d65746d3d41766791f29b1a7d92c1f11</data>
      <data key="v_content">isn&apos;t,&quot; Great food, isn&apos;t it?&quot; Ron muttered to Harry through the hangings.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d65746d3d41766791f29b1a7d92c1f11</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2962">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-73713ece3de1f5eece25947ec01d6529</data>
      <data key="v_content">Scabbers!He&apos;s,&quot;Get off, Scabbers! He&apos;s chewing my sheets.&quot;
Harry was going to ask Ron if he&apos;d had any of the treacle tart, but he
fell asleep almost at once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-73713ece3de1f5eece25947ec01d6529</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2963">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa9f633902cc3689d858240712ecbb05</data>
      <data key="v_content">Perhaps Harry had eaten a bit too much, because he had a very strange
dream.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa9f633902cc3689d858240712ecbb05</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2964">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3443b8c2c50fc5fa4a89ddbf940b563e</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was wearing Professor Quirrell&apos;s turban, which kept talking to
him, telling him he must transfer to Slytherin at once, because it was
his destiny.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3443b8c2c50fc5fa4a89ddbf940b563e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2965">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7feeeb40eca4ff33a8e122a4bfffc3fc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry told the turban he didn&apos;t want to be in Slytherin; it
got heavier and heavier; he tried to pull it off but it tightened
painfully -- and there was Malfoy, laughing at him as he struggled with
it -then Malfoy turned into the hook-nosed teacher, Snape, whose laugh
became high and cold -- there was a burst of green light and Harry woke,
sweating and shaking.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7feeeb40eca4ff33a8e122a4bfffc3fc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2966">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-94e92e861806660d135b248f7156d342</data>
      <data key="v_content">He rolled over and fell asleep again, and when he woke next day, he
didn&apos;t remember the dream at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-94e92e861806660d135b248f7156d342</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2967">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-382ed22b55072a3d1bd406989fd2b12e</data>
      <data key="v_content">CHAPTER EIGHT
THE POTIONS MASTER
There, look.&quot;
&quot;Where?&quot;
105
&quot;Next to the tall kid with the red hair.&quot;
&quot;Wearing the glasses?&quot;
&quot;Did you see his face?&quot;
&quot;Did you see his scar?&quot;
Whispers followed Harry from the moment he left his dormitory the next
day.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-382ed22b55072a3d1bd406989fd2b12e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2968">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-629d4f3f703ed7342d07fd271c1c6aee</data>
      <data key="v_content">People lining up outside classrooms stood on tiptoe to get a look
at him, or doubled back to pass him in the corridors again, staring.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-629d4f3f703ed7342d07fd271c1c6aee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2969">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a4d09b99cc8a96bf55b1e6e5ee90e3b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Harry wished they wouldn&apos;t, because he was trying to concentrate on
finding his way to classes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a4d09b99cc8a96bf55b1e6e5ee90e3b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2970">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-07a78a6ea34574f1d1f64f29947d16d5</data>
      <data key="v_content">There were a hundred and forty-two staircases at Hogwarts: wide,
sweeping ones; narrow, rickety ones; some that led somewhere different
on a Friday; some with a vanishing step halfway up that you had to
remember to jump.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-07a78a6ea34574f1d1f64f29947d16d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2971">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2794090dd4b96d414ca91743dbc07d1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then there were doors that wouldn&apos;t open unless you
asked politely, or tickled them in exactly the right place, and doors
that weren&apos;t really doors at all, but solid walls just pretending.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2794090dd4b96d414ca91743dbc07d1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2972">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-df7fe8ffe728a5c7d50d1d823faafcff</data>
      <data key="v_content">It
was also very hard to remember where anything was, because it all seemed
to move around a lot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-df7fe8ffe728a5c7d50d1d823faafcff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2973">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7609f42b465b00b0923981f9e2786117</data>
      <data key="v_content">The people in the portraits kept going to visit
each other, and Harry was sure the coats of armor could walk.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7609f42b465b00b0923981f9e2786117</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2974">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec61000423779e69bb928a8b73f4982a</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was always a nasty shock when one of
them glided suddenly through a door you were trying to open.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec61000423779e69bb928a8b73f4982a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2975">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b45cdbe684c3b1eb35f0710a3ca84045</data>
      <data key="v_content">Nearly
Headless Nick was always happy to point new Gryffindors in the right
direction, but Peeves the Poltergeist was worth two locked doors and a
trick staircase if you met him when you were late for class.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b45cdbe684c3b1eb35f0710a3ca84045</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2976">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f5cc677e89433724a0b63b34a6267e3c</data>
      <data key="v_content">He would
drop wastepaper baskets on your head, pull rugs from under your feet,
pelt you with bits of chalk, or sneak up behind you, invisible, grab
your nose, and screech, &quot;GOT YOUR CONK!&quot;
Even worse than Peeves, if that was possible, was the caretaker, Argus
Filch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f5cc677e89433724a0b63b34a6267e3c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2977">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-275a6f8dba083f95a344ae1af89f4994</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Ron managed to get on the wrong side of him on their
very first morning.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-275a6f8dba083f95a344ae1af89f4994</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2978">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a59de8a58577c2343f379adae6e7ce07</data>
      <data key="v_content">Filch found them trying to force their way through a
door that unluckily turned out to be the entrance to the out-of-bounds
corridor on the third floor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a59de8a58577c2343f379adae6e7ce07</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2979">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-248fd129f166a7a2677b12047a760eec</data>
      <data key="v_content">He wouldn&apos;t believe they were lost, was
sure they were trying to break into it on purpose, and was threatening
to lock them in the dungeons when they were rescued by Professor
Quirrell, who was passing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-248fd129f166a7a2677b12047a760eec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2980">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2c1652f8a7f1a7c7749df30a26dbd624</data>
      <data key="v_content">106
Filch owned a cat called Mrs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2c1652f8a7f1a7c7749df30a26dbd624</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2981">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3a34e216da64f1680c96fd1cd5faa4ea</data>
      <data key="v_content">ascrawny,dust-colored,Norris, a scrawny, dust-colored creature
with bulging, lamp like eyes just like Filch&apos;s.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3a34e216da64f1680c96fd1cd5faa4ea</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2982">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6e47a2ffdde61c2ce901b676208cddeb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Break a rule in front of her, put just one toe out of
line, and she&apos;d whisk off for Filch, who&apos;d appear, wheezing, two seconds
later.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6e47a2ffdde61c2ce901b676208cddeb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2983">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-097e1fe1c9a78996c28f2765fd85db15</data>
      <data key="v_content">Filch knew the secret passageways of the school better than
anyone (except perhaps the Weasley twins) and could pop up as suddenly
as any of the ghosts.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-097e1fe1c9a78996c28f2765fd85db15</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2984">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1691c61417ec36db0b931e17dd5eee88</data>
      <data key="v_content">The students all hated him, and it was the dearest
ambition of many to give Mrs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1691c61417ec36db0b931e17dd5eee88</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2985">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5b87e996e1942a5822050ef4676dae23</data>
      <data key="v_content">onceyou,And then, once you had managed to find them, there were the classes
themselves.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5b87e996e1942a5822050ef4676dae23</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2986">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fcf54e8931c168cd90032eb4d8bb82b0</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was a lot more to magic, as Harry quickly found out,
than waving your wand and saying a few funny words.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fcf54e8931c168cd90032eb4d8bb82b0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2987">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cefa9753d45d42274617b506310592fa</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had to study the night skies through their telescopes every
Wednesday at midnight and learn the names of different stars and the
movements of the planets.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cefa9753d45d42274617b506310592fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2988">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-af7630154fc568148b1572d7c2cb14c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Three times a week they went out to the
greenhouses behind the castle to study Herbology, with a dumpy little
witch called Professor Sprout, where they learned how to take care of
all the strange plants and fungi, and found out what they were used for.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-af7630154fc568148b1572d7c2cb14c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2989">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1042b748bb6195da99d77568dc893c40</data>
      <data key="v_content">Easily the most boring class was History of Magic, which was the only
one taught by a ghost.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1042b748bb6195da99d77568dc893c40</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2990">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2388e6ebe86ddd571b7f20f0ad0d69d3</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor Binns had been very old
indeed when he had fallen asleep in front of the staff room fire and got
up next morning to teach, leaving his body behind him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2388e6ebe86ddd571b7f20f0ad0d69d3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2991">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-07579abd3335a1ac0e5eac640d63ec6e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Binns droned on
and on while they scribbled down names and dates, and got Emetic the
Evil and Uric the Oddball mixed up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-07579abd3335a1ac0e5eac640d63ec6e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2992">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5578dd6e69573accec7fd2b17c0f059a</data>
      <data key="v_content">theCharms,Professor Flitwick, the Charms teacher, was a tiny little wizard who had
to stand on a pile of books to see over his desk.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5578dd6e69573accec7fd2b17c0f059a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2993">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7e8a1ca7fac9fa528453e2ea6e733d5e</data>
      <data key="v_content">At the start of their
first class he took the roll call, and when he reached Harry&apos;s name he
gave an excited squeak and toppled out of sight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7e8a1ca7fac9fa528453e2ea6e733d5e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2994">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-90826d5f65b91c04bd10dd92a36ccd0b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had been quite right to
think she wasn&apos;t a teacher to cross.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-90826d5f65b91c04bd10dd92a36ccd0b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2995">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8bf3552d03b60a36b7e64df48e22aeab</data>
      <data key="v_content">she,Strict and clever, she gave them a
talking-to the moment they sat down in her first class.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8bf3552d03b60a36b7e64df48e22aeab</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2996">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-67bf6d7a25c8f4933558986757393dbb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Transfiguration is some of the most complex and dangerous magic you
will learn at Hogwarts,&quot; she said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-67bf6d7a25c8f4933558986757393dbb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2997">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a521da147c8a2d1af2e35fc12b2479f1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Anyone messing around in my class
will leave and not come back.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a521da147c8a2d1af2e35fc12b2479f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2998">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-acc1aa15800d64c365e413266d74920a</data>
      <data key="v_content">You have been warned.&quot;
Then she changed her desk into a pig and back again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-acc1aa15800d64c365e413266d74920a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n2999">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c33346ceb02076787c6647ee274010b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were all very
impressed and couldn&apos;t wait to get started, but soon realized they
107
weren&apos;t going to be changing the furniture into animals for a long time.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c33346ceb02076787c6647ee274010b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3000">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5de3bf96a012bc0931dd0acd0a77b130</data>
      <data key="v_content">After taking a lot of complicated notes, they were each given a match
and started trying to turn it into a needle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5de3bf96a012bc0931dd0acd0a77b130</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3001">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0f080b3b977f4028def7079c802c2d57</data>
      <data key="v_content">By the end of the lesson,
only Hermione Granger had made any difference to her match; Professor
McGonagall showed the class how it had gone all silver and pointy and
gave Hermione a rare smile.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0f080b3b977f4028def7079c802c2d57</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3002">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eb98f34656a65ee36e748e94256ebd6c</data>
      <data key="v_content">The class everyone had really been looking forward to was Defense
Against the Dark Arts, but Quirrell&apos;s lessons turned out to be a bit of
a joke.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eb98f34656a65ee36e748e94256ebd6c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3003">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-50d21d9da313215b4164df9ebcc2dc18</data>
      <data key="v_content">His classroom smelled strongly of garlic, which everyone said
was to ward off a vampire he&apos;d met in Romania and was afraid would be
coming back to get him one of these days.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-50d21d9da313215b4164df9ebcc2dc18</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3004">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-203ea6d4b46dc28e1504ea3e1bb60a97</data>
      <data key="v_content">hetold,His turban, he told them, had
been given to him by an African prince as a thank-you for getting rid of
a troublesome zombie, but they weren&apos;t sure they believed this story.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-203ea6d4b46dc28e1504ea3e1bb60a97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3005">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8a6a4d113b0a799132ca1bd6c924ba64</data>
      <data key="v_content">when,For one thing, when Seamus Finnigan asked eagerly to hear how Quirrell
had fought off the zombie, Quirrell went pink and started talking about
the weather; for another, they had noticed that a funny smell hung
around the turban, and the Weasley twins insisted that it was stuffed
full of garlic as well, so that Quirrell was protected wherever he went.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8a6a4d113b0a799132ca1bd6c924ba64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3006">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-96dd829978a082932896832330c8e7f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry was very relieved to find out that he wasn&apos;t miles behind everyone
else.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-96dd829978a082932896832330c8e7f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3007">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1d7e612abc29e2ecd457abb2c0334303</data>
      <data key="v_content">Lots of people had come from Muggle families and, like him, hadn&apos;t
had any idea that they were witches and wizards.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1d7e612abc29e2ecd457abb2c0334303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3008">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b7f5bb0689d047e31e960c5af817e40e</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was so much to
learn that even people like Ron didn&apos;t have much of a head start.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b7f5bb0689d047e31e960c5af817e40e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3009">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-03971b4c04ccd01a52b07deb94ab6b07</data>
      <data key="v_content">Friday was an important day for Harry and Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-03971b4c04ccd01a52b07deb94ab6b07</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3010">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4620c5cb433ae138839b135b084a12ff</data>
      <data key="v_content">They finally managed to
find their way down to the Great Hall for breakfast without getting lost
once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4620c5cb433ae138839b135b084a12ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3011">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a1b82f8aa9676725d1d2875aa4238f6d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What have we got today?&quot; Harry asked Ron as he poured sugar on his
porridge.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a1b82f8aa9676725d1d2875aa4238f6d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3012">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-30d751810c21423b4523c433d2301d59</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Double Potions with the Slytherins,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-30d751810c21423b4523c433d2301d59</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3013">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b7c41ebcbfb204c9070c6fc87b3d6d60</data>
      <data key="v_content">They say he always favors them -- we&apos;ll be able to see
if it&apos;s true.&quot;
&quot;Wish McGonagall favored us, &quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b7c41ebcbfb204c9070c6fc87b3d6d60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3014">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ea0f1bf6d29690ac63fe098e4f362ef4</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall was head
of Gryffindor House, but it hadn&apos;t stopped her from giving them a huge
pile of homework the day before.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ea0f1bf6d29690ac63fe098e4f362ef4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3015">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bbd5b58e8388cbd3154f05562d89f2f2</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had gotten used to this by now, but
it had given him a bit of a shock on the first morning, when about a
hundred owls had suddenly streamed into the Great Hall during breakfast,
108
circling the tables until they saw their owners, and dropping letters
and packages onto their laps.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bbd5b58e8388cbd3154f05562d89f2f2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3016">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a46cf466342736700d2755a9144e4224</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hedwig hadn&apos;t brought Harry anything so far.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a46cf466342736700d2755a9144e4224</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3017">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e363c828d3b8debd75b6f8c46ac8d65e</data>
      <data key="v_content">She sometimes flew in to
nibble his ear and have a bit of toast before going off to sleep in the
owlery with the other school owls.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e363c828d3b8debd75b6f8c46ac8d65e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3018">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-94c4e898e7876d8a5e91da2b3df9ea7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">however,she,This morning, however, she fluttered
down between the marmalade and the sugar bowl and dropped a note onto
Harry&apos;s plate.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-94c4e898e7876d8a5e91da2b3df9ea7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3019">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f2367d413796f48a9e4e78bc322db627</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry tore it open at once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f2367d413796f48a9e4e78bc322db627</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3020">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-82a82aa174bc4306374e0eff8b7ba721</data>
      <data key="v_content">ina,It said, in a very untidy
scrawl:
Dear Harry,
I know you get Friday afternoons off, so would you like to come and have
a cup of tea with me around three?
I want to hear all about your first week.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-82a82aa174bc4306374e0eff8b7ba721</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3021">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b82d0ccf680cc9f4fb918919da435c67</data>
      <data key="v_content">Send us an answer back with
Hedwig.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b82d0ccf680cc9f4fb918919da435c67</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3022">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-535db356cf7ec7ddf545ceccf97bf40b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid
Harry borrowed Ron&apos;s quill, scribbled Yes, please, see you later on the
back of the note, and sent Hedwig off again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-535db356cf7ec7ddf545ceccf97bf40b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3023">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9d2ae4e6067f5769ce15b1d0bf27ab4c</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was lucky that Harry had tea with Hagrid to look forward to, because
the Potions lesson turned out to be the worst thing that had happened to
him so far.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9d2ae4e6067f5769ce15b1d0bf27ab4c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3024">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1b73d3b64927ba6a70e93ca3a642fca3</data>
      <data key="v_content">,At the start-of-term banquet, Harry had gotten the idea that Professor
Snape disliked him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1b73d3b64927ba6a70e93ca3a642fca3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3025">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-00d21427ddb6a9831b67fe9fa8b757ef</data>
      <data key="v_content">By the end of the first Potions lesson, he knew he&apos;d
been wrong.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-00d21427ddb6a9831b67fe9fa8b757ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3026">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8b67135b1d1c58532ca185c9a74f2f1a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape didn&apos;t dislike Harry -- he hated him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8b67135b1d1c58532ca185c9a74f2f1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3027">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0c0edebe918a1260a114e31a1508f6cd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Potions lessons took place down in one of the dungeons.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0c0edebe918a1260a114e31a1508f6cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3028">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b287901ee9d3f63bf1d0323f33ab0e7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was colder
here than up in the main castle, and would have been quite creepy enough
without the pickled animals floating in glass jars all around the walls.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b287901ee9d3f63bf1d0323f33ab0e7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3029">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-760d972f586e9206e337990a40aaf397</data>
      <data key="v_content">likeFlitwick,started,Snape, like Flitwick, started the class by taking the roll call, and
like Flitwick, he paused at Harry&apos;s name.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-760d972f586e9206e337990a40aaf397</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3030">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5a5c5b700cc533de8b0dc8b26d863a3f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Yes,&quot;hesaid,&quot;Ah, Yes,&quot; he said softly, &quot;Harry Potter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5a5c5b700cc533de8b0dc8b26d863a3f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3031">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0279d2a818fab548396fe08a8776e09e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Our new -- celebrity.&quot;
Draco Malfoy and his friends Crabbe and Goyle sniggered behind their
109
hands.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0279d2a818fab548396fe08a8776e09e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3032">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e7d8e76fbf16d750143763a16dbef763</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape finished calling the names and looked up at the class.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e7d8e76fbf16d750143763a16dbef763</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3033">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1c9fa2dad8cefe3b41c8dadabaefb582</data>
      <data key="v_content">His
eyes were black like Hagrid&apos;s, but they had none of Hagrid&apos;s warmth.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1c9fa2dad8cefe3b41c8dadabaefb582</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3034">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-903da51a9a77176f5ed1221ea4ba2b23</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were cold and empty and made you think of dark tunnels.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-903da51a9a77176f5ed1221ea4ba2b23</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3035">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-75aef1f8a9b078e910808d5ba52e92c3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You are here to learn the subtle science and exact art of
potionmaking,&quot; he began.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-75aef1f8a9b078e910808d5ba52e92c3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3036">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e502d5428e0ab695873f74f9a9664aaa</data>
      <data key="v_content">He spoke in barely more than a whisper, but
they caught every word -- like Professor McGonagall, Snape had y caught
every word -- like Professor McGonagall, Snape had the gift of keeping a
class silent without effort.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e502d5428e0ab695873f74f9a9664aaa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3037">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0a331fea1a534a96a1bfe758fce48494</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;As there is little foolish wand-waving
here, many of you will hardly believe this is magic.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0a331fea1a534a96a1bfe758fce48494</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3038">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c507db3737161d6d12efa23ab201eed4</data>
      <data key="v_content">I don&apos;t expect you
will really understand the beauty of the softly simmering cauldron with
its shimmering fumes, the delicate power of liquids that creep through
human veins, bewitching the mind, ensnaring the senses....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c507db3737161d6d12efa23ab201eed4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3039">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fccdab36b68fcc157742eec06218ce4b</data>
      <data key="v_content">I can teach
you how to bottle fame, brew glory, even stopper death -- if you aren&apos;t
as big a bunch of dunderheads as I usually have to teach.&quot;
More silence followed this little speech.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fccdab36b68fcc157742eec06218ce4b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3040">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c7342fa026d06bf19158ff5af22101ac</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Ron exchanged looks
with raised eyebrows.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c7342fa026d06bf19158ff5af22101ac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3041">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7ac77e4bfac3fb72208e6b302f10961f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione Granger was on the edge of her seat and
looked desperate to start proving that she wasn&apos;t a dunderhead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7ac77e4bfac3fb72208e6b302f10961f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3042">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-11a26aa27530d7497b527c75f1f43432</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What would I get if I added powdered
root of asphodel to an infusion of wormwood?&quot;
Powdered root of what to an infusion of what? Harry glanced at Ron, who
looked as stumped as he was; Hermione&apos;s hand had shot into the air.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-11a26aa27530d7497b527c75f1f43432</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3043">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e3b7b1f10c921523c40f196208d674e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">sit,&quot;,&quot;I don&apos;t know, sit,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e3b7b1f10c921523c40f196208d674e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3044">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5cef20e659090e2a9ec4bd4763b49696</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape&apos;s lips curled into a sneer.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5cef20e659090e2a9ec4bd4763b49696</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3045">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fec5a0b4d8679a281b3f40bb3920fb33</data>
      <data key="v_content">tut--fame,&quot;Tut, tut -- fame clearly isn&apos;t everything.&quot;
He ignored Hermione&apos;s hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fec5a0b4d8679a281b3f40bb3920fb33</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3046">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f8770021743e0895fc155add185a564e</data>
      <data key="v_content">wherewouldyou,Potter, where would you look if I told you to find me
a bezoar?&quot;
Hermione stretched her hand as high into the air as it would go without
her leaving her seat, but Harry didn&apos;t have the faintest idea what a
bezoar was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f8770021743e0895fc155add185a564e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3047">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-65df8268e3cd83e23c7fa666f14dad8b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He tried not to look at Malfoy, Crabbe, and Goyle, who were
shaking with laughter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-65df8268e3cd83e23c7fa666f14dad8b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3048">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5de41205f2165ff0fe3931c6937095e4</data>
      <data key="v_content">sit.&quot;,&quot;I don&apos;t know, sit.&quot; &quot;Thought you wouldn&apos;t open a book before coming,
110
eh, Potter?&quot; Harry forced himself to keep looking straight into those
cold eyes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5de41205f2165ff0fe3931c6937095e4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3049">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2f9c758fc0129fa7a1004befb53f49a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had looked through his books at the Dursleys&apos;, but did
Snape expect him to remember everything in One Thousand Magical Herbs
and Fungi?
Snape was still ignoring Hermione&apos;s quivering hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2f9c758fc0129fa7a1004befb53f49a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3050">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4027560da31a2251517f3997611dcadb</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;What is the difference, Potter, between monkshood and wolfsbane?&quot;
At this, Hermione stood up, her hand stretching toward the dungeon
ceiling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4027560da31a2251517f3997611dcadb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3051">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c960fd65846a1973195dd49709f363a9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;said,&quot;I don&apos;t know,&quot; said Harry quietly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c960fd65846a1973195dd49709f363a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3052">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fe33f491d14b7f8b06145c85fbe2e277</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;I think Hermione does, though, why
don&apos;t you try her?&quot;
A few people laughed; Harry caught Seamus&apos;s eye, and Seamus winked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fe33f491d14b7f8b06145c85fbe2e277</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3053">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0d43bd30944d340b2678336fd65e99eb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;hesnapped,&quot;Sit down,&quot; he snapped at Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0d43bd30944d340b2678336fd65e99eb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3054">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eafbced6c22ef2d1f1c19d666a061ee6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Potter,,&quot;For your information, Potter,
asphodel and wormwood make a sleeping potion so powerful it is known as
the Draught of Living Death.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eafbced6c22ef2d1f1c19d666a061ee6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3055">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-040d255ca8b25d3a5451a2c1028eef24</data>
      <data key="v_content">A bezoar is a stone taken from the stomach
of a goat and it will save you from most poisons.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-040d255ca8b25d3a5451a2c1028eef24</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3056">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aba1ded40f0ad23f85eb85f9ebc2d362</data>
      <data key="v_content">As for monkshood and
wolfsbane, they are the same plant, which also goes by the name of
aconite.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aba1ded40f0ad23f85eb85f9ebc2d362</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3057">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bac5f6c50c7463c450b8ccc827329b47</data>
      <data key="v_content">Well? Why aren&apos;t you all copying that down?&quot;
There was a sudden rummaging for quills and parchment.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bac5f6c50c7463c450b8ccc827329b47</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3058">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8ff835e7b62ca18c2ec6153893e3504a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape,Over the noise,
Snape said, &quot;And a point will be taken from Gryffindor House for your
cheek, Potter.&quot;
Things didn&apos;t improve for the Gryffindors as the Potions lesson
continued.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8ff835e7b62ca18c2ec6153893e3504a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3059">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f4bd85c1d9c6d68a4e3686d11f387752</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape put them all into pairs and set them to mixing up a
simple potion to cure boils.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f4bd85c1d9c6d68a4e3686d11f387752</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3060">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f2cfddba55be466bdf3c09a2654063c3</data>
      <data key="v_content">He swept around in his long black cloak,
watching them weigh dried nettles and crush snake fangs, criticizing
almost everyone except Malfoy, whom he seemed to like.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f2cfddba55be466bdf3c09a2654063c3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3061">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b2a5ed0e02b0ff1027550a2c1eba5ff9</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was just
telling everyone to look at the perfect way Malfoy had stewed his horned
slugs when clouds of acid green smoke and a loud hissing filled the
dungeon.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b2a5ed0e02b0ff1027550a2c1eba5ff9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3062">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6774338e546a3f503b74f109b057c0ca</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville had somehow managed to melt Seamus&apos;s cauldron into a
twisted blob, and their potion was seeping across the stone floor,
burning holes in people&apos;s shoes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6774338e546a3f503b74f109b057c0ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3063">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-06ff703699b2affbbb674419a6fa8db8</data>
      <data key="v_content">thewhole,Within seconds, the whole class was
standing on their stools while Neville, who had been drenched in the
potion when the cauldron collapsed, moaned in pain as angry red boils
sprang up all over his arms and legs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-06ff703699b2affbbb674419a6fa8db8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3064">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eb9ed8f91b407b608ee8371a4d0aa2ba</data>
      <data key="v_content">111
&quot;Idiot boy!&quot; snarled Snape, clearing the spilled potion away with one
wave of his wand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eb9ed8f91b407b608ee8371a4d0aa2ba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3065">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c2e7e4ba50d5906c94b4cd0b516b7876</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I suppose you added the porcupine quills before
taking the cauldron off the fire?&quot;
Neville whimpered as boils started to pop up all over his nose.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c2e7e4ba50d5906c94b4cd0b516b7876</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3066">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a68aea8f4f7c3c6e7b43499d62e49167</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Take him up to the hospital wing,&quot; Snape spat at Seamus.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a68aea8f4f7c3c6e7b43499d62e49167</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3067">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-501c3cdc91f056e7dd713872eba075bd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then he
rounded on Harry and Ron, who had been working next to Neville.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-501c3cdc91f056e7dd713872eba075bd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3068">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2d2d028d7df45873b4f17271f18f201e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You -- Potter -- why didn&apos;t you tell him not to add the quills? Thought
he&apos;d make you look good if he got it wrong, did you? That&apos;s another
point you&apos;ve lost for Gryffindor.&quot;
This was so unfair that Harry opened his mouth to argue, but Ron kicked
him behind their cauldron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2d2d028d7df45873b4f17271f18f201e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3069">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-64ed450367d3b40f30efc2e2e159bbcc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;he,&quot;Doi* push it,&quot; he muttered, &quot;I&apos;ve heard Snape can turn very nasty.&quot;
As they climbed the steps out of the dungeon an hour later, Harry&apos;s mind
was racing and his spirits were low.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-64ed450367d3b40f30efc2e2e159bbcc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3070">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-84df0c56a0546102a87538476d7aed65</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;d lost two points for Gryffindor
in his very first week -- why did Snape hate him so much? &quot;Cheer up,&quot;
said Ron, &quot;Snape&apos;s always taking points off Fred and George.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-84df0c56a0546102a87538476d7aed65</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3071">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7cddb812073046ed6b1c9fb56b173c9a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Can I come
and meet Hagrid with you?&quot;
At five to three they left the castle and made their way across the
grounds.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7cddb812073046ed6b1c9fb56b173c9a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3072">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1130fa3a94e195336e31a1a5025f851d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid lived in a small wooden house on the edge of the
forbidden forest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1130fa3a94e195336e31a1a5025f851d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3073">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7d30c10337c3b452e00e3c0d3152386f</data>
      <data key="v_content">A crossbow and a pair of galoshes were outside the
front door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7d30c10337c3b452e00e3c0d3152386f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3074">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e2659ec3ae0e0519011f98bd0bb9001b</data>
      <data key="v_content">When Harry knocked they heard a frantic scrabbling from inside and
several booming barks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e2659ec3ae0e0519011f98bd0bb9001b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3075">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c7b897d8a4758383e5c8a9419554f89d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then Hagrid&apos;s voice rang out, saying, &quot;Back, Fang
-- back.&quot;
Hagrid&apos;s big, hairy face appeared in the crack as he pulled the door
open.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c7b897d8a4758383e5c8a9419554f89d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3076">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8b41002f27d60def06f891f38458d390</data>
      <data key="v_content">Fang.&quot;Helet,&quot;Back, Fang.&quot;
He let them in, struggling to keep a hold on the collar of an enormous
black boarhound.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8b41002f27d60def06f891f38458d390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3077">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e51d2b9bf58ac806d0dbc923c05a17d7</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was only one room inside.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e51d2b9bf58ac806d0dbc923c05a17d7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3078">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2dbae31f1a8b2813d12cb6f69c002a61</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hams and pheasants were hanging from the
ceiling, a copper kettle was boiling on the open fire, and in the corner
112
stood a massive bed with a patchwork quilt over it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2dbae31f1a8b2813d12cb6f69c002a61</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3079">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-52d68503d5e55a74f64f4342cf4b4932</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;Make yerselves at home,&quot; said Hagrid, letting go of Fang, who bounded
straight at Ron and started licking his ears.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-52d68503d5e55a74f64f4342cf4b4932</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3080">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5889ba2be7112926b1ab5104f8d519a9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Fangwas,Like Hagrid, Fang was
clearly not as fierce as he looked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5889ba2be7112926b1ab5104f8d519a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3081">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-27b85b28d3b80e7244d179314a294028</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Harry,&quot;This is Ron,&quot; Harry told Hagrid, who was pouring boiling water into a
large teapot and putting rock cakes onto a plate.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-27b85b28d3b80e7244d179314a294028</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3082">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1ffb730e35666806a2ca1c8d2a5bf360</data>
      <data key="v_content">eh?&quot;said,&quot;Another Weasley, eh?&quot; said Hagrid, glancing at Ron&apos;s freckles.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1ffb730e35666806a2ca1c8d2a5bf360</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3083">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e98b71e585cd9709f8869a570b216378</data>
      <data key="v_content">I spent
half me life chasin&apos; yer twin brothers away from the forest.&quot;
The rock cakes were shapeless lumps with raisins that almost broke their
teeth, but Harry and Ron pretended to be enjoying them as they told
Hagrid all about their first -lessons.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e98b71e585cd9709f8869a570b216378</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3084">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca1e83b0438c45bb3f89e0acabd82c7e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Fang rested his head on Harry&apos;s
knee and drooled all over his robes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca1e83b0438c45bb3f89e0acabd82c7e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3085">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-338efc3377bba7b1e51c9dfd4c10f03b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Ron were delighted to hear Hagrid call Fitch &quot;that old git.&quot;
&quot;An&apos; as fer that cat, Mrs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-338efc3377bba7b1e51c9dfd4c10f03b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3086">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d3c17aafaa0c3b1fd0b81d2742664a30</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;dliketer,Norris, I&apos;d like ter introduce her to Fang
sometime.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d3c17aafaa0c3b1fd0b81d2742664a30</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3087">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c6e263b92480cad71cea3912a6f16a53</data>
      <data key="v_content">everytime,D&apos;yeh know, every time I go up ter the school, she follows me
everywhere? Can&apos;t get rid of her -- Fitch puts her up to it.&quot;
Harry told Hagrid about Snape&apos;s lesson.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c6e263b92480cad71cea3912a6f16a53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3088">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e6c657795402117260dc3d1d40a04b66</data>
      <data key="v_content">likeRon,told,Hagrid, like Ron, told Harry not
to worry about it, that Snape liked hardly any of the students.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e6c657795402117260dc3d1d40a04b66</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3089">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6cd2852c10924f1211c6c949ae1bfca8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But he seemed to really hate me.&quot;
&quot;Rubbish!&quot; said Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6cd2852c10924f1211c6c949ae1bfca8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3090">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-61e51183075f0dabbcd2c1bc21c519f1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Why should he?&quot;
Yet Harry couldn&apos;t help thinking that Hagrid didn&apos;t quite meet his eyes
when he said that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-61e51183075f0dabbcd2c1bc21c519f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3091">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8eea53e9b1fbf5f956460b57be2579e4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;How&apos;s yer brother Charlie?&quot; Hagrid asked Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8eea53e9b1fbf5f956460b57be2579e4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3092">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-25128f3a6357ddbc288c8fed06e15d36</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I liked him a lot --
great with animals.&quot;
Harry wondered if Hagrid had changed the subject on purpose.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-25128f3a6357ddbc288c8fed06e15d36</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3093">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c3a83b85f1dad64306b743f646f9a086</data>
      <data key="v_content">While Ron
told Hagrid all about Charlie&apos;s work with dragons, Harry picked up a
piece of paper that was lying on the table under the tea cozy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c3a83b85f1dad64306b743f646f9a086</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3094">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-642a65562bcfb54e5c4a477212da1f42</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was a
cutting from the Daily Prophet:
GRINGOTTS BREAK-IN LATEST
113
Investigations continue into the break-in at Gringotts on 31 July,
widely believed to be the work of Dark wizards or witches unknown.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-642a65562bcfb54e5c4a477212da1f42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3095">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f74bdf8e766c967d2149a17c9f67a7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Gringotts goblins today insisted that nothing had been taken.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f74bdf8e766c967d2149a17c9f67a7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3096">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b86dad9ec871dc193798f91400df51e9</data>
      <data key="v_content">The vault
that was searched had in fact been emptied the same day.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b86dad9ec871dc193798f91400df51e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3097">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9a6a3a9f608e4b28376b59c13e5b0afa</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But we&apos;re not telling you what was in there, so keep your noses out if
you know what&apos;s good for you,&quot; said a Gringotts spokesgoblin this
afternoon.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9a6a3a9f608e4b28376b59c13e5b0afa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3098">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6c3e684d270409a2dac7c4840db7bf83</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry remembered Ron telling him on the train that someone had tried to
rob Gringotts, but Ron hadn&apos;t mentioned the date.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6c3e684d270409a2dac7c4840db7bf83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3099">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9e8f7224931d66f9dc7d7bd6ef26fb7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;that,&quot;Hagrid!&quot; said Harry, &quot;that Gringotts break-in happened on my birthday!
It might&apos;ve been happening while we were there!&quot;
There was no doubt about it, Hagrid definitely didn&apos;t meet Harry&apos;s eyes
this time.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9e8f7224931d66f9dc7d7bd6ef26fb7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3100">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-debbde5e53421854f36828d50608bd49</data>
      <data key="v_content">He grunted and offered him another rock cake.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-debbde5e53421854f36828d50608bd49</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3101">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a76d59ba72fe4ca0327385fc9a681e57</data>
      <data key="v_content">The vault that was searched had in fact been emptied
earlier that same day.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a76d59ba72fe4ca0327385fc9a681e57</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3102">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-220ef88fbc56ea2262c6820cf6cfe300</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid had emptied vault seven hundred and
thirteen, if you could call it emptying, taking out that grubby little
package.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-220ef88fbc56ea2262c6820cf6cfe300</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3103">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1db4a60b11fbd78e7ab995373c8d4fba</data>
      <data key="v_content">Had that been what the thieves were looking for?
As Harry and Ron walked back to the castle for dinner, their pockets
weighed down with rock cakes they&apos;d been too polite to refuse, Harry
thought that none of the lessons he&apos;d had so far had given him as much
to think about as tea with Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1db4a60b11fbd78e7ab995373c8d4fba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3104">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa0e4fc7207507e0c86f68aad4ef0834</data>
      <data key="v_content">Had Hagrid collected that package
just in time? Where was it now? And did Hagrid know something about
Snape that he didn&apos;t want to tell Harry?
CHAPTER NINE
THE MIDNIGHT DUEL
Harry had never believed he would meet a boy he hated more than Dudley,
but that was before he met Draco Malfoy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa0e4fc7207507e0c86f68aad4ef0834</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3105">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-acc21b31a2133940d57f60a64c3ef14e</data>
      <data key="v_content">first-yearGryffindorsonly,Still, first-year
Gryffindors only had Potions with the Slytherins, so they didn&apos;t have to
put up with Malfoy much.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-acc21b31a2133940d57f60a64c3ef14e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3106">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-224848da912783e1c334afd40d0e3d0c</data>
      <data key="v_content">they,Or at least, they didn&apos;t until they spotted a
notice pinned up in the Gryffindor common room that made them all groan.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-224848da912783e1c334afd40d0e3d0c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3107">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b4135bf6cb1c32492bb5095f8a16eead</data>
      <data key="v_content">Flying lessons would be starting on Thursday -- and Gryffindor and
Slytherin would be learning together.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b4135bf6cb1c32492bb5095f8a16eead</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3108">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6bba475f8a8eec4ded8669db444eb309</data>
      <data key="v_content">To make a fool
of myself on a broomstick in front of Malfoy.&quot;
He had been looking forward to learning to fly more than anything else.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6bba475f8a8eec4ded8669db444eb309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3109">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-03c7b47a7218afa254a4020b15c7e1c4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You don&apos;t know that you&apos;ll make a fool of yourself,&quot; said Ron
reasonably.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-03c7b47a7218afa254a4020b15c7e1c4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3110">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-700dc6de17a7cb2327b49c82bfa912be</data>
      <data key="v_content">IknowMalfoy&apos;s,&quot;Anyway, I know Malfoy&apos;s always going on about how good he
is at Quidditch, but I bet that&apos;s all talk.&quot;
Malfay certainly did talk about flying a lot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-700dc6de17a7cb2327b49c82bfa912be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3111">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa8f74c1ed467ecac48664dfe00ed3d6</data>
      <data key="v_content">He complained loudly about
first years never getting on the house Quidditch teams and told long,
boastful stories that always seemed to end with him narrowly escaping
Muggles in helicopters.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa8f74c1ed467ecac48664dfe00ed3d6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3112">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-29ef734aded071494f36c37a3911a943</data>
      <data key="v_content">He wasn&apos;t the only one, though: the way Seamus
Finnigan told it, he&apos;d spent most of his childhood zooming around the
countryside on his broomstick.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-29ef734aded071494f36c37a3911a943</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3113">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-305cef41eceb38f30fe802305b933aa8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Even Ron would tell anyone who&apos;d listen
about the time he&apos;d almost hit a hang glider on Charlie&apos;s old broom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-305cef41eceb38f30fe802305b933aa8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3114">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1f678ba367709e1c979edabb924798bf</data>
      <data key="v_content">Everyone from wizarding families talked about Quidditch constantly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1f678ba367709e1c979edabb924798bf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3115">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f8de0fd274e5a15aa3bf1bc60932f904</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron
had already had a big argument with Dean Thomas, who shared their
dormitory, about soccer.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f8de0fd274e5a15aa3bf1bc60932f904</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3116">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f6cb26024e8aa7550779afe314d7a6c1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron couldn&apos;t see what was exciting about a game
with only one ball where no one was allowed to fly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f6cb26024e8aa7550779afe314d7a6c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3117">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-89ff545f5ec0f559432b1152037f219c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had caught Ron
prodding Dean&apos;s poster of West Ham soccer team, trying to make the
players move.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-89ff545f5ec0f559432b1152037f219c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3118">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-039f18096f65528ec1f27340dcf497c0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville had never been on a broomstick in his life, because his
grandmother had never let him near one.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-039f18096f65528ec1f27340dcf497c0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3119">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-519d347e6e0dcf362e219c542f3f808c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harryfeltshe&apos;d,Privately, Harry felt she&apos;d had
good reason, because Neville managed to have an extraordinary number of
accidents even with both feet on the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-519d347e6e0dcf362e219c542f3f808c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3120">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c9371162e7d432ffd4d0cfd628509307</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione Granger was almost as nervous about flying as Neville was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c9371162e7d432ffd4d0cfd628509307</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3121">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ffd99a72082c1e08699c4d3e4e3a3066</data>
      <data key="v_content">This
was something you couldn&apos;t learn by heart out of a book -- not that she
hadn&apos;t tried.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ffd99a72082c1e08699c4d3e4e3a3066</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3122">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-84815bf2ecf94cc21f00698ce0ee06fa</data>
      <data key="v_content">At breakfast on Thursday she bored them all stupid with
flying tips she&apos;d gotten out of a library book called Quidditch Through
the Ages.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-84815bf2ecf94cc21f00698ce0ee06fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3123">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6b4e02ab0e7e7a30be327d1b41eed0ba</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville was hanging on to her every word, desperate for
anything that might help him hang on to his broomstick later, but
everybody else was very pleased when Hermione&apos;s lecture was interrupted
by the arrival of the mail.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6b4e02ab0e7e7a30be327d1b41eed0ba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3124">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d047ae74cdafcd1aa1e270b8cc17b98f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry hadn&apos;t had a single letter since Hagrid&apos;s note, something that
Malfoy had been quick to notice, of course.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d047ae74cdafcd1aa1e270b8cc17b98f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3125">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8ef5213b885fa5b014214d0a923d0075</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy&apos;s eagle owl was
always bringing him packages of sweets from home, which he opened
gloatingly at the Slytherin table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8ef5213b885fa5b014214d0a923d0075</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3126">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4e8b9f0a55f2f041cdd81b73736b343d</data>
      <data key="v_content">A barn owl brought Neville a small package from his grandmother.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4e8b9f0a55f2f041cdd81b73736b343d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3127">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-944c348f9d834d54132e9851969d2cd1</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
115
opened it excitedly and showed them a glass ball the size of a large
marble, which seemed to be full of white smoke.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-944c348f9d834d54132e9851969d2cd1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3128">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b9e4c523efa68a3a86441b36056cdb16</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Gran knows I forget things -- this
tells you if there&apos;s something you&apos;ve forgotten to do.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b9e4c523efa68a3a86441b36056cdb16</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3129">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-030a1521af152184675cb32c78a0ee7b</data>
      <data key="v_content">youholdit,Look, you hold it
tight like this and if it turns red -- oh...&quot; His face fell, because the
Remembrall had suddenly glowed scarlet,
&quot;You&apos;ve forgotten something...&quot;
Neville was trying to remember what he&apos;d forgotten when Draco Malfoy,
who was passing the Gryffindor table, snatched the Remembrall out of his
hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-030a1521af152184675cb32c78a0ee7b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3130">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9b51d436c746a322d65faa065e454629</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Ron jumped to their feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9b51d436c746a322d65faa065e454629</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3131">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7b0670eccc632140fcea80cc296afb24</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were half hoping for a reason
to fight Malfay, but Professor McGonagall, who could spot trouble
quicker than any teacher in the school, was there in a flash.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7b0670eccc632140fcea80cc296afb24</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3132">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-24be05835ab37b4933f0b118cae2f99a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What&apos;s going on?&quot;
&quot;Malfoy&apos;s got my Remembrall, Professor.&quot;
Scowling, Malfoy quickly dropped the Remembrall back on the table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-24be05835ab37b4933f0b118cae2f99a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3133">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-11c595486843413ba34be6aaa6fadd36</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;hesaid,,&quot;Just looking,&quot; he said, and he sloped away with Crabbe and Goyle behind
him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-11c595486843413ba34be6aaa6fadd36</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3134">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e77e5529ee6996e89cea8e4b2a963c88</data>
      <data key="v_content">,At three-thirty that afternoon, Harry, Ron, and the other Gryffindors
hurried down the front steps onto the grounds for their first flying
lesson.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e77e5529ee6996e89cea8e4b2a963c88</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3135">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-44fe06a48a68c8ebeed876743307e249</data>
      <data key="v_content">,It was a clear, breezy day, and the grass rippled under their
feet as they marched down the sloping lawns toward a smooth, flat lawn
on the opposite side of the grounds to the forbidden forest, whose trees
were swaying darkly in the distance.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-44fe06a48a68c8ebeed876743307e249</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3136">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c407a727efb0e362ca764a24644a2485</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Slytherins were already there, and so were twenty broomsticks lying
in neat lines on the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c407a727efb0e362ca764a24644a2485</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3137">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aeac578bced77fd8ea2b2b69231ca3a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had heard Fred and George Weasley
complain about the school brooms, saying that some of them started to
vibrate if you flew too high, or always flew slightly to the left.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aeac578bced77fd8ea2b2b69231ca3a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3138">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-434fb689744a2163a14a7fca51981bc8</data>
      <data key="v_content">gray,She had short, gray hair, and
yellow eyes like a hawk.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-434fb689744a2163a14a7fca51981bc8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3139">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9f40266d00db533622d3d9d102f4a445</data>
      <data key="v_content">whatareyou,&quot;Well, what are you all waiting for?&quot; she barked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9f40266d00db533622d3d9d102f4a445</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3140">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f7c9092d6e297110f988babd6a640b52</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Everyone stand by a
116
broomstick.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f7c9092d6e297110f988babd6a640b52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3141">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-19ea38a39d7f4c132a41b2198c172101</data>
      <data key="v_content">hurryup.&quot;,Come on, hurry up.&quot;
Harry glanced down at his broom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-19ea38a39d7f4c132a41b2198c172101</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3142">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-79e4df41946316ca88296f3f0ec4ccc9</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was old and some of the twigs stuck
out at odd angles.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-79e4df41946316ca88296f3f0ec4ccc9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3143">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-853d1cd2b1734d42acceaf4710fda45d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Stick out your right hand over your broom,&quot; called Madam Hooch at the
front, &quot;and say &apos;Up!&quot;&apos;
&quot;UPF everyone shouted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-853d1cd2b1734d42acceaf4710fda45d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3144">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a4429a8b54b15b2c4cb9ab88e9a7e112</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry&apos;s broom jumped into his hand at once, but it was one of the few
that did.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a4429a8b54b15b2c4cb9ab88e9a7e112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3145">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bba2baf2d357ce83dc3400d9db586f8b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione Granger&apos;s had simply rolled over on the ground, and
Neville&apos;s hadn&apos;t moved at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bba2baf2d357ce83dc3400d9db586f8b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3146">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d0783761fd64872d4d672ea481daff44</data>
      <data key="v_content">likehorses,,Perhaps brooms, like horses, could tell
when you were afraid, thought Harry; there was a quaver in Neville&apos;s
voice that said only too clearly that he wanted to keep his feet on the
ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d0783761fd64872d4d672ea481daff44</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3147">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-56fca96462b4fc56fb67f107011ffba5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Madam Hooch then showed them how to mount their brooms without sliding
off the end, and walked up and down the rows correcting their grips.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-56fca96462b4fc56fb67f107011ffba5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3148">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-69b1024771bd2398dc8c6ad840e21086</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Ron were delighted when she told Malfoy he&apos;d been doing it
wrong for years.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-69b1024771bd2398dc8c6ad840e21086</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3149">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6ed3f45e2252d7e8513714934b42a62d</data>
      <data key="v_content">whenIblow,&quot;Now, when I blow my whistle, you kick off from the ground, hard,&quot; said
Madam Hooch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6ed3f45e2252d7e8513714934b42a62d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3150">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-35f33240eaa0722d63ebd1405904edd9</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Keep your brooms steady, rise a few feet, and then come
straight back down by leaning forward slightly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-35f33240eaa0722d63ebd1405904edd9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3151">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b21e217f0a469c59fe4d2d6c0b6cbb4f</data>
      <data key="v_content">On my whistle -- three
-- two --&quot;
But Neville, nervous and jumpy and frightened of being left on the
ground, pushed off hard before the whistle had touched Madam Hooch&apos;s
lips.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b21e217f0a469c59fe4d2d6c0b6cbb4f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3152">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2f5d02c61e0ed7f612158deddb4ef6f9</data>
      <data key="v_content">boy!&quot;she,&quot;Come back, boy!&quot; she shouted, but Neville was rising straight up like a
cork shot out of a bottle -- twelve feet -- twenty feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2f5d02c61e0ed7f612158deddb4ef6f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3153">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-08f99e5634cc0e5662171992906c9873</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry saw his
scared white face look down at the ground falling away, saw him gasp,
slip sideways off the broom and --
WHAM -- a thud and a nasty crack and Neville lay facedown on the grass
in a heap.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-08f99e5634cc0e5662171992906c9873</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3154">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-29abd296c47c7b4429b175f2e3f06bda</data>
      <data key="v_content">His broomstick was still rising higher and higher, and
started to drift lazily toward the forbidden forest and out of sight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-29abd296c47c7b4429b175f2e3f06bda</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3155">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cf320e6a1cabbcf41ca81fea200f1f16</data>
      <data key="v_content">Madam Hooch was bending over Neville, her face as white as his.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cf320e6a1cabbcf41ca81fea200f1f16</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3156">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6772450607024f69180fa43109f92847</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Harryheard,&quot;Broken wrist,&quot; Harry heard her mutter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6772450607024f69180fa43109f92847</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3157">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-130b61fd54cded4ebb792329f40f1ba6</data>
      <data key="v_content">boy--,&quot;Come on, boy -- it&apos;s all right,
117
up you get.&quot;.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-130b61fd54cded4ebb792329f40f1ba6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3158">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f5de53a6076fd45eccae67936c3fa5c2</data>
      <data key="v_content">She turned to the rest of the class.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f5de53a6076fd45eccae67936c3fa5c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3159">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e6592ef39c0ee0f7158234776f3d9c6d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;None of you is to move while I take this boy to the hospital wing! You
leave those brooms where they are or you&apos;ll be out of Hogwarts before
you can say &apos;Quidditch.&apos; Come on, dear.&quot;
Neville, his face tear-streaked, clutching his wrist, hobbled off with
Madam Hooch, who had her arm around him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e6592ef39c0ee0f7158234776f3d9c6d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3160">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-53961724e07837c4ef33a9e0792dd983</data>
      <data key="v_content">No sooner were they out of earshot than Malfoy burst into laughter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-53961724e07837c4ef33a9e0792dd983</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3161">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1cd8a6c3e591c433a3956508a11edc99</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Did you see his face, the great lump?&quot;
The other Slytherins joined in.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1cd8a6c3e591c433a3956508a11edc99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3162">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-26df081b503d9b7d325e58fc37a5608c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy,&quot;snapped,&quot;Shut up, Malfoy,&quot; snapped Parvati Patil.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-26df081b503d9b7d325e58fc37a5608c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3163">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c0d76c3e0004ac76188f6c970d582812</data>
      <data key="v_content">stickingupfor,&quot;Ooh, sticking up for Longbottom?&quot; said Pansy Parkinson, a hard-faced
Slytherin girl.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c0d76c3e0004ac76188f6c970d582812</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3164">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ac4663811ae19f01e776bf8816ef42f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Never thought you&apos;d like fat little crybabies,
Parvati.&quot;
&quot;Look!&quot; said Malfoy, darting forward and snatching something out of the
grass.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ac4663811ae19f01e776bf8816ef42f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3165">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec41ada7aaa20a770a29dfe042ac15e3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s that stupid thing Longbottom&apos;s gran sent him.&quot;
The Remembrall glittered in the sun as he held it up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec41ada7aaa20a770a29dfe042ac15e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3166">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6eb9214f4b172352b36d53135fa5e16c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy,&quot;,&quot;Give that here, Malfoy,&quot; said Harry quietly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6eb9214f4b172352b36d53135fa5e16c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3167">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-21f03996fcc76e18c2e639ba9d75cd65</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I think I&apos;ll leave it somewhere for Longbottom to find -- how about --
up a tree?&quot;
&quot;Give it here!&quot; Harry yelled, but Malfoy had leapt onto his broomstick
and taken off.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-21f03996fcc76e18c2e639ba9d75cd65</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3168">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c5c47ed44dd21de87e170466944c3459</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He hadn&apos;t been lying, he could fly well.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c5c47ed44dd21de87e170466944c3459</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3169">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c403a23f1338a8fd6c5f032ddbfd23cd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hovering level
with the topmost branches of an oak he called, &quot;Come and get it,
Potter!&quot;
Harry grabbed his broom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c403a23f1338a8fd6c5f032ddbfd23cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3170">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-833d8c12a9074b14d53d783edeceecc1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Madam Hooch told us not to move --
you&apos;ll get us all into trouble.&quot;
Harry ignored her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-833d8c12a9074b14d53d783edeceecc1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3171">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-18ffbe4e808e69ebb8c55edf015ddc8d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Blood was pounding in his ears.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-18ffbe4e808e69ebb8c55edf015ddc8d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3172">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e09bdceae4f96b6dc30077bd47d2c542</data>
      <data key="v_content">He mounted the broom
and kicked hard against the ground and up, up he soared; air rushed
through his hair, and his robes whipped out behind him -and in a rush of
fierce joy he realized he&apos;d found something he could do without being
taught -- this was easy, this was wonderful.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e09bdceae4f96b6dc30077bd47d2c542</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3173">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8af33e3a2272a06d88d2aa23dc105424</data>
      <data key="v_content">He pulled his broomstick up
a little to take it even higher, and heard screams and gasps of girls
back on the ground and an admiring whoop from Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8af33e3a2272a06d88d2aa23dc105424</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3174">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6af1ecd0aefa8049781f95be5ee5872e</data>
      <data key="v_content">He turned his broomstick sharply to face Malfoy in midair.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6af1ecd0aefa8049781f95be5ee5872e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3175">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9c4bd814dc346c243e12079d7bdaab45</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Harry,&quot;Give it here,&quot; Harry called, &quot;or I&apos;ll knock you off that broom!&quot; &quot;Oh,
yeah?&quot; said Malfoy, trying to sneer, but looking worried.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9c4bd814dc346c243e12079d7bdaab45</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3176">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ab397ca746f079b45d043fa5ecbaafdd</data>
      <data key="v_content">somehow,what,Harry knew, somehow, what to do.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ab397ca746f079b45d043fa5ecbaafdd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3177">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5d4da5d6c73d8804c700bbd6f0f63d28</data>
      <data key="v_content">He leaned forward and grasped the broom
tightly in both hands, and it shot toward Malfay like a javelin.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5d4da5d6c73d8804c700bbd6f0f63d28</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3178">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c2d8baea9b95f63b264ecba36e7bd225</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy
only just got out of the way in time; Harry made a sharp about-face and
held the broom steady.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c2d8baea9b95f63b264ecba36e7bd225</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3179">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0e29a384e630c77c671f87300b20da6d</data>
      <data key="v_content">A few people below were clapping.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0e29a384e630c77c671f87300b20da6d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3180">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7657b79ec6963a9c0177aa6088e07c7e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;No Crabbe and Goyle up here to save your neck, Malfoy,&quot; Harry called.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7657b79ec6963a9c0177aa6088e07c7e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3181">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5b6036c0a078159e9510bee7b8f01e62</data>
      <data key="v_content">The same thought seemed to have struck Malfoy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5b6036c0a078159e9510bee7b8f01e62</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3182">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-232f7e91fde69aee1b378266e7a36fb8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Catch it if you can, then!&quot; he shouted, and he threw the glass ball
high into the air and streaked back toward the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-232f7e91fde69aee1b378266e7a36fb8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3183">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-db3146af72125e4ec64c296bc2607175</data>
      <data key="v_content">asthough,Harry saw, as though in slow motion, the ball rise up in the air and
then start to fall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-db3146af72125e4ec64c296bc2607175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3184">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-802f6e8b5d5676ffa657f9ef10e76131</data>
      <data key="v_content">He leaned forward and pointed his broom handle down
-- next second he was gathering speed in a steep dive, racing the ball
-- wind whistled in his ears, mingled with the screams of people
watching -- he stretched out his hand -- a foot from the ground he
caught it, just in time to pull his broom straight, and he toppled
gently onto the grass with the Remembrall clutched safely in his fist.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-802f6e8b5d5676ffa657f9ef10e76131</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3185">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c3a17ee41f3e46e97a1b7b56f091f5cc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;HARRY POTTER!&quot;
His heart sank faster than he&apos;d just dived.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c3a17ee41f3e46e97a1b7b56f091f5cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3186">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3f3a4b01d71a2d08563bc3c97db46cc8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall was
running toward them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3f3a4b01d71a2d08563bc3c97db46cc8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3187">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5de69b053964c5d8b2a7f01cbc208db5</data>
      <data key="v_content">He got to his feet, trembling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5de69b053964c5d8b2a7f01cbc208db5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3188">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-16dd41b571a74d8458d85b634d1c8884</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Never -- in all my time at Hogwarts --&quot;
119
Professor McGonagall was almost speechless with shock, and her glasses
flashed furiously, &quot;-- how dare you -- might have broken your neck --&quot;
&quot;It wasn&apos;t his fault, Professor --&quot;
&quot;Be quiet, Miss Patil
&quot;But Malfoy --&quot;
&quot;That&apos;s enough, Mr.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-16dd41b571a74d8458d85b634d1c8884</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3189">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-73f9534bd6a636a0a5f9d126ae494efe</data>
      <data key="v_content">followme,now.&quot;,Potter, follow me, now.&quot;
Harry caught sight of Malfoy, Crabbe, and Goyle&apos;s triumphant faces as he
left, walking numbly in Professor McGonagall&apos;s wake as she strode toward
the castle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-73f9534bd6a636a0a5f9d126ae494efe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3190">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-20c58a8a32e129352fd18c5e386d7233</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was going to be expelled, he just knew it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-20c58a8a32e129352fd18c5e386d7233</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3191">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2e3f3f13fb1e543756b0a3d260359d15</data>
      <data key="v_content">He wanted to
say something to defend himself, but there seemed to be something wrong
with his voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2e3f3f13fb1e543756b0a3d260359d15</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3192">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3597e92968a859c1b2b3f38d328fbde0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall was sweeping along without even
looking at him; he had to jog to keep up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3597e92968a859c1b2b3f38d328fbde0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3193">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-484f262cafa7ce2d69fe9aaa88d91378</data>
      <data key="v_content">He hadn&apos;t
even lasted two weeks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-484f262cafa7ce2d69fe9aaa88d91378</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3194">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b3fb6cd6db9faf081cfcb16bd1d43a04</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;d be packing his bags in ten minutes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b3fb6cd6db9faf081cfcb16bd1d43a04</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3195">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-40f3d40ecb0ac83804ff63e1c7e9bd66</data>
      <data key="v_content">What
would the Dursleys say when he turned up on the doorstep?
Up the front steps, up the marble staircase inside, and still Professor
McGonagall didn&apos;t say a word to him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-40f3d40ecb0ac83804ff63e1c7e9bd66</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3196">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-65b6545e93e910c42973f86d2c89d0b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">She wrenched open doors and marched
along corridors with Harry trotting miserably behind her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-65b6545e93e910c42973f86d2c89d0b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3197">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e0775cddabb016a2fce3bb790d4f570f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Maybe she was
taking him to Dumbledore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e0775cddabb016a2fce3bb790d4f570f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3198">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9c41d273f20fb3a56283eac284cea040</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He thought of Hagrid, expelled but allowed to
stay on as gamekeeper.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9c41d273f20fb3a56283eac284cea040</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3199">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ef5241e5ecf71806a757dd4227f6ae6e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Perhaps he could be Hagrid&apos;s assistant.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ef5241e5ecf71806a757dd4227f6ae6e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3200">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-73d6d43f8681ee3fc6c52d2e7ae09ded</data>
      <data key="v_content">His
stomach twisted as he imagined it, watching Ron and the others becoming
wizards, while he stumped around the grounds carrying Hagrid&apos;s bag.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-73d6d43f8681ee3fc6c52d2e7ae09ded</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3201">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d01bad2ec8ef6cec680d3dff66f58924</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall stopped outside a classroom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d01bad2ec8ef6cec680d3dff66f58924</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3202">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-89b7f1b114689a5520c9503593acdcbc</data>
      <data key="v_content">She opened the door
and poked her head inside.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-89b7f1b114689a5520c9503593acdcbc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3203">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-186cda8a3a6679ca5125053c77265339</data>
      <data key="v_content">ProfessorFlitwick,,&quot;Excuse me, Professor Flitwick, could I borrow Wood for a moment?&quot;
Wood? thought Harry, bewildered; was Wood a cane she was going to use on
him?
But Wood turned out to be a person, a burly fifth-year boy who came out
of Flitwicles class looking confused.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-186cda8a3a6679ca5125053c77265339</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3204">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-577ec7d9e4940b0f782b0f6988ae0351</data>
      <data key="v_content">youtwo,&quot;,&quot;Follow me, you two,&quot; said Professor McGonagall, and they marched on up
the corridor, Wood looking curiously at Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-577ec7d9e4940b0f782b0f6988ae0351</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3205">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2416e67004d6353609602944a8da7633</data>
      <data key="v_content">120
&quot;In here.&quot;
Professor McGonagall pointed them into a classroom that was empty except
for Peeves, who was busy writing rude words on the blackboard.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2416e67004d6353609602944a8da7633</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3206">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a8b71ed281afd7e9cec489cee6609e52</data>
      <data key="v_content">Peeves threw the chalk into a bin, which
clanged loudly, and he swooped out cursing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a8b71ed281afd7e9cec489cee6609e52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3207">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f603177a1e974172402cf5de55e0e00c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall slammed
the door behind him and turned to face the two boys.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f603177a1e974172402cf5de55e0e00c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3208">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-78fca1b924846fc23c898d1ee1d4ac51</data>
      <data key="v_content">Wood -- I&apos;ve found you a Seeker.&quot;
Wood&apos;s expression changed from puzzlement to delight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-78fca1b924846fc23c898d1ee1d4ac51</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3209">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-954c9c55fcdb3e3e1fffefab11991a64</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor?&quot;,&quot;Are you serious, Professor?&quot;
&quot;Absolutely,&quot; said Professor McGonagall crisply.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-954c9c55fcdb3e3e1fffefab11991a64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3210">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-15848e881c1c72bb65cb830b9c5ae8ca</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;ve never seen anything like it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-15848e881c1c72bb65cb830b9c5ae8ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3211">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f1c9cf9f1e59ffdcbfa60b4b60d63c1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Was that your first time on a
broomstick, Potter?&quot;
Harry nodded silently.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f1c9cf9f1e59ffdcbfa60b4b60d63c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3212">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6b75981177c2097dbc34d51c1a325c58</data>
      <data key="v_content">He didn&apos;t have a clue what was going on, but he
didn&apos;t seem to be being expelled, and some of the feeling started coming
back to his legs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6b75981177c2097dbc34d51c1a325c58</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3213">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-28b6cc033bf333b1119f275900564d73</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He caught that thing in his hand after a fifty-foot dive,&quot; Professor
McGonagall told Wood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-28b6cc033bf333b1119f275900564d73</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3214">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d94ca2f992cf9a0cea37e3869e36464f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Charlie Weasley
couldn&apos;t have done it.&quot;
Wood was now looking as though all his dreams had come true at once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d94ca2f992cf9a0cea37e3869e36464f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3215">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9e60fbeec5927ca60b1745444ec98015</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ever seen a game of Quidditch, Potter?&quot; he asked excitedly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9e60fbeec5927ca60b1745444ec98015</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3216">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-62dc0be09a2ef5e6c9786fd0d46519d5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Wood&apos;s captain of the Gryffindor team,&quot; Professor McGonagall explained.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-62dc0be09a2ef5e6c9786fd0d46519d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3217">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-22fae0ea8434a36bcb105a824f901f1d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He&apos;s just the build for a Seeker, too,&quot; said Wood, now walking around
Harry and staring at him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-22fae0ea8434a36bcb105a824f901f1d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3218">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2a951cfdbb53601341d293c410d84bcd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Light -- speedy -- we&apos;ll have to get him a
decent broom, Professor -- a Nimbus Two Thousand or a Cleansweep Seven,
I&apos;d say.&quot;
I shall speak to Professor Dumbledore and see if we can&apos;t bend the
first-year rule.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2a951cfdbb53601341d293c410d84bcd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3219">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8df4e68100122db5b158ce02be3337c6</data>
      <data key="v_content">weneed,Heaven knows, we need a better team than last year.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8df4e68100122db5b158ce02be3337c6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3220">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-33784e96cb118c74c33350cee347c1e9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Flattened in that last match by Slytherin, I couldn&apos;t look Severus Snape
in the face for weeks....&quot;
121
Professor McGonagall peered sternly over her glasses at Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-33784e96cb118c74c33350cee347c1e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3221">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e2c1b7846c31efeea67c3c1636270604</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I want to hear you&apos;re training hard, Potter, or I may change my mind
about punishing you.&quot;
Then she suddenly smiled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e2c1b7846c31efeea67c3c1636270604</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3222">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-437ae2558f0b5c39d5cd09a99ac13e71</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Your father would have been proud,&quot; she said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-437ae2558f0b5c39d5cd09a99ac13e71</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3223">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f451aefb925bf8db0774f4bf42ac38d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He was an excellent
Quidditch player himself.&quot;
&quot;You&apos;re joking.&quot;
It was dinnertime.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f451aefb925bf8db0774f4bf42ac38d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3224">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5c3ab09d58048f9ec39be8f8e68f1383</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had just finished telling Ron what had happened
when he&apos;d left the grounds with Professor McGonagall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5c3ab09d58048f9ec39be8f8e68f1383</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3225">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7597b1dbf4a7425199336c4396e2d030</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron had a piece of
steak and kidney pie halfway to his mouth, but he&apos;d forgotten all about
it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7597b1dbf4a7425199336c4396e2d030</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3226">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5107ffdd74d8d441998feb496d5d9881</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But first years never -- you must be the youngest
house player in about a century, said Harry, shoveling pie into his
mouth.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5107ffdd74d8d441998feb496d5d9881</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3227">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-afeb010adb3ffcc2be94e8ea535425a4</data>
      <data key="v_content">He felt particularly hungry after the excitement of the
afternoon.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-afeb010adb3ffcc2be94e8ea535425a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3228">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8170f6a09914c5c9f7af4cf20217f539</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Wood told me.&quot;
Ron was so amazed, so impressed, he just sat and gaped at Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8170f6a09914c5c9f7af4cf20217f539</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3229">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3185fd5abe7090ee9496c788afad6e83</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I start training next week,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3185fd5abe7090ee9496c788afad6e83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3230">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b57f5e0c5570cb323ab5962c2d3be503</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Only don&apos;t tell anyone, Wood
wants to keep it a secret.&quot;
Fred and George Weasley now came into the hall, spotted Harry, and
hurried over.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b57f5e0c5570cb323ab5962c2d3be503</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3231">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-12f6016ac96ad6e1493ef29176984c6a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidGeorge,&quot;Well done,&quot; said George in a low voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-12f6016ac96ad6e1493ef29176984c6a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3232">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-df66c6661fcdcbcb59f7f61963f01314</data>
      <data key="v_content">We&apos;re on the
team too -- Beaters.&quot;
&quot;I tell you, we&apos;re going to win that Quidditch cup for sure this year,&quot;
said Fred.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-df66c6661fcdcbcb59f7f61963f01314</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3233">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f1e4aed7d791b8915fa3b0246cef61d7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We haven&apos;t won since Charlie left, but this year&apos;s team is
going to be brilliant.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f1e4aed7d791b8915fa3b0246cef61d7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3234">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5d9e2f08339f14fb7b90b8de797bb3e3</data>
      <data key="v_content">,You must be good, Harry, Wood was almost skipping
when he told us.&quot;
&quot;Anyway, we&apos;ve got to go, Lee Jordan reckons he&apos;s found a new secret
passageway out of the school.&quot;
&quot;Bet it&apos;s that one behind the statue of Gregory the Smarmy that we found
in our first week.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5d9e2f08339f14fb7b90b8de797bb3e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3235">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-335b5cc3469e47a4053d7d605e4920b9</data>
      <data key="v_content">See you.&quot;
122
Fred and George had hardly disappeared when someone far less welcome
turned up: Malfoy, flanked by Crabbe and Goyle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-335b5cc3469e47a4053d7d605e4920b9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3236">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b8265abe1f9994a1a8b6993f10e88dad</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Having a last meal, Potter? When are you getting the train back to the
Muggles?&quot;
&quot;You&apos;re a lot braver now that you&apos;re back on the ground and you&apos;ve got
your little friends with you,&quot; said Harry coolly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b8265abe1f9994a1a8b6993f10e88dad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3237">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e5e615a8909482e374c34f6df36733f9</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was of course
nothing at all little about Crabbe and Goyle, but as the High Table was
full of teachers, neither of them could do more than crack their
knuckles and scowl.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e5e615a8909482e374c34f6df36733f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3238">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0cd2312177415f12ae540f3756830122</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;d take you on anytime on my own,&quot; said Malfoy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0cd2312177415f12ae540f3756830122</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3239">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5caecc0b3be5403cb303a253e4d6883c</data>
      <data key="v_content">What&apos;s the matter? Never heard
of a wizard&apos;s duel before, I suppose?&quot;
&quot;Of course he has,&quot; said Ron, wheeling around.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5caecc0b3be5403cb303a253e4d6883c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3240">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2f52dff4e405f1867a7bdd0477a51fb</data>
      <data key="v_content">who&apos;s,&quot;I&apos;m his second, who&apos;s
yours?&quot;
Malfoy looked at Crabbe and Goyle, sizing them up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2f52dff4e405f1867a7bdd0477a51fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3241">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-49338f0208ac5bbfdd3021f5f55fc9a9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Midnight all right? We&apos;ll meet you in the trophy
room; that&apos;s always unlocked.&quot;
When Malfoy had gone, Ron and Harry looked at each other.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-49338f0208ac5bbfdd3021f5f55fc9a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3242">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3b307a103e89dfffa36f99e2dd842061</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What is a
wizard&apos;s duel?&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3b307a103e89dfffa36f99e2dd842061</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3243">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9419756b5e11b54b992e522e9421d5d6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And what do you mean, you&apos;re my second?&quot;
&quot;Well, a second&apos;s there to take over if you die,&quot; said Ron casually,
getting started at last on his cold pie.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9419756b5e11b54b992e522e9421d5d6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3244">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8a637af3a32f017ce9b5a713d2a9cd95</data>
      <data key="v_content">Catching the look on Harry&apos;s
face, he added quickly, &quot;But people only die in proper duels, you know,
with real wizards.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8a637af3a32f017ce9b5a713d2a9cd95</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3245">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-17f5c9c3617fc4d7253d42cc4435f6b5</data>
      <data key="v_content">The most you and Malfoy&apos;ll be able to do is send
sparks at each other.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-17f5c9c3617fc4d7253d42cc4435f6b5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3246">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-49f8ee88b4d83b70e40cdf9a4e46131e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neither of you knows enough magic to do any real
damage.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-49f8ee88b4d83b70e40cdf9a4e46131e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3247">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ae2deb1adc37a2cb77f4c165f422e5b5</data>
      <data key="v_content">I bet he expected you to refuse, anyway.&quot;
&quot;And what if I wave my wand and nothing happens?&quot;
&quot;Throw it away and punch him on the nose,&quot; Ron suggested.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ae2deb1adc37a2cb77f4c165f422e5b5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3248">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-236de1debd7a674024f44531ec4002cb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Excuse me.&quot;
They both looked up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-236de1debd7a674024f44531ec4002cb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3249">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-71cf4345818971f17b7b6d613457b098</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Can&apos;t a person eat in peace in this place?&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-71cf4345818971f17b7b6d613457b098</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3250">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-39e4718c33ace66f0f929afe95a5dd46</data>
      <data key="v_content">123
Hermione ignored him and spoke to Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-39e4718c33ace66f0f929afe95a5dd46</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3251">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec11ea5d68396cc29ad06fdbf8943e45</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I couldn&apos;t help overhearing what you and Malfoy were saying --&quot;
&quot;Bet you could,&quot; Ron muttered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec11ea5d68396cc29ad06fdbf8943e45</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3252">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5f09617f1b673fc055e313a692c6c6c2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;--and you mustn&apos;t go wandering around the school at night, think of the
points you&apos;ll lose Gryffindor if you&apos;re caught, and you&apos;re bound to be.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5f09617f1b673fc055e313a692c6c6c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3253">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1835f2ca0808af625f0b7954616faa26</data>
      <data key="v_content">It&apos;s really very selfish of you.&quot;
&quot;And it&apos;s really none of your business,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1835f2ca0808af625f0b7954616faa26</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3254">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4a1b4b4084b7a56c9bd045ce9e5400dd</data>
      <data key="v_content">it,All the same, it wasn&apos;t what you&apos;d call the perfect end to the day,
Harry thought, as he lay awake much later listening to Dean and Seamus
falling asleep (Neville wasn&apos;t back from the hospital wing).</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4a1b4b4084b7a56c9bd045ce9e5400dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3255">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-69bd503bf5cdd20577c2a0bf7daf11fb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron had
spent all evening giving him advice such as &quot;If he tries to curse you,
you&apos;d better dodge it, because I can&apos;t remember how to block them.&quot;
There was a very good chance they were going to get caught by Filch or
Mrs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-69bd503bf5cdd20577c2a0bf7daf11fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3256">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-276f4676ec22d5237b2d8cb01273650e</data>
      <data key="v_content">andHarryfelt,Norris, and Harry felt he was pushing his luck, breaking another
school rule today.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-276f4676ec22d5237b2d8cb01273650e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3257">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1ef12e9711492ffe9c67d7e236d1b36f</data>
      <data key="v_content">,On the other hand, Malfoys sneering face kept looming
up out of the darkness - this was his big chance to beat Malfoy
face-to-face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1ef12e9711492ffe9c67d7e236d1b36f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3258">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-230ef2586e6763f3dcd0ae0071ca13a3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ronmuttered,&quot;Half-past eleven,&quot; Ron muttered at last, &quot;we&apos;d better go.&quot;
They pulled on their bathrobes, picked up their wands, and crept across
the tower room, down the spiral staircase, and into the Gryffindor
common room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-230ef2586e6763f3dcd0ae0071ca13a3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3259">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bb0273bc4e12b1238b8adc57fac870a1</data>
      <data key="v_content">A few embers were still glowing in the fireplace, turning
all the armchairs into hunched black shadows.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bb0273bc4e12b1238b8adc57fac870a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3260">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e9374b36541c542f55b8bfb0d4cbad4b</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had almost reached
the portrait hole when a voice spoke from the chair nearest them, &quot;I
can&apos;t believe you&apos;re going to do this, Harry.&quot;
A lamp flickered on.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e9374b36541c542f55b8bfb0d4cbad4b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3261">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a7937ba78dc0ce855a67040a87f11db8</data>
      <data key="v_content">,It was Hermione Granger, wearing a pink bathrobe
and a frown.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a7937ba78dc0ce855a67040a87f11db8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3262">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2cf1d036bd40c59fab510f022ee29341</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Go back to bed!&quot;
&quot;I almost told your brother,&quot; Hermione snapped, &quot;Percy -- he&apos;s a
prefect, he&apos;d put a stop to this.&quot;
Harry couldn&apos;t believe anyone could be so interfering.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2cf1d036bd40c59fab510f022ee29341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3263">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4787791bd8858167b81d3ed551d6d9da</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;he,124
&quot;Come on,&quot; he said to Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4787791bd8858167b81d3ed551d6d9da</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3264">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-25a3f074dbab2e595f3ba70345ebf7eb</data>
      <data key="v_content">He pushed open the portrait of the Fat Lady
and climbed through the hole.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-25a3f074dbab2e595f3ba70345ebf7eb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3265">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-205107a06d11ca3ceeb0df31ffbb1b55</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione wasn&apos;t going to give up that easily.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-205107a06d11ca3ceeb0df31ffbb1b55</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3266">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a797303ff92e638ca5dc945865304340</data>
      <data key="v_content">She followed Ron through
the portrait hole, hissing at them like an angry goose.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a797303ff92e638ca5dc945865304340</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3267">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec4988bc8e5fe5c08a4cfe2e81e4c957</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Don&apos;t you care about Gryffindor, do you only care about yourselves, I
don&apos;t want Slytherin to win the house cup, and you&apos;ll lose all the
points I got from Professor McGonagall for knowing about Switching
Spells.&quot;
&quot;Go away.&quot; &quot;All right, but I warned you, you just remember what I said
when you&apos;re on the train home tomorrow, you&apos;re so --&quot;
But what they were, they didn&apos;t find out.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec4988bc8e5fe5c08a4cfe2e81e4c957</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3268">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e13329c1481c85a6ff6ef04fb8e840f1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione had turned to the
portrait of the Fat Lady to get back inside and found herself facing an
empty painting.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e13329c1481c85a6ff6ef04fb8e840f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3269">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-21296d63ad9573a79f37362e1f6e8271</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Fat Lady had gone on a nighttime visit and Hermione
was locked out of Gryffindor tower.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-21296d63ad9573a79f37362e1f6e8271</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3270">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1bd17623ab1645806c16bc92b74c151f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Now what am I going to do?&quot; she asked shrilly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1bd17623ab1645806c16bc92b74c151f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3271">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c69d0f9e9a24ccc9a11629cdab07b082</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;We&apos;ve got to go, we 3 re going to be
late.&quot;
They hadn&apos;t even reached the end of the corridor when Hermione caught up
with them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c69d0f9e9a24ccc9a11629cdab07b082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3272">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cef87067e41833b646f05ce6f47748a8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;I&apos;m coming with you,&quot; she said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cef87067e41833b646f05ce6f47748a8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3273">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3fa00fa98c4d90eea7954303cad21f06</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You are not.&quot;
&quot;D&apos;you think I&apos;m going to stand out here and wait for Filch to catch me?
If he finds all three of us I&apos;ll tell him the truth, that I was trying
to stop you, and you can back me up.&quot;
&quot;You&apos;ve got some nerve --&quot; said Ron loudly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3fa00fa98c4d90eea7954303cad21f06</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3274">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f24ab5d7d17fee919facc70d598eaa1c</data>
      <data key="v_content">bothof,&quot;Shut up, both of you!&quot; said Harry sharply.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f24ab5d7d17fee919facc70d598eaa1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3275">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-21095eb6269ac5bb2cbf5b3efefb45d5</data>
      <data key="v_content">I heard something.&quot;
It was a sort of snuffling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-21095eb6269ac5bb2cbf5b3efefb45d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3276">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-59d331eeb215db1a891ea99f70cdcd41</data>
      <data key="v_content">squinting,Norris?&quot; breathed Ron, squinting through the dark.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-59d331eeb215db1a891ea99f70cdcd41</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3277">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-33a23eb5348815f3f3df33beb1e32867</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was curled up on the floor,
fast asleep, but jerked suddenly awake as they crept nearer.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-33a23eb5348815f3f3df33beb1e32867</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3278">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bd5bc1f11c7c9f0cac8baaa84fdbb574</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Thank goodness you found me! I&apos;ve been out here for hours, I couldn&apos;t
remember the new password to get in to bed.&quot;
&quot;Keep your voice down, Neville.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bd5bc1f11c7c9f0cac8baaa84fdbb574</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3279">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-926a21e58b23d717969c846a5ef4740c</data>
      <data key="v_content">The password&apos;s &apos;Pig snout&apos; but it won&apos;t
help you now, the Fat Lady&apos;s gone off somewhere.&quot;
&quot;How&apos;s your arm?&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-926a21e58b23d717969c846a5ef4740c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3280">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-928b085c60dfca8fab8328d1fb8bbea8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Madam Pomfrey mended it in about a
minute.&quot;
&quot;Good - well, look, Neville, we&apos;ve got to be somewhere, we&apos;ll see you
later --&quot;
&quot;Don&apos;t leave me!&quot; said Neville, scrambling to his feet, &quot;I don&apos;t want to
stay here alone, the Bloody Baron&apos;s been past twice already.&quot;
Ron looked at his watch and then glared furiously at Hermione and
Neville.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-928b085c60dfca8fab8328d1fb8bbea8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3281">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c8fadb56834377160c905cca893bf1dc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;If either of you get us caught, I&apos;ll never rest until I&apos;ve learned that
Curse of the Bogies Quirrell told us about, and used it on you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c8fadb56834377160c905cca893bf1dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3282">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cc541a702a5beb33352cc862f74728b2</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Hermione opened her mouth, perhaps to tell Ron exactly how to use the
Curse of the Bogies, but Harry hissed at her to be quiet and beckoned
them all forward.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cc541a702a5beb33352cc862f74728b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3283">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d985b581f31b8679056a5e569da4eb4d</data>
      <data key="v_content">They flitted along corridors striped with bars of moonlight from the
high windows.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d985b581f31b8679056a5e569da4eb4d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3284">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2b62af1f2a63fbad9374f82996750e6</data>
      <data key="v_content">At every turn Harry expected to run into Filch or Mrs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2b62af1f2a63fbad9374f82996750e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3285">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-56593c5d948f4a063f0376ae53ac1e0b</data>
      <data key="v_content">They sped up a staircase to the third floor
and tiptoed toward the trophy room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-56593c5d948f4a063f0376ae53ac1e0b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3286">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-df2a4725174a9a2b6e290840e8e1859c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy and Crabbe weren&apos;t there yet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-df2a4725174a9a2b6e290840e8e1859c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3287">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a45a66e13c1c4333e707e536449d86b</data>
      <data key="v_content">The crystal trophy cases glimmered
where the moonlight caught them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a45a66e13c1c4333e707e536449d86b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3288">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b6ce5642c98812152ee48c989b79d904</data>
      <data key="v_content">shields,plates,and,Cups, shields, plates, and statues
winked silver and gold in the darkness.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b6ce5642c98812152ee48c989b79d904</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3289">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-43d505bd8c257a8e312604307077e059</data>
      <data key="v_content">They edged along the walls,
keeping their eyes on the doors at either end of the room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-43d505bd8c257a8e312604307077e059</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3290">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-13e821aa2e192ab37b03ee56c2cd5efd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry took
out his wand in case Malfoy leapt in and started at once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-13e821aa2e192ab37b03ee56c2cd5efd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3291">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca016f2724beacc248e9e4526825e784</data>
      <data key="v_content">maybe,126
&quot;He&apos;s late, maybe he&apos;s chickened out,&quot; Ron whispered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca016f2724beacc248e9e4526825e784</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3292">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d619639ea81b22c094f35a15fd1247ec</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then a noise in the next room made them jump.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d619639ea81b22c094f35a15fd1247ec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3293">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6c7d13fb22391fec5b3602c70885d969</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had only just raised
his wand when they heard someone speak -and it wasn&apos;t Malfoy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6c7d13fb22391fec5b3602c70885d969</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3294">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-29ec89592981dce18be3c7f52993bdbf</data>
      <data key="v_content">mysweet,,&quot;Sniff around, my sweet, they might be lurking in a corner.&quot;
It was Filch speaking to Mrs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-29ec89592981dce18be3c7f52993bdbf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3295">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2522ae7864deea34f11251c5080e9889</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harrywavedmadly,Horror-struck, Harry waved madly
at the other three to follow him as quickly as possible; they scurried
silently toward the door, away from Filch&apos;s voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2522ae7864deea34f11251c5080e9889</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3296">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-76af0733528cecf6b970dc026e39db04</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville&apos;s robes had
barely whipped round the corner when they heard Filch enter the trophy
room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-76af0733528cecf6b970dc026e39db04</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3297">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e55f0650fdd68957dedb97d31656575d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;They&apos;re in here somewhere,&quot; they heard him mutter, &quot;probably hiding.&quot;
&quot;This way!&quot; Harry mouthed to the others and, petrified, they began to
creep down a long gallery full of suits of armor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e55f0650fdd68957dedb97d31656575d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3298">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e1f900d5432356490044efafea39c74b</data>
      <data key="v_content">They could hear Filch
getting nearer.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e1f900d5432356490044efafea39c74b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3299">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-163eab12439e5c192a6697a2295132e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville suddenly let out a frightened squeak and broke
into a run -he tripped, grabbed Ron around the waist, and the pair of
them toppled right into a suit of armor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-163eab12439e5c192a6697a2295132e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3300">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e3a2a0c238239b3d14a7aa4931363322</data>
      <data key="v_content">The clanging and crashing were enough to wake the whole castle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e3a2a0c238239b3d14a7aa4931363322</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3301">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-54ba84888db9df2168cd62bab6fa7702</data>
      <data key="v_content">and,&quot;RUN!&quot; Harry yelled, and the four of them sprinted down the gallery, not
looking back to see whether Filch was following -- they swung around the
doorpost and galloped down one corridor then another, Harry in the lead,
without any idea where they were or where they were going -- they ripped
through a tapestry and found themselves in a hidden passageway, hurtled
along it and came out near their Charms classroom, which they knew was
miles from the trophy room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-54ba84888db9df2168cd62bab6fa7702</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3302">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d75fc8d27e350da7cf1a50871d5e9afd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I think we&apos;ve lost him,&quot; Harry panted, leaning against the cold wall
and wiping his forehead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d75fc8d27e350da7cf1a50871d5e9afd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3303">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0b8a9a4ed19de501a6c9a3e38b612f1c</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Neville was bent double, wheezing and
spluttering.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0b8a9a4ed19de501a6c9a3e38b612f1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3304">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e456171b4d41d9fd37ad0de4ce859777</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,I -- told -you,&quot; Hermione gasped, clutching at the stitch in her chest,
&quot;I -- told -- you.&quot;
&quot;We&apos;ve got to get back to Gryffindor tower,&quot; said Ron, &quot;quickly as
possible.&quot;
&quot;Malfoy tricked you,&quot; Hermione said to Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e456171b4d41d9fd37ad0de4ce859777</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3305">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d3be9baec7cc3a19a58b6efef39698b7</data>
      <data key="v_content">don&apos;t,&quot;You realize that, don&apos;t
you? He was never going to meet you -- Filch knew someone was going to
127
be in the trophy room, Malfoy must have tipped him off.&quot;
Harry thought she was probably right, but he wasn&apos;t going to tell her
that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d3be9baec7cc3a19a58b6efef39698b7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3306">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0ce12bee39f7436cb4164bedfc10d572</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Let&apos;s go.&quot;
It wasn&apos;t going to be that simple.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0ce12bee39f7436cb4164bedfc10d572</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3307">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-764a24c01c5fff7453a33066fa118a94</data>
      <data key="v_content">They hadn&apos;t gone more than a dozen
paces when a doorknob rattled and something came shooting out of a
classroom in front of them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-764a24c01c5fff7453a33066fa118a94</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3308">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5df37a40420444926b3968c47c508ae7</data>
      <data key="v_content">He caught sight of them and gave a squeal of delight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5df37a40420444926b3968c47c508ae7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3309">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-76bfcf16b50d16dc813347ba49f7c69c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Peeves--,&quot;Shut up, Peeves -- please -- you&apos;ll get us thrown out.&quot;
Peeves cackled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-76bfcf16b50d16dc813347ba49f7c69c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3310">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fb5b1e61f38fad2cf7aafc147ca768a5</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Wandering around at midnight, Ickle Firsties? Tut, tut, tut.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fb5b1e61f38fad2cf7aafc147ca768a5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3311">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-231bf9da2bb7c3198b08892e28838281</data>
      <data key="v_content">naughty,you&apos;llget,Naughty,
naughty, you&apos;ll get caughty.&quot;
&quot;Not if you don&apos;t give us away, Peeves, please.&quot;
&quot;Should tell Filch, I should,&quot; said Peeves in a saintly voice, but his
eyes glittered wickedly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-231bf9da2bb7c3198b08892e28838281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3312">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-de703977cc80b14ba48809a653390216</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s for your own good, you know.&quot;
&quot;Get out of the way,&quot; snapped Ron, taking a swipe at Peeves this was a
big mistake.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-de703977cc80b14ba48809a653390216</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3313">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-289d628ce0805155a6119006a4fc4439</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;STUDENTS OUT OF BED!&quot; Peeves bellowed, &quot;STUDENTS OUT OF BED
DOWN THE
CHARMS CORRIDOR&quot;
Ducking under Peeves, they ran for their lives, right to the end of the
corridor where they slammed into a door -- and it was locked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-289d628ce0805155a6119006a4fc4439</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3314">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7583060bc7c6bbe259f488f406b1ab7f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;This is it!&quot; Ron moaned, as they pushed helplessly at the door, &quot;We&apos;re
done for! This is the end!&quot; They could hear footsteps, Filch running as
fast as he could toward Peeves&apos;s shouts.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7583060bc7c6bbe259f488f406b1ab7f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3315">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a91800a05ca104c0e4d74f1c9b3f086d</data>
      <data key="v_content">,She grabbed Harry&apos;s wand, tapped the
lock, and whispered, &apos;Alohomora!&quot;
The lock clicked and the door swung open -- they piled through it, shut
128
it quickly, and pressed their ears against it, listening.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a91800a05ca104c0e4d74f1c9b3f086d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3316">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ba661789fba7d03cc3f413c849a4dac3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Which way did they go, Peeves?&quot; Filch was saying.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ba661789fba7d03cc3f413c849a4dac3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3317">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-30b79abe05a47fe51a99af7188265c39</data>
      <data key="v_content">tellme.&quot;&quot;Say,&quot;Quick, tell me.&quot;
&quot;Say &apos;please.&quot;&apos;
&quot;Don&apos;t mess with me, Peeves, now where did they go?&quot;
&quot;Shan&apos;t say nothing if you don&apos;t say please,&quot; said Peeves in his
annoying singsong voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-30b79abe05a47fe51a99af7188265c39</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3318">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-34541464c7a0cd3805814384681efedb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;All right -please.&quot;
&quot;NOTHING! Ha haaa! Told you I wouldn&apos;t say nothing if you didn&apos;t say
please! Ha ha! Haaaaaa!&quot; And they heard the sound of Peeves whooshing
away and Filch cursing in rage.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-34541464c7a0cd3805814384681efedb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3319">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9f6e8e6eadee9723ac0551e3834537fa</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He thinks this door is locked,&quot; Harry whispered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9f6e8e6eadee9723ac0551e3834537fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3320">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-619ce2581e37d2b9237deb313d08257a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I think we&apos;ll be okay
-- get off, Neville!&quot; For Neville had been tugging on the sleeve of
Harry&apos;s bathrobe for the last minute.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-619ce2581e37d2b9237deb313d08257a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3321">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f8119b207bb943a5ce6270649b4205ca</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What?&quot;
Harry turned around -- and saw, quite clearly, what.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f8119b207bb943a5ce6270649b4205ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3322">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-49db4566d6ebd32c6a5fb893f7288549</data>
      <data key="v_content">he,For a moment, he
was sure he&apos;d walked into a nightmare -- this was too much, on top of
everything that had happened so far.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-49db4566d6ebd32c6a5fb893f7288549</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3323">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-783047e23e226f16e08338acded28166</data>
      <data key="v_content">They weren&apos;t in a room, as he had supposed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-783047e23e226f16e08338acded28166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3324">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e48b18971263367052abaab660efcf0a</data>
      <data key="v_content">The
forbidden corridor on the third floor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e48b18971263367052abaab660efcf0a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3325">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5e0e6242df5228f074468816dbf4bd94</data>
      <data key="v_content">And now they knew why it was
forbidden.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5e0e6242df5228f074468816dbf4bd94</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3326">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-581834db2dd285aa8830f5859becb240</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were looking straight into the eyes of a monstrous dog, a dog that
filled the whole space between ceiling and floor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-581834db2dd285aa8830f5859becb240</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3327">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-12a212b1aa869e6a8a18fa01a4707a73</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Three pairs of rolling, mad eyes; three noses, twitching
and quivering in their direction; three drooling mouths, saliva hanging
in slippery ropes from yellowish fangs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-12a212b1aa869e6a8a18fa01a4707a73</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3328">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-334fc829dbc89d01ffc262ccbe256bfb</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was standing quite still, all six eyes staring at them, and Harry
knew that the only reason they weren&apos;t already dead was that their
sudden appearance had taken it by surprise, but it was quickly getting
over that, there was no mistaking what those thunderous growls meant.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-334fc829dbc89d01ffc262ccbe256bfb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3329">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f23cbacafa7c7a83feb7827e75c65b5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry groped for the doorknob -- between Filch and death, he&apos;d take
Filch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f23cbacafa7c7a83feb7827e75c65b5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3330">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e249f7435a06ec02e119d1ed44ead497</data>
      <data key="v_content">129
They fell backward -- Harry slammed the door shut, and they ran, they
almost flew, back down the corridor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e249f7435a06ec02e119d1ed44ead497</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3331">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-578042bbb609af28b3e2c9a1aa3eb0fa</data>
      <data key="v_content">Filch must have hurried off to look
for them somewhere else, because they didn&apos;t see him anywhere, but they
hardly cared -- all they wanted to do was put as much space as possible
between them and that monster.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-578042bbb609af28b3e2c9a1aa3eb0fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3332">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8700130ab28fd2eb8bbb90f45bca67b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">They didn&apos;t stop running until they
reached the portrait of the Fat Lady on the seventh floor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8700130ab28fd2eb8bbb90f45bca67b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3333">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-78b33b4ba3cd90e070e384a370fb2423</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Where on earth have you all been?&quot; she asked, looking at their
bathrobes hanging off their shoulders and their flushed, sweaty faces.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-78b33b4ba3cd90e070e384a370fb2423</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3334">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1d5743348db76790fb1ab92905ec28ff</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Never mind that -- pig snout, pig snout,&quot; panted Harry, and the
portrait swung forward.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1d5743348db76790fb1ab92905ec28ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3335">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-459096b913d86f9c4e676c5ced3de93b</data>
      <data key="v_content">They scrambled into the common room and
collapsed, trembling, into armchairs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-459096b913d86f9c4e676c5ced3de93b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3336">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d18d7512c2a4765cc420002f86377140</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was a while before any of them said anything.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d18d7512c2a4765cc420002f86377140</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3337">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b0f50e69055f0c33661f8ea8598788a6</data>
      <data key="v_content">indeed,lookedas,Neville, indeed, looked
as if he&apos;d never speak again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b0f50e69055f0c33661f8ea8598788a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3338">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7067e7096db5e90cd5a4714633948fac</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What do they think they&apos;re doing, keeping a thing like that locked up
in a school?&quot; said Ron finally.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7067e7096db5e90cd5a4714633948fac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3339">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f75b2a832544dde95d9b8870d480965f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;If any dog needs exercise, that one
does.&quot;
Hermione had got both her breath and her bad temper back again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f75b2a832544dde95d9b8870d480965f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3340">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9d46e5b4410f23f479d6ada3e8d3b76c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You
don&apos;t use your eyes, any of you, do you?&quot; she snapped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9d46e5b4410f23f479d6ada3e8d3b76c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3341">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-018c4bab2a83aaeb161b38acf305f12e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Didn&apos;t you see
what it was standing on.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-018c4bab2a83aaeb161b38acf305f12e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3342">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c5478e74275f2c55714d35da0e162f8d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I wasn&apos;t looking at its feet, I was too
busy with its heads.&quot;
&quot;No, not the floor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c5478e74275f2c55714d35da0e162f8d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3343">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-038ed2d5796726b480021b6bb7f03fb9</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was standing on a trapdoor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-038ed2d5796726b480021b6bb7f03fb9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3344">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bd04f96f01b57ee02467ba958100b47c</data>
      <data key="v_content">It&apos;s obviously
guarding something.&quot;
She stood up, glaring at them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bd04f96f01b57ee02467ba958100b47c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3345">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c8466a8beda3c23d5a03a134bf115008</data>
      <data key="v_content">I hope you&apos;re pleased with yourselves.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c8466a8beda3c23d5a03a134bf115008</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3346">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-50a4c80781a875572080f271a43c40aa</data>
      <data key="v_content">We could all have been killed --
or worse, expelled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-50a4c80781a875572080f271a43c40aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3347">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8305fd36ca51841b2e521fe1f07a31cc</data>
      <data key="v_content">ifyoudon&apos;t,Now, if you don&apos;t mind, I&apos;m going to bed.&quot;
Ron stared after her, his mouth open.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8305fd36ca51841b2e521fe1f07a31cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3348">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-68a6a6b8482254acf75b016e948987c5</data>
      <data key="v_content">wedon&apos;tmind,&quot;,&quot;No, we don&apos;t mind,&quot; he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-68a6a6b8482254acf75b016e948987c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3349">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7c89d6d72174cbd5d42e975a3bb85444</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;d think we dragged her along,
wouldn&apos;t you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7c89d6d72174cbd5d42e975a3bb85444</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3350">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fc9469645367dfa3d5d54ae7d43d6f1a</data>
      <data key="v_content">But Hermione had given Harry something else to think about as he climbed
130
back into bed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fc9469645367dfa3d5d54ae7d43d6f1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3351">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-adebed25ea9c3210c8021e763e3c2ca3</data>
      <data key="v_content">What had Hagrid said?
Gringotts was the safest place in the world for something you wanted to
hide -- except perhaps Hogwarts.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-adebed25ea9c3210c8021e763e3c2ca3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3352">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e39c2e617bed9cbafb577edbbdcb68a4</data>
      <data key="v_content">It looked as though Harry had found out where the grubby littie package
from vault seven hundred and thirteen was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e39c2e617bed9cbafb577edbbdcb68a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3353">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5bc1c77d0dc83518ee4456d3c8701915</data>
      <data key="v_content">CHAPTER TEN
HALLOWEEN
Malfoy couldn&apos;t believe his eyes when he saw that Harry and Ron were
still at Hogwarts the next day, looking tired but perfectly cheerful.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5bc1c77d0dc83518ee4456d3c8701915</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3354">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-63aa666b3e13224391b2fce4f3411501</data>
      <data key="v_content">bythenext,Indeed, by the next morning Harry and Ron thought that meeting the
three-headed dog had been an excellent adventure, and they were quite
keen to have another one.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-63aa666b3e13224391b2fce4f3411501</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3355">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cddfc1b72dd674095dbd7dcfa91cc072</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry,In the meantime, Harry filled Ron in about the
package that seemed to have been moved from Gringotts to Hogwarts, and
they spent a lot of time wondering what could possibly need such heavy
protection.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cddfc1b72dd674095dbd7dcfa91cc072</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3356">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c7e152442cd4735e26ec38f37d887a84</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s either really valuable or really dangerous,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c7e152442cd4735e26ec38f37d887a84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3357">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-701e9617e8bd2049421019e6f3bfbdb4</data>
      <data key="v_content">But as all they knew for sure about the mysterious object was that it
was about two inches long, they didn&apos;t have much chance of guessing what
it was without further clues.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-701e9617e8bd2049421019e6f3bfbdb4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3358">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eb70b64382bcad07227194832f4071b9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neither Neville nor Hermione showed the slightest interest in what lay
underneath the dog and the trapdoor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eb70b64382bcad07227194832f4071b9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3359">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-53effc4c1fd286cb8b8353b6e4255102</data>
      <data key="v_content">All Neville cared about was never
going near the dog again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-53effc4c1fd286cb8b8353b6e4255102</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3360">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f69a49dcdcc689056336bbed01dc6d52</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione was now refusing to speak to Harry and Ron, but she was such a
bossy know-it-all that they saw this as an added bonus.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f69a49dcdcc689056336bbed01dc6d52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3361">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d841d7fde5bffb10d91a226de6bf4b0c</data>
      <data key="v_content">All they really
wanted now was a way of getting back at Malfoy, and to their great
delight, just such a thing arrived in the mail about a week later.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d841d7fde5bffb10d91a226de6bf4b0c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3362">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c774fd7e770b8ce9c0c8368dc4d10a2d</data>
      <data key="v_content">As the owls flooded into the Great Hall as usual, everyone&apos;s attention
was caught at once by a long, thin package carried by six large screech
owls.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c774fd7e770b8ce9c0c8368dc4d10a2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3363">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f1814ea733660ccaab36248ba67e84ce</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry was just as interested as everyone else to see what was in
this large parcel, and was amazed when the owls soared down and dropped
it right in front of him, knocking his bacon to the floor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f1814ea733660ccaab36248ba67e84ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3364">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-16f351b05195ffafc1a0f04421568ccc</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had
hardly fluttered out of the way when another owl dropped a letter on top
of the parcel.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-16f351b05195ffafc1a0f04421568ccc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3365">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-273011d11ee72520103c60135fa508f8</data>
      <data key="v_content">131
Harry ripped open the letter first, which was lucky, because it said:
DO NOT OPEN THE PARCEL AT THE TABLE.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-273011d11ee72520103c60135fa508f8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3366">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cb12caaa7318859e6e407fce880d2e9d</data>
      <data key="v_content">It contains your new Nimbus Two Thousand, but I don&apos;t want everybody
knowing you&apos;ve got a broomstick or they&apos;ll all want one.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cb12caaa7318859e6e407fce880d2e9d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3367">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7c95b28d8981c9fa03ead87667f5f078</data>
      <data key="v_content">Oliver Wood
will meet you tonight on the Quidditch field at seven o&apos;clock for your
first training session.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7c95b28d8981c9fa03ead87667f5f078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3368">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ac05478c7f7da61d47a717f4fdcf62d8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall
Harry had difficulty hiding his glee as he handed the note to Ron to
read.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ac05478c7f7da61d47a717f4fdcf62d8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3369">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b37b7815d92248f8680c5585b269bbb9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;A Nimbus Two Thousand!&quot; Ron moaned enviously.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b37b7815d92248f8680c5585b269bbb9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3370">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7fb2d511bb27b8e0736f7901f4f47f38</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;ve never even touched
one.&quot;
They left the hall quickly, wanting to unwrap the broomstick in private
before their first class, but halfway across the entrance hall they
found the way upstairs barred by Crabbe and Goyle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7fb2d511bb27b8e0736f7901f4f47f38</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3371">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-93286784c1adbf0ebdc82828fc10c732</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy seized the
package from Harry and felt it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-93286784c1adbf0ebdc82828fc10c732</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3372">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fc9262db415811ac11f36a26ad2616fc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;he,&quot;That&apos;s a broomstick,&quot; he said, throwing it back to Harry with a mixture
of jealousy and spite on his face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fc9262db415811ac11f36a26ad2616fc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3373">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-87ddb4548215743f0664cae813d52cf5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;ll be in for it this time,
Potter, first years aren&apos;t allowed them.&quot;
Ron couldn&apos;t resist it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-87ddb4548215743f0664cae813d52cf5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3374">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-36cc4487d852c2c7e23ddf9e2341f224</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s not any old broomstick,&quot; he said, &quot;it&apos;s a Nimbus Two Thousand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-36cc4487d852c2c7e23ddf9e2341f224</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3375">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0371dce7f690edc83af38f9c19878269</data>
      <data key="v_content">What did you say you&apos;ve got at home, Malfoy, a Comet Two Sixty?&quot; Ron
grinned at Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0371dce7f690edc83af38f9c19878269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3376">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a72ce222df2a8b91010d81f05fc57a5</data>
      <data key="v_content">but,&quot;Comets look flashy, but they&apos;re not in the same
league as the Nimbus.&quot;
&quot;What would you know about it, Weasley, you couldn&apos;t afford half the
handle,&quot; Malfoy snapped back.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a72ce222df2a8b91010d81f05fc57a5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3377">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dcfcc48abac7057fa19e4c34019c5348</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I suppose you and your brothers have to
save up twig by twig.&quot;
Before Ron could answer, Professor Flitwick appeared at Malfoy&apos;s elbow.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dcfcc48abac7057fa19e4c34019c5348</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3378">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f6777eafd5e05b1a10f010e15958adc8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ihope,,&quot;Not arguing, I hope, boys?&quot; he squeaked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f6777eafd5e05b1a10f010e15958adc8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3379">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5c818927b824cd3019a3f70ca60b162</data>
      <data key="v_content">132
&quot;Potter&apos;s been sent a broomstick, Professor,&quot; said Malfoy quickly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5c818927b824cd3019a3f70ca60b162</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3380">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-309c71486a2f8dbd8f0cd29bc9d3fd0d</data>
      <data key="v_content">yes,that&apos;sright,&quot;,&quot;Yes, yes, that&apos;s right,&quot; said Professor Flitwick, beaming at Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-309c71486a2f8dbd8f0cd29bc9d3fd0d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3381">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5c3d84a896fc01e4d4bfd64b6dff09ae</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Professor McGonagall told me all about the special circumstances,
Potter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5c3d84a896fc01e4d4bfd64b6dff09ae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3382">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b5f1e094b5cf97d38391e6e2e5355e73</data>
      <data key="v_content">And what model is it?&quot;
&quot;A Nimbus Two Thousand, sit,&quot; said Harry, fighting not to laugh at the
look of horror on Malfoy&apos;s face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b5f1e094b5cf97d38391e6e2e5355e73</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3383">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-49f27e836e453c02ef2c990c6b183f29</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And it&apos;s really thanks to Malfoy here
that I&apos;ve got it,&quot; he added.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-49f27e836e453c02ef2c990c6b183f29</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3384">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c0c7a282336496d3c6748beeaad5d077</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Ron headed upstairs, smothering their laughter at Malfoy&apos;s
obvious rage and confusion.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c0c7a282336496d3c6748beeaad5d077</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3385">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-beca53a98407e0ea69ae243e65a3d754</data>
      <data key="v_content">it&apos;strue,&quot;Harry,&quot;Well, it&apos;s true,&quot; Harry chortled as they
reached the top of the marble staircase, &quot;If he hadn&apos;t stolen Neville&apos;s
Remembrall I wouln&apos;t be on the team....&quot;
&quot;So I suppose you think that&apos;s a reward for breaking rules?&quot; came an
angry voice from just behind them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-beca53a98407e0ea69ae243e65a3d754</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3386">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d7279191fb1fc90cbc7800ac97a43521</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione was stomping up the stairs,
looking disapprovingly at the package in Harry&apos;s hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d7279191fb1fc90cbc7800ac97a43521</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3387">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-92542ae29fddfeb09d6a3b2fa6acbbb6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I thought you weren&apos;t speaking to us?&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-92542ae29fddfeb09d6a3b2fa6acbbb6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3388">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-00fe5cdcfdbce88af2c3bc4d27573300</data>
      <data key="v_content">don&apos;tstopnow,&quot;,&quot;Yes, don&apos;t stop now,&quot; said Ron, &quot;it&apos;s doing us so much good.&quot;
Hermione marched away with her nose in the air.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-00fe5cdcfdbce88af2c3bc4d27573300</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3389">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c08b082d6322fb245096f58b6f08402c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had a lot of trouble keeping his mind on his lessons that day.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c08b082d6322fb245096f58b6f08402c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3390">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e585b866ef736d4f27e95a0a9dcb38bf</data>
      <data key="v_content">It
kept wandering up to the dormitory where his new broomstick was lying
under his bed, or straying off to the Quidditch field where he&apos;d be
learning to play that night.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e585b866ef736d4f27e95a0a9dcb38bf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3391">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec578e7877507e00e95aa91a8bc0e836</data>
      <data key="v_content">He bolted his dinner that evening without
noticing what he was eating, and then rushed upstairs with Ron to unwrap
the Nimbus Two Thousand at last.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec578e7877507e00e95aa91a8bc0e836</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3392">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5e52d7d3adc26c4c4c76da43e4848cb7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ronsighed,as,&quot;Wow,&quot; Ron sighed, as the broomstick rolled onto Harry&apos;s bedspread.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5e52d7d3adc26c4c4c76da43e4848cb7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3393">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-033f02c170223328190755864adbf629</data>
      <data key="v_content">whoknew,Even Harry, who knew nothing about the different brooms, thought it
looked wonderful.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-033f02c170223328190755864adbf629</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3394">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a869f6c4229d5278e7a5dd1923876090</data>
      <data key="v_content">with,Sleek and shiny, with a mahogany handle, it had a long
tail of neat, straight twigs and Nimbus Two Thousand written in gold
near the top.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a869f6c4229d5278e7a5dd1923876090</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3395">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-edb1afb54facf5d628c43c8b1709ce53</data>
      <data key="v_content">As seven o&apos;clock drew nearer, Harry left the castle and set off in the
dusk toward the Quidditch field.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-edb1afb54facf5d628c43c8b1709ce53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3396">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e988f561267f857154ac3d1fed8c5f2b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Held never been inside the stadium
before.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e988f561267f857154ac3d1fed8c5f2b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3397">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bf742938fc7516d45c197f1f77b8c238</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hundreds of seats were raised in stands around the field so that
the spectators were high enough to see what was going on.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bf742938fc7516d45c197f1f77b8c238</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3398">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dd548c11cdac432d8de237e56d8c3c7a</data>
      <data key="v_content">At either end
133
of the field were three golden poles with hoops on the end.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dd548c11cdac432d8de237e56d8c3c7a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3399">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-72fcda99be070b7454434a361fcaa20c</data>
      <data key="v_content">They
reminded Harry of the little plastic sticks Muggle
children blew bubbles through, except that they were fifty feet high.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-72fcda99be070b7454434a361fcaa20c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3400">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-778a8dd3d53ba286c182aab043d67391</data>
      <data key="v_content">Too eager to fly again to wait for Wood, Harry mounted his broomstick
and kicked off from the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-778a8dd3d53ba286c182aab043d67391</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3401">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7382b17f8382dc49561b7fa89ef8c121</data>
      <data key="v_content">What a feeling -- he swooped in and out
of the goal posts and then sped up and down the field.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7382b17f8382dc49561b7fa89ef8c121</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3402">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-caa8dea1b0c90d2de52fbcfd2363d68e</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Nimbus Two
Thousand turned wherever he wanted at his lightest touch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-caa8dea1b0c90d2de52fbcfd2363d68e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3403">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a579eabcbd9399159d4cc5e18752ed7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Potter,comedown!&apos;,&quot;Hey, Potter, come down!&apos;
Oliver Wood had arrived.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a579eabcbd9399159d4cc5e18752ed7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3404">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d4d9836ea4b01ed6d53a8f46fd6c102d</data>
      <data key="v_content">fie was carrying a large wooden crate under his
arm.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d4d9836ea4b01ed6d53a8f46fd6c102d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3405">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd6ccaec1d3e3fc45aa6ed40f6379eee</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidWood,,&quot;Very nice,&quot; said Wood, his eyes glinting.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd6ccaec1d3e3fc45aa6ed40f6379eee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3406">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5a9851cb4647778fc6c162176dd59bcb</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;m just going to teach you the rules
this evening, then you&apos;ll be joining team practice three times a week.&quot;
He opened the crate.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5a9851cb4647778fc6c162176dd59bcb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3407">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9a31d0a39093567dabd2d7e94048315e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Quidditchiseasy,&quot;Now, Quidditch is easy enough to understand, even
if it&apos;s not too easy to play.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9a31d0a39093567dabd2d7e94048315e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3408">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-362deb999538fd9e147d8daca217f449</data>
      <data key="v_content">There are seven players on each side.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-362deb999538fd9e147d8daca217f449</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3409">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8e14076c71c91ac876291f1134523e72</data>
      <data key="v_content">Three of them are called Chasers.&quot;
&quot;Three Chasers,&quot; Harry repeated, as Wood took out a bright red ball
about the size of a soccer ball.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8e14076c71c91ac876291f1134523e72</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3410">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8849c9cb693a405788a42b87727fb5d2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;This ball&apos;s called the Quaffle,&quot; said Wood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8849c9cb693a405788a42b87727fb5d2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3411">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1edf8c5909d55e244db741d7c4f804de</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The Chasers throw the
Quaffle to each other and try and get it through one of the hoops to
score a goal.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1edf8c5909d55e244db741d7c4f804de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3412">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd3727a950f2e0a7d50ffe61b657314e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ten points every time the Quaffle goes through one of the
hoops.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd3727a950f2e0a7d50ffe61b657314e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3413">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ecb2a511df7460b77f243581e8810c5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Follow me?&quot;
&quot;The Chasers throw the Quaffle and put it through the hoops to score,&quot;
Harry recited.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ecb2a511df7460b77f243581e8810c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3414">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bf50595653dc82e68783ce71a338fe23</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So -- that&apos;s sort of like basketball on broomsticks with
six hoops, isn&apos;t it?&quot;
&quot;What&apos;s basketball?&quot; said Wood curiously.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bf50595653dc82e68783ce71a338fe23</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3415">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-21729e873fe31be85f4a8113c9ea8075</data>
      <data key="v_content">there&apos;sanotherplayer,&quot;Now, there&apos;s another player on each side who&apos;s called the Keeper -I&apos;m
Keeper for Gryffindor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-21729e873fe31be85f4a8113c9ea8075</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3416">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-21b0d53eea69f6ffb6cbc5d786bc1c1a</data>
      <data key="v_content">I have to fly around our hoops and stop the other
team from scoring.&quot;
134
&quot;Three Chasers, one Keeper,&quot; said Harry, who was determined to remember
it all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-21b0d53eea69f6ffb6cbc5d786bc1c1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3417">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6f608e06fe6514a8c3768d3ef7edc6f7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And they play with the Quaffle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6f608e06fe6514a8c3768d3ef7edc6f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3418">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-973ca959461690c8c36b72fd7630289d</data>
      <data key="v_content">So what are
they for?&quot; He pointed at the three balls left inside the box.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-973ca959461690c8c36b72fd7630289d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3419">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b63acca9ec4fcda440ab8267c31d9cca</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;I&apos;ll show you now,&quot; said Wood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b63acca9ec4fcda440ab8267c31d9cca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3420">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a4eb62ad5f4086198dbaec0b5a4d5b32</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Take this.&quot;
He handed Harry a small club, a bit like a short baseball bat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a4eb62ad5f4086198dbaec0b5a4d5b32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3421">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4a2821118e764f0dde8854499865033e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;m going to show you what the Bludgers do,&quot; Wood said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4a2821118e764f0dde8854499865033e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3422">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6e6c85e25796d10946fac2e980336749</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;These two are
the Bludgers.&quot;
He showed Harry two identical balls, jet black and slightly smaller than
the red Quaffle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6e6c85e25796d10946fac2e980336749</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3423">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6531792566559508a8f283472e6c92d5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry noticed that they seemed to be straining to
escape the straps holding them inside the box.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6531792566559508a8f283472e6c92d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3424">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f4bca203ef95096a5b3513a8dd87a57f</data>
      <data key="v_content">He bent down and freed one of the
Bludgers.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f4bca203ef95096a5b3513a8dd87a57f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3425">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1648fc05cd959c4a7bcfb58375466881</data>
      <data key="v_content">theblack,At once, the black ball rose high in the air and then pelted straight at
Harry&apos;s face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1648fc05cd959c4a7bcfb58375466881</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3426">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b53967768054f2bf10b88a4173ea0f64</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry swung at it with the bat to stop it from breaking
his nose, and sent it zigzagging away into the air -- it zoomed around
their heads and then shot at Wood, who dived on top of it and managed to
pin it to the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b53967768054f2bf10b88a4173ea0f64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3427">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4af3134ae8750608a2d606d7de068337</data>
      <data key="v_content">forcing,&quot;See?&quot; Wood panted, forcing the struggling Bludger back into the crate
and strapping it down safely.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4af3134ae8750608a2d606d7de068337</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3428">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e219f7c92c5b74d5eb564537ab8f0cff</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;The Bludgers rocket around, trying to
knock players off their brooms.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e219f7c92c5b74d5eb564537ab8f0cff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3429">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7a8aa2a9533788e1180688f126747ee6</data>
      <data key="v_content">That&apos;s why you have two Beaters on each
team -- the Weasley twins are ours -- it&apos;s their job to protect their
side from the Bludgers and try and knock them toward the other team.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7a8aa2a9533788e1180688f126747ee6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3430">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9b61fbcbf32204ffa193ce58f460577d</data>
      <data key="v_content">So
-- think you&apos;ve got all that?&quot;
&quot;Three Chasers try and score with the Quaffle; the Keeper guards the
goal posts; the Beaters keep the Bludgers away from their team,&quot; Harry
reeled off.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9b61fbcbf32204ffa193ce58f460577d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3431">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ee4fc1c071a4967cf964608b690740db</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Er -- have the Bludgers ever killed anyone?&quot; Harry asked, hoping he
sounded offhand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ee4fc1c071a4967cf964608b690740db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3432">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-04375f7846b4e29de38d0acfd0147be1</data>
      <data key="v_content">We&apos;ve had a couple of broken jaws but nothing worse
than that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-04375f7846b4e29de38d0acfd0147be1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3433">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0283b6a2586c8329818e740f127e69db</data>
      <data key="v_content">thelastmember,Now, the last member of the team is the
135
Seeker.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0283b6a2586c8329818e740f127e69db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3434">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6f4013822d197b0be0e2e4e22261b396</data>
      <data key="v_content">And you don&apos;t have to worry about the Quaffle or the
Bludgers unless they crack my head open.&quot;
&quot;Don&apos;t worry, the Weasleys are more than a match for the Bludgers -- I
mean, they&apos;re like a pair of human Bludgers themselves.&quot;
Wood reached into the crate and took out the fourth and last ball.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6f4013822d197b0be0e2e4e22261b396</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3435">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-73784c46d2cbdef57c606402a71eb9c1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Compared with the Quaffle and the Bludgers, it was tiny, about the size
of a large walnut.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-73784c46d2cbdef57c606402a71eb9c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3436">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cd7bcc6e43f0227aef7736ab31c9c112</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was bright gold and had little fluttering silver
wings.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cd7bcc6e43f0227aef7736ab31c9c112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3437">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4da6425897e4cf2f3566850fc4ddaed8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidWood,&quot;is,&quot;This,&quot; said Wood, &quot;is the Golden Snitch, and it&apos;s the most important
ball of the lot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4da6425897e4cf2f3566850fc4ddaed8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3438">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-00ef7466b744fc3a15f2ddcfa16bc05e</data>
      <data key="v_content">It&apos;s very hard to catch because it&apos;s so fast and
difficult to see.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-00ef7466b744fc3a15f2ddcfa16bc05e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3439">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1bce7f1e48d7f23b4940fa538c454732</data>
      <data key="v_content">It&apos;s the Seeker&apos;s job to catch it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1bce7f1e48d7f23b4940fa538c454732</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3440">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d81bf2f1a13436a97a98a14f5f495c58</data>
      <data key="v_content">You&apos;ve got to weave
in and out of the Chasers, Beaters, Bludgers, and Quaffle to get it
before the other team&apos;s Seeker, because whichever Seeker catches the
Snitch wins his team an extra hundred and fifty points, so they
nearly always win.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d81bf2f1a13436a97a98a14f5f495c58</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3441">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-717f66943c46fcb89559c60e8e954d3a</data>
      <data key="v_content">That&apos;s why Seekers get fouled so much.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-717f66943c46fcb89559c60e8e954d3a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3442">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e1bf670c6f4d4bee5defdfa671b84ec9</data>
      <data key="v_content">A game of
Quidditch only ends when the Snitch is caught, so it can go on for ages
-- I think the record is three months, they had to keep bringing on
substitutes so the players could get some sleep.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e1bf670c6f4d4bee5defdfa671b84ec9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3443">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-39d11add12d5479f5b2fb709b276f258</data>
      <data key="v_content">that&apos;sit--,&quot;Well, that&apos;s it -- any
questions?&quot;
Harry shook his head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-39d11add12d5479f5b2fb709b276f258</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3444">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b83937185df23a874e5d5bd26f32e5b4</data>
      <data key="v_content">He understood what he had to do all right, it was
doing it that was going to be the problem.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b83937185df23a874e5d5bd26f32e5b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3445">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6ab429384a923e9210f57e5231134cbc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We won&apos;t practice with the Snitch yet,&quot; said Wood, carefully shutting
it back inside the crate, &quot;it&apos;s too dark, we might lose it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6ab429384a923e9210f57e5231134cbc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3446">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6f66a6dd3734f884ea495c2d99c349b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">Let&apos;s try
you out with a few of these.&quot;
He pulled a bag of ordinary golf balls out of his pocket and a few
minutes later, he and Harry were up in the air, Wood throwing the golf
balls as hard as he could in every direction for Harry to catch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6f66a6dd3734f884ea495c2d99c349b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3447">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec818c44b0ddff4377769a4c0ade8c53</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry didn&apos;t miss a single one, and Wood was delighted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec818c44b0ddff4377769a4c0ade8c53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3448">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b0d0798601b3de3497af7f70ce7ff78e</data>
      <data key="v_content">,After half an
hour, night had really fallen and they couldn&apos;t carry on.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b0d0798601b3de3497af7f70ce7ff78e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3449">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a388e06794d74ef8a1b9879245e2b187</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;That Quidditch cup&apos;ll have our name on it this year,&quot; said Wood happily
as they trudged back up to the castle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a388e06794d74ef8a1b9879245e2b187</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3450">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-346fdc3891b4fa26a26a125f08e236c0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I wouldn&apos;t be surprised if you
turn out better than Charlie Weasley, and he could have played for
England if he hadn&apos;t gone off chasing dragons.&quot;
136
Perhaps it was because he was now so busy, what with Quidditch practice
three evenings a week on top of all his homework, but Harry could hardly
believe it when he realized that he&apos;d already been at Hogwarts two
months.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-346fdc3891b4fa26a26a125f08e236c0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3451">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fe539439c30c28470af4b78e4113b280</data>
      <data key="v_content">The castle felt more like home than Privet Drive ever had.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fe539439c30c28470af4b78e4113b280</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3452">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-21fffe353e0e1ec4c9e98bd324962b99</data>
      <data key="v_content">too,were,His
lessons, too, were becoming more and more interesting now that they had
mastered the basics.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-21fffe353e0e1ec4c9e98bd324962b99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3453">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8921ce72d66612c88533f9a0bdfd7e74</data>
      <data key="v_content">On Halloween morning they woke to the delicious smell of baking pumpkin
wafting through the corridors.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8921ce72d66612c88533f9a0bdfd7e74</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3454">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b116acf78e52b3cdc58879ad3f727dad</data>
      <data key="v_content">ProfessorFlitwick,Even better, Professor Flitwick announced
in Charms that he thought they were ready to start making objects fly,
something they had all been dying to try since they&apos;d seen him make
Neville&apos;s toad zoom around the classroom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b116acf78e52b3cdc58879ad3f727dad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3455">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5ff0d5a35efd4d84062669cb6b1fbdd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor Flitwick put the
class into pairs to practice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5ff0d5a35efd4d84062669cb6b1fbdd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3456">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-792668b8fff356a10a76593a7a30bdba</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry&apos;s partner was Seamus Finnigan (which
was a relief, because Neville had been trying to catch his eye).</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-792668b8fff356a10a76593a7a30bdba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3457">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-08e116d49f66e1cc3939fd459fdbd088</data>
      <data key="v_content">however,wasto,Ron,
however, was to be working with Hermione Granger.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-08e116d49f66e1cc3939fd459fdbd088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3458">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-88a4c34777bc9df30ca0131100ed0086</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was hard to tell
whether Ron or Hermione was angrier about this.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-88a4c34777bc9df30ca0131100ed0086</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3459">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-701fecd19eff59c3ff13056ff5b3a981</data>
      <data key="v_content">She hadn&apos;t spoken to
either of them since the day Harry&apos;s broomstick had arrived.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-701fecd19eff59c3ff13056ff5b3a981</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3460">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-76bc6168a6a26d8420a471bf1973209e</data>
      <data key="v_content">don&apos;tforgetthat,&quot;Now, don&apos;t forget that nice wrist movement we&apos;ve been practicing!&quot;
squeaked Professor Flitwick, perched on top of his pile of books as
usual.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-76bc6168a6a26d8420a471bf1973209e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3461">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2d1f89b931a11dcadbf5474a7e062df6</data>
      <data key="v_content">remember,,&quot;Swish and flick, remember, swish and flick.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2d1f89b931a11dcadbf5474a7e062df6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3462">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b4c1b10d076ac37751cc8a4a70019a34</data>
      <data key="v_content">And saying the magic
words properly is very important, too -- never forget Wizard Baruffio,
who said &apos;s&apos; instead of &apos;f&apos; and found himself on the floor with a
buffalo on his chest.&quot;
It was very difficult.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b4c1b10d076ac37751cc8a4a70019a34</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3463">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-74eab51b39b72844199b03b354c14566</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Seamus swished and flicked, but the
feather they were supposed to be sending skyward just lay on the
desktop.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-74eab51b39b72844199b03b354c14566</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3464">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b87af0836f083a7023db3a5148e8ebe2</data>
      <data key="v_content">Seamus got so impatient that he prodded it with his wand and
set fire to it -- Harry had to put it out with his hat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b87af0836f083a7023db3a5148e8ebe2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3465">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-002946e0decac8aa3aa7f5b6602b227b</data>
      <data key="v_content">atthenext,Ron, at the next table, wasn&apos;t having much more luck.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-002946e0decac8aa3aa7f5b6602b227b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3466">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-42099c6f812b3f56131b03c8d2f2276d</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Wingardium Leviosa!&quot; he shouted, waving his long arms like a windmill.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-42099c6f812b3f56131b03c8d2f2276d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3467">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5b78b469794a39ccdb945daf0364ad97</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;You&apos;re saying it wrong,&quot; Harry heard Hermione snap.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5b78b469794a39ccdb945daf0364ad97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3468">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a57245d04b941c3b2746d26a1267aad2</data>
      <data key="v_content">make,&quot;It&apos;s Wing-gar-dium
Levi-o-sa, make the &apos;gar&apos; nice and long.&quot;
&quot;You do it, then, if you&apos;re so clever,&quot; Ron snarled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a57245d04b941c3b2746d26a1267aad2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3469">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-35f1cbaa62809655d4b02c612d9d7403</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione rolled up the sleeves of her gown, flicked her wand, and said,
&quot;Wingardium Leviosa!&quot;
137
Their feather rose off the desk and hovered about four feet above their
heads.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-35f1cbaa62809655d4b02c612d9d7403</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3470">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5b38a051c03c78d7951370ff81216b2d</data>
      <data key="v_content">welldone!&quot;cried,&quot;Oh, well done!&quot; cried Professor Flitwick, clapping.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5b38a051c03c78d7951370ff81216b2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3471">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5e45850e6eaedb3b1a84f4e5924cbf13</data>
      <data key="v_content">Miss,&quot;Everyone see here,
Miss Granger&apos;s done it!&quot;
Ron was in a very bad mood by the end of the class.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5e45850e6eaedb3b1a84f4e5924cbf13</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3472">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-907197dace183af73c7fc7d9117ee6b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s no wonder no
one can stand her,&quot; he said to Harry as they pushed their way into the
crowded corridor, &quot;she&apos;s a nightmare, honestly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-907197dace183af73c7fc7d9117ee6b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3473">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-01e90f7af6b8d60af20026a89ac310dc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;
Someone knocked into Harry as they hurried past him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-01e90f7af6b8d60af20026a89ac310dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3474">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8437894ea3253954ad1d249befc0eda0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry caught a glimpse of her face -- and was startled to see that she
was in tears.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8437894ea3253954ad1d249befc0eda0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3475">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-52b4dcbf0ed07e5a3010952cd839bc0f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I think she heard you.&quot;
&quot;So?&quot; said Ron, but he looked a bit uncomfortable.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-52b4dcbf0ed07e5a3010952cd839bc0f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3476">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7aa394a9ea675ae5fdc23ffaa70915f0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;She must&apos;ve noticed
she&apos;s got no friends.&quot;
Hermione didn&apos;t turn up for the next class and wasn&apos;t seen all
afternoon.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7aa394a9ea675ae5fdc23ffaa70915f0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3477">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f819066f3ef876bbd514a016514456ee</data>
      <data key="v_content">On their way down to the Great Hall for the Halloween feast,
Harry and Ron overheard Parvati Patil telling her friend Lavender that
Hermione was crying in the girls&apos; bathroom and wanted to be left alone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f819066f3ef876bbd514a016514456ee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3478">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cf6ec1c86edb1dfe06938925e486ac75</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron looked still more awkward at this, but a moment later they had
entered the Great Hall, where the Halloween decorations put Hermione out
of their minds.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cf6ec1c86edb1dfe06938925e486ac75</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3479">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-03f27fc92ee855fe78d8828d3ed32404</data>
      <data key="v_content">A thousand live bats fluttered from the walls and ceiling while a
thousand more swooped over the tables in low black clouds, making the
candles in the pumpkins stutter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-03f27fc92ee855fe78d8828d3ed32404</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3480">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a4882ca6ddd655dc4d4e3dfb053bbf1e</data>
      <data key="v_content">The feast appeared suddenly on the
golden plates, as it had at the start-of-term banquet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a4882ca6ddd655dc4d4e3dfb053bbf1e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3481">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bfc0ed80cde8ab736bf635c1ab154b64</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry was just helping himself to a baked potato when Professor Quirrell
came sprinting into the hall, his turban askew and terror on his face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bfc0ed80cde8ab736bf635c1ab154b64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3482">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3934c67299190c7f2e4d4588b34443e0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Everyone stared as he reached Professor Dumbledore&apos;s chair, slumped
against the table, and gasped, &quot;Troll -- in the dungeons -- thought you
ought to know.&quot;
He then sank to the floor in a dead faint.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3934c67299190c7f2e4d4588b34443e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3483">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-266d28ee124126a9762a8dbfd00df102</data>
      <data key="v_content">It took several purple firecrackers exploding from
the end of Professor Dumbledore&apos;s wand to bring silence.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-266d28ee124126a9762a8dbfd00df102</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3484">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b7ad84046d980505d06b8699199da0ae</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;herumbled,,138
&quot;Prefects,&quot; he rumbled, &quot;lead your Houses back to the dormitories
immediately!&quot;
Percy was in his element.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b7ad84046d980505d06b8699199da0ae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3485">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b2a86c1b976f18be13945d3aeaf05cdf</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Follow me! Stick together, first years! No need to fear the troll if
you follow my orders! Stay close behind me, now.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b2a86c1b976f18be13945d3aeaf05cdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3486">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ef73c4068d669c868ae9d372e48f4e18</data>
      <data key="v_content">firstyears,Make way, first years
coming through! Excuse me, I&apos;m a prefect!&quot;
&quot;How could a troll get in?&quot; Harry asked as they climbed the stairs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ef73c4068d669c868ae9d372e48f4e18</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3487">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b36212812dc30e41546dddee0b5d5ba7</data>
      <data key="v_content">they&apos;re,&quot;Don&apos;t ask me, they&apos;re supposed to be really stupid,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b36212812dc30e41546dddee0b5d5ba7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3488">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7499d59b31963be0effc3b710d8576fc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Maybe
Peeves let it in for a Halloween joke.&quot;
They passed different groups of people hurrying in different directions.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7499d59b31963be0effc3b710d8576fc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3489">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-64357cb45bb3db8595edabe94cb977ce</data>
      <data key="v_content">As they jostled their way through a crowd of confused Hufflepuffs, Harry
suddenly grabbed Ron&apos;s arm.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-64357cb45bb3db8595edabe94cb977ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3490">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-80195b00eb9e3904fd49da0db19ad4ff</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;ve just thought -- Hermione.&quot;
&quot;What about her?&quot;
&quot;She doesn&apos;t know about the troll.&quot;
Ron bit his lip.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-80195b00eb9e3904fd49da0db19ad4ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3491">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b4aa1f7dc5b35ff2b0ff3c23ec880de1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But Percy&apos;d better not see us.&quot;
Ducking down, they joined the Hufflepuffs going the other way, slipped
down a deserted side corridor, and hurried off toward the girls&apos;
bathroom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b4aa1f7dc5b35ff2b0ff3c23ec880de1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3492">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-540ef6d99b03d1faeda828380ef19ebc</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had just turned the corner when they heard quick
footsteps behind them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-540ef6d99b03d1faeda828380ef19ebc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3493">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d3f1065a6564fd6298b611b904319a80</data>
      <data key="v_content">pulling,&quot;Percy!&quot; hissed Ron, pulling Harry behind a large stone griffin.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d3f1065a6564fd6298b611b904319a80</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3494">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b861b588c6c48555871e5a54ed0c46ab</data>
      <data key="v_content">however,,Peering around it, however, they saw not Percy but Snape.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b861b588c6c48555871e5a54ed0c46ab</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3495">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ddd01451aea32a2379fa242003204652</data>
      <data key="v_content">He crossed the
corridor and disappeared from view.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ddd01451aea32a2379fa242003204652</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3496">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-70ec2ff9a89901b941fc4c68983fc995</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Why isn&apos;t he down in the dungeons
with the rest of the teachers?&quot;
&quot;Search me.&quot;
139
Quietly as possible, they crept along the next corridor after Snape&apos;s
fading footsteps.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-70ec2ff9a89901b941fc4c68983fc995</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3497">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f688a4d8c7071120a522a138009582bd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He&apos;s heading for the third floor,&quot; Harry said, but Ron held up his
hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f688a4d8c7071120a522a138009582bd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3498">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d905f9d8b7de2907f1f9453604d20100</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Can you smell something?&quot;
Harry sniffed and a foul stench reached his nostrils, a mixture of old
socks and the kind of public toilet no one seems to clean.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d905f9d8b7de2907f1f9453604d20100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3499">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-38980e459a09c6efb5247ccb8ee60d43</data>
      <data key="v_content">And then they heard it -- a low grunting, and the shuffling footfalls of
gigantic feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-38980e459a09c6efb5247ccb8ee60d43</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3500">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-15923084d58f104d392f750dd02e8344</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron pointed -- at the end of a passage to the left,
something huge was moving toward them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-15923084d58f104d392f750dd02e8344</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3501">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d3c75f7eee08d32e4324ca5d3371015c</data>
      <data key="v_content">They shrank into the shadows and
watched as it emerged into a patch of moonlight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d3c75f7eee08d32e4324ca5d3371015c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3502">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a3c63d12c0f302bc1c8bdbfd06f68838</data>
      <data key="v_content">its,Twelve feet tall, its skin was a dull, granite
gray, its great lumpy body like a boulder with its small bald head
perched on top like a coconut.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a3c63d12c0f302bc1c8bdbfd06f68838</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3503">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-25587526230f9f9973d03b618f6f0a7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">It had short legs thick as tree trunks
with flat, horny feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-25587526230f9f9973d03b618f6f0a7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3504">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-32079a468e98d7f996afc9a871dbda90</data>
      <data key="v_content">The smell coming from it was incredible.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-32079a468e98d7f996afc9a871dbda90</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3505">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c3e72dc799bf1ffc6c8b1bf64221b5e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was
holding a huge wooden club, which dragged along the floor because its
arms were so long.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c3e72dc799bf1ffc6c8b1bf64221b5e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3506">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-78db74e32efd5b4344059cb8f17550f5</data>
      <data key="v_content">The troll stopped next to a doorway and peered inside.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-78db74e32efd5b4344059cb8f17550f5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3507">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-29a677316b036d8148b22120ec90a4bb</data>
      <data key="v_content">It waggled its
long ears, making up its tiny mind, then slouched slowly into the room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-29a677316b036d8148b22120ec90a4bb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3508">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dd93d03536dcce9cb03c11cf1daf3afb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The keys in the lock,&quot; Harry muttered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dd93d03536dcce9cb03c11cf1daf3afb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3509">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-27b27beaa0fe8467df53ea2d4f018d84</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We could lock it in.&quot;
&quot;Good idea,&quot; said Ron nervously.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-27b27beaa0fe8467df53ea2d4f018d84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3510">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f81e0f7c2999cc54d8ee7d1db5eb1ff1</data>
      <data key="v_content">They edged toward the open door, mouths dry, praying the troll wasn&apos;t
about to come out of it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f81e0f7c2999cc54d8ee7d1db5eb1ff1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3511">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7e6bfa3d178bf39225cab55bb39ef639</data>
      <data key="v_content">,With one great leap, Harry managed to grab the
key, slam the door, and lock it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7e6bfa3d178bf39225cab55bb39ef639</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3512">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ff32abe7c004864229c9adc5c76906fd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&apos;Yes!&quot;
Flushed with their victory, they started to run back up the passage, but
as they reached the corner they heard something that made their hearts
stop -- a high, petrified scream -- and it was coming from the chamber
they&apos;d just chained up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ff32abe7c004864229c9adc5c76906fd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3513">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8100a896a8a534e87dbba164dd74a1da</data>
      <data key="v_content">no,&quot;saidRon,,&quot;Oh, no,&quot; said Ron, pale as the Bloody Baron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8100a896a8a534e87dbba164dd74a1da</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3514">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2eca41271ad2b680681d270aa9a171ae</data>
      <data key="v_content">140
&quot;It&apos;s the girls&apos; bathroom!&quot; Harry gasped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2eca41271ad2b680681d270aa9a171ae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3515">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0e152c1d9f76ee9f0e4256e13162cf93</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was the last thing they wanted to do, but what choice did they have?
Wheeling around, they sprinted back to the door and turned the key,
fumbling in their panic.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0e152c1d9f76ee9f0e4256e13162cf93</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3516">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a4f0461c7aec7b14a2d8ca0b6c11ec1f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry pulled the door open and they ran inside.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a4f0461c7aec7b14a2d8ca0b6c11ec1f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3517">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a5920f1ccb72ebeb7dc3ebfadd5b8d9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione Granger was shrinking against the wall opposite, looking as if
she was about to faint.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a5920f1ccb72ebeb7dc3ebfadd5b8d9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3518">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e80bb423f45d16628076314e26f1b2cb</data>
      <data key="v_content">The troll was advancing on her, knocking the
sinks off the walls as it went.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e80bb423f45d16628076314e26f1b2cb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3519">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0f0968de9f0fe06442b5e324e1c8fac6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Confuse it!&quot; Harry said desperately to Ron, and, seizing a tap, he
threw it as hard as he could against the wall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0f0968de9f0fe06442b5e324e1c8fac6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3520">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9c0ddd261ee0bd36dbcf54b3c986e412</data>
      <data key="v_content">The troll stopped a few feet from Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9c0ddd261ee0bd36dbcf54b3c986e412</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3521">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2e1bcd267d36a4e6bb249d603eb849b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">blinking,It lumbered around, blinking
stupidly, to see what had made the noise.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2e1bcd267d36a4e6bb249d603eb849b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3522">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d6983d8409c9757f043cec28a5315207</data>
      <data key="v_content">Its mean little eyes saw
Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d6983d8409c9757f043cec28a5315207</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3523">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4e1f73245026c4c02ad3ba25feefbfcc</data>
      <data key="v_content">thenmade,It hesitated, then made for him instead, lifting its club as it
went.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4e1f73245026c4c02ad3ba25feefbfcc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3524">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd8c351f0a175a25f7c6bbef6288d091</data>
      <data key="v_content">pea-brain!&quot;yelledRon,&quot;Oy, pea-brain!&quot; yelled Ron from the other side of the chamber, and he
threw a metal pipe at it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd8c351f0a175a25f7c6bbef6288d091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3525">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-925f593de993d81b59e92799b8e3ae1b</data>
      <data key="v_content">The troll didn&apos;t even seem to notice the pipe
hitting its shoulder, but it heard the yell and paused again, turning
its ugly snout toward Ron instead, giving Harry time to run around it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-925f593de993d81b59e92799b8e3ae1b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3526">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c1ed1c70bfc7fe73736617b083546dad</data>
      <data key="v_content">run,run!&quot;,&quot;Come on, run, run!&quot; Harry yelled at Hermione, trying to pull her toward
the door, but she couldn&apos;t move, she was still flat against the wall,
her mouth open with terror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c1ed1c70bfc7fe73736617b083546dad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3527">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3af6bfc8bba32a43a6de5d4979f93054</data>
      <data key="v_content">The shouting and the echoes seemed to be driving the troll berserk.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3af6bfc8bba32a43a6de5d4979f93054</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3528">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ff5cc56e62a5a44af913864c0125715d</data>
      <data key="v_content">It
roared again and started toward Ron, who was nearest and had no way to
escape.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ff5cc56e62a5a44af913864c0125715d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3529">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bff3c2cdb93987e149823dce759e0de8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry then did something that was both very brave and very stupid: He
took a great running jump and managed to fasten his arms around the
troll&apos;s neck from behind.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bff3c2cdb93987e149823dce759e0de8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3530">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6c1f48d3e4a9f1b7acdd65cdbd1d97b8</data>
      <data key="v_content">The troll couldn&apos;t feel Harry hanging there,
but even a troll will notice if you stick a long bit of wood up its
nose, and Harry&apos;s wand had still been in his hand when he&apos;d jumped -- it
had gone straight up one of the troll&apos;s nostrils.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6c1f48d3e4a9f1b7acdd65cdbd1d97b8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3531">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8772240e29fde533f6dbc7eef6b504c1</data>
      <data key="v_content">the,Howling with pain, the troll twisted and flailed its club, with Harry
clinging on for dear life; any second, the troll was going to rip him
141
off or catch him a terrible blow with the club.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8772240e29fde533f6dbc7eef6b504c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3532">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-36702890a00ff282ba8c0d9ff1703272</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione had sunk to the floor in fright; Ron pulled out his own wand --
not knowing what he was going to do he heard himself cry the first spell
that came into his head: &quot;Wingardium Leviosa!&quot;
The club flew suddenly out of the troll&apos;s hand, rose high, high up into
the air, turned slowly over -- and dropped, with a sickening crack, onto
its owner&apos;s head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-36702890a00ff282ba8c0d9ff1703272</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3533">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-71a8bfa29aa74c092228655d44fd054c</data>
      <data key="v_content">The troll swayed on the spot and then fell flat on its
face, with a thud that made the whole room tremble.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-71a8bfa29aa74c092228655d44fd054c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3534">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1156aeee9ffe502a09a2380096472b48</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was shaking and out of breath.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1156aeee9ffe502a09a2380096472b48</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3535">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2d2c983772d333448e0fc421fd02b6ef</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron was
standing there with his wand still raised, staring at what he had done.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2d2c983772d333448e0fc421fd02b6ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3536">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-664b5e1763089966e527dcfb4c1603b4</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was Hermione who spoke first.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-664b5e1763089966e527dcfb4c1603b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3537">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8c84db13dfb875e572224889d911ce90</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Is it -- dead?&quot;
I don&apos;t think so,&quot; said Harry, I think it&apos;s just been knocked out.&quot;
He bent down and pulled his wand out of the troll&apos;s nose.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8c84db13dfb875e572224889d911ce90</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3538">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2587090cba427f9a1b8973da6301a736</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was covered
in what looked like lumpy gray glue.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2587090cba427f9a1b8973da6301a736</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3539">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d9f69b53e15f6ce3facafeddd14e0678</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Urgh -- troll boogers.&quot;
He wiped it on the troll&apos;s trousers.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d9f69b53e15f6ce3facafeddd14e0678</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3540">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca9e597698c27647a7766e390324cd63</data>
      <data key="v_content">A sudden slamming and loud footsteps made the three of them look up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca9e597698c27647a7766e390324cd63</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3541">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5deeb5eb84668c5d4a3f7b7d9580c6c5</data>
      <data key="v_content">They hadn&apos;t realized what a racket they had been making, but of course,
someone downstairs must have heard the crashes and the troll&apos;s roars.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5deeb5eb84668c5d4a3f7b7d9580c6c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3542">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8682b07ea40d0e0b84a139abf3a16dfe</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor,A
moment later, Professor McGonagall had come bursting into the room,
closely followed by Snape, with Quirrell bringing up the rear.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8682b07ea40d0e0b84a139abf3a16dfe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3543">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa28609409ca8efffd7143c6c90648a7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Quirrell
took one look at the troll, let out a faint whimper, and sat quickly
down on a toilet, clutching his heart.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa28609409ca8efffd7143c6c90648a7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3544">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2fc3377c33404911f3de69b09b555c0d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall was looking at Ron and
Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2fc3377c33404911f3de69b09b555c0d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3545">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-621db00ce682160baf8c44071d076336</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had never seen her look so angry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-621db00ce682160baf8c44071d076336</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3546">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7306f4b966c127f1350ebc91e69c8c26</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hopes of winning fifty points for Gryffindor faded quickly from Harry&apos;s
mind.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7306f4b966c127f1350ebc91e69c8c26</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3547">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6c217576f30db4dbba552dacd45526bd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What on earth were you thinking of?&quot; said Professor McGonagall, with
cold fury in her voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6c217576f30db4dbba552dacd45526bd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3548">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c5476a950b7557ae89e00bc04243b388</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Harry looked at Ron, who was still standing with
his wand in the air.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c5476a950b7557ae89e00bc04243b388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3549">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6505eaf85fee70d5662cca7297a12fa9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Why aren&apos;t you in
142
your dormitory?&quot;
Snape gave Harry a swift, piercing look.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6505eaf85fee70d5662cca7297a12fa9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3550">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d598213a001c59c8b3e1287bd046d4e3</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
wished Ron would put his wand down.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d598213a001c59c8b3e1287bd046d4e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3551">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-98452c1f7f0faf6b132dc8ac0230134a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then a small voice came out of the shadows.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-98452c1f7f0faf6b132dc8ac0230134a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3552">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-42b4b8a1c2117247b5c3343cebbe8d97</data>
      <data key="v_content">ProfessorMcGonagall--,&quot;Please, Professor McGonagall -- they were looking for me.&quot;
&quot;Miss Granger!&quot;
Hermione had managed to get to her feet at last.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-42b4b8a1c2117247b5c3343cebbe8d97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3553">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-92f1fddfa932f12ebd9f0a2f219a42ee</data>
      <data key="v_content">I went looking for the troll because I -- I thought I could deal with it
on my own -- you know, because I&apos;ve read all about them.&quot;
Ron dropped his wand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-92f1fddfa932f12ebd9f0a2f219a42ee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3554">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-55a1d36907cac79f01accf14cd7799fb</data>
      <data key="v_content">tellinga,Hermione Granger, telling a downright lie to a
teacher? &quot;If they hadn&apos;t found me, I&apos;d be dead now.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-55a1d36907cac79f01accf14cd7799fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3555">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1e469af495e457db1c2a87b71305b08d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry stuck his wand
up its nose and Ron knocked it out with its own club.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1e469af495e457db1c2a87b71305b08d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3556">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e5d13049866ad9d11d31c346e821ca58</data>
      <data key="v_content">They didn&apos;t have
time to come and fetch anyone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e5d13049866ad9d11d31c346e821ca58</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3557">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-abc7acafb9707249a15bfa394de479d9</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was about to finish me off when they
arrived.&quot;
Harry and Ron tried to look as though this story wasn&apos;t new to them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-abc7acafb9707249a15bfa394de479d9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3558">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f0983e422ccdb88034a6e7dc6d8dcd2f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Well -- in that case...&quot; said Professor McGonagall, staring at the
three of them, &quot;Miss Granger, you foolish girl, how could you think of
tackling a mountain troll on your own?&quot;
Hermione hung her head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f0983e422ccdb88034a6e7dc6d8dcd2f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3559">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-de483df1a2413bead25f8a4de60160ee</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione was the last
person to do anything against the rules, and here she was, pretending
she had, to get them out of trouble.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-de483df1a2413bead25f8a4de60160ee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3560">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3afe6ff95c65297f92722d1003780c08</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was as if Snape had started
handing out sweets.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3afe6ff95c65297f92722d1003780c08</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3561">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f243811893594040d761d94aba12244</data>
      <data key="v_content">fivepoints,&quot;Miss Granger, five points will be taken from Gryffindor for this,&quot; said
Professor McGonagall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f243811893594040d761d94aba12244</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3562">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8a1c85410124bfe7516523a762d474ce</data>
      <data key="v_content">If you&apos;re not hurt
at all, you&apos;d better get off to Gryffindor tower.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8a1c85410124bfe7516523a762d474ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3563">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1a1c6cbd9bfb167557fecce7ec8813a7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Students are finishing
the feast in their houses.&quot;
Hermione left.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1a1c6cbd9bfb167557fecce7ec8813a7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3564">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8bd2e7cec95ff383a1fb09e7e88f1d99</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall turned to Harry and Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8bd2e7cec95ff383a1fb09e7e88f1d99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3565">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6838780a78e2e08f92b237d547b65860</data>
      <data key="v_content">Istillsay,&quot;Well, I still say you were lucky, but not many first years could have
143
taken on a full-grown mountain troll.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6838780a78e2e08f92b237d547b65860</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3566">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-00f52177d8dbfe98dc8a91ce810dc3d8</data>
      <data key="v_content">You each win Gryffindor five
points.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-00f52177d8dbfe98dc8a91ce810dc3d8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3567">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-75695ff178eb2336018eac49610336b2</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor Dumbledore will be informed of this.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-75695ff178eb2336018eac49610336b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3568">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-da77cadf55723a98d5fd510369766306</data>
      <data key="v_content">You may go.&quot;
They hurried out of the chamber and didn&apos;t speak at all until they had
climbed two floors up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-da77cadf55723a98d5fd510369766306</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3569">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0364ac6737e308d755c2b6b0e3007e19</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was a relief to be away from the smell of the
troll, quite apart from anything else.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0364ac6737e308d755c2b6b0e3007e19</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3570">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1aaf8ee5c69d2fcabe9c9f3e4e06981a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We should have gotten more than ten points,&quot; Ron grumbled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1aaf8ee5c69d2fcabe9c9f3e4e06981a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3571">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-80a319b14ccbc2e0308788082c4f54c0</data>
      <data key="v_content">youmean,once,&quot;Five, you mean, once she&apos;s taken off Hermione&apos;s.&quot;
&quot;Good of her to get us out of trouble like that,&quot; Ron admitted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-80a319b14ccbc2e0308788082c4f54c0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3572">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8437a23ca97247a6f309d5dc240e3be8</data>
      <data key="v_content">wedid,&quot;Mind
you, we did save her.&quot;
&quot;She might not have needed saving if we hadn&apos;t locked the thing in with
her,&quot; Harry reminded him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8437a23ca97247a6f309d5dc240e3be8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3573">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-101cbb9ebab9ddbafb070151bdede3e4</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had reached the portrait of the Fat Lady.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-101cbb9ebab9ddbafb070151bdede3e4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3574">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-382b071bf1d907c3be7a2d43cc0f7614</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;theysaid,&quot;Pig snout,&quot; they said and entered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-382b071bf1d907c3be7a2d43cc0f7614</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3575">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a3109c71c9cd1b56289615e0fa40cde7</data>
      <data key="v_content">The common room was packed and noisy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a3109c71c9cd1b56289615e0fa40cde7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3576">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9ea5efcb410929bfb0d8dd62e1df3c0f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Everyone was eating the food that
had been sent up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9ea5efcb410929bfb0d8dd62e1df3c0f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3577">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c6b5d0969f5c62f002980744ecdf2d10</data>
      <data key="v_content">however,stoodalone,Hermione, however, stood alone by the door, waiting
for them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c6b5d0969f5c62f002980744ecdf2d10</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3578">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-be76c3576ecea2da391c7ea5fd8e1e0d</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was a very embarrassed pause.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-be76c3576ecea2da391c7ea5fd8e1e0d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3579">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4163136a503aa2169963c986f13cc91b</data>
      <data key="v_content">noneofthem,Then, none of them looking
at each other, they all said &quot;Thanks,&quot; and hurried off to get plates.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4163136a503aa2169963c986f13cc91b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3580">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-89e0d0c413189f8bcce22a51fb3ab7cc</data>
      <data key="v_content">But from that moment on, Hermione Granger became their friend.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-89e0d0c413189f8bcce22a51fb3ab7cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3581">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-57dca1d0dd4e01a9bb76620d499a106f</data>
      <data key="v_content">There are
some things you can&apos;t share without ending up liking each other, and
knocking out a twelve-foot mountain troll is one of them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-57dca1d0dd4e01a9bb76620d499a106f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3582">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-59b63c3896d5cc0deab7376d99071e22</data>
      <data key="v_content">CHAPTER ELEVEN
QUIDDITCH
As they entered November, the weather turned very cold.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-59b63c3896d5cc0deab7376d99071e22</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3583">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-db27184d0cbac4005491f677f3be685d</data>
      <data key="v_content">The mountains
around the school became icy gray and the lake like chilled steel.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-db27184d0cbac4005491f677f3be685d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3584">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ee4af7d3e68e0a7d24fb5c05ca67b03</data>
      <data key="v_content">Every
morning the ground was covered in frost.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ee4af7d3e68e0a7d24fb5c05ca67b03</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3585">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8ac618a6a52311c9f57a2fd760cf7b01</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid could be seen from the
upstairs windows defrosting broomsticks on the Quidditch field, bundled
up in a long moleskin overcoat, rabbit fur gloves, and enormous
beaverskin boots.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8ac618a6a52311c9f57a2fd760cf7b01</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3586">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3584e7337623fd873e6dacc5264491ff</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harrywould,On Saturday, Harry would be playing in
144
his first match after weeks of training: Gryffindor versus Slytherin.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3584e7337623fd873e6dacc5264491ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3587">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fb8526d2a8047211829c5c45816f9b5f</data>
      <data key="v_content">they,If
Gryffindor won, they would move up into second place in the house
championship.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fb8526d2a8047211829c5c45816f9b5f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3588">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1e05f5d09c3fb0d737d2d13a174837c8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hardly anyone had seen Harry play because Wood had decided that, as
their secret weapon, Harry should be kept, well, secret.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1e05f5d09c3fb0d737d2d13a174837c8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3589">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c4dfbb3202da68078dc1b786a0ea491f</data>
      <data key="v_content">But the news
that he was playing Seeker had leaked out somehow, and Harry didn&apos;t know
which was worse -- people telling him he&apos;d be brilliant or people
telling him they&apos;d be running around underneath him holding a mattress.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c4dfbb3202da68078dc1b786a0ea491f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3590">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d9bc0e80667d0f0c3b92c2a5e957e8bb</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was really lucky that Harry now had Hermlone as a friend.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d9bc0e80667d0f0c3b92c2a5e957e8bb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3591">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-89b704aaf02c75cf81846785f3d95088</data>
      <data key="v_content">He didn&apos;t
know how he&apos;d have gotten through all his homework without her, what
with all the last-minute Quidditch practice Wood was making them do.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-89b704aaf02c75cf81846785f3d95088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3592">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6ab14c8833afd7b4372b01e1e0497bf6</data>
      <data key="v_content">She
had also tent him Quidditch Through the Ages, which turned out to be a
very interesting read.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6ab14c8833afd7b4372b01e1e0497bf6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3593">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cbd0af271ff730ca06816ecfb409838f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry learned that there were seven hundred ways of committing a
Quidditch foul and that all of them had happened during a World Cup
match in 1473; that Seekers were usually the smallest and fastest
players, and that most serious Quidditch accidents seemed to happen to
them; that although people rarely died playing Quidditch, referees had
been known to vanish and turn up months later in the Sahara Desert.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cbd0af271ff730ca06816ecfb409838f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3594">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3adc6557886b8a171fee3bb813ed1bf6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione had become a bit more relaxed about breaking rules since Harry
and Ron had saved her from the mountain troll, and she was much nicer
for it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3adc6557886b8a171fee3bb813ed1bf6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3595">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dc4d826929aa504102f359d84df8d5ed</data>
      <data key="v_content">The day before Harry&apos;s first Quidditch match the three of them
were out in the freezing courtyard during break, and she had conjured
them up a bright blue fire that could be carried around in a jam jar.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dc4d826929aa504102f359d84df8d5ed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3596">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0024eb8ce40fc92513530d147a14554e</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were standing with their backs to it, getting warm, when Snape
crossed the yard.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0024eb8ce40fc92513530d147a14554e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3597">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ba441c0ca89476293d6352bc097c7f39</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry noticed at once that Snape was limping.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ba441c0ca89476293d6352bc097c7f39</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3598">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a6a73cb8f52c654171672797227b74db</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron,andHermione,Harry,
Ron, and Hermione moved closer together to block the fire from view;
they were sure it wouldn&apos;t be allowed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a6a73cb8f52c654171672797227b74db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3599">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-27643344b9d7fe979ccc830f440b909a</data>
      <data key="v_content">somethingabouttheir,Unfortunately, something about
their guilty faces caught Snape&apos;s eye.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-27643344b9d7fe979ccc830f440b909a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3600">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-07dcb97d0335d87a03fd00bcb5b84411</data>
      <data key="v_content">He hadn&apos;t seen
the fire, but he seemed to be looking for a reason to tell them off
anyway.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-07dcb97d0335d87a03fd00bcb5b84411</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3601">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2b5660d5a2ec04e8c9243be588a01ecf</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What&apos;s that you&apos;ve got there, Potter?&quot;
It was Quidditch Through the Ages.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2b5660d5a2ec04e8c9243be588a01ecf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3602">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3a61e9d5bdd1b8e005b4dcb8ab137363</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Library books are not to be taken outside the school,&quot; said Snape.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3a61e9d5bdd1b8e005b4dcb8ab137363</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3603">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-60f7a88ab3bf7cfd277e996d918f09a8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Five points from Gryffindor.&quot;
145
&quot;He&apos;s just made that rule up,&quot; Harry muttered angrily as Snape limped
away.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-60f7a88ab3bf7cfd277e996d918f09a8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3604">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dd4485300538a02133a4741ecccc8379</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Wonder what&apos;s wrong with his leg?&quot;
&quot;Dunno, but I hope it&apos;s really hurting him,&quot; said Ron bitterly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dd4485300538a02133a4741ecccc8379</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3605">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0251128dff4ff39d44cb45250db7641b</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Gryffindor common room was very noisy that evening.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0251128dff4ff39d44cb45250db7641b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3606">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bc7c15bcfe8797a1bc54540bb277db1f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron,andHermione,Harry, Ron, and
Hermione sat together next to a window.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bc7c15bcfe8797a1bc54540bb277db1f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3607">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-83a28b3dc491fa5d191a4a05bba81dc0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione was checking Harry and
Ron&apos;s Charms homework for them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-83a28b3dc491fa5d191a4a05bba81dc0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3608">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e22dea134a54c4549901d59509adea53</data>
      <data key="v_content">She would never let them copy (&quot;How will
you learn?&quot;), but by asking her to read it through, they got the right
answers anyway.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e22dea134a54c4549901d59509adea53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3609">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e727699ae4c01496ef880412bdfc7ca1</data>
      <data key="v_content">He wanted Quidditch Through the Ages back, to take
his mind off his nerves about tomorrow.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e727699ae4c01496ef880412bdfc7ca1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3610">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-255d37dc462b36c915e7e4e6d4d9457f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Why should he be afraid of
Snape? Getting up, he told Ron and Hermione he was going to ask Snape if
he could have it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-255d37dc462b36c915e7e4e6d4d9457f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3611">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eb077d20f8100c08ef770e19d53fc4ae</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;Better you than me,&quot; they said together, but Harry had an idea that
Snape wouldn&apos;t refuse if there were other teachers listening.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eb077d20f8100c08ef770e19d53fc4ae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3612">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5469fd2b234e3f62c9441f1bae4b5189</data>
      <data key="v_content">He made his way down to the staffroom and knocked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5469fd2b234e3f62c9441f1bae4b5189</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3613">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b40ddb5c06efc6e06f94201a2e9962be</data>
      <data key="v_content">Perhaps Snape had left the book in there? It was worth a try.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b40ddb5c06efc6e06f94201a2e9962be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3614">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2526b5f598345f7703c096baaf91488</data>
      <data key="v_content">He pushed
the door ajar and peered inside -- and a horrible scene met his eyes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2526b5f598345f7703c096baaf91488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3615">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4c9185498ef34a5b300d5d729558656f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape and Filch were inside, alone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4c9185498ef34a5b300d5d729558656f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3616">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f85f0ff1cfe8ff3057bfa33379fc92af</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape was holding his robes above
his knees.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f85f0ff1cfe8ff3057bfa33379fc92af</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3617">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3bf0e43bb5edf1837602dfbc8b571f86</data>
      <data key="v_content">One of his legs was bloody and mangled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3bf0e43bb5edf1837602dfbc8b571f86</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3618">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-81c69ee7024b1828086035024f59de9c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;How are you supposed to keep your
eyes on all three heads at once?&quot;
Harry tried to shut the door quietly, but --
&quot;POTTER!&quot;
Snape&apos;s face was twisted with fury as he dropped his robes quickly to
hide his leg.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-81c69ee7024b1828086035024f59de9c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3619">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8e9ed68142c9fb387632f377a22bee1f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I just wondered if I could have my book back.&quot;
&quot;GET OUT! OUT!&quot;
146
Harry left, before Snape could take any more points from Gryffindor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8e9ed68142c9fb387632f377a22bee1f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3620">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-798ae541e3e0c4628ce3fa8b32daec42</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Did you get it?&quot; Ron asked as Harry joined them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-798ae541e3e0c4628ce3fa8b32daec42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3621">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ad37f70fd5ebeec0d23aca34d918e299</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What&apos;s the matter?&quot;
In a low whisper, Harry told them what he&apos;d seen.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ad37f70fd5ebeec0d23aca34d918e299</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3622">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7c77fc4f19c5be8fd938e8511fc5ead2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You know what this means?&quot; he finished breathlessly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7c77fc4f19c5be8fd938e8511fc5ead2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3623">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-866fc59bf21f354883cb65c986b687a4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He tried to get
past that three-headed dog at Halloween! That&apos;s where he was going when
we saw him -- he&apos;s after whatever it&apos;s guarding! And Id bet my
broomstick he let that troll in, to make a diversion!&quot;
Hermione&apos;s eyes were wide.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-866fc59bf21f354883cb65c986b687a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3624">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7104dcc2768df5740f3b484b09ff7477</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;No -- he wouldn&apos;t, she said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7104dcc2768df5740f3b484b09ff7477</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3625">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-09f3ea8db61031ed1db298110f6072dc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I know he&apos;s not very nice, but he
wouldn&apos;t try and steal something Dumbledore was keeping safe.&quot;
&quot;Honestly, Hermione, you think all teachers are saints or something,&quot;
snapped Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-09f3ea8db61031ed1db298110f6072dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3626">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5a903b206d876bfe1a8dabb0d99729c</data>
      <data key="v_content">I wouldn&apos;t put anything past Snape.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5a903b206d876bfe1a8dabb0d99729c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3627">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e0d54bcaac0b9b5e041b5da5a1ae45bd</data>
      <data key="v_content">But
what&apos;s he after? What&apos;s that dog guarding?&quot;
Harry went to bed with his head buzzing with the same question.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e0d54bcaac0b9b5e041b5da5a1ae45bd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3628">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7c55c722b6d2a508718044bd1c386bac</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Neville
was snoring loudly, but Harry couldn&apos;t sleep.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7c55c722b6d2a508718044bd1c386bac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3629">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-07f64df02f61c927d51fa100904b77eb</data>
      <data key="v_content">He tried to empty his mind
-- he needed to sleep, he had to, he had his first Quidditch match in a
few hours -- but the expression on Snape&apos;s face when Harry had seen his
leg wasn&apos;t easy to forget.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-07f64df02f61c927d51fa100904b77eb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3630">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-01aa34c6b5f412e914c468b3cf4b9eb8</data>
      <data key="v_content">The next morning dawned very bright and cold.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-01aa34c6b5f412e914c468b3cf4b9eb8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3631">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-114b8d55f8d1fa2104fc69ee15e32dbc</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Great Hall was full of
the delicious smell of fried sausages and the cheer ful chatter of
everyone looking forward to a good Quidditch match.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-114b8d55f8d1fa2104fc69ee15e32dbc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3632">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-89ae3f508aaab110e183a0ab747c81ba</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;ve got to eat some breakfast.&quot;
&quot;I don&apos;t want anything.&quot;
&quot;Just a bit of toast,&quot; wheedled Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-89ae3f508aaab110e183a0ab747c81ba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3633">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d941720ee3ed4de2af2b80e42e73085e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;m not hungry.&quot;
Harry felt terrible.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d941720ee3ed4de2af2b80e42e73085e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3634">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f2e87619e53488433c6a3cb206d41810</data>
      <data key="v_content">In an hour&apos;s time he&apos;d be walking onto the field.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f2e87619e53488433c6a3cb206d41810</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3635">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0b349df9468f885f8bd8ab490564e282</data>
      <data key="v_content">youneedyour,&quot;Harry, you need your strength,&quot; said Seamus Finnigan.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0b349df9468f885f8bd8ab490564e282</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3636">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7d3b8a6e73baf0d0fd763586a8ad854b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Seekers are
always the ones who get clobbered by the other team.&quot;
147
&quot;Thanks, Seamus,&quot; said Harry, watching Seamus pile ketchup on his
sausages.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7d3b8a6e73baf0d0fd763586a8ad854b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3637">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8527d3a3852e7e14daf52f454259e6d5</data>
      <data key="v_content">By eleven o&apos;clock the whole school seemed to be out in the stands around
the Quidditch pitch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8527d3a3852e7e14daf52f454259e6d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3638">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bd43ee68448bd5b0a846f9f61f7bf6bc</data>
      <data key="v_content">The seats might be
raised high in the air, but it was still difficult to see what was going
on sometimes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bd43ee68448bd5b0a846f9f61f7bf6bc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3639">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-224ee185a482c329fdf3206d06c7f8bc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron and Hermione joined Neville, Seamus, and Dean the West Ham fan up in
the top row.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-224ee185a482c329fdf3206d06c7f8bc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3640">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6fd38c8f672113e75c78ff4b945a65f4</data>
      <data key="v_content">As a surprise for Harry, they had painted a large banner on
one of the sheets Scabbers had ruined.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6fd38c8f672113e75c78ff4b945a65f4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3641">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-70350cf5d4ada896fe265a3eb41a486c</data>
      <data key="v_content">It said Potter for President, and
Dean, who was good at drawing, had done a large Gryffindor lion
underneath.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-70350cf5d4ada896fe265a3eb41a486c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3642">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0c4e2411bbe4a5f0f1f03b794e11cba6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then Hermione had performed a tricky little charm so that
the paint flashed different colors.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0c4e2411bbe4a5f0f1f03b794e11cba6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3643">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9025144fffd277d5e15848e6ccb9a45e</data>
      <data key="v_content">inthelocker,Meanwhile, in the locker room, Harry and the rest of the team were
changing into their scarlet Quidditch robes (Slytherin would be playing
in green).</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9025144fffd277d5e15848e6ccb9a45e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3644">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8dee7e6cd8440a042dcaf973f0d046f1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Wood cleared his throat for silence.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8dee7e6cd8440a042dcaf973f0d046f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3645">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c30bcd31a16859a85aebfc46773b1d44</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidChaser,&quot;And women,&quot; said Chaser Angelina Johnson.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c30bcd31a16859a85aebfc46773b1d44</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3646">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-10d4d111265c49af6a12fae4c609ef0d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;This is it.&quot;
&quot;The big one,&quot; said Fred Weasley.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-10d4d111265c49af6a12fae4c609ef0d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3647">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f1199f4c9242f2bfa939a0d7efef7152</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The one we&apos;ve all been waiting for,&quot; said George.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f1199f4c9242f2bfa939a0d7efef7152</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3648">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9bbbde9df1176f99302923562b6fa74b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We know Oliver&apos;s speech by heart,&quot; Fred told Harry, &quot;we were on the
team last year.&quot;
&quot;Shut up, you two,&quot; said Wood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9bbbde9df1176f99302923562b6fa74b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3649">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-93abad82578e6651a74c3026ea1751b2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;This is the best team Gryffindor&apos;s had
in years.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-93abad82578e6651a74c3026ea1751b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3650">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e448aca8aa1c21fc8f0dd992a2e03d65</data>
      <data key="v_content">I know it.&quot;
He glared at them all as if to say, &quot;Or else.&quot;
&quot;Right.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e448aca8aa1c21fc8f0dd992a2e03d65</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3651">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7ef98ab440d8caca2b99f79223c4f23f</data>
      <data key="v_content">allof,Good luck, all of you.&quot;
Harry followed Fred and George out of the locker room and, hoping his
148
knees weren&apos;t going to give way, walked onto the field to loud cheers.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7ef98ab440d8caca2b99f79223c4f23f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3652">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-07fea2a9146d049909a31db40021b72c</data>
      <data key="v_content">She stood in the middle of the field waiting
for the two teams, her broom in her hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-07fea2a9146d049909a31db40021b72c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3653">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0799da622a0a91e600331e1581962de6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Iwanta,&quot;Now, I want a nice fair game, all of you,&quot; she said, once they were all
gathered around her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0799da622a0a91e600331e1581962de6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3654">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b0733a646823f29d27211c0857d609f7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry noticed that she seemed to be speaking
particularly to the Slytherin Captain, Marcus Flint, a sixth year.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b0733a646823f29d27211c0857d609f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3655">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ac9fb9670713b0f8b45a05564df897b1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry
thought Flint looked as if he had some troll blood in him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ac9fb9670713b0f8b45a05564df897b1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3656">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c8ddf0f3efb198101313dc05774b2eef</data>
      <data key="v_content">Out of the
corner of his eye he saw the fluttering banner high above, flashing
Potter for President over the crowd.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c8ddf0f3efb198101313dc05774b2eef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3657">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d5bfbe8ac179544ab54e4e58378ca0ec</data>
      <data key="v_content">please.&quot;,&quot;Mount your brooms, please.&quot;
Harry clambered onto his Nimbus Two Thousand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d5bfbe8ac179544ab54e4e58378ca0ec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3658">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b79d8b16a749afa3615646084d8f514f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Madam Hooch gave a loud blast on her silver whistle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b79d8b16a749afa3615646084d8f514f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3659">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca49c5faa62180fbdc70e65103376a0a</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Fifteen brooms rose up, high, high into the air.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca49c5faa62180fbdc70e65103376a0a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3660">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cd8e817864aea31545a19497097e1d4c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And the
Quaffle is taken immediately by Angelina Johnson of Gryffindor -- what
an excellent Chaser that girl is, and rather attractive, too --&quot;
&quot;JORDAN!&quot;
&quot;Sorry, Professor.&quot;
The Weasley twins&apos; friend, Lee Jordan, was doing the commentary for the
match, closely watched by Professor McGonagall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cd8e817864aea31545a19497097e1d4c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3661">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f16e5785a5efed6317b314a2cc34ed4e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And she&apos;s really belting along up there, a neat pass to Alicia Spinnet,
a good find of Oliver Wood&apos;s, last year only a reserve -- back to
Johnson and -- no, the Slytherins have taken the Quaffle, Slytherin
Captain Marcus Flint gains the Quaffle and off he goes -- Flint flying
like an eagle up there -- he&apos;s going to sc- no, stopped by an excellent
move by Gryffindor Keeper Wood and the Gryffindors take the Quaffle --
that&apos;s Chaser Katie Bell of Gryffindor there, nice dive around Flint,
off up the field and -- OUCH -- that must have hurt, hit in the back of
the head by a Bludger -- Quaffle taken by the Slytherins -- that&apos;s
Adrian Pucey speeding off toward the goal posts, but he&apos;s blocked by a
second Bludger -- sent his way by Fred or George Weasley, can&apos;t tell
which -- nice play by the Gryffindor Beater, anyway, and Johnson back in
possession of the Quaffle, a clear field ahead and off she goes -- she&apos;s
really flying -- dodges a speeding Bludger -- the goal posts are ahead
149
-- come on, now, Angelina -- Keeper Bletchley dives -- misses --
GRYFFINDORS SCORE!&quot;
Gryffindor cheers filled the cold air, with howls and moans from the
Slytherins.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f16e5785a5efed6317b314a2cc34ed4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3662">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5bf9af85dcc79ec5a5aad62eaad5417e</data>
      <data key="v_content">move,&quot;Budge up there, move along.&quot;
&quot;Hagrid!&quot;
Ron and Hermione squeezed together to give Hagrid enough space to join
them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5bf9af85dcc79ec5a5aad62eaad5417e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3663">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-40ec0e623273a78dec3eee46eb9e41eb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Bin watchin&apos; from me hut,&quot; said Hagrid, patting a large pair of
binoculars around his neck, &quot;But it isn&apos;t the same as bein&apos; in the
crowd.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-40ec0e623273a78dec3eee46eb9e41eb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3664">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-59785742c061329fa16a2da7de44c333</data>
      <data key="v_content">No sign of the Snitch yet, eh?&quot;
&quot;Nope,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-59785742c061329fa16a2da7de44c333</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3665">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-96dd25a3a2926eb0df96abe36068d75e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Harry hasn&apos;t had much to do yet.&quot;
&quot;Kept outta trouble, though, that&apos;s somethin&apos;,&quot; said Hagrid, raising his
binoculars and peering skyward at the speck that was Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-96dd25a3a2926eb0df96abe36068d75e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3666">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2ea1d28dd923a27994d8f041743ae745</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Way up above them, Harry was gliding over the game, squinting about for
some sign of the Snitch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2ea1d28dd923a27994d8f041743ae745</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3667">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-99516c0d1ea9024b111e0ec6a9086b04</data>
      <data key="v_content">This was part of his and Wood&apos;s game plan.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-99516c0d1ea9024b111e0ec6a9086b04</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3668">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2d2ab4752e27b2021f32226a2c4b18b0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Keep out of the way until you catch sight of the Snitch,&quot; Wood had
said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2d2ab4752e27b2021f32226a2c4b18b0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3669">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e1f458fd5dd486026c63afc1888693ee</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We don&apos;t want you attacked before you have to be.&quot;
When Angelina had scored, Harry had done a couple of loop-the-loops to
let off his feelings.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e1f458fd5dd486026c63afc1888693ee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3670">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b07aa8fd9f17b20d88a07b4b4b508dcc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Now he was back to staring around for the Snitch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b07aa8fd9f17b20d88a07b4b4b508dcc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3671">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9ab0b2071973644d63626cd80e02a071</data>
      <data key="v_content">Once he caught sight of a flash of gold, but it was just a reflection
from one of the Weasleys&apos; wristwatches, and once a Bludger decided to
come pelting his way, more like a cannonball than anything, but Harry
dodged it and Fred Weasley came chasing after it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9ab0b2071973644d63626cd80e02a071</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3672">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-40ea957431021b50430f1da5f8e0cc78</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry?&quot;,&quot;All right there, Harry?&quot; he had time to yell, as he beat the Bludger
furiously toward Marcus Flint.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-40ea957431021b50430f1da5f8e0cc78</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3673">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-32410adf3a94bc73ac957d1b6a1882fb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Lee,&quot;Slytherin in possession,&quot; Lee Jordan was saying, &quot;Chaser Pucey ducks
two Bludgers, two Weasleys, and Chaser Bell, and speeds toward the --
wait a moment -- was that the Snitch?&quot;
A murmur ran through the crowd as Adrian Pucey dropped the Quaffle, too
150
busy looking over his shoulder at the flash of gold that had passed his
left ear.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-32410adf3a94bc73ac957d1b6a1882fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3674">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ccc95a08a307361dfdbf34309d0f8fb5</data>
      <data key="v_content">In a great rush of excitement he dived downward after the
streak of gold.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ccc95a08a307361dfdbf34309d0f8fb5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3675">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-087d60b6de13ef0aba6d828982b5bb45</data>
      <data key="v_content">Slytherin Seeker Terence Higgs had seen it, too.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-087d60b6de13ef0aba6d828982b5bb45</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3676">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aa98b850f4068095fafe524c7a98ec2e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neck
and neck they hurtled toward the Snitch -all the Chasers seemed to have
forgotten what they were supposed to be doing as they hung in midair to
watch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aa98b850f4068095fafe524c7a98ec2e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3677">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9f885d7709a5488cebdb9ccdaba84285</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry was faster than Higgs -- he could see the little round ball, wings
fluttering, darting up ahead - - he put on an extra spurt of speed --
WHAM! A roar of rage echoed from the Gryffindors below -- Marcus Flint
had blocked Harry on purpose, and Harry&apos;s broom spun off course, Harry
holding on for dear life.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9f885d7709a5488cebdb9ccdaba84285</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3678">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-41af3fa3bf53d77e7f05da2e20541ca8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Madam Hooch spoke angrily to Flint and then ordered a free shot at the
goal posts for Gryffindor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-41af3fa3bf53d77e7f05da2e20541ca8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3679">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4173066dc4b8b787a49911851070842f</data>
      <data key="v_content">But in all the confusion, of course, the
Golden Snitch had disappeared from sight again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4173066dc4b8b787a49911851070842f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3680">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e515efdb05ddba05cfe4f00692b06d07</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Down in the stands, Dean Thomas was yelling, &quot;Send him off, ref! Red
card!&quot;
&quot;What are you talking about, Dean?&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e515efdb05ddba05cfe4f00692b06d07</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3681">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3e2492d054fc1fa0a8c2b6054f3b5420</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;In soccer you get shown the red card
and you&apos;re out of the game!&quot;
&quot;But this isn&apos;t soccer, Dean,&quot; Ron reminded him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3e2492d054fc1fa0a8c2b6054f3b5420</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3682">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a7bd43fc4cbbfc002ff3933245b6560d</data>
      <data key="v_content">however,wason,Hagrid, however, was on Dean&apos;s side.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a7bd43fc4cbbfc002ff3933245b6560d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3683">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-793db3cabc07f2a881734539b5010905</data>
      <data key="v_content">Flint coulda knocked Harry outta the
air.&quot;
Lee Jordan was finding it difficult not to take sides.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-793db3cabc07f2a881734539b5010905</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3684">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5784c6109a7f8f3ba8a4700a0a163dde</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So -- after that obvious and disgusting bit of cheating
&quot;Jordan!&quot; growled Professor McGonagall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5784c6109a7f8f3ba8a4700a0a163dde</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3685">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-99a5d5bc9fd976422e3506f8a134b054</data>
      <data key="v_content">after,151
&quot;I mean, after that open and revolting foul
&apos;Jordan, I&apos;m warning you --&quot;
&quot;All right, all right.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-99a5d5bc9fd976422e3506f8a134b054</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3686">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c1e310ba5e72c1b19b63f176399ebac8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Flint nearly kills the Gryffindor Seeker, which
could happen to anyone, I&apos;m sure, so a penalty to Gryffindor, taken by
Spinner, who puts it away, no trouble, and we continue play, Gryffindor
still in possession.&quot;
It was as Harry dodged another Bludger, which went spinning dangerously
past his head, that it happened.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c1e310ba5e72c1b19b63f176399ebac8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3687">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d27025ed06803c93e8b6bc277743d4ee</data>
      <data key="v_content">His broom gave a sudden, frightening
lurch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d27025ed06803c93e8b6bc277743d4ee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3688">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-501f127eb98370e9cce4d38b54557245</data>
      <data key="v_content">,For a split second, he thought he was going to fall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-501f127eb98370e9cce4d38b54557245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3689">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-98afce46ff5a92653dc6a5a793028d22</data>
      <data key="v_content">He gripped
the broom tightly with both his hands and knees.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-98afce46ff5a92653dc6a5a793028d22</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3690">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-46c534230e4fb2dc75d3a404d4978881</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;d never felt
anything like that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-46c534230e4fb2dc75d3a404d4978881</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3691">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4cec4d306ebb9ddd0942013cfa2d0893</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was as though the broom was trying to buck him
off.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4cec4d306ebb9ddd0942013cfa2d0893</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3692">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7a20202c885b3c47d58b2fefdd5e1dbc</data>
      <data key="v_content">But Nimbus Two Thousands did not suddenly decide to buck their
riders off.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7a20202c885b3c47d58b2fefdd5e1dbc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3693">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ed4b0040f62eac11c75a84641eb414f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry tried to turn back toward the Gryffindor goal- posts
-- he had half a mind to ask Wood to call time-out -- and then he
realized that his broom was completely out of his control.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ed4b0040f62eac11c75a84641eb414f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3694">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-02c8cf277c53a1c9aa430bce01c2c44f</data>
      <data key="v_content">He couldn&apos;t direct it at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-02c8cf277c53a1c9aa430bce01c2c44f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3695">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9573a3cf858ea11913b624fc3912d2bf</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was zigzagging through the
air, and every now and then making violent swishing movements that
almost unseated him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9573a3cf858ea11913b624fc3912d2bf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3696">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-37d40b621e4a0e8b6803b4bf2853a28c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Slytherin in possession -- Flint with the Quaffle -- passes Spinnet --
passes Bell -- hit hard in the face by a Bludger, hope it broke his nose
-- only joking, Professor -- Slytherins score -- A no...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-37d40b621e4a0e8b6803b4bf2853a28c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3697">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4bcbb7e9d2cbad126253593c1bf22602</data>
      <data key="v_content">No one seemed to have noticed that Harry&apos;s
broom was behaving strangely.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4bcbb7e9d2cbad126253593c1bf22602</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3698">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9d1d70ef20c6fbeb8659b48748e77e54</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was carrying- him slowly higher, away
from the game, jerking and twitching as it went.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9d1d70ef20c6fbeb8659b48748e77e54</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3699">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e1aba6886561cf03f086f730d1c5e7f7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Dunno what Harry thinks he&apos;s doing,&quot; Hagrid mumbled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e1aba6886561cf03f086f730d1c5e7f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3700">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ab70d6df1e8b9651ea912192dfed055</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;If I didn&apos; know better, I&apos;d say he&apos;d lost control of
his broom...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ab70d6df1e8b9651ea912192dfed055</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3701">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7b30f398a7950a927de9525b0153d5c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">but he can&apos;t have....&quot;
Suddenly, people were pointing up at Harry all over the stands.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7b30f398a7950a927de9525b0153d5c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3702">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5ad24c6c5373026b41980d0dd3050aae</data>
      <data key="v_content">His
broom had started to roll over and over, with him only just managing to
hold on.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5ad24c6c5373026b41980d0dd3050aae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3703">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cb1941c17517f55c9be6d2ff10eb5e90</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry&apos;s broom had given a wild
jerk and Harry swung off it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cb1941c17517f55c9be6d2ff10eb5e90</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3704">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ce23dcb77dfeb3e6ac904e7bc20ef25e</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was now dangling from it, holding on
with only one hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ce23dcb77dfeb3e6ac904e7bc20ef25e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3705">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-404bb9f06fa4c8c8fda5923428aa0d25</data>
      <data key="v_content">152
&quot;Did something happen to it when Flint blocked him?&quot; Seamus whispered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-404bb9f06fa4c8c8fda5923428aa0d25</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3706">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fdb15a5626695cd080fb42d1e366b845</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Hagridsaid,,&quot;Can&apos;t have,&quot; Hagrid said, his voice shaking.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fdb15a5626695cd080fb42d1e366b845</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3707">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7d627add4a93407c0909a997cd061342</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Can&apos;t nothing interfere
with a broomstick except powerful Dark magic -- no kid could do that to
a Nimbus Two Thousand.&quot;
At these words, Hermione seized Hagrid&apos;s binoculars, but instead of
looking up at Harry, she started looking frantically at the crowd.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7d627add4a93407c0909a997cd061342</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3708">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-56983335f492a5697130165a97098a28</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What are you doing?&quot; moaned Ron, gray-faced.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-56983335f492a5697130165a97098a28</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3709">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a8db8d9d77e78fe757724af78bf593f3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Hermione,&quot;I knew it,&quot; Hermione gasped, &quot;Snape -- look.&quot;
Ron grabbed the binoculars.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a8db8d9d77e78fe757724af78bf593f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3710">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c8b74944d4a97dd2411bced2b13f5103</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape was in the middle of the stands
opposite them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c8b74944d4a97dd2411bced2b13f5103</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3711">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eb5c9db847d3d49189f89731f3c8e639</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had his eyes fixed on Harry and was muttering nonstop
under his breath.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eb5c9db847d3d49189f89731f3c8e639</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3712">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-13e2074b9e2b2c967013d904f6fa851b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He&apos;s doing something -- jinxing the broom,&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-13e2074b9e2b2c967013d904f6fa851b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3713">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ebdd24abf6ba41b0d3a785f913cdb47e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What should we do?&quot;
&quot;Leave it to me.&quot;
Before Ron could say another word, Hermione had disappeared.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ebdd24abf6ba41b0d3a785f913cdb47e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3714">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6053c6b94543fda984981ab463d593ac</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron turned
the binoculars back on Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6053c6b94543fda984981ab463d593ac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3715">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dc3d198b4ccb7faf750b1070c8b2b426</data>
      <data key="v_content">His broom was vibrating so hard, it was
almost impossible for him to hang on much longer.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dc3d198b4ccb7faf750b1070c8b2b426</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3716">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-72afecb77489e511aa913d73e1c634a8</data>
      <data key="v_content">The whole crowd was on
its feet, watching, terrified, as the Weasleys flew up to try and pull
Harry safely onto one of their brooms, but it was no good -- every time
they got near him, the broom would jump higher still.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-72afecb77489e511aa913d73e1c634a8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3717">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cca8518c1dcd07cbe38b7f96d21a425a</data>
      <data key="v_content">They dropped lower
and circled beneath him, obviously hoping to catch him if he fell.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cca8518c1dcd07cbe38b7f96d21a425a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3718">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e33db54b99e6e80d35b3671253854599</data>
      <data key="v_content">Marcus
Flint seized the Quaffle and scored five times without anyone noticing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e33db54b99e6e80d35b3671253854599</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3719">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-faf59c5041368cf2df62503123303791</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione,&quot;Ron,&quot;Come on, Hermione,&quot; Ron muttered desperately.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-faf59c5041368cf2df62503123303791</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3720">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b55eedf81ec27212d81403844dc31e39</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione had fought her way across to the stand where Snape stood, and
was now racing along the row behind him; she didn&apos;t even stop to say
sorry as she knocked Professor Quirrell headfirst into the row in front.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b55eedf81ec27212d81403844dc31e39</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3721">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-12ef7be076069d90784dc10686ba10b9</data>
      <data key="v_content">shecrouched,Reaching Snape, she crouched down, pulled out her wand, and whispered a
few, well- chosen words.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-12ef7be076069d90784dc10686ba10b9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3722">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bc86dcc591707fe2160e220db8e91e7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Bright blue flames shot from her wand onto the
hem of Snape&apos;s robes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bc86dcc591707fe2160e220db8e91e7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3723">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e5f7a0320f4e81574751ac8b59b68d89</data>
      <data key="v_content">153
It took perhaps thirty seconds for Snape to realize that he was on fire.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e5f7a0320f4e81574751ac8b59b68d89</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3724">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dd925c9b8d8f72c0ee1b0520406738ba</data>
      <data key="v_content">A sudden yelp told her she had done her job.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dd925c9b8d8f72c0ee1b0520406738ba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3725">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-93060943c9fef22dc03fc861131d9d2e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Scooping the fire off him
into a little jar in her pocket, she scrambled back along the row --
Snape would never know what had happened.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-93060943c9fef22dc03fc861131d9d2e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3726">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-31be831ff00eb00e3249cbda88234f0c</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Up in the air, Harry was suddenly able to clamber back on
to his broom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-31be831ff00eb00e3249cbda88234f0c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3727">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9f4ceccb6f18fbfd24331a0d0c0f0348</data>
      <data key="v_content">youcanlook!&quot;,&quot;Neville, you can look!&quot; Ron said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9f4ceccb6f18fbfd24331a0d0c0f0348</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3728">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0c3c32180e8b89b9e955a493fbd55161</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville had been sobbing into
Hagrid&apos;s jacket for the last five minutes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0c3c32180e8b89b9e955a493fbd55161</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3729">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7f7eae3467f85f26524aa6fc1fe0177a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry was speeding toward the ground when the crowd saw him clap his
hand to his mouth as though he was about to be sick -- he hit the field
on all fours -- coughed -- and something gold fell into his hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7f7eae3467f85f26524aa6fc1fe0177a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3730">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b121ea360db68712bc4c5fb466ddaea2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;ve got the Snitch!&quot; he shouted, waving it above his head, and the
game ended in complete confusion.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b121ea360db68712bc4c5fb466ddaea2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3731">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f5b90c0ccafaeca5c7f31a635284bf2a</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;He didn&apos;t catch it, he nearly swallowed it,&quot; Flint was still howling
twenty minutes later, but it made no difference -- Harry hadn&apos;t broken
any rules and Lee Jordan was still happily shouting the results --
Gryffindor had won by one hundred and seventy points to sixty.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f5b90c0ccafaeca5c7f31a635284bf2a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3732">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fccca6a997977cd2afe7829bfe16edda</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry
heard none of this, though.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fccca6a997977cd2afe7829bfe16edda</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3733">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6bc5a0e0a20fc59098d93ad0b985d4c6</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was being made a cup of strong tea back
in Hagrid&apos;s hut, with Ron and Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6bc5a0e0a20fc59098d93ad0b985d4c6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3734">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4fae9dafe07d0de8c8be6c5eb0df4858</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ron,&quot;It was Snape,&quot; Ron was explaining, &quot;Hermione and I saw him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4fae9dafe07d0de8c8be6c5eb0df4858</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3735">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-31f9fce706d764b254c01dfa165a97d6</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was
cursing your broomstick, muttering, he wouldn&apos;t take his eyes off you.&quot;
&quot;Rubbish,&quot; said Hagrid, who hadn&apos;t heard a word of what had gone on next
to him in the stands.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-31f9fce706d764b254c01dfa165a97d6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3736">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec044d224beee43fab9b0308c45f0fe1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Why would Snape do somethin&apos; like that?&quot;
Harry, Ron, and Hermione looked at one another, wondering what to tell
him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec044d224beee43fab9b0308c45f0fe1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3737">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-37702d57b2da383792580b645715633d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I found out something about him,&quot; he told Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-37702d57b2da383792580b645715633d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3738">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-638ab4b5c7cd595c6df169196667e85d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He tried to get past
that three-headed dog on Halloween.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-638ab4b5c7cd595c6df169196667e85d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3739">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-24e1932f38217aa6ab63715e26e777b8</data>
      <data key="v_content">We think he was trying
to steal whatever it&apos;s guarding.&quot;
Hagrid dropped the teapot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-24e1932f38217aa6ab63715e26e777b8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3740">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d3ca8a015b828cc3a9b6a69c007963d0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;How do you know about Fluffy?&quot; he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d3ca8a015b828cc3a9b6a69c007963d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3741">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-df3dd455204fb7f74142a2f995214362</data>
      <data key="v_content">154
&quot;Fluffy?&quot;
&quot;Yeah -- he&apos;s mine -- bought him off a Greek chappie I met in the pub
las&apos; year -- I lent him to Dumbledore to guard the
&quot;Yes?&quot; said Harry eagerly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-df3dd455204fb7f74142a2f995214362</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3742">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-49cc6fc1ceb6bbe6feb58b5f941e120c</data>
      <data key="v_content">don&apos;taskme,&quot;Now, don&apos;t ask me anymore,&quot; said Hagrid gruffly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-49cc6fc1ceb6bbe6feb58b5f941e120c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3743">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ae8fd4efeb6be0a54aa4f5094bb6d209</data>
      <data key="v_content">that,&quot;That&apos;s top secret,
that is.&quot;
&quot;But Snape&apos;s trying to steal it.&quot;
&quot;Rubbish,&quot; said Hagrid again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ae8fd4efeb6be0a54aa4f5094bb6d209</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3744">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2999b9d5960ccfd2042b4c5996668357</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Snape&apos;s a Hogwarts teacher, he&apos;d do
nothin&apos; of the sort.&quot;
&quot;So why did he just try and kill Harry?&quot; cried Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2999b9d5960ccfd2042b4c5996668357</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3745">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6b4dc350714c6e17afc576a8a193858a</data>
      <data key="v_content">The afternoon&apos;s events certainly seemed to have changed her mind about
Snape.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6b4dc350714c6e17afc576a8a193858a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3746">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-38836351ddd52dd68ea15119b9a30c19</data>
      <data key="v_content">I know a jinx when I see one, Hagrid, I&apos;ve read all about them!
You&apos;ve got to keep eye contact, and Snape wasn&apos;t blinking at all, I saw
him!&quot;
&quot;I&apos;m tellin&apos; yeh, yer wrong!&quot; said Hagrid hotly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-38836351ddd52dd68ea15119b9a30c19</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3747">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2eab716bc59b7b6db74ac84b5e340330</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I don&apos; know why
Harry&apos;s broom acted like that, but Snape wouldn&apos; try an&apos; kill a student!
Now, listen to me, all three of yeh -- yer meddlin&apos; in things that don&apos;
concern yeh.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2eab716bc59b7b6db74ac84b5e340330</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3748">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e1f7e58ad1a5e87cee9bf4f917c37492</data>
      <data key="v_content">,You forget that dog, an&apos; you forget what
it&apos;s guardin&apos;, that&apos;s between Professor Dumbledore an&apos; Nicolas Flamel
--&quot;
&quot;Aha!&quot; said Harry, &quot;so there&apos;s someone called Nicolas Flamel involved,
is there?&quot;
Hagrid looked furious with himself.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e1f7e58ad1a5e87cee9bf4f917c37492</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3749">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9cc75536e20ff3e1486b5b003c8b200c</data>
      <data key="v_content">CHAPTER TWELVE
THE MIRROR OF ERISED
Christmas was coming.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9cc75536e20ff3e1486b5b003c8b200c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3750">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-24165d28f2ee0a07f2593223c88bf2a9</data>
      <data key="v_content">,One morning in mid-December, Hogwarts woke to find
155
itself covered in several feet of snow.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-24165d28f2ee0a07f2593223c88bf2a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3751">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-673543e7c6bc1f18367aea1124e037b1</data>
      <data key="v_content">The lake froze solid and the
Weasley twins were punished for bewitching several snowballs so that
they followed Quirrell around, bouncing off the back of his turban.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-673543e7c6bc1f18367aea1124e037b1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3752">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6b4c815492a387972b4e221686e87ecc</data>
      <data key="v_content">The
few owls that managed to battle their way through the stormy sky to
deliver mail had to be nursed back to health by Hagrid before they could
fly off again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6b4c815492a387972b4e221686e87ecc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3753">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd13d08cf46aaaa079ab8fb7e4f400a1</data>
      <data key="v_content">No one could wait for the holidays to start.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd13d08cf46aaaa079ab8fb7e4f400a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3754">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eb6cf0ea09240878cef11144b42e3ae4</data>
      <data key="v_content">While the Gryffindor common
room and the Great Hall had roaring fires, the drafty corridors had
become icy and a bitter wind rattled the windows in the classrooms.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eb6cf0ea09240878cef11144b42e3ae4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3755">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9fc6033b592938bbe12a3d9b53e2e02b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Worst of all were Professor Snape&apos;s classes down in the dungeons, where
their breath rose in a mist before them and they kept as close as
possible to their hot cauldrons.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9fc6033b592938bbe12a3d9b53e2e02b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3756">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-56861177f5219d2d97bed9ebabc69ef5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I do feel so sorry,&quot; said Draco Malfoy, one Potions class, &quot;for all
those people who have to stay at Hogwarts for Christmas because they&apos;re
not wanted at home.&quot;
He was looking over at Harry as he spoke.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-56861177f5219d2d97bed9ebabc69ef5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3757">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-012c9d2088c5f6d14c3ef149c092a71d</data>
      <data key="v_content">whowasmeasuring,Harry, who was measuring out powdered spine of lionfish, ignored them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-012c9d2088c5f6d14c3ef149c092a71d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3758">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-214be4eea025bba78deb87ea477d3775</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy had been even more unpleasant than usual since the Quidditch
match.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-214be4eea025bba78deb87ea477d3775</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3759">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a210bbc5a33d033453c9757293c5aa85</data>
      <data key="v_content">Disgusted that the Slytherins had lost, he had tried to get
everyone laughing at how a wide-mouthed tree frog would be replacing
Harry as Seeker next.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a210bbc5a33d033453c9757293c5aa85</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3760">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d5a74acf72085bdd5de0dd8b349347e9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then he&apos;d realized that nobody found this funny,
because they were all so impressed at the way Harry had managed to stay
on his bucking broomstick.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d5a74acf72085bdd5de0dd8b349347e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3761">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7cbd0ccea9ef8f240049ac1626a19ab7</data>
      <data key="v_content">jealousand,So Malfoy, jealous and angry, had gone back
to taunting Harry about having no proper family.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7cbd0ccea9ef8f240049ac1626a19ab7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3762">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-02e1af948dd6069050b13e19b1e87fee</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was true that Harry wasn&apos;t going back to Privet Drive for Christmas.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-02e1af948dd6069050b13e19b1e87fee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3763">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3f8929610d65af570309037b741223c1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall had come around the week before, making a list of
students who would be staying for the holidays, and Harry had signed up
at once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3f8929610d65af570309037b741223c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3764">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e50da5559316765e394a87804782af7b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He didn&apos;t feel sorry for himself at all; this would probably be
the best Christmas he&apos;d ever had.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e50da5559316765e394a87804782af7b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3765">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-76990a2b6872d663321eec666e36f530</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron and his brothers were staying,
too, because Mr.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-76990a2b6872d663321eec666e36f530</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3766">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eb801fb333e655e7402a035760ba15c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Weasley were going to Romania to visit
Charlie.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eb801fb333e655e7402a035760ba15c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3767">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fb1589fafdc4af364ebd5fe70d3d8ad5</data>
      <data key="v_content">When they left the dungeons at the end of Potions, they found a large
fir tree blocking the corridor ahead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fb1589fafdc4af364ebd5fe70d3d8ad5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3768">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4486e4bef0852182b8a5404941a85cbd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Two enormous feet sticking out at
the bottom and a loud puffing sound told them that Hagrid was behind it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4486e4bef0852182b8a5404941a85cbd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3769">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3d06fb2a8157fac9a0d0f9d4ddebeec7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid,wantany,&quot;Hi, Hagrid, want any help?&quot; Ron asked, sticking his head through the
branches.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3d06fb2a8157fac9a0d0f9d4ddebeec7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3770">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d5c5ffec7bb3fc75815ac1015b9bafa0</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;mall,156
&quot;Nah, I&apos;m all right, thanks, Ron.&quot;
&quot;Would you mind moving out of the way?&quot; came Malfoys cold drawl from
behind them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d5c5ffec7bb3fc75815ac1015b9bafa0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3771">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a32c5faf8267770bab2064484d5ee6f3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Are you trying to earn some extra money, Weasley? Hoping
to be gamekeeper yourself when you leave Hogwarts, I suppose -- that hut
of Hagrid&apos;s must seem like a palace compared to what your family&apos;s used
to.&quot;
Ron dived at Malfoy just as Snape came up the stairs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a32c5faf8267770bab2064484d5ee6f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3772">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-399226db455a244cdc6c33a5b448208b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;WEASLEY!&quot;
Ron let go of the front of Malfoy&apos;s robes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-399226db455a244cdc6c33a5b448208b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3773">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-20fc45409caee9ea06a7e37729040489</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor,&quot;He was provoked, Professor Snape,&quot; said Hagrid, sticking his huge hairy
face out from behind the tree.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-20fc45409caee9ea06a7e37729040489</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3774">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-162fcabcce21bd46fcb440b687f6205c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Malfoy was insultin&apos; his family.&quot;
&quot;Be that as it may, fighting is against Hogwarts rules, Hagrid,&quot; said
Snape silkily.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-162fcabcce21bd46fcb440b687f6205c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3775">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4c075bbb960d5273ff0ff3e691b4ef9e</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Five points from Gryffindor, Weasley, and be grateful it
isn&apos;t more.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4c075bbb960d5273ff0ff3e691b4ef9e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3776">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8c9ef89cef6869a5ffdf3db62bc8a856</data>
      <data key="v_content">allof,Move along, all of you.&quot;
Malfoy, Crabbe, and Goyle pushed roughly past the tree, scattering
needles everywhere and smirking.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8c9ef89cef6869a5ffdf3db62bc8a856</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3777">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-94ec6b79c7d6a8807a86cbab5f1a72fe</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;said,&quot;I&apos;ll get him,&quot; said Ron, grinding his teeth at Malfoy&apos;s back, &quot;one of
these days, I&apos;ll get him --&quot;
&quot;I hate them both,&quot; said Harry, &quot;Malfoy and Snape.&quot;
&quot;Come on, cheer up, it&apos;s nearly Christmas,&quot; said Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-94ec6b79c7d6a8807a86cbab5f1a72fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3778">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a69d041e2c457007d60334313b0af72c</data>
      <data key="v_content">come,&quot;Tell yeh what,
come with me an&apos; see the Great Hall, looks a treat.&quot;
So the three of them followed Hagrid and his tree off to -the Great
Hall, where Professor McGonagall and Professor Flitwick were busy with
the Christmas decorations.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a69d041e2c457007d60334313b0af72c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3779">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bda8b799525c150c008ba530f6abe267</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid,thelast,&quot;Ah, Hagrid, the last tree -- put it in the far corner, would you?&quot;
The hall looked spectacular.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bda8b799525c150c008ba530f6abe267</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3780">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-445e7d6eb38ad9d86d937c4a04cbfa9b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Festoons of holly and mistletoe hung all
around the walls, and no less than twelve towering Christmas trees stood
around the room, some sparkling with tiny icicles, some glittering with
hundreds of candles.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-445e7d6eb38ad9d86d937c4a04cbfa9b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3781">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0e59302ea64c1cbb6545bd522d1de680</data>
      <data key="v_content">157
&quot;How many days you got left until yer holidays?&quot; Hagrid asked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0e59302ea64c1cbb6545bd522d1de680</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3782">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b15102b3d5bf9c3f1339f31245a68db8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And that reminds me -Harry, Ron, we&apos;ve got
half an hour before lunch, we should be in the library.&quot;
&quot;Oh yeah, you&apos;re right,&quot; said Ron, tearing his eyes away from Professor
Flitwick, who had golden bubbles blossoming out of his wand and was
trailing them over the branches of the new tree.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b15102b3d5bf9c3f1339f31245a68db8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3783">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c32b06a1ae15d8e0ff7aca5a3bd86686</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;The library?&quot; said Hagrid, following them out of the hall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c32b06a1ae15d8e0ff7aca5a3bd86686</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3784">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-217fdf863b3aa7056419b5b5546d8a30</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Just before
the holidays? Bit keen, aren&apos;t yeh?&quot;
&quot;Oh, we&apos;re not working,&quot; Harry told him brightly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-217fdf863b3aa7056419b5b5546d8a30</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3785">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6b91a64cb67f8074a0767ef9410a1a1c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ever since you
mentioned Nicolas Flamel we&apos;ve been trying to find out who he is.&quot;
&quot;You what?&quot; Hagrid looked shocked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6b91a64cb67f8074a0767ef9410a1a1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3786">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b9a8850d2b75b9b0249839975e9c71aa</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Listen here -- I&apos;ve told yeh -- drop
it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b9a8850d2b75b9b0249839975e9c71aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3787">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f8869163a8b6965e1e10202561b7707d</data>
      <data key="v_content">It&apos;s nothin&apos; to you what that dog&apos;s guardin&apos;.&quot;
&quot;We just want to know who Nicolas Flamel is, that&apos;s all,&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f8869163a8b6965e1e10202561b7707d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3788">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-28ee8b9a14ea9a73c020ed3bed4b53c1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Unless you&apos;d like to tell us and save us the trouble?&quot; Harry added.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-28ee8b9a14ea9a73c020ed3bed4b53c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3789">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cded4733d684ca00515e39681bab51b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We
must&apos;ve been through hundreds of books already and we can&apos;t find him
anywhere -- just give us a hint -- I know I&apos;ve read his name somewhere.&quot;
&quot;I&apos;m sayin&apos; nothin, said Hagrid flatly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cded4733d684ca00515e39681bab51b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3790">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-47f35f2dc215fbaa840f998a48421fa4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Just have to find out for ourselves, then,&quot; said Ron, and they left
Hagrid looking disgruntled and hurried off to the library.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-47f35f2dc215fbaa840f998a48421fa4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3791">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9c3447653723d74efa58e7263d9cac9b</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had indeed been searching books for Flamel&apos;s name ever since Hagrid
had let it slip, because how else were they going to find out what Snape
was trying to steal? The trouble was, it was very hard to know where to
begin, not knowing what Flamel might have done to get himself into a
book.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9c3447653723d74efa58e7263d9cac9b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3792">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9265d16357f36e2783d11c7b02500e2e</data>
      <data key="v_content">He wasn&apos;t in Great Wizards of the Twentieth Century, or Notable
Magical Names of Our Time; he was missing, too, from Important Modern
Magical Discoveries, and A Study of Recent Developments in Wizardry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9265d16357f36e2783d11c7b02500e2e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3793">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2fbb663a1282070c7b2baf48d405dd7</data>
      <data key="v_content">ofcourse,,And
then, of course, there was the sheer size of the library; tens of
thousands of books; thousands of shelves; hundreds of narrow rows.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2fbb663a1282070c7b2baf48d405dd7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3794">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7f1a22245c8d5cf1f02a84d4dfc9cdf6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione took out a list of subjects and titles she had decided to
search while Ron strode off down a row of books and started pulling them
off the shelves at random.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7f1a22245c8d5cf1f02a84d4dfc9cdf6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3795">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-34a229c06a69d737c87acf51bb6645e8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry wandered over to the Restricted
Section.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-34a229c06a69d737c87acf51bb6645e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3796">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d648f72276e7a9f4b16a4784bc0c7b2b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had been wondering for a while if Flamel wasn&apos;t somewhere in
158
there.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d648f72276e7a9f4b16a4784bc0c7b2b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3797">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ea3c388a2592f41701f0236631ff0ee</data>
      <data key="v_content">youneededa,Unfortunately, you needed a specially signed note from one of the
teachers to look in any of the restricted books, and he knew he&apos;d never
get one.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ea3c388a2592f41701f0236631ff0ee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3798">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7e6762501b620b4414641b24f385be83</data>
      <data key="v_content">These were the books containing powerful Dark Magic never
taught at Hogwarts, and only read by older students studying advanced
Defense Against the Dark Arts.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7e6762501b620b4414641b24f385be83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3799">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-34b87159d53800e81cc5d87663d29043</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What are you looking for, boy?&quot;
&quot;Nothing,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-34b87159d53800e81cc5d87663d29043</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3800">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b658ba3b39e1aa40db6ccdb2269ac379</data>
      <data key="v_content">Madam Pince the librarian brandished a feather duster at him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b658ba3b39e1aa40db6ccdb2269ac379</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3801">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-936537df7ace4fdae1808089d86dae6c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Go on -- out!&quot;
Wishing he&apos;d been a bit quicker at thinking up some story, Harry left
the library.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-936537df7ace4fdae1808089d86dae6c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3802">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7f1df0f214a5427a0815d62f2ebf6b81</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron,andHermione,He, Ron, and Hermione had already agreed they&apos;d better not
ask Madam Pince where they could find Flamel.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7f1df0f214a5427a0815d62f2ebf6b81</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3803">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-abeab6abd0354031dc88d1862dcf75a4</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were sure she&apos;d be
able to tell them, but they couldn&apos;t risk Snape hearing what they were
up to.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-abeab6abd0354031dc88d1862dcf75a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3804">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9628c47c33fa3cf868f8e79095693bd0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry waited outside in the corridor to see if the other two had found
anything, but he wasn&apos;t very hopeful.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9628c47c33fa3cf868f8e79095693bd0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3805">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9e1cf85296452c144de041eb95266fd0</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had been looking for two
weeks, after A, but as they only had odd moments between lessons it
wasn&apos;t surprising they&apos;d found nothing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9e1cf85296452c144de041eb95266fd0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3806">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ead3cb13d72958e7dc8d4512f7f6f61</data>
      <data key="v_content">What they really needed was a
nice long search without Madam Pince breathing down their necks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ead3cb13d72958e7dc8d4512f7f6f61</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3807">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-86335b79b934a4933c0a76d876628b92</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron,Five minutes later, Ron and Hermione joined him, shaking their heads.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-86335b79b934a4933c0a76d876628b92</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3808">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d591fc880d30ae9096ab49c07eb3ae38</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You will keep looking while I&apos;m away, won&apos;t you?&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d591fc880d30ae9096ab49c07eb3ae38</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3809">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b8de668d08a8bdcc6245300c6227a2a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And
send me an owl if you find anything.&quot;
&quot;And you could ask your parents if they know who Flamel is,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b8de668d08a8bdcc6245300c6227a2a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3810">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d884d815f4aabbbf02cdb926c5f9129a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;d be safe to ask them.&quot;
&quot;Very safe, as they&apos;re both dentists,&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d884d815f4aabbbf02cdb926c5f9129a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3811">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8dd282d27e0ebcad035da5c5603af723</data>
      <data key="v_content">Once the holidays had started, Ron and Harry were having too good a time
to think much about Flamel.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8dd282d27e0ebcad035da5c5603af723</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3812">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b9e9aeffb0bc383b09c66ae9fe1efdb9</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had the dormitory to themselves and the
common room was far emptier than usual, so they were able to get the
good armchairs by the fire.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b9e9aeffb0bc383b09c66ae9fe1efdb9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3813">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a49680ab845d14acf0d4d68b32081df4</data>
      <data key="v_content">They sat by the hour eating anything they
could spear on a toasting fork -- bread, English muffins, marshmallows
-- and plotting ways of getting Malfoy expelled, which were fun to talk
159
about even if they wouldn&apos;t work.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a49680ab845d14acf0d4d68b32081df4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3814">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-222a15a20eae4d41d12fdb2e60d854f3</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron also started teaching Harry wizard chess.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-222a15a20eae4d41d12fdb2e60d854f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3815">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-272f2399b9f399411d28468b184925de</data>
      <data key="v_content">This was exactly like
Muggle chess except that the figures were alive, which made it a lot
like directing troops in battle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-272f2399b9f399411d28468b184925de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3816">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-832ca2c543aabc8cd78540110affc7e9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron&apos;s set was very old and battered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-832ca2c543aabc8cd78540110affc7e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3817">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-346c732e5afd6988ae6ee0d1792a33a1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Like everything else he owned, it had once belonged to someone else in
his family -- in this case, his grandfather.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-346c732e5afd6988ae6ee0d1792a33a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3818">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0004c0b6d3b57bac26bf370c8beccb31</data>
      <data key="v_content">oldchessmenweren&apos;t,However, old chessmen
weren&apos;t a drawback at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0004c0b6d3b57bac26bf370c8beccb31</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3819">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-739c21a5bc649e8d5e7c4e8bb8ee49e5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron knew them so well he never had trouble
getting them to do what he wanted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-739c21a5bc649e8d5e7c4e8bb8ee49e5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3820">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-27f310ed83a2ef2ab2eaac21d2589a6f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry played with chessmen Seamus Finnigan had lent him, and they didn&apos;t
trust him at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-27f310ed83a2ef2ab2eaac21d2589a6f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3821">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-44bd98c4375c8bd90f3df09bc9ef754e</data>
      <data key="v_content">He wasn&apos;t a very good player yet and they kept
shouting different bits of advice at him, which was confusing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-44bd98c4375c8bd90f3df09bc9ef754e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3822">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e4632fd715ddff941c1139fdc7a7ab71</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Don&apos;t
send me there, can&apos;t you see his knight? Send him, we can afford to lose
him.&quot; On Christmas Eve, Harry went to bed looking forward to the next
day for the food and the fun, but not expecting any presents at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e4632fd715ddff941c1139fdc7a7ab71</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3823">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-840f5c373756cfa6f43e3a91ca0efa32</data>
      <data key="v_content">When he woke early in the morning, however, the first thing he saw was a
small pile of packages at the foot of his bed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-840f5c373756cfa6f43e3a91ca0efa32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3824">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ecfa5c72448d518d62f3444ae142c73d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidRon,&quot;Merry Christmas,&quot; said Ron sleepily as Harry scrambled out of bed and
pulled on his bathrobe.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ecfa5c72448d518d62f3444ae142c73d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3825">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ad591cc0efec449f1b22117498d722a6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Will you look at this? I&apos;ve got some presents!&quot;
&quot;What did you expect, turnips?&quot; said Ron, turning to his own pile, which
was a lot bigger than Harry&apos;s.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ad591cc0efec449f1b22117498d722a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3826">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6204274acdff89603bdfb7b80e042945</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry picked up the top parcel.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6204274acdff89603bdfb7b80e042945</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3827">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d4eaf252112a1bb8edbf86010bf9ff0a</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was wrapped in thick brown paper and
scrawled across it was To Harry, from Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d4eaf252112a1bb8edbf86010bf9ff0a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3828">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e9027ce88115d3b4b7adce7e73005d2c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Inside was a roughly cut
wooden flute.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e9027ce88115d3b4b7adce7e73005d2c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3829">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a130b7f63d62988739b0c52701718b88</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid had obviously whittled it himself.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a130b7f63d62988739b0c52701718b88</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3830">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-78cf00ac3446c5b09386d00fd421fdba</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry blew it --
it sounded a bit like an owl.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-78cf00ac3446c5b09386d00fd421fdba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3831">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4c244a69bba633c11d1d54d76b1968cf</data>
      <data key="v_content">verysmall,A second, very small parcel contained a note.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4c244a69bba633c11d1d54d76b1968cf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3832">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f2440b28569338ffe77c6455b6866cf</data>
      <data key="v_content">We received your message and enclose your Christmas present.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f2440b28569338ffe77c6455b6866cf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3833">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a2bf7a5ff2abc97f2ecf72e17196d318</data>
      <data key="v_content">From Uncle
Vernon and Aunt Petunia.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a2bf7a5ff2abc97f2ecf72e17196d318</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3834">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6723669d33d01c86bb4a0b7f86fff66a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Taped to the note was a fifty-pence piece.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6723669d33d01c86bb4a0b7f86fff66a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3835">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ddd3cb5e4c448cd2cc1409a5c290612b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron was fascinated by the fifty pence.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ddd3cb5e4c448cd2cc1409a5c290612b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3836">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-072b7ed226da84a1ebe61f236022a065</data>
      <data key="v_content">&apos;NMat,&quot;Weird!&quot; he said, &apos;NMat a shape! This is money?&quot;
160
&quot;You can keep it,&quot; said Harry, laughing at how pleased Ron was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-072b7ed226da84a1ebe61f236022a065</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3837">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7c132af4dd3143a735da8201e57de391</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Hagrid
and my aunt and uncle -- so who sent these?&quot;
&quot;I think I know who that one&apos;s from,&quot; said Ron, turning a bit pink and
pointing to a very lumpy parcel.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7c132af4dd3143a735da8201e57de391</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3838">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-22a4a49c84ac3a8f3f93b7bda18b632d</data>
      <data key="v_content">I told her you didn&apos;t expect
any presents and -- oh, no,&quot; he groaned, &quot;she&apos;s made you a Weasley
sweater.&quot;
Harry had torn open the parcel to find a thick, hand-knitted sweater in
emerald green and a large box of homemade fudge.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-22a4a49c84ac3a8f3f93b7bda18b632d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3839">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e2e1ecafb5e7e89065206827db302a71</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Every year she makes us a sweater,&quot; said Ron, unwrapping his own, &quot;and
mine&apos;s always maroon.&quot;
&quot;That&apos;s really nice of her,&quot; said Harry, trying the fudge, which was
very tasty.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e2e1ecafb5e7e89065206827db302a71</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3840">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6044153f0bc34a2e2c07968d73ebc485</data>
      <data key="v_content">His next present also contained candy -- a large box of Chocolate Frogs
from Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6044153f0bc34a2e2c07968d73ebc485</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3841">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1025147f628f3ebf6c99b4f7602ec298</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry picked it up and felt it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1025147f628f3ebf6c99b4f7602ec298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3842">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0054b94489eddcfde1c7901d4f22c0b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Something fluid and silvery gray went slithering to the floor where it
lay in gleaming folds.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0054b94489eddcfde1c7901d4f22c0b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3843">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-08b20bb5162795b7d129fc33b6b96e7a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;I&apos;ve heard of those,&quot; he said in a hushed voice, dropping the box of
Every Flavor Beans he&apos;d gotten from Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-08b20bb5162795b7d129fc33b6b96e7a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3844">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-257c9f43cba2fcde579029655912a159</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;If that&apos;s what I think it
is -- they&apos;re really rare, and really valuable.&quot;
&quot;What is it?&quot;
Harry picked the shining, silvery cloth off the floor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-257c9f43cba2fcde579029655912a159</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3845">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-06c0750804e0567c06600c9a05f613c2</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was strange to
the touch, like water woven into material.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-06c0750804e0567c06600c9a05f613c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3846">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0599c0b29842c48682a1300cc87c48de</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;It&apos;s an invisibility cloak,&quot; said Ron, a look of awe on his face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0599c0b29842c48682a1300cc87c48de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3847">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e6149fdef80c27d8ea2a05e82aa68a75</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;m
sure it is -- try it on.&quot;
Harry threw the cloak around his shoulders and Ron gave a yell.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e6149fdef80c27d8ea2a05e82aa68a75</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3848">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b1328f39f1a1ade70fdc84fd6b9c70ad</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It is! Look down!&quot;
Harry looked down at his feet, but they were gone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b1328f39f1a1ade70fdc84fd6b9c70ad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3849">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa3a8066371112170bbe246c56c8fc12</data>
      <data key="v_content">He dashed to the
161
mirror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa3a8066371112170bbe246c56c8fc12</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3850">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-93976e958e9ce68fd4d81312f10de42a</data>
      <data key="v_content">hisreflection,Sure enough, his reflection looked back at him, just his head
suspended in midair, his body completely invisible.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-93976e958e9ce68fd4d81312f10de42a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3851">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b0c53baf0e0cbd90841cd086988a9039</data>
      <data key="v_content">He pulled the cloak
over his head and his reflection vanished completely.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b0c53baf0e0cbd90841cd086988a9039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3852">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3a951c8a58ae3ff186f756685a078fde</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;There&apos;s a note!&quot; said Ron suddenly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3a951c8a58ae3ff186f756685a078fde</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3853">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c9bfa1b5cd554bd57bcabf8eedae8a1f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;A note fell out of it!&quot;
Harry pulled off the cloak and seized the letter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c9bfa1b5cd554bd57bcabf8eedae8a1f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3854">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1322b7a4ff94d7abf4854e464aaa6dae</data>
      <data key="v_content">loopy,Written in narrow,
loopy writing he had never seen before were the following words: Your
father left this in my possession before he died.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1322b7a4ff94d7abf4854e464aaa6dae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3855">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b489973af7f639f3796cd16db0524b31</data>
      <data key="v_content">It is time it was
returned to you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b489973af7f639f3796cd16db0524b31</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3856">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1ef1d0451f75b5b70e49e563bd509f81</data>
      <data key="v_content">A Very Merry Christmas to you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1ef1d0451f75b5b70e49e563bd509f81</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3857">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c38aeda7c15facf02ad2cfa274e58baa</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;d give anything for one of these,&quot; he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c38aeda7c15facf02ad2cfa274e58baa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3858">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b3b2d76e6dd8455fb72faab3cb310407</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,What&apos;s the
matter?&quot;
&quot;Nothing,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b3b2d76e6dd8455fb72faab3cb310407</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3859">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6d16b20bc357b45e1cd01c10ec2025ed</data>
      <data key="v_content">Who had sent the cloak? Had
it really once belonged to his father?
Before he could say or think anything else, the dormitory door was flung
open and Fred and George Weasley bounded in.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6d16b20bc357b45e1cd01c10ec2025ed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3860">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e011296f77965c5c1129f3ecfb0a21ff</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry stuffed the cloak
quickly out of sight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e011296f77965c5c1129f3ecfb0a21ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3861">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bf46604057ad68b1f8bfc8332eebbc36</data>
      <data key="v_content">He didn&apos;t feel like sharing it with anyone else
yet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bf46604057ad68b1f8bfc8332eebbc36</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3862">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-08362ede8f49bee803f122887595fe18</data>
      <data key="v_content">look,&quot;Merry Christmas!&quot;
&quot;Hey, look -- Harry&apos;s got a Weasley sweater, too!&quot;
Fred and George were wearing blue sweaters, one with a large yellow F on
it, the other a G.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-08362ede8f49bee803f122887595fe18</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3863">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3982422a94b06aea8d1b623b71ca1f3a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Harry&apos;s is better than ours, though,&quot; said Fred, holding up Harry&apos;s
sweater.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3982422a94b06aea8d1b623b71ca1f3a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3864">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-67330170802f4f4c857406b13fcfd956</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;She obviously makes more of an effort if you&apos;re not family.&quot;
&quot;Why aren&apos;t you wearing yours, Ron?&quot; George demanded.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-67330170802f4f4c857406b13fcfd956</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3865">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-24a2a96ed159185177efc3c7c076758e</data>
      <data key="v_content">getit,&quot;Come on, get it
on, they&apos;re lovely and warm.&quot;
&quot;I hate maroon,&quot; Ron moaned halfheartedly as he pulled it over his head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-24a2a96ed159185177efc3c7c076758e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3866">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0abe9bfc7ac0654ebe52f013c1ff2161</data>
      <data key="v_content">162
&quot;You haven&apos;t got a letter on yours,&quot; George observed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0abe9bfc7ac0654ebe52f013c1ff2161</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3867">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2e54cf965a5543483383c8b8b982e307</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I suppose she
thinks you don&apos;t forget your name.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2e54cf965a5543483383c8b8b982e307</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3868">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5eb4a2c567d9ec580d619aba5b8a4883</data>
      <data key="v_content">But we&apos;re not stupid -- we know we&apos;re
called Gred and Forge.&quot;
&quot;What&apos;s all th is noise.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5eb4a2c567d9ec580d619aba5b8a4883</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3869">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9b726db2ff923c9be41ac22b407827cb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Percy Weasley stuck his head through the door, looking disapproving.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9b726db2ff923c9be41ac22b407827cb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3870">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5056a6bb660baf5ca37999764bab213d</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
had clearly gotten halfway through unwrapping his presents as he, too,
carried a lumpy sweater over his arm, which
Fred seized.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5056a6bb660baf5ca37999764bab213d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3871">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b6a6019f1aa955a4549e662a0610b3f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;P for prefect! Get it on, Percy, come on, we&apos;re all wearing ours, even
Harry got one.&quot;
&quot;I -- don&apos;t -- want said Percy thickly, as the twins forced the sweater
over his head, knocking his glasses askew.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b6a6019f1aa955a4549e662a0610b3f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3872">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-71e8fe6abdf3a428586170591e2f678b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And you&apos;re not sitting with the prefects today, either,&quot; said
George.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-71e8fe6abdf3a428586170591e2f678b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3873">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0bfc9547531ab512519d44d58832bc99</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Christmas is a time for family.&quot;
They frog-marched Percy from the room, his arms pinned to his side by
his sweater.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0bfc9547531ab512519d44d58832bc99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3874">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-536d0d759fcf598a34e6948926a68091</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had never in all his life had such a Christmas dinner.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-536d0d759fcf598a34e6948926a68091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3875">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c5e977290b9d594e5a17814036285e98</data>
      <data key="v_content">roast,A hundred
fat, roast turkeys; mountains of roast and boiled potatoes; platters of
chipolatas; tureens of buttered peas, silver boats of thick, rich gravy
and cranberry sauce -- and stacks of wizard crackers every few feet
along the table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c5e977290b9d594e5a17814036285e98</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3876">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2c31546b7939a3a10d27185bdce3a506</data>
      <data key="v_content">These fantastic party favors were nothing like the
feeble Muggle ones the Dursleys usually bought, with their little
plastic toys and their flimsy paper hats inside.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2c31546b7939a3a10d27185bdce3a506</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3877">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f1cdd0bd099ce5176eb60ed1087b256f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry pulled a wizard
cracker with Fred and it didn&apos;t just bang, it went off with a blast like
a cannon and engulfed them all in a cloud of blue smoke, while from the
inside exploded a rear admiral&apos;s hat and several live, white mice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f1cdd0bd099ce5176eb60ed1087b256f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3878">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c71eb332d14363ef70e3ec0281587a32</data>
      <data key="v_content">Up at
the High Table, Dumbledore had swapped his pointed wizard&apos;s hat for a
flowered bonnet, and was chuckling merrily at a joke Professor Flitwick
had just read him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c71eb332d14363ef70e3ec0281587a32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3879">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4200ebf19769fad87785bf9ba6638d0d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Flaming Christmas puddings followed the turkey.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4200ebf19769fad87785bf9ba6638d0d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3880">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c817c38c05b146139be86bbc4aa8ded4</data>
      <data key="v_content">Percy nearly broke his
teeth on a silver sickle embedded in his slice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c817c38c05b146139be86bbc4aa8ded4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3881">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-49d2c5fdb78d2e6c399046ecd85f0550</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry watched Hagrid
getting redder and redder in the face as he called for more wine,
finally kissing Professor McGonagall on the cheek, who, to Harry&apos;s
163
amazement, giggled and blushed, her top hat lopsided.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-49d2c5fdb78d2e6c399046ecd85f0550</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3882">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-88c7dd882b5bba4908ee78ddff8e3f03</data>
      <data key="v_content">When Harry finally left the table, he was laden down with a stack of
things out of the crackers, including a pack of nonexplodable, luminous
balloons, a Grow-Your-Own-Warts kit, and his own new wizard chess set.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-88c7dd882b5bba4908ee78ddff8e3f03</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3883">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-447d27af7b0a3e1f5789b05c5811ba87</data>
      <data key="v_content">The white mice had disappeared and Harry had a nasty feeling they were
going to end up as Mrs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-447d27af7b0a3e1f5789b05c5811ba87</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3884">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-133c719f55423930dd753260cf87f958</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and the Weasleys spent a happy afternoon having a furious snowball
fight on the grounds.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-133c719f55423930dd753260cf87f958</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3885">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e4ded44b05d90f3e9bc692f652e28481</data>
      <data key="v_content">cold,wet,and,Then, cold, wet, and gasping for breath, they
returned to the fire in the Gryffindor common room, where Harry broke in
his new chess set by losing spectacularly to Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e4ded44b05d90f3e9bc692f652e28481</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3886">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eea1405270de125a37f47b58072cf71c</data>
      <data key="v_content">He suspected he
wouldn&apos;t have lost so badly if Percy hadn&apos;t tried to help him so much.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eea1405270de125a37f47b58072cf71c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3887">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4ab95b70c7ac2b04046159c283990017</data>
      <data key="v_content">After a meal of turkey sandwiches, crumpets, trifle, and Christmas cake,
everyone felt too full and sleepy to do much before bed except sit and
watch Percy chase Fred and George all over Gryffindor tower because
they&apos;d stolen his prefect badge.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4ab95b70c7ac2b04046159c283990017</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3888">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-55bcdb7588edf0aaac99759d04eb92ad</data>
      <data key="v_content">It had been Harry&apos;s best Christmas day ever.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-55bcdb7588edf0aaac99759d04eb92ad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3889">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7a3addc7f83e67d5fbc495a2fea19bcc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Yet something had been
nagging at the back of his mind all day.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7a3addc7f83e67d5fbc495a2fea19bcc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3890">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-05b605b95e850ce55d86253875a08bba</data>
      <data key="v_content">Not until he climbed into bed
was he free to think about it: the invisibility cloak and whoever had
sent it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-05b605b95e850ce55d86253875a08bba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3891">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-60964c75cd23dd1d7de7afaa7bff85d1</data>
      <data key="v_content">fullofturkey,Ron, full of turkey and cake and with nothing mysterious to bother him,
fell asleep almost as soon as he&apos;d drawn the curtains of his
four-poster.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-60964c75cd23dd1d7de7afaa7bff85d1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3892">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4e4d9e5e0423605c8034eb9b718f12e2</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry leaned over the side of his own bed and pulled the
cloak out from under it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4e4d9e5e0423605c8034eb9b718f12e2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3893">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-55dbcb24f831044be1ebc1705b29cd52</data>
      <data key="v_content">He let the material flow
over his hands, smoother than silk, light as air.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-55dbcb24f831044be1ebc1705b29cd52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3894">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-424ce59191a88d5d76224dc269a0bf49</data>
      <data key="v_content">the,Use it well, the note
had said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-424ce59191a88d5d76224dc269a0bf49</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3895">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3cccfb0fbbe72c628b96216faf323085</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had to try it, now.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3cccfb0fbbe72c628b96216faf323085</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3896">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ad5c3223364cc84087a03c36eb24f182</data>
      <data key="v_content">He slipped out of bed and wrapped the cloak
around himself.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ad5c3223364cc84087a03c36eb24f182</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3897">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6784a906ff938e580cd9fc5de9ce66ff</data>
      <data key="v_content">Looking down at his legs, he saw only moonlight and
shadows.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6784a906ff938e580cd9fc5de9ce66ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3898">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-42971a2475c3ec1984f2411ac6366f58</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was a very funny feeling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-42971a2475c3ec1984f2411ac6366f58</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3899">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-05fedb77ca284def7a63291b5d73d5a2</data>
      <data key="v_content">The whole of Hogwarts was open to him
in this cloak.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-05fedb77ca284def7a63291b5d73d5a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3900">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d8ec1aa364bd461e56b03acbdf63fe61</data>
      <data key="v_content">Excitement flooded through him as he stood there in the
dark and silence.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d8ec1aa364bd461e56b03acbdf63fe61</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3901">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6243ca94582c2c2c19dd907db7546512</data>
      <data key="v_content">He could go anywhere in this, anywhere, and Filch
would never know.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6243ca94582c2c2c19dd907db7546512</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3902">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a255953768a7fef9378a48f31e2dfe0f</data>
      <data key="v_content">164
Ron grunted in his sleep.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a255953768a7fef9378a48f31e2dfe0f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3903">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7cdb9a9ceb313b458a1f0b35fbedd852</data>
      <data key="v_content">Should Harry wake him? Something held him back
-- his father&apos;s cloak -- he felt that this time -- the first time -- he
wanted to use it alone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7cdb9a9ceb313b458a1f0b35fbedd852</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3904">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-34dfc423bb3914b9485436a9331320b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">He crept out of the dormitory, down the stairs, across the common room,
and climbed through the portrait hole.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-34dfc423bb3914b9485436a9331320b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3905">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fc208f783c63357123905478ad5db8f0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Who&apos;s there?&quot; squawked the Fat Lady.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fc208f783c63357123905478ad5db8f0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3906">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0466912d56f5894c2da33f107f08ece5</data>
      <data key="v_content">He walked
quickly down the corridor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0466912d56f5894c2da33f107f08ece5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3907">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9ae8209521a5cc81d77ef14802339a6f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Where should he go? He stopped, his heart racing, and thought.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9ae8209521a5cc81d77ef14802339a6f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3908">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b7d21d8a1fa99d680f5ddeec72c684c2</data>
      <data key="v_content">And then
it came to him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b7d21d8a1fa99d680f5ddeec72c684c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3909">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4b05500850ec31628cc3392d6baec31e</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Restricted Section in the library.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4b05500850ec31628cc3392d6baec31e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3910">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-21bb19b3a95e090268d78fbdf29b2c1f</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;d be able to
read as long as he liked, as long as it took to find out who Flamel was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-21bb19b3a95e090268d78fbdf29b2c1f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3911">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b4d8349781c85a8a6b06dd248e7c81e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">drawing,He set off, drawing the invisibility cloak tight around him as he
walked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b4d8349781c85a8a6b06dd248e7c81e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3912">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5a412e505e69e1efd53c60385d9cf2b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">The library was pitch-black and very eerie.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5a412e505e69e1efd53c60385d9cf2b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3913">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-86f368d5d268352d61c15f2c41c036e1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry lit a lamp to see his
way along the rows of books.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-86f368d5d268352d61c15f2c41c036e1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3914">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1e1d55ef48c281735a91aad09ae56a65</data>
      <data key="v_content">The lamp looked as if it was floating along
in midair, and even though Harry could feel his arm supporting it, the
sight gave him the creeps.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1e1d55ef48c281735a91aad09ae56a65</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3915">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5dd297a895f27b959d70e2b277dd6f79</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Restricted Section was right at the back of the library.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5dd297a895f27b959d70e2b277dd6f79</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3916">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-60e63e30cca2443650849c7e7ed41cd3</data>
      <data key="v_content">Step ping
carefully over the rope that separated these books from the rest of the
library, he held up his lamp to read the titles.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-60e63e30cca2443650849c7e7ed41cd3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3917">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9ad30bc5c8ca963bed2f7682a67db936</data>
      <data key="v_content">fadedgold,Their peeling, faded gold letters spelled
words in languages Harry couldn&apos;t understand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9ad30bc5c8ca963bed2f7682a67db936</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3918">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f7c8947fc34f34a62feaf2c5dcd7624e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Some had no title at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f7c8947fc34f34a62feaf2c5dcd7624e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3919">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6ea964d0f77c39e9bc0b9cdd84f6f669</data>
      <data key="v_content">One book had a dark stain on it that looked horribly like blood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6ea964d0f77c39e9bc0b9cdd84f6f669</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3920">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7a6a1e9c11439e635b8510ae6ad3c4b7</data>
      <data key="v_content">The
hairs on the back of Harry&apos;s neck prickled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7a6a1e9c11439e635b8510ae6ad3c4b7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3921">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fc81aed621209e80440998c2f43ed94b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Maybe he was imagining it,
maybe not, but he thought a faint whispering was coming from the books,
as though they knew someone was there who shouldn&apos;t be.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fc81aed621209e80440998c2f43ed94b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3922">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-52c4d580fe795111c984e2334d514a2b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Setting the lamp down carefully on the floor,
he looked along the bottom shelf for an interestinglooking book.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-52c4d580fe795111c984e2334d514a2b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3923">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-889919023b9b01cd7f94e8ca613a16ef</data>
      <data key="v_content">A large
black and silver volume caught his eye.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-889919023b9b01cd7f94e8ca613a16ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3924">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9254790e858de9519a5c32aa43ffa956</data>
      <data key="v_content">He pulled it out with
difficulty, because it was very heavy, and, balancing it on his knee,
let it fall open.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9254790e858de9519a5c32aa43ffa956</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3925">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2147ec4f040ce83e56e52bb476d75405</data>
      <data key="v_content">bloodcurdlingshriek,A piercing, bloodcurdling shriek split the silence -- the book was
screaming! Harry snapped it shut, but the shriek went on and on, one
high, unbroken, earsplitting note.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2147ec4f040ce83e56e52bb476d75405</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3926">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f4c77799a8a96af847df75f80f819997</data>
      <data key="v_content">He stumbled backward and knocked over
his lamp, which went out at once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f4c77799a8a96af847df75f80f819997</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3927">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ebd07a0d86e8479df3d0caae91a492d0</data>
      <data key="v_content">heheardfootsteps,Panicking, he heard footsteps coming
165
down the corridor outside -- stuffing the shrieking book back on the
shelf, he ran for it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ebd07a0d86e8479df3d0caae91a492d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3928">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2fa9419f1ed0c13b3979ec39b991c061</data>
      <data key="v_content">He passed Filch in the doorway; Filch&apos;s pale, wild
eyes looked straight through him, and Harry slipped under Filch&apos;s
outstretched arm and streaked off up the corridor, the book&apos;s shrieks
still ringing in his ears.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2fa9419f1ed0c13b3979ec39b991c061</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3929">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7624f9f79584c7e790918b0a66900c99</data>
      <data key="v_content">He came to a sudden halt in front of a tall suit of armor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7624f9f79584c7e790918b0a66900c99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3930">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2f9de21a16eede5f81f1bd27b0edcff0</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had been
so busy getting away from the library, he hadn&apos;t paid attention to where
he was going.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2f9de21a16eede5f81f1bd27b0edcff0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3931">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eeb93701cf1a2da0f12ddb5eed39e90a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Perhaps because it was dark, he didn&apos;t recognize where he
was at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eeb93701cf1a2da0f12ddb5eed39e90a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3932">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4e3f3de3217a85ea86cd34f7b50e7dbe</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was a suit of armor near the kitchens, he knew, but he
must be five floors above there.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4e3f3de3217a85ea86cd34f7b50e7dbe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3933">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-23bca600e61e0f617b9d6b66adbc73fc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You asked me to come directly to you, Professor, if anyone was
wandering around at night, and somebody&apos;s been in the library Restricted
Section.&quot;
Harry felt the blood drain out of his face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-23bca600e61e0f617b9d6b66adbc73fc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3934">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4235cd6aeceb4dddb0e5bdb08e441f4a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Filch,Wherever he was, Filch must
know a shortcut, because his soft, greasy voice was getting nearer, and
to his horror, it was Snape who replied, &quot;The Restricted Section? Well,
they can&apos;t be far, we&apos;ll catch them.&quot;
Harry stood rooted to the spot as Filch and Snape came around the corner
ahead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4235cd6aeceb4dddb0e5bdb08e441f4a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3935">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f21a252e78c01f2fb045437de4370dd</data>
      <data key="v_content">,They couldn&apos;t see him, of course, but it was a narrow corridor
and if they came much nearer they&apos;d knock right into him -- the cloak
didn&apos;t stop him from being solid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f21a252e78c01f2fb045437de4370dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3936">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fcdc39157557e0aa289fb61fdd76f453</data>
      <data key="v_content">He backed away as quietly as he could.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fcdc39157557e0aa289fb61fdd76f453</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3937">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4d6c4f9f485aba0fb591daa6a52eae6c</data>
      <data key="v_content">A door stood ajar to his left.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4d6c4f9f485aba0fb591daa6a52eae6c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3938">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cded9f0da9bc8c1ca58c2e4caf2d2270</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He squeezed through it, holding his breath, trying
not to move it, and to his relief he managed to get inside the room
without their noticing anything.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cded9f0da9bc8c1ca58c2e4caf2d2270</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3939">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9b0c84fda9cb377d7d7a130f8e8dc63f</data>
      <data key="v_content">,They walked straight past, and Harry
leaned against the wall, breathing deeply, listening to their footsteps
dying away.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9b0c84fda9cb377d7d7a130f8e8dc63f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3940">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3c1b42042bc43bad3c9538c784550ea8</data>
      <data key="v_content">,That had been close, very close.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3c1b42042bc43bad3c9538c784550ea8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3941">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-006e1f8ff1e776cec5494a7045f72683</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was a few seconds before
he noticed anything about the room he had hidden in.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-006e1f8ff1e776cec5494a7045f72683</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3942">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e4b16de8f70418ecb765d3e1a9830eaa</data>
      <data key="v_content">It looked like an unused classroom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e4b16de8f70418ecb765d3e1a9830eaa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3943">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-52fa4c276622b2c4b8537dcbc2bb8672</data>
      <data key="v_content">The dark shapes of desks and chairs
were piled against the walls, and there was an upturned wastepaper
basket -- but propped against the wall facing him was something that
didn&apos;t look as if it belonged there, something that looked as if someone
had just put it there to keep it out of the way.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-52fa4c276622b2c4b8537dcbc2bb8672</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3944">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e45f56596e98a00000282b1f917d016c</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was a magnificent mirror, as high as the ceiling, with an ornate gold
frame, standing on two clawed feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e45f56596e98a00000282b1f917d016c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3945">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6b867659bb61e87166de018334a961d3</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was an inscription carved
around the top: Erised stra ehru oyt ube cafru oyt on wohsi.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6b867659bb61e87166de018334a961d3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3946">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a20f85446b02c5e3cedd5d5c77b49356</data>
      <data key="v_content">His panic
166
fading now that there was no sound of Filch and Snape, Harry moved
nearer to the mirror, wanting to look at himself but see no reflection
again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a20f85446b02c5e3cedd5d5c77b49356</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3947">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9608759c461497c7fe41b3c6605184a8</data>
      <data key="v_content">He stepped in front of it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9608759c461497c7fe41b3c6605184a8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3948">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b3ed5849b72670a8053f77034df25269</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had to clap his hands to his mouth to stop himself from screaming.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b3ed5849b72670a8053f77034df25269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3949">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fab93702b26028e8cfca888ceb1021df</data>
      <data key="v_content">His heart was pounding far more furiously than when the
book had screamed -- for he had seen not only himself in the mirror, but
a whole crowd of people standing right behind him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fab93702b26028e8cfca888ceb1021df</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3950">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-93d1fcb4b0a0d8437552c990dc455824</data>
      <data key="v_content">he,Breathing very fast, he turned slowly back to
the mirror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-93d1fcb4b0a0d8437552c990dc455824</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3951">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c47c0b397cbd65f5bc376a9d5d00d307</data>
      <data key="v_content">reflected,There he was, reflected in it, white and scared-looking, and there,
reflected behind him, were at least ten others.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c47c0b397cbd65f5bc376a9d5d00d307</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3952">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca490b00feb814f1ac265f30acf7f60f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry looked over his
shoulder -- but still, no one was there.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca490b00feb814f1ac265f30acf7f60f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3953">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-84229ed1977dfd8af472a7b5366c713c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Or were they all invisible,
too? Was he in fact in a room full of invisible people and this mirror&apos;s
trick was that it reflected them, invisible or not?
He looked in the mirror again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-84229ed1977dfd8af472a7b5366c713c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3954">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-416b54028edcbb29a3947440ae4e00ef</data>
      <data key="v_content">A woman standing right behind his
reflection was smiling at him and waving.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-416b54028edcbb29a3947440ae4e00ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3955">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-228816f856ac74e94253c5f0b222c9b2</data>
      <data key="v_content">He reached out a hand and felt
the air behind him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-228816f856ac74e94253c5f0b222c9b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3956">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bba45018a8ce9ab79099b0c786cde6d7</data>
      <data key="v_content">If she was really there, he&apos;d touch her, their
reflections were so close together, but he felt only air -- she and the
others existed only in the mirror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bba45018a8ce9ab79099b0c786cde6d7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3957">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f19d95106d99e3c13c84475edf1bf65c</data>
      <data key="v_content">She was a very pretty woman.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f19d95106d99e3c13c84475edf1bf65c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3958">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3b25643dadc3439ed17f310fe90f2af4</data>
      <data key="v_content">She had dark red hair and her eyes -- her
eyes are just like mine, Harry thought, edging a little closer to the
glass.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3b25643dadc3439ed17f310fe90f2af4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3959">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ef1f8d73b81b6ea66621b1aecec9cc32</data>
      <data key="v_content">Bright green -- exactly the same shape, but then he noticed that
she was crying; smiling, but crying at the same time.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ef1f8d73b81b6ea66621b1aecec9cc32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3960">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1de92746270c9de7f4a2ffde2940a073</data>
      <data key="v_content">thin,black-haired,The tall, thin,
black-haired man standing next to her put his arm around her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1de92746270c9de7f4a2ffde2940a073</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3961">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fc5fdfc91906528ff155e2f52e7c42ac</data>
      <data key="v_content">and,He wore
glasses, and his hair was very untidy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fc5fdfc91906528ff155e2f52e7c42ac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3962">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e1eb8083e3c708d100a0df1e01949874</data>
      <data key="v_content">It stuck up at the back, just as
Harry&apos;s did.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e1eb8083e3c708d100a0df1e01949874</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3963">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a839a6e956d9d3a4aae873fc680f809</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry was so close to the mirror now that his nose was nearly touching
that of his reflection.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a839a6e956d9d3a4aae873fc680f809</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3964">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d95fea798770779b09b27a58fad617bb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Dad?&quot;
They just looked at him, smiling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d95fea798770779b09b27a58fad617bb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3965">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1f68030ebb51b33acdd3957ea1cec3bf</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harrylooked,And slowly, Harry looked into the
faces of the other people in the mirror, and saw other pairs of green
eyes like his, other noses like his, even a little old man who looked as
though he had Harry&apos;s knobbly knees -- Harry was looking at his family,
for the first time in his life.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1f68030ebb51b33acdd3957ea1cec3bf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3966">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e0d399889f4d0529610f5028e9010e19</data>
      <data key="v_content">167
The Potters smiled and waved at Harry and he stared hungrily back at
them, his hands pressed flat against the glass as though he was hoping
to fall right through it and reach them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e0d399889f4d0529610f5028e9010e19</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3967">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7e1517abad55a5354fe74792a7d7fbc3</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had a powerful kind of ache
inside him, half joy, half terrible sadness.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7e1517abad55a5354fe74792a7d7fbc3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3968">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-376f66d727ffd502231e34631ed55fa9</data>
      <data key="v_content">How long he stood there, he didn&apos;t know.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-376f66d727ffd502231e34631ed55fa9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3969">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e1e841b6aca86dfc2008fd5736d6d92d</data>
      <data key="v_content">The reflections did not fade
and he looked and looked until a distant noise brought him back to his
senses.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e1e841b6aca86dfc2008fd5736d6d92d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3970">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-897fc13f256a2b1595bcaf574a5c565a</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He couldn&apos;t stay here, he had to find his way back to bed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-897fc13f256a2b1595bcaf574a5c565a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3971">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-74b92acb84de343f4ab8dc09a4dcc52f</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
tore his eyes away from his mother&apos;s face, whispered, &quot;I&apos;ll come back,&quot;
and hurried from the room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-74b92acb84de343f4ab8dc09a4dcc52f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3972">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bc5972ec53aeb76ba9ebd507ad81e7a1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You could have woken me up,&quot; said Ron, crossly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bc5972ec53aeb76ba9ebd507ad81e7a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3973">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-95bc249d35e99fbb805b6f830ec36779</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;You can come tonight, I&apos;m going back, I want to show you the mirror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-95bc249d35e99fbb805b6f830ec36779</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3974">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-32d8d36e6b4b6017fc95ad97f172efc0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;d like to see your mom and dad,&quot; Ron said eagerly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-32d8d36e6b4b6017fc95ad97f172efc0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3975">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2302c71ffae15cea384597e640e64f95</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And I want to see all your family, all the Weasleys, you&apos;ll be able to
show me your other brothers and everyone.&quot;
&quot;You can see them any old time,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2302c71ffae15cea384597e640e64f95</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3976">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-455cc0ab0176ff203059f29eacd29838</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Just come round my house
this summer.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-455cc0ab0176ff203059f29eacd29838</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3977">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8b964a4fec293548f8c01f461ef47973</data>
      <data key="v_content">maybeitonly,Anyway, maybe it only shows dead people.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8b964a4fec293548f8c01f461ef47973</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3978">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0639a1d2a2909ab63e2b84ba89cb1223</data>
      <data key="v_content">Shame about not
finding Flamel, though.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0639a1d2a2909ab63e2b84ba89cb1223</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3979">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-22d2f6edb6531f90d9437a01089920a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Have some bacon or something, why aren&apos;t you
eating anything?&quot;
Harry couldn&apos;t eat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-22d2f6edb6531f90d9437a01089920a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3980">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e7916321c0a7766e61f2bf0943dc1f17</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had seen his parents and would be seeing them
again tonight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e7916321c0a7766e61f2bf0943dc1f17</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3981">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6d327e595f439e54d177087912c9b54a</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had almost forgotten about Flamel.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6d327e595f439e54d177087912c9b54a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3982">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-361dbc8a99d0527013898d15ccc7f345</data>
      <data key="v_content">It didn&apos;t seem very
important anymore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-361dbc8a99d0527013898d15ccc7f345</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3983">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bd424dab867e27e22491efb706b8c6d6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Who cared what the three headed dog was guarding?
What did it matter if Snape stole it, really?
&quot;Are you all right?&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bd424dab867e27e22491efb706b8c6d6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3984">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-261ba3ee0e48e774571f4c72a14cc787</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You look odd.&quot;
What Harry feared most was that he might not be able to find the mirror
room again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-261ba3ee0e48e774571f4c72a14cc787</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3985">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6e863f4406ac2f0d3bb9651c30b91d24</data>
      <data key="v_content">With Ron covered in the cloak, too, they had to walk much
more slowly the next night.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6e863f4406ac2f0d3bb9651c30b91d24</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3986">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-09cda0f3bfdf30e3ae18c36b73fff8dd</data>
      <data key="v_content">They tried retracing Harry&apos;s route from the
library, wandering around the dark passageways for nearly an hour.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-09cda0f3bfdf30e3ae18c36b73fff8dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3987">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3c3ba0167d5556c4a4dcd75c55fdd3ea</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Let&apos;s forget it and go back.&quot;
&quot;No!&quot; Harry hissed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3c3ba0167d5556c4a4dcd75c55fdd3ea</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3988">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b89c37a8e23a888422dd09e11896a593</data>
      <data key="v_content">I know it&apos;s here somewhere.&quot;
They passed the ghost of a tall witch gliding in the opposite direction,
but saw no one else.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b89c37a8e23a888422dd09e11896a593</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3989">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-42a55cacdf09412566ed07414acb79df</data>
      <data key="v_content">just as Ron started moaning that his feet were dead
168
with cold, Harry spotted the suit of armor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-42a55cacdf09412566ed07414acb79df</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3990">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e20c05de99d036a56ac95309ddc337ce</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s here -- just here -- yes!&quot;
They pushed the door open.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e20c05de99d036a56ac95309ddc337ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3991">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b319ee524ccda5bdbceca4d26ff9f169</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry dropped the cloak from around his
shoulders and ran to the mirror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b319ee524ccda5bdbceca4d26ff9f169</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3992">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e4cac1f95a414850662013b3a3db2d39</data>
      <data key="v_content">His mother and father beamed at the sight of him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e4cac1f95a414850662013b3a3db2d39</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3993">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4b63f4b710928f3f6a1ab0e51b984efa</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I can&apos;t see anything.&quot;
&quot;Look! Look at them all...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4b63f4b710928f3f6a1ab0e51b984efa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3994">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-100825f2bfeec61dff4d500509e7ba14</data>
      <data key="v_content">there are loads of them....&quot;
&quot;I can only see you.&quot;
&quot;Look in it properly, go on, stand where I am.&quot;
Harry stepped aside, but with Ron in front of the mirror, he couldn&apos;t
see his family anymore, just Ron in his paisley pajamas.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-100825f2bfeec61dff4d500509e7ba14</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3995">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a56b913b7136c8c6a7cebf65b0c81cab</data>
      <data key="v_content">though,wasstaring,Ron, though, was staring transfixed at his image.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a56b913b7136c8c6a7cebf65b0c81cab</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3996">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-88b9d5d5f4d4623e6b21b60258ed046a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Can you see all your family standing around you?&quot;
&quot;No -- I&apos;m alone -- but I&apos;m different -- I look older -- and I&apos;m head
boy!&quot;
&quot;What?&quot;
&quot;I am -- I&apos;m wearing the badge like Bill used to -- and I&apos;m holding the
house cup and the Quidditch cup -- I&apos;m Quidditch captain, too.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-88b9d5d5f4d4623e6b21b60258ed046a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3997">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b1b3af739b4294fd289aa24ec48fffd0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron tore his eyes away from this splendid sight to look excitedly at
Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b1b3af739b4294fd289aa24ec48fffd0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3998">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7c7b1e7127a7a9e8a0932f626a8837e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Do you think this mirror shows the future?&quot;
&quot;How can it? All my family are dead -- let me have another look --&quot;
169
&quot;You had it to yourself all last night, give me a bit more time.&quot;
&quot;You&apos;re only holding the Quidditch cup, what&apos;s interesting about that? I
want to see my parents.&quot;
&quot;Don&apos;t push me --&quot;
A sudden noise outside in the corridor put an end to their discussion.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7c7b1e7127a7a9e8a0932f626a8837e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n3999">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-79a7a4f1e80e278daa0849549bd6175c</data>
      <data key="v_content">They hadn&apos;t realized how loudly they had been talking.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-79a7a4f1e80e278daa0849549bd6175c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4000">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-41808293bdf4dafcaf97cbb14099eea7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Quick!&quot;
Ron threw the cloak back over them as the luminous eyes of Mrs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-41808293bdf4dafcaf97cbb14099eea7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4001">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2e4b92e1d747f9edd79344c37e766479</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron and Harry stood quite still, both thinking the
same thing -- did the cloak work on cats? After what seemed an age, she
turned and left.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2e4b92e1d747f9edd79344c37e766479</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4002">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cc4bd779465edf3bbd80291f9a868b9b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;This isn&apos;t safe -- she might have gone for Filch, I bet she heard us.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cc4bd779465edf3bbd80291f9a868b9b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4003">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-38e525fc39a2cd3545d4ce2451e3f3fd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Come on.&quot;
And Ron pulled Harry out of the room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-38e525fc39a2cd3545d4ce2451e3f3fd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4004">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f4e6d304d2fbd2b77304341e2f98fd43</data>
      <data key="v_content">The snow still hadn&apos;t melted the next morning.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f4e6d304d2fbd2b77304341e2f98fd43</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4005">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b79388b5d18c6e198104c9877cb315fa</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Want to play chess, Harry?&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b79388b5d18c6e198104c9877cb315fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4006">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a7e6ba44f301ee33f0bfc3fa15895447</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;No.&quot;
&quot;Why don&apos;t we go down and visit Hagrid?&quot;
&quot;No...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a7e6ba44f301ee33f0bfc3fa15895447</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4007">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ceb58bfd92b2c328170f6068697adafe</data>
      <data key="v_content">you go...&quot;
&quot;I know what you&apos;re thinking about, Harry, that mirror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ceb58bfd92b2c328170f6068697adafe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4008">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7369d8abba10d3b66ea97bb9f775948e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Don&apos;t go back
tonight.&quot;
&quot;Why not?&quot;
&quot;I dunno, I&apos;ve just got a bad feeling about it -- and anyway, you&apos;ve had
too many close shaves already.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7369d8abba10d3b66ea97bb9f775948e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4009">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ad7e16fe56a464309c22f5af669d46a5</data>
      <data key="v_content">So what if they can&apos;t see you? What if they walk into
you? What if you knock something over?&quot;
&quot;You sound like Hermione.&quot;
170
&quot;I&apos;m serious, Harry, don&apos;t go.&quot;
But Harry only had one thought in his head, which was to get back in
front of the mirror, and Ron wasn&apos;t going to stop him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ad7e16fe56a464309c22f5af669d46a5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4010">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fcc4e3c6f02183f99c388dc489db73cf</data>
      <data key="v_content">That third night he found his way more quickly than before.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fcc4e3c6f02183f99c388dc489db73cf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4011">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8e826e73943d67d3b796f7e781ff55ba</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was
walking so fast he knew he was making more noise than was wise, but he
didn&apos;t meet anyone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8e826e73943d67d3b796f7e781ff55ba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4012">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-47a00d8a4b62a2a9460e431dd721b4ea</data>
      <data key="v_content">And there were his mother and father smiling at him again, and one of
his grandfathers nodding happily.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-47a00d8a4b62a2a9460e431dd721b4ea</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4013">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d30a026517745b8a9113a37335eb0fce</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry sank down to sit on the floor in
front of the mirror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d30a026517745b8a9113a37335eb0fce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4014">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3712e7bf3ef7552c582e7d28f540ac46</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was nothing to stop him from staying here all
night with his family.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3712e7bf3ef7552c582e7d28f540ac46</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4015">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1a87877119023dd921eb388cf2c486dd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Except --
&quot;So -- back again, Harry?&quot;
Harry felt as though his insides had turned to ice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1a87877119023dd921eb388cf2c486dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4016">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c92b4f2d4e15424b28a04735c37d08d7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Sitting on one of the desks by the wall was none other than Albus
Dumbledore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c92b4f2d4e15424b28a04735c37d08d7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4017">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-599baa59e0d1f56fc27083360ec337aa</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry must have walked straight past him, so desperate to
get to the mirror he hadn&apos;t noticed him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-599baa59e0d1f56fc27083360ec337aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4018">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-be8cf3b9f8550543e79fccd895d8f5d1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot; -- I didn&apos;t see you, sir.&quot;
&quot;Strange how nearsighted being invisible can make you,&quot; said Dumbledore,
and Harry was relieved to see that he was smiling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-be8cf3b9f8550543e79fccd895d8f5d1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4019">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a2ce14721618685e59b033b9605012d6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidDumbledore,slipping,&quot;So,&quot; said Dumbledore, slipping off the desk to sit on the floor with
Harry, &quot;you, like hundreds before you, have discovered the delights of
the Mirror of Erised.&quot;
&quot;I didn&apos;t know it was called that, Sir.&quot;
&quot;But I expect you&apos;ve realized by now what it does?&quot;
&quot;It -- well -- it shows me my family --&quot;
&quot;And it showed your friend Ron himself as head boy.&quot;
&quot;How did you know --?&quot;
171
&quot;I don&apos;t need a cloak to become invisible,&quot; said Dumbledore gently.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a2ce14721618685e59b033b9605012d6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4020">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fb9a8c833dad8aad2fb624e0131aee40</data>
      <data key="v_content">canyouthink,&quot;Now, can you think what the Mirror of Erised shows us all?&quot;
Harry shook his head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fb9a8c833dad8aad2fb624e0131aee40</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4021">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c4a0062c8aa5355af567cd91ffa62377</data>
      <data key="v_content">The happiest man on earth would be able to use the
Mirror of Erised like a normal mirror, that is, he would look into it
and see himself exactly as he is.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c4a0062c8aa5355af567cd91ffa62377</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4022">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4f60e620deb4274335fb4aa177c2e79a</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Then he said slowly, &quot;It shows us what we want...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4f60e620deb4274335fb4aa177c2e79a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4023">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5f0234badfef9e97cc660f6b93cc115</data>
      <data key="v_content">whatever we want...&quot;
&quot;Yes and no,&quot; said Dumbledore quietly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5f0234badfef9e97cc660f6b93cc115</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4024">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-46c1fc9582a4a16194e41fd0ac6c3537</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It shows us nothing more or less
than the deepest, most desperate desire of our hearts.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-46c1fc9582a4a16194e41fd0ac6c3537</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4025">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1beaf4e034744e50a5ae5bc0b7da2103</data>
      <data key="v_content">whohavenever,You, who have
never known your family, see them standing around you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1beaf4e034744e50a5ae5bc0b7da2103</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4026">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-87a4149d313a1ff835c8485f9653172f</data>
      <data key="v_content">whohas,Ronald Weasley,
who has always been overshadowed by his brothers, sees himself standing
alone, the best of all of them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-87a4149d313a1ff835c8485f9653172f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4027">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f214ecc2db1e1153051b682f0c44f40e</data>
      <data key="v_content">thismirrorwill,However, this mirror will give us
neither knowledge or truth.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f214ecc2db1e1153051b682f0c44f40e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4028">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa513c03cac8e9b90f396353b4ad6001</data>
      <data key="v_content">Men have wasted away before it, entranced by
what they have seen, or been driven mad, not knowing if what it shows is
real or even possible.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa513c03cac8e9b90f396353b4ad6001</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4029">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0f14e7583766e30a0677aa3a6883a0b4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The Mirror will be moved to a new home tomorrow, Harry, and I ask you
not to go looking for it again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0f14e7583766e30a0677aa3a6883a0b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4030">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-39795571c94e66e521a8b8bf630edd5c</data>
      <data key="v_content">If you ever do run across it, you will
now be prepared.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-39795571c94e66e521a8b8bf630edd5c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4031">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a08a35667ef0ba1abaac874f02306c60</data>
      <data key="v_content">It does not do to dwell on dreams and forget to live,
remember that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a08a35667ef0ba1abaac874f02306c60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4032">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-03a11e186d9bb5f3c03a0b8123e70b56</data>
      <data key="v_content">whydon&apos;tyou,Now, why don&apos;t you put that admirable cloak back on and
get off to bed?&quot;
Harry stood up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-03a11e186d9bb5f3c03a0b8123e70b56</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4033">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-93179d40c96ea4badbb5d2b76d037dea</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Sir -- Professor Dumbledore? Can I ask you something?&quot;
&quot;Obviously, you&apos;ve just done so,&quot; Dumbledore smiled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-93179d40c96ea4badbb5d2b76d037dea</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4034">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-143054b74206905e9df1c4b902c5e457</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You may ask me one
more thing, however.&quot;
&quot;What do you see when you look in the mirror?&quot;
&quot;I? I see myself holding a pair of thick, woolen socks.&quot;
Harry stared.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-143054b74206905e9df1c4b902c5e457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4035">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-729dac9d36c5694981ca9dbbcf4065f5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;One can never have enough socks,&quot; said Dumbledore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-729dac9d36c5694981ca9dbbcf4065f5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4036">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8d40b9a1becf35d36c60b1ac4d65ff5c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Another Christmas
has come and gone and I didn&apos;t get a single pair.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8d40b9a1becf35d36c60b1ac4d65ff5c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4037">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-30852bb7adcbed45ab8358393474478d</data>
      <data key="v_content">People will insist on
giving me books.&quot;
172
It was only when he was back in bed that it struck Harry that Dumbledore
might not have been quite truthful.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-30852bb7adcbed45ab8358393474478d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4038">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7485f52c84b939486a221f4e2f0e1558</data>
      <data key="v_content">hethought,,But then, he thought, as he shoved
Scabbers off his pillow, it had been quite a personal question.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7485f52c84b939486a221f4e2f0e1558</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4039">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eecdc43ddf89d3b2d024204919f02c51</data>
      <data key="v_content">CHAPTER THIRTEEN
NICOLAS FLAMEL
Dumbledore had convinced Harry not to go looking for the Mirror of
Erised again, and for the rest of the Christmas holidays the
invisibility cloak stayed folded at the bottom of his trunk.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eecdc43ddf89d3b2d024204919f02c51</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4040">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-28888b068444ed81555a3a37d78a0e6d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry
wished he could forget what he&apos;d seen in the mirror as easily, but he
couldn&apos;t.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-28888b068444ed81555a3a37d78a0e6d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4041">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e62a2ee4130e4a20883e2b334b3bd261</data>
      <data key="v_content">Over and over again he dreamed
about his parents disappearing in a flash of green light, while a high
voice cackled with laughter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e62a2ee4130e4a20883e2b334b3bd261</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4042">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-371933dbbf7463ad3b1879a82885cdb4</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dumbledorewas,&quot;You see, Dumbledore was right, that mirror could drive you mad,&quot; said
Ron, when Harry told him about these drearns.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-371933dbbf7463ad3b1879a82885cdb4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4043">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-09eb0d6e77797012ad31ddbafd93966b</data>
      <data key="v_content">whocameback,Hermione, who came back the day before term started, took a different
view of things.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-09eb0d6e77797012ad31ddbafd93966b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4044">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3a4f6589424cbd3d51e6e6befee915fa</data>
      <data key="v_content">She was torn between horror at the idea of Harry being
out of bed, roaming the school three nights in a row (&quot;If Filch had
caught you!&quot;), and disappointment that he hadn&apos;t at least found out who
Nicolas Flamel was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3a4f6589424cbd3d51e6e6befee915fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4045">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9b558bf88fab6d3a7fdf12b34b8c3146</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had almost given up hope of ever finding Flamel in a li- brary
book, even though Harry was still sure he&apos;d read the name somewhere.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9b558bf88fab6d3a7fdf12b34b8c3146</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4046">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b84236f0e678122d53256bb2f48a7c5d</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Once term had started, they were back to skimming through books for ten
minutes during their breaks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b84236f0e678122d53256bb2f48a7c5d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4047">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c8e3fe863f006766c034451587aa2d37</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had even less time than the other
two, because Quidditch practice had started again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c8e3fe863f006766c034451587aa2d37</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4048">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a11c39f65b34d268135757bf4deb33c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Wood was working the team harder than ever.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a11c39f65b34d268135757bf4deb33c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4049">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2479beb5e01fa509bd0d8de45502912</data>
      <data key="v_content">Even the endless rain that
had replaced the snow couldn&apos;t dampen his spirits.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2479beb5e01fa509bd0d8de45502912</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4050">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4005b45de503f250e7f493bd22b2099c</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Weasleys
complained that Wood was becoming a fanatic, but Harry was on Wood&apos;s
side.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4005b45de503f250e7f493bd22b2099c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4051">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-64bf8ff4a24a9d625826849d0e8c30c2</data>
      <data key="v_content">If they won their next match, against Hufflepuff, they would
overtake Slytherin in the house championship for the first time in seven
years.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-64bf8ff4a24a9d625826849d0e8c30c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4052">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f1aab8d984408423f24eb52b6dac82ef</data>
      <data key="v_content">Quite apart from wanting to win, Harry found that he had fewer
nightmares when he was tired out after training.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f1aab8d984408423f24eb52b6dac82ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4053">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aacc78cdd96e1ab5b87d734525b6cdd3</data>
      <data key="v_content">duringoneparticularly,Then, during one particularly wet and muddy practice session, Wood gave
the team a bit of bad news.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aacc78cdd96e1ab5b87d734525b6cdd3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4054">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-232e06e5965bda0cd73625930bc7e07b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;d just gotten very angry with the
173
Weasleys, who kept dive-bombing each other and pretending to fall off
their brooms.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-232e06e5965bda0cd73625930bc7e07b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4055">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5a3755551855b2e76cad8d36f205a6a4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Will you stop messing around!&quot; he yelled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5a3755551855b2e76cad8d36f205a6a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4056">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5466c0b00714ddc6b4f0b9fe7bb8abec</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;That&apos;s exactly the sort of
thing that&apos;ll lose us the match! Snape&apos;s refereeing this time, and he&apos;ll
be looking for any excuse to knock points off Gryffindor!&quot;
George Weasley really did fall off his broom at these words.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5466c0b00714ddc6b4f0b9fe7bb8abec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4057">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7c024ef88fe83cb08157950ab1521e7a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Snape&apos;s refereeing?&quot; he spluttered through a mouthful of mud.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7c024ef88fe83cb08157950ab1521e7a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4058">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2f42aef7c19f07a373380dfb4ca6d786</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;When&apos;s
he ever refereed a Quidditch match? He&apos;s not going to be fair if we
might overtake Slytherin.&quot;
The rest of the team landed next to George to complain, too.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2f42aef7c19f07a373380dfb4ca6d786</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4059">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9e0ae027210c42188ab888d63731b192</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;It&apos;s not my fault,&quot; said Wood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9e0ae027210c42188ab888d63731b192</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4060">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ffd3bc97bb60aa793f46aa17731a978e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;ve just got to make sure we play a
clean game, so Snape hasn&apos;t got an excuse to pick on us.&quot;
Which was all very well, thought Harry, but he had another reason for
not wanting Snape near him while he was playing Quidditch....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ffd3bc97bb60aa793f46aa17731a978e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4061">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b10bb44075ea900ef28127914250749b</data>
      <data key="v_content">The rest of the team hung back to talk to one another as usual at the
end of practice, but Harry headed straight back to the Gryffindor common
room, where he found Ron and Hermione playing chess.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b10bb44075ea900ef28127914250749b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4062">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7fc5f1fa9b836cea334761c646300ba0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Chess was the only
thing Hermione ever lost at, something Harry and Ron thought was very
good for her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7fc5f1fa9b836cea334761c646300ba0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4063">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-df343401059708b6b0cfb36818b1368f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Don&apos;t talk to me for a moment,&quot; said Ron when Harry sat down next to
him, &quot;I need to concen --&quot; He caught sight of Harry&apos;s face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-df343401059708b6b0cfb36818b1368f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4064">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e4722934493cc5695d2dae006a959f1d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What&apos;s the
matter with you? You look terrible.&quot;
Speaking quietly so that no one else would hear, Harry told the other
two about Snape&apos;s sudden, sinister desire to be a Quidditch referee.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e4722934493cc5695d2dae006a959f1d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4065">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-45e2102d54598bfabaa7f0dc31a243cf</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidHermione,&quot;Don&apos;t play,&quot; said Hermione at once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-45e2102d54598bfabaa7f0dc31a243cf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4066">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-27f92425ed00c32b5b1c1430bcf63fd6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Pretend to break your leg,&quot; Hermione suggested.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-27f92425ed00c32b5b1c1430bcf63fd6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4067">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa543d2a84215ba8f502a3d82a177b17</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;Really break your leg,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa543d2a84215ba8f502a3d82a177b17</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4068">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-220c0290de1822f98edcd057d2e44a64</data>
      <data key="v_content">,If I back out,
174
Gryffindor can&apos;t play at all.&quot;
At that moment Neville toppled into the common room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-220c0290de1822f98edcd057d2e44a64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4069">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ceb49dbe3eab59ec11aa93ef0208940a</data>
      <data key="v_content">How he had managed
to climb through the portrait hole was anyone&apos;s guess, because his legs
had been stuck together with what they recognized at once as the
Leg-Locker Curse.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ceb49dbe3eab59ec11aa93ef0208940a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4070">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e3db2d3949c55246a124d11808046a1b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He must have had to bunny hop all the way up to
Gryffindor tower.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e3db2d3949c55246a124d11808046a1b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4071">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a1c9f1a2406533f7805ab71f0a2a3ea8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Everyone fell over laughing except Hermione, who leapt up and performed
the countercurse.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a1c9f1a2406533f7805ab71f0a2a3ea8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4072">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-86bdca731414fbcc17599ce62f6429f9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville&apos;s legs sprang apart and he got to his feet,
trembling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-86bdca731414fbcc17599ce62f6429f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4073">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ef036cf50cdf0a0b75d8c9e07411a0d3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What happened?&quot; Hermione asked him, leading him over to sit
with Harry and Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ef036cf50cdf0a0b75d8c9e07411a0d3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4074">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-15ab54d362f0ce3030c55fff9a197e9a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I met him outside the library.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-15ab54d362f0ce3030c55fff9a197e9a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4075">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-39b0ed02a5a7d8c4750e120bfa02bdd9</data>
      <data key="v_content">He said
he&apos;d been looking for someone to practice that on.&quot;
&quot;Go to Professor McGonagall!&quot; Hermione urged Neville.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-39b0ed02a5a7d8c4750e120bfa02bdd9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4076">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cc4d99334f274456158379e790f6af4d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Report him!&quot;
Neville shook his head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cc4d99334f274456158379e790f6af4d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4077">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6186d249b7e18ab1730b2e02b0cff3f0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I don&apos;t want more trouble,&quot; he mumbled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6186d249b7e18ab1730b2e02b0cff3f0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4078">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5329a8787bea926a8a78c53967a1f586</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;ve got to stand up to him, Neville!&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5329a8787bea926a8a78c53967a1f586</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4079">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-01bbae9f0c6ac0c7e01b83a5f8f87ed5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He&apos;s used to
walking all over people, but that&apos;s no reason to lie down in front of
him and make it easier.&quot;
&quot;There&apos;s no need to tell me I&apos;m not brave enough to be in Gryffindor,
Malfoy&apos;s already done that,&quot; Neville choked out.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-01bbae9f0c6ac0c7e01b83a5f8f87ed5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4080">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-abe7740a7282f0e6e02a61e58eb9b214</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry felt in the pocket of his robes and pulled out a Chocolate Frog,
the very last one from the box Hermione had given him for Christmas.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-abe7740a7282f0e6e02a61e58eb9b214</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4081">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d182024c6ff056108311a426ab386799</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
gave it to Neville, who looked as though he might cry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d182024c6ff056108311a426ab386799</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4082">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a73586ecaf332c8da0694065de271dae</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;re worth twelve of Malfoy,&quot; Harry said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a73586ecaf332c8da0694065de271dae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4083">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-50f7edb3826db3afd551c34a6dbd4241</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The Sorting Hat chose you
for Gryffindor, didn&apos;t it? And where&apos;s Malfoy? In stinking Slytherin.&quot;
Neville&apos;s lips twitched in a weak smile as he unwrapped the frog.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-50f7edb3826db3afd551c34a6dbd4241</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4084">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d04e8a3a29f19e956d903b86819ed155</data>
      <data key="v_content">I think I&apos;ll go to bed....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d04e8a3a29f19e956d903b86819ed155</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4085">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d4c1a241b8ffd93311728486ed166287</data>
      <data key="v_content">,D&apos;you want the card, you
collect them, don&apos;t you?&quot;
As Neville walked away, Harry looked at the Famous Wizard card.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d4c1a241b8ffd93311728486ed166287</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4086">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0743c2134dcda452c4008d2cc10b86f9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;he,175
&quot;Dumbledore again,&quot; he said, &quot;He was the first one I ever-&quot;
He gasped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0743c2134dcda452c4008d2cc10b86f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4087">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8c4d7eee8a787ebcb08882133fe9a42e</data>
      <data key="v_content">He stared at the back of the card.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8c4d7eee8a787ebcb08882133fe9a42e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4088">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-02dc11f425feebe79e303377cdaa8f38</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then he looked up at Ron
and Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-02dc11f425feebe79e303377cdaa8f38</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4089">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-44adfe68fffa5276c39b1217f0228f02</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;ve found Flamel! I told you I&apos;d read
the name somewhere before, I read it on the train coming here -- listen
to this: &apos;Dumbledore is particularly famous for his defeat of the dark
wizard Grindelwald in 1945, for the discovery of the twelve uses of
dragon&apos;s blood, and his work on alchemy with his partner, Nicolas
Flamel&apos;!&quot;
Hermione jumped to her feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-44adfe68fffa5276c39b1217f0228f02</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4090">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5d3589b07cc9c18bd61ed60604a97a6d</data>
      <data key="v_content">She hadn&apos;t looked so excited since they&apos;d
gotten back the marks for their very first piece of homework.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5d3589b07cc9c18bd61ed60604a97a6d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4091">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8cde8b284d855fc8a1d316880da86c64</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Stay there!&quot; she said, and she sprinted up the stairs to the girls&apos;
dormitories.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8cde8b284d855fc8a1d316880da86c64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4092">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4a2ede5206e99cc924e510aba31fb9f8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Ron barely had time to exchange mystified looks
before she was dashing back, an enormous old book in her arms.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4a2ede5206e99cc924e510aba31fb9f8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4093">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4421f81e9224771508922f0d34fe7226</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I never thought to look in here!&quot; she whispered excitedly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4421f81e9224771508922f0d34fe7226</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4094">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dcfa5caf216739f6cbf12553f2470bae</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I got this
out of the library weeks ago for a bit of light reading.&quot;
&quot;Light?&quot; said Ron, but Hermione told him to be quiet until she&apos;d looked
something up, and started flicking frantically through the pages,
muttering to herself.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dcfa5caf216739f6cbf12553f2470bae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4095">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d05be7ba8d9d2477534013b5e70281e6</data>
      <data key="v_content">At last she found what she was looking for.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d05be7ba8d9d2477534013b5e70281e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4096">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-560049a76cbedd13d887783f9ef76522</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I knew it! I knew it!&quot;
&quot;Are we allowed to speak yet?&quot; said Ron grumpily.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-560049a76cbedd13d887783f9ef76522</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4097">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e9bab78b261478d1cba54f4a0a1ad1cd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;shewhispered,&quot;Nicolas Flamel,&quot; she whispered dramatically, &quot;is the only known maker
of the Sorcerer&apos;s Stone!&quot;
This didn&apos;t have quite the effect she&apos;d expected.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e9bab78b261478d1cba54f4a0a1ad1cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4098">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fbd6f3dfda5499dd01a6b09aa9aaf67c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The what?&quot; said Harry and Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fbd6f3dfda5499dd01a6b09aa9aaf67c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4099">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-51594131ff21702d24930509decfdc11</data>
      <data key="v_content">honestly,don&apos;tyou,&quot;Oh, honestly, don&apos;t you two read? Look -- read that, there.&quot;
She pushed the book toward them, and Harry and Ron read: The ancient
study of alchemy is concerned with making the Sorcerer&apos;s Stone, a
176
legendary substance with astonishing powers.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-51594131ff21702d24930509decfdc11</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4100">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8a95eb5cc20a341f4b2b96c37f55dc5f</data>
      <data key="v_content">The stone will transform
any metal into pure gold.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8a95eb5cc20a341f4b2b96c37f55dc5f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4101">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5d1224504488f332055168489877b7bc</data>
      <data key="v_content">It also produces the Elixir of Life, which
will make the drinker immortal.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5d1224504488f332055168489877b7bc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4102">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7afe9b0355fa1e534f8f9fdb2d5f687f</data>
      <data key="v_content">There have been many reports of the Sorcerer&apos;s Stone over the centuries,
but the only Stone currently in existence belongs to Mr.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7afe9b0355fa1e534f8f9fdb2d5f687f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4103">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-16a10bfd33ceecd5efe3ed02d937fdcd</data>
      <data key="v_content">thenoted,Nicolas Flamel,
the noted alchemist and opera lover.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-16a10bfd33ceecd5efe3ed02d937fdcd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4104">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8565d2718743a2258c71ea7779167753</data>
      <data key="v_content">whocelebratedhis,Flamel, who celebrated his six
hundred and sixty-fifth birthday last year, enjoys a quiet life in Devon
with his wife, Perenelle (six hundred and fifty-eight).</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8565d2718743a2258c71ea7779167753</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4105">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-157cbec50376be4429764571c52f8868</data>
      <data key="v_content">when,&quot;See?&quot; said Hermione, when Harry and Ron had finished.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-157cbec50376be4429764571c52f8868</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4106">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-23181d84ea6c83c1fd5534efb5309fb2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The dog must be
guarding Flamel&apos;s Sorcerer&apos;s Stone! I bet he asked Dumbledore to keep it
safe for him, because they&apos;re friends and he knew someone was after it,
that&apos;s why he wanted the Stone moved out of Gringotts!&quot;
&quot;A stone that makes gold and stops you from ever dying!&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-23181d84ea6c83c1fd5534efb5309fb2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4107">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2a7c72032f595629ba381a5b69c2d84b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;No
wonder Snape&apos;s after it! Anyone would want it.&quot;
&quot;And no wonder we couldn&apos;t find Flamel in that Study of Recent
Developments in Wizardry,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2a7c72032f595629ba381a5b69c2d84b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4108">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-464c5518ea2f2c4b10be81a10dc19ce0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He&apos;s not exactly recent if he&apos;s
six hundred and sixty-five, is he?&quot;
The next morning in Defense Against the Dark Arts, while copying down
different ways of treating werewolf bites, Harry and Ron were still
discussing what they&apos;d do with a Sorcerer&apos;s Stone if they had one.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-464c5518ea2f2c4b10be81a10dc19ce0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4109">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d8cf9a6e9261792349b64349a46beb88</data>
      <data key="v_content">It
wasn&apos;t until Ron said he&apos;d buy his own Quidditch team that Harry
remembered about Snape and the coming match.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d8cf9a6e9261792349b64349a46beb88</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4110">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2449a0bf289409de2b03f798156d78f8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;I&apos;m going to play,&quot; he told Ron and Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2449a0bf289409de2b03f798156d78f8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4111">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f7993cd03e4bfb55679505fc34c53e6b</data>
      <data key="v_content">all,&quot;If I don&apos;t, all the
Slytherins will think I&apos;m just too scared to face Snape.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f7993cd03e4bfb55679505fc34c53e6b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4112">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aa8c920622d6d3313e07692cfdf02ba9</data>
      <data key="v_content">it&apos;ll really wipe the smiles off their faces if we win.&quot;
&quot;Just as long as we&apos;re not wiping you off the field,&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aa8c920622d6d3313e07692cfdf02ba9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4113">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0646a158bafbe8852c3121cbd757041a</data>
      <data key="v_content">As the match drew nearer, however, Harry became more and more nervous,
whatever he told Ron and Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0646a158bafbe8852c3121cbd757041a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4114">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-37e48ee3a640a0ddb415e837babb5ae8</data>
      <data key="v_content">The rest of the team wasn&apos;t too calm,
either.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-37e48ee3a640a0ddb415e837babb5ae8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4115">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d19e40adb8a955f77748e3564bf6bdcb</data>
      <data key="v_content">The idea of overtaking Slytherin in the house championship was
wonderful, no one had done it for seven years, but would they be allowed
to, with such a biased referee?
Harry didn&apos;t know whether he was imagining it or not, but he seemed to
keep running into Snape wherever he went.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d19e40adb8a955f77748e3564bf6bdcb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4116">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0ba50715ba1ea2c054963383d56b8d26</data>
      <data key="v_content">heeven,At times, he even wondered
whether Snape was following him, trying to catch him on his own.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0ba50715ba1ea2c054963383d56b8d26</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4117">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5c3c2b0d0193c5de8dcc3659ac2fbb68</data>
      <data key="v_content">Potions
177
lessons were turning into a sort of weekly torture, Snape was so
horrible to Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5c3c2b0d0193c5de8dcc3659ac2fbb68</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4118">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ce373f21370d8347cfe62f1385b2639b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Could Snape possibly know they&apos;d found out about the
Sorcerer&apos;s Stone? Harry didn&apos;t see how he could -- yet he sometimes had
the horrible feeling that Snape could read minds.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ce373f21370d8347cfe62f1385b2639b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4119">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-de5c52613744d43a5aa4f6aebb4a0995</data>
      <data key="v_content">whenthey,Harry knew, when they wished him good luck outside the locker rooms the
next afternoon, that Ron and Hermione were wondering whether they&apos;d ever
see him alive again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-de5c52613744d43a5aa4f6aebb4a0995</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4120">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-12706b9cf0ff521c1a47afdfad9ff751</data>
      <data key="v_content">This wasn&apos;t what you&apos;d call comforting.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-12706b9cf0ff521c1a47afdfad9ff751</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4121">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-60913a10a04d344f1562d94a96a91ed9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry
hardly heard a word of Wood&apos;s pep talk as he pulled on his Quidditch
robes and picked up his Nimbus Two Thousand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-60913a10a04d344f1562d94a96a91ed9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4122">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0572fbf8b9a407e4793ab92a3aaf4147</data>
      <data key="v_content">meanwhile,,Ron and Hermione, meanwhile, had found a place in the stands next to
Neville, who couldn&apos;t understand why they looked so grim and worried, or
why they had both brought their wands to the match.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0572fbf8b9a407e4793ab92a3aaf4147</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4123">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a35e0547b78d74051c9aa799b846af49</data>
      <data key="v_content">Little did Harry
know that Ron and Hermione had been secretly practicing the Leg-Locker
Curse.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a35e0547b78d74051c9aa799b846af49</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4124">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3fbc17965313ca68c89f9da69b56b59b</data>
      <data key="v_content">They&apos;d gotten the idea from Malfoy using it on Neville, and were
ready to use it on Snape if he showed any sign of wanting to hurt Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3fbc17965313ca68c89f9da69b56b59b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4125">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e6b7b640ccd7808ee7b5a84253dcb4aa</data>
      <data key="v_content">don&apos;tforget,it&apos;s,&quot;Now, don&apos;t forget, it&apos;s Locomotor Mortis,&quot; Hermione muttered as Ron
slipped his wand up his sleeve.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e6b7b640ccd7808ee7b5a84253dcb4aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4126">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ab024ccbed20975c3eb35cd519f341f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Don&apos;t nag.&quot;
Back in the locker room, Wood had taken Harry aside.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ab024ccbed20975c3eb35cd519f341f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4127">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cf3fab6fc90deb6ee9d3e423399c74ac</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Don&apos;t want to pressure you, Potter, but if we ever need an early
capture of the Snitch it&apos;s now.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cf3fab6fc90deb6ee9d3e423399c74ac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4128">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2f589c60d0de20264824d9d1b8787f0a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Finish the game before Snape can favor
Hufflepuff too much.&quot;
&quot;The whole school&apos;s out there!&quot; said Fred Weasley, peering out of the
door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2f589c60d0de20264824d9d1b8787f0a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4129">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-911c0492b91756004f92ac93be9b6f47</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Even -- blimey -- Dumbledore&apos;s come to watch!&quot;
Harry&apos;s heart did a somersault.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-911c0492b91756004f92ac93be9b6f47</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4130">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d5573d536baac1ad89c9d8e53e68ffa4</data>
      <data key="v_content">dashing,&quot;Dumbledore?&quot; he said, dashing to the door to make sure.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d5573d536baac1ad89c9d8e53e68ffa4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4131">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dc9ffb88de9daedbd112f186e3a07e7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was no mistaking that silver beard.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dc9ffb88de9daedbd112f186e3a07e7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4132">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-645cc5427f94159d0d42da80da46d7bc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry could have laughed out loud with relief He was safe.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-645cc5427f94159d0d42da80da46d7bc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4133">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c1d2aff9cad861174d0f87c742db6d75</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was
simply no way that Snape would dare to try to hurt him if Dumbledore was
watching.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c1d2aff9cad861174d0f87c742db6d75</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4134">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-622e0f542c45d6852fc1222f9192c7d2</data>
      <data key="v_content">Perhaps that was why Snape was looking so angry as the teams marched
onto the field, something that Ron noticed, too.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-622e0f542c45d6852fc1222f9192c7d2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4135">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d68ab2353c97604a818a0a996988fe64</data>
      <data key="v_content">178
&quot;I&apos;ve never seen Snape look so mean,&quot; he told Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d68ab2353c97604a818a0a996988fe64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4136">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ea6152c85ca1a21b5aa57080281982b8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Look -they&apos;re
off Ouch!&quot;
Someone had poked Ron in the back of the head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ea6152c85ca1a21b5aa57080281982b8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4137">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-38d8fdbc07e721f196615389ed482b1d</data>
      <data key="v_content">sorry,Weasley,didn&apos;t,&quot;Oh, sorry, Weasley, didn&apos;t see you there.&quot;
Malfoy grinned broadly at Crabbe and Goyle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-38d8fdbc07e721f196615389ed482b1d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4138">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c97d86d7af2b5625a15aac053d21adab</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Wonder how long Potter&apos;s going to stay on his broom this time? Anyone
want a bet? What about you, Weasley?&quot;
Ron didn&apos;t answer; Snape had just awarded Hufflepuff a penalty because
George Weasley had hit a Bludger at him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c97d86d7af2b5625a15aac053d21adab</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4139">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-21569f57edb917eaf75a48509d7fd6df</data>
      <data key="v_content">whohadall,Hermione, who had all her
fingers crossed in her lap, was squinting fixedly at Harry, who was
circling the game like a hawk, looking for the Snitch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-21569f57edb917eaf75a48509d7fd6df</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4140">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fddf2fa4d559619e89bacc0b731b2395</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You know how I think they choose people for the Gryffindor team?&quot; said
Malfoy loudly a few minutes later, as Snape awarded Hufflepuff another
penalty for no reason at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fddf2fa4d559619e89bacc0b731b2395</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4141">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7da334404695983ca073f969daa20ccb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s people they feel sorry for.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7da334404695983ca073f969daa20ccb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4142">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d473fe60aa994472d63c89f4769e2213</data>
      <data key="v_content">there&apos;sPotter,who&apos;s,See,
there&apos;s Potter, who&apos;s got no parents, then there&apos;s the Weasleys, who&apos;ve
got no money -- you should be on the team, Longbottom, you&apos;ve got no
brains.&quot;
Neville went bright red but turned in his seat to face Malfoy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d473fe60aa994472d63c89f4769e2213</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4143">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-481322ecc7a670dc456d21a035880a8b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;m worth twelve of you, Malfoy,&quot; he stammered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-481322ecc7a670dc456d21a035880a8b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4144">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-88c6ee35739b0b58e7e8a640e28cfe05</data>
      <data key="v_content">Crabbe,andGoyle,Malfoy, Crabbe, and Goyle howled with laughter, but Ron, still not
daring to take his eyes from the game, said, &quot;You tell him, Neville.&quot;
&quot;Longbottom, if brains were gold you&apos;d be poorer than Weasley, and
that&apos;s saying something.&quot;
Ron&apos;s nerves were already stretched to the breaking point with anxiety
about Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-88c6ee35739b0b58e7e8a640e28cfe05</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4145">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-05dab6a5719603dbdeaadd374bfda9b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy,&quot;I&apos;m warning you, Malfoy -- one more word
&quot;Ron!&quot; said Hermione suddenly, &quot;Harry --&quot;
&quot;What? Where?&quot;
179
Harry had suddenly gone into a spectacular dive, which drew gasps and
cheers from the crowd.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-05dab6a5719603dbdeaadd374bfda9b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4146">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a55854b6a20d4e4835243d990384c7be</data>
      <data key="v_content">her,Hermione stood up, her crossed fingers in her
mouth, as Harry streaked toward the ground like a bullet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a55854b6a20d4e4835243d990384c7be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4147">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3eb673751b9783896d64e9d2ed06a2e8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Weasley,,&quot;You&apos;re in luck, Weasley, Potter&apos;s obviously spotted some money on the
ground!&quot; said Malfoy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3eb673751b9783896d64e9d2ed06a2e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4148">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1199a9898fae64c21de21b33dce5992c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Before Malfoy knew what was happening, Ron was on top of
him, wrestling him to the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1199a9898fae64c21de21b33dce5992c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4149">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5703448df903ccf0c583df213e4d34e</data>
      <data key="v_content">thenclambered,Neville hesitated, then clambered over
the back of his seat to help.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5703448df903ccf0c583df213e4d34e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4150">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aa965c49a43d8c45df9b08bb54498cbc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry!&quot;Hermione,&quot;Come on, Harry!&quot; Hermione screamed, leaping onto her seat to watch as
Harry sped straight at Snape -- she didn&apos;t even notice Malfoy and Ron
rolling around under her seat, or the scuffles and yelps coming from the
whirl of fists that was Neville, Crabbe, and Goyle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aa965c49a43d8c45df9b08bb54498cbc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4151">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-becf683420373b8382ce928c69af0177</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Up in the air, Snape turned on his broomstick just in time to see
something scarlet shoot past him, missing him by inches -- the next
second, Harry had pulled out of the dive, his arm raised in triumph, the
Snitch clasped in his hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-becf683420373b8382ce928c69af0177</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4152">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e2991505a153a87e5783637c66729df1</data>
      <data key="v_content">The stands erupted; it had to be a record, no one could ever remember
the Snitch being caught so quickly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e2991505a153a87e5783637c66729df1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4153">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-57116c97a154014459807be8edcc2f52</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ron! Ron! Where are you? The game&apos;s over! Harry&apos;s won! We&apos;ve won!
Gryffindor is in the lead!&quot; shrieked Hermione, dancing up and down on
her seat and hugging Parvati Patil in the row in front.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-57116c97a154014459807be8edcc2f52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4154">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-37a1d2432212fbde80814b134c73587a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry jumped off his broom, a foot from the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-37a1d2432212fbde80814b134c73587a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4155">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b64d95f93a41e5d1b8cf478306d9f858</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;d done it -- the game was over; it had barely lasted five
minutes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b64d95f93a41e5d1b8cf478306d9f858</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4156">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5693f72e8a4edad6355f3d0fd376d3d8</data>
      <data key="v_content">As Gryffindors came spilling onto the field, he saw Snape land
nearby, white-faced and tight-lipped -- then Harry felt a hand on his
shoulder and looked up into Dumbledore&apos;s smiling face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5693f72e8a4edad6355f3d0fd376d3d8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4157">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f82bd89e16556836c9bb0fc75fc9ad59</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidDumbledore,&quot;Well done,&quot; said Dumbledore quietly, so that only Harry could hear.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f82bd89e16556836c9bb0fc75fc9ad59</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4158">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-26d6184ffcf3b4340897830bf9a0991f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Nice to see you haven&apos;t been brooding about that mirror...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-26d6184ffcf3b4340897830bf9a0991f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4159">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3bc29db5153acc78373beece30b5bae4</data>
      <data key="v_content">excellent...&quot;
Snape spat bitterly on the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3bc29db5153acc78373beece30b5bae4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4160">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0b29915e9057a3b281585ea96e54439a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry left the locker room alone some time later, to take his Nimbus Two
Thousand back to the broomshed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0b29915e9057a3b281585ea96e54439a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4161">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a47ce851779508151a72df1e0009802d</data>
      <data key="v_content">He couldn&apos;t ever remember feeling
180
happier.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a47ce851779508151a72df1e0009802d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4162">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-63dd81990f2b342bcc26b1a7930ac338</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;d really done something to be proud of now -- no one could
say he was just a famous name any more.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-63dd81990f2b342bcc26b1a7930ac338</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4163">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-56b8af5bb154d7c3071d2a129f0a2885</data>
      <data key="v_content">The evening air had never
smelled so sweet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-56b8af5bb154d7c3071d2a129f0a2885</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4164">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d1394104bbfd7facfd4003a1b28ae58d</data>
      <data key="v_content">He walked over the damp grass, reliving the last hour
in his head, which was a happy blur: Gryffindors running to lift him
onto their shoulders; Ron and Hermione in the distance, jumping up and
down, Ron cheering through a heavy nosebleed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d1394104bbfd7facfd4003a1b28ae58d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4165">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a1ec12ae7c890d52bad4f42506dba770</data>
      <data key="v_content">He leaned against the wooden door and looked
up at Hogwarts, with its windows glowing red in the setting sun.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a1ec12ae7c890d52bad4f42506dba770</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4166">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cfa9cd2cf52af15710b7181a1fe19b04</data>
      <data key="v_content">he&apos;d,He&apos;d done it, he&apos;d shown Snape....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cfa9cd2cf52af15710b7181a1fe19b04</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4167">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4bce2cf523e2e9829e0e631c78e51236</data>
      <data key="v_content">A hooded figure came swiftly down the front steps of the castle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4bce2cf523e2e9829e0e631c78e51236</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4168">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1059d53967c8ad55693fef7c4d83e799</data>
      <data key="v_content">Clearly
not wanting to be seen, it walked as fast as possible toward the
forbidden forest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1059d53967c8ad55693fef7c4d83e799</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4169">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a8ca00262789a78b73d4d4af1068e42e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry&apos;s victory faded from his mind as he watched.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a8ca00262789a78b73d4d4af1068e42e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4170">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5d0debff3c2ad2c0a08f01119f310802</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
recognized the figure&apos;s prowling walk.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5d0debff3c2ad2c0a08f01119f310802</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4171">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cf7b484b4a63b53cca489d1423a4c2e2</data>
      <data key="v_content">sneakingintothe,Snape, sneaking into the forest
while everyone else was at dinner -- what was going on?
Harry jumped back on his Nimbus Two Thousand and took off.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cf7b484b4a63b53cca489d1423a4c2e2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4172">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9a6980b611094cf7903e219757555882</data>
      <data key="v_content">Gliding
silently over the castle he saw Snape enter the forest at a run.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9a6980b611094cf7903e219757555882</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4173">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7b96a303f94f36a9b882e8d1cff7c608</data>
      <data key="v_content">The trees were so thick he couldn&apos;t see where Snape had gone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7b96a303f94f36a9b882e8d1cff7c608</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4174">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a4108ecd9348677096f4981610fd4a0f</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He flew in
circles, lower and lower, brushing the top branches of trees until he
heard voices.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a4108ecd9348677096f4981610fd4a0f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4175">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-743b9b5f0d40751203b14c61134c2002</data>
      <data key="v_content">He glided toward them and landed noiselessly in a towering
beech tree.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-743b9b5f0d40751203b14c61134c2002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4176">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-12bd365c538160eb6829c6d36d21e2ad</data>
      <data key="v_content">He climbed carefully along one of the branches, holding tight to his
broomstick, trying to see through the leaves.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-12bd365c538160eb6829c6d36d21e2ad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4177">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7cb3f4becaadcb9a398ea31ebd5215f8</data>
      <data key="v_content">inashadowy,Below, in a shadowy
clearing, stood Snape, but he wasn&apos;t alone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7cb3f4becaadcb9a398ea31ebd5215f8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4178">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-27dcc47d42ba946cd30a6e0227d8a50f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry couldn&apos;t make out the look on his face, but he was stuttering
worse than ever.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-27dcc47d42ba946cd30a6e0227d8a50f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4179">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d9290f2906c82618a973783903344128</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry strained to catch what they were saying.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d9290f2906c82618a973783903344128</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4180">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c6a5010a861589612905decf46c2e16c</data>
      <data key="v_content">d-don&apos;t know why you wanted t-t-to meet here of all p-places,
Severus...&quot;
&quot;Oh, I thought we&apos;d keep this private,&quot; said Snape, his voice icy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c6a5010a861589612905decf46c2e16c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4181">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-44ef00e0adcd45cddd9bc369084cb11c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Students aren&apos;t supposed to know about the Sorcerer&apos;s Stone, after
all.&quot;
Harry leaned forward.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-44ef00e0adcd45cddd9bc369084cb11c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4182">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d301acaba3dbc64bc1817e37c6460358</data>
      <data key="v_content">181
&quot;Have you found out how to get past that beast of Hagrid&apos;s yet?&quot;
&quot;B-b-but Severus, I --&quot;
&quot;You don&apos;t want me as your enemy, Quirrell,&quot; said Snape, taking a step
toward him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d301acaba3dbc64bc1817e37c6460358</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4183">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cd5aa23a46645a86ba4501095724330e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I-I don&apos;t know what you
&quot;You know perfectly well what I mean.&quot;
An owl hooted loudly, and Harry nearly fell out of the tree.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cd5aa23a46645a86ba4501095724330e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4184">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9e154f39c49eaf79626d9c265fa15b74</data>
      <data key="v_content">He steadied
himself in time to hear Snape say, &quot;-- your little bit of hocus-pocus.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9e154f39c49eaf79626d9c265fa15b74</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4185">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d98972a7883bbadef083689ae5f2abde</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;m waiting.&quot;
&quot;B-but I d-d-don&apos;t --&quot;
&quot;Very well,&quot; Snape cut in.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d98972a7883bbadef083689ae5f2abde</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4186">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3214ee82de6a20da24014bbc07cbdfd5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;ll have another little chat soon, when
you&apos;ve had time to think things over and decided where your loyalties
lie.&quot;
He threw his cloak over his head and strode out of the clearing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3214ee82de6a20da24014bbc07cbdfd5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4187">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e58a96e29f9d2b29001f921422914fa7</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was
almost dark now, but Harry could see Quirrell, standing quite still as
though he was petrified.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e58a96e29f9d2b29001f921422914fa7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4188">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7e40fac375874e093f2f1784701b9173</data>
      <data key="v_content">wherehaveyou,&quot;Harry, where have you been?&quot; Hermione squeaked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7e40fac375874e093f2f1784701b9173</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4189">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-92a4557dbdf84a23c239e90f699a9de4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We won! You won! We won!&quot; shouted Ron, thumping Harry on the back.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-92a4557dbdf84a23c239e90f699a9de4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4190">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-045512ce67b4e184b38bc5d1733829dd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And
I gave Malfoy a black eye, and Neville tried to take on Crabbe and Goyle
single-handed! He&apos;s still out cold but Madam Pomftey says he&apos;ll be all
right - talk about showing Slytherin! Everyone&apos;s waiting for you in the
common room, we&apos;re having a party, Fred and George stole some cakes and
stuff from the kitchens.&quot;
&quot;Never mind that now,&quot; said Harry breathlessly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-045512ce67b4e184b38bc5d1733829dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4191">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d9940135a191fdf142af4eb3c2119d64</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Let&apos;s find an empty
room, you wait &apos;til you hear this....&quot;
He made sure Peeves wasn&apos;t inside before shutting the door behind them,
then he told them what he&apos;d seen and heard.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d9940135a191fdf142af4eb3c2119d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4192">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0a95cdf82f14f0f46a28e08589950adc</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;So we were right, it is the Sorcerer&apos;s Stone, and Snape&apos;s trying to
force Quirrell to help him get it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0a95cdf82f14f0f46a28e08589950adc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4193">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3914d32a00c2e13de8e5324f6bc49615</data>
      <data key="v_content">He asked if he knew how to get past
182
Fluffy - and he said something about Quirrell&apos;s &apos;hocus pocuss-- I reckon
there are other things guarding the stone apart from Fluffy, loads of
enchantments, probably, and Quirrell would have done some anti-Dark Arts
spell that Snape needs to break through --&quot;
&quot;So you mean the Stone&apos;s only safe as long as Quirrell stands up to
Snape?&quot; said Hermione in alarm.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3914d32a00c2e13de8e5324f6bc49615</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4194">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9348deedabc9ecf9142d626bdd86e5f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;ll be gone by next Tuesday,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9348deedabc9ecf9142d626bdd86e5f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4195">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9b63cd6229d2b695c1ec815533f59e7f</data>
      <data key="v_content">CHAPTER FOURTEEN
NORBERT THE NORWEGIAN RIDGEBACK
Quirrell, however, must have been braver than they&apos;d thought.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9b63cd6229d2b695c1ec815533f59e7f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4196">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a57815dc04be3f19501fd0d863e5845b</data>
      <data key="v_content">In the
weeks that followed he did seem to be getting paler and thinner, but it
didn&apos;t look as though he&apos;d cracked yet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a57815dc04be3f19501fd0d863e5845b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4197">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3519c04010820c7666165fa59355f709</data>
      <data key="v_content">Every time they passed the third-floor corridor, Harry, Ron, and
Hermione would press their ears to the door to check that Fluffy was
still growling inside.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3519c04010820c7666165fa59355f709</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4198">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a94c6840a95385cc97c9858e0d6f63c8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape was sweeping about in his usual bad temper,
which surely meant that the Stone was still safe.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a94c6840a95385cc97c9858e0d6f63c8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4199">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-15d0ae161fe0417883de57becab1802a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Whenever Harry passed
Quirrell these days he gave him an encouraging sort of smile, and Ron
had started telling people off for laughing at Quirrell&apos;s stutter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-15d0ae161fe0417883de57becab1802a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4200">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b3e0c47096dbd317a6f9108d078ea18b</data>
      <data key="v_content">however,hadmore,Hermione, however, had more on her mind than the Sorcerer&apos;s Stone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b3e0c47096dbd317a6f9108d078ea18b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4201">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6875085892752b876bc2ce218ab20d5c</data>
      <data key="v_content">She
had started drawing up study schedules and colorcoding all her notes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6875085892752b876bc2ce218ab20d5c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4202">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-be21483219f8e3c6b2372b40c7b9b52d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Ron wouldn&apos;t have minded, but she kept nagging them to do the
same.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-be21483219f8e3c6b2372b40c7b9b52d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4203">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c1c65b258a2e7a6dea40e0cc23b03b9b</data>
      <data key="v_content">theexamsare,&quot;Hermione, the exams are ages away.&quot;
&quot;Ten weeks,&quot; Hermione snapped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c1c65b258a2e7a6dea40e0cc23b03b9b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4204">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4ee796ce33a98b214e9f0244b242b396</data>
      <data key="v_content">that&apos;s,&quot;That&apos;s not ages, that&apos;s like a second to
Nicolas Flamel.&quot;
&quot;But we&apos;re not six hundred years old,&quot; Ron reminded her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4ee796ce33a98b214e9f0244b242b396</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4205">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4daa3bd3fc19f9fb1c3a7ad7d0b4bad3</data>
      <data key="v_content">whatareyou,&quot;Anyway, what
are you studying for, you already know it A.&quot;
&quot;What am I studying for? Are you crazy? You realize we need to pass
these exams to get into the second year? They&apos;re very important, I
should have started studying a month ago, I don&apos;t know what&apos;s gotten
into me....&quot;
183
Unfortunately, the teachers seemed to be thinking along the same lines
as Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4daa3bd3fc19f9fb1c3a7ad7d0b4bad3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4206">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c312ad23983c9c17d43df1eae279d7bb</data>
      <data key="v_content">They piled so much homework on them that the Easter
holidays weren&apos;t nearly as much fun as the Christmas ones.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c312ad23983c9c17d43df1eae279d7bb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4207">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cea4b63b9151aea71fe3c1328094d66a</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was hard
to relax with Hermione next to you reciting the twelve uses of dragon&apos;s
blood or practicing wand movements.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cea4b63b9151aea71fe3c1328094d66a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4208">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-251f687e9dbb77e866672077af9edef4</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry,Moaning and yawning, Harry and Ron
spent most of their free time in the library with her, trying to get
through all their extra work.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-251f687e9dbb77e866672077af9edef4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4209">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-992fdae2b23f078bf86f5a15455429f9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;I&apos;ll never remember this,&quot; Ron burst out one afternoon, throwing down
his quill and looking longingly out of the library window.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-992fdae2b23f078bf86f5a15455429f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4210">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a28d948cde98da1db117490667e58c4c</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was the
first really fine day they&apos;d had in months.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a28d948cde98da1db117490667e58c4c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4211">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-96135dd70c55f7269a29ef0d6d8101de</data>
      <data key="v_content">The sky was a clear,
forget-me-not blue, and there was a feeling in the air of summer coming.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-96135dd70c55f7269a29ef0d6d8101de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4212">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-93999771b40907dc71fdabb59a2d6dd6</data>
      <data key="v_content">whowaslooking,Harry, who was looking up &quot;Dittany&quot; in One Thousand Magical Herbs and
Fungi, didn&apos;t look up until he heard Ron say, &quot;Hagrid! What are you
doing in the library?&quot;
Hagrid shuffled into view, hiding something behind his back.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-93999771b40907dc71fdabb59a2d6dd6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4213">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-06cf8ae261899c3bd255fb0af803bf03</data>
      <data key="v_content">He looked
very out of place in his moleskin overcoat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-06cf8ae261899c3bd255fb0af803bf03</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4214">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-058e8a585f32c4e5dceaf955ded4f33c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;hesaid,,&quot;Jus&apos; lookin&apos;,&quot; he said, in a shifty voice that got their interest at
once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-058e8a585f32c4e5dceaf955ded4f33c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4215">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-322661642c1e340c88e984050706d3a6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;An&apos; what&apos;re you lot up ter?&quot; He looked suddenly suspicious.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-322661642c1e340c88e984050706d3a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4216">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c3e1712a39051bc69bd1b3097398409f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Yer
not still lookin&apos; fer Nicolas Flamel, are yeh?&quot; &quot;Oh, we found out who he
is ages ago,&quot; said Ron impressively.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c3e1712a39051bc69bd1b3097398409f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4217">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca65c84ffe724360bbd8611eece6bc56</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And we know what that dog&apos;s
guarding, it&apos;s a Sorcerer&apos;s St --&quot;
&quot;Shhhh!&quot; Hagrid looked around quickly to see if anyone was listening.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca65c84ffe724360bbd8611eece6bc56</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4218">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5bc37a164768e4cc2c39daa0e9afd0f3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Don&apos; go shoutin&apos; about it, what&apos;s the matter with yeh?&quot;
&quot;There are a few things we wanted to ask you, as a matter of fact,&quot; said
Harry, &quot;about what&apos;s guarding the Stone apart from Fluffy --&quot;
&quot;SHHHH!&quot; said Hagrid again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5bc37a164768e4cc2c39daa0e9afd0f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4219">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e9c2e442b438852ce5f5419746f5e5ac</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Listen - come an&apos; see me later, I&apos;m not
promisin&apos; I&apos;ll tell yeh anythin&apos;, mind, but don&apos; go rabbitin&apos; about it
in here, students aren&apos; s&apos;pposed ter know.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e9c2e442b438852ce5f5419746f5e5ac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4220">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-86ff63b8dbfb123cbc1a748a8cc8dbc1</data>
      <data key="v_content">They&apos;ll think I&apos;ve told yeh
--&quot;
&quot;See you later, then,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-86ff63b8dbfb123cbc1a748a8cc8dbc1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4221">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e8b6c48ad3ec95827e65577679d71243</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What was he hiding behind his back?&quot; said Hermione thoughtfully.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e8b6c48ad3ec95827e65577679d71243</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4222">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6153f3d944ed8448a900f3706e124a94</data>
      <data key="v_content">184
&quot;Do you think it had anything to do with the Stone?&quot;
&quot;I&apos;m going to see what section he was in,&quot; said Ron, who&apos;d had enough of
working.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6153f3d944ed8448a900f3706e124a94</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4223">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-21d4473ea17d95cbbc6b0d55cae6c6a9</data>
      <data key="v_content">He came back a minute later with a pile of books in his arms
and slammed them down on the table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-21d4473ea17d95cbbc6b0d55cae6c6a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4224">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8bf740f1084d3064d12f742970f1d0b2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Hagrid was looking up stuff about dragons!
Look at these: Dragon Species of Great Britain and Ireland; From Egg to
Inferno, A Dragon Keeper&apos;s Guide.&quot;
&quot;Hagrid&apos;s always wanted a dragon, he told me so the first time I ever
met him, &quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8bf740f1084d3064d12f742970f1d0b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4225">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd69ca3fff818c0e0bba26b4bf76c256</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But it&apos;s against our laws,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd69ca3fff818c0e0bba26b4bf76c256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4226">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6f9fc37789cf2a8358bb89c26c18113a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Dragon breeding was outlawed by
the Warlocks&apos; Convention of 1709, everyone knows that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6f9fc37789cf2a8358bb89c26c18113a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4227">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-44a0fcec76b8975bc6fa1b68647c3429</data>
      <data key="v_content">It&apos;s hard to stop
Muggles from noticing us if we&apos;re keeping dragons in the back garden -
anyway, you can&apos;t tame dragons, it&apos;s dangerous.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-44a0fcec76b8975bc6fa1b68647c3429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4228">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cc9adf43a1da3c7ec2711d9682aba1de</data>
      <data key="v_content">You should see the burns
Charlie&apos;s got off wild ones in Romania.&quot;
&quot;But there aren&apos;t wild dragons in Britain?&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cc9adf43a1da3c7ec2711d9682aba1de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4229">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f731b74db62bedb860573759f77d6e5b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;Of course there are,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f731b74db62bedb860573759f77d6e5b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4230">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b8c2f699b3aefdf30bf4a1fd6eca02c2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Common Welsh Green and Hebridean
Blacks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b8c2f699b3aefdf30bf4a1fd6eca02c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4231">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-030e1aea85f2d08e662b592747f64dbf</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Ministry of Magic has a job hushing them up, I can tell you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-030e1aea85f2d08e662b592747f64dbf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4232">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c983af8eebe48c5c2c93e824abf70542</data>
      <data key="v_content">Our kind have to keep putting spells on Muggles who&apos;ve spotted them, to
make them forget.&quot;
&quot;So what on earths Hagrid up to?&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c983af8eebe48c5c2c93e824abf70542</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4233">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a8684b921f06bff5f9d8546170ec645a</data>
      <data key="v_content">When they knocked on the door of the gamekeeper&apos;s hut an hour later,
they were surprised to see that all the curtains were closed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a8684b921f06bff5f9d8546170ec645a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4234">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6ec8f3c18e180be1b2a037d1a08d42d5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid
called &quot;Who is it?&quot; before he let them in, and then shut the door
quickly behind them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6ec8f3c18e180be1b2a037d1a08d42d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4235">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5e8ce9aa2e92d14478b060ba3d38fd5f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Even though it was such a warm day, there
was a blazing fire in the grate.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5e8ce9aa2e92d14478b060ba3d38fd5f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4236">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d6d64a8ccf1b2e4777d158ba83c3a280</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid made them tea and offered them
stoat sandwiches, which they refused.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d6d64a8ccf1b2e4777d158ba83c3a280</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4237">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cd037bbb16607bd2337c0600c55028d6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So -- yeh wanted to ask me somethin&apos;?&quot;
&quot;Yes,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cd037bbb16607bd2337c0600c55028d6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4238">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9879f34d4eb2ea2f615381c0adf5a3e3</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was no point beating around the bush.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9879f34d4eb2ea2f615381c0adf5a3e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4239">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6e21f371e4aa0548140c73f04b4b6643</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We were
wondering if you could tell us what&apos;s guarding the Sorcerer&apos;s Stone
apart from Fluffy.&quot;
185
Hagrid frowned at him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6e21f371e4aa0548140c73f04b4b6643</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4240">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bc62962fe181733d75aaaa148a58d3fc</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;0&apos; course I cant, he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bc62962fe181733d75aaaa148a58d3fc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4241">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c75fb34d3b95ec330a6459d264e8170c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Idon&apos;,&quot;Number one, I don&apos; know meself.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c75fb34d3b95ec330a6459d264e8170c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4242">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e783aaeccb6f37fddf364f581a64b86f</data>
      <data key="v_content">yehknow,Number two,
yeh know too much already, so I wouldn&apos; tell yeh if I could.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e783aaeccb6f37fddf364f581a64b86f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4243">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6ae84ae2d8644c46ec6d266a980e9485</data>
      <data key="v_content">That
Stone&apos;s here fer a good reason.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6ae84ae2d8644c46ec6d266a980e9485</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4244">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b47abeafe686159ed5c18ca8d8eea3ca</data>
      <data key="v_content">It Was almost stolen outta Gringotts - I
s&apos;ppose yeh&apos;ve worked that out an&apos; all? Beats me how yeh even know abou&apos;
Fluffy.&quot;
&quot;Oh, come on, Hagrid, you might not want to tell us, but you do know,
you know everything that goes on round here,&quot; said Hermione in a warm,
flattering voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b47abeafe686159ed5c18ca8d8eea3ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4245">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cf953edabd2dccf7be56b95ac1ac4f53</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid&apos;s beard twitched and they could tell he was
smiling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cf953edabd2dccf7be56b95ac1ac4f53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4246">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0f21e326519311fe97bcdcea3e499ff4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We only wondered who had done the guarding, really.&quot; Hermione
went on.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0f21e326519311fe97bcdcea3e499ff4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4247">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e0c998d90659dd2ed2db1466dda8ffb1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We wondered who Dumbledore had trusted enough to help him,
apart from you.&quot;
Hagrid&apos;s chest swelled at these last words.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e0c998d90659dd2ed2db1466dda8ffb1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4248">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bd9ada2720e71314e92bb8ed269b93a4</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Ron beamed at
Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bd9ada2720e71314e92bb8ed269b93a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4249">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f7715c371d884de217389f33ca5bff2f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Idon&apos;s&apos;pose,&quot;Well, I don&apos; s&apos;pose it could hurt ter tell yeh that...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f7715c371d884de217389f33ca5bff2f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4250">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2761578016f1d4bb932787475dbba779</data>
      <data key="v_content">then some o&apos; the teachers did enchantments...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2761578016f1d4bb932787475dbba779</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4251">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0b960c8c5f5eedd6da16b8325fe7c723</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor Sprout -- Professor Flitwick -- Professor McGonagall --&quot; he
ticked them off on his fingers, &quot;Professor Quirrell -- an&apos; Dumbledore
himself did somethin&apos;, o&apos; course.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0b960c8c5f5eedd6da16b8325fe7c723</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4252">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fcc81e2a8f8d38bbeceaed1e7af334b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">ProfessorSnape.&quot;,Oh
yeah, Professor Snape.&quot;
&quot;Snape?&quot;
&quot;Yeah -- yer not still on abou&apos; that, are yeh? Look, Snape helped
protect the Stone, he&apos;s not about ter steal it.&quot;
Harry knew Ron and Hermione were thinking the same as he was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fcc81e2a8f8d38bbeceaed1e7af334b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4253">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-68e1580fb9b280ea5b7f4bf3349f586f</data>
      <data key="v_content">If Snape
had been in on protecting the Stone, it must have been easy to find out
how the other teachers had guarded it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-68e1580fb9b280ea5b7f4bf3349f586f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4254">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8e8d676d29180c2d595eadd26104df28</data>
      <data key="v_content">He probably knew everything --
except, it seemed, Quirrell&apos;s spell and how to get past Fluffy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8e8d676d29180c2d595eadd26104df28</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4255">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7f65371eda07ffe5c15834f13a9065a6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;re the only one who knows how to get past Fluffy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7f65371eda07ffe5c15834f13a9065a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4256">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca7e6b1dddec86f25a71fb1e00b956a7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid?&quot;said,aren&apos;t you,
Hagrid?&quot; said Harry anxiously.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca7e6b1dddec86f25a71fb1e00b956a7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4257">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a931f714146c18dc127ff0e26baa1940</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And you wouldn&apos;t tell anyone, would you?
Not even one of the teachers?&quot;
&quot;Not a soul knows except me an&apos; Dumbledore,&quot; said Hagrid proudly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a931f714146c18dc127ff0e26baa1940</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4258">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-78ec2a83f5dfbe81254ff3d8586d1a6c</data>
      <data key="v_content">that&apos;ssomething,&quot;Harry,&quot;Well, that&apos;s something,&quot; Harry muttered to the others.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-78ec2a83f5dfbe81254ff3d8586d1a6c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4259">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2d27521e2864bd0553446fc426751d16</data>
      <data key="v_content">canwe186,&quot;Hagrid, can we
186
have a window open? I&apos;m boiling.&quot;
&quot;Can&apos;t, Harry, sorry,&quot; said Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2d27521e2864bd0553446fc426751d16</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4260">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-283cb353a9dbcb633c0d215983679765</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry noticed him glance at the
fire.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-283cb353a9dbcb633c0d215983679765</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4261">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5c735c985c1a37a688b05e9fcebd47d2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Hagrid -- what&apos;s that?&quot;
But he already knew what it was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5c735c985c1a37a688b05e9fcebd47d2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4262">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ad92667dc0bb27ae79244300420063e3</data>
      <data key="v_content">In the very heart of the fire,
underneath the kettle, was a huge, black egg.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ad92667dc0bb27ae79244300420063e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4263">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4b225216124c587f030fe7bc412ac43e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidHagrid,fiddling,&quot;Ah,&quot; said Hagrid, fiddling nervously with his beard, &quot;That&apos;s er...&quot;
&quot;Where did you get it, Hagrid?&quot; said Ron, crouching over the fire to get
a closer look at the egg.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4b225216124c587f030fe7bc412ac43e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4264">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bb3ff83571756a0c3ff6060586eaf941</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It must&apos;ve cost you a fortune.&quot;
&quot;Won it,&quot; said Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bb3ff83571756a0c3ff6060586eaf941</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4265">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-647ab2fd4007bedb5d255eadb557f558</data>
      <data key="v_content">I was down in the village havin&apos; a
few drinks an&apos; got into a game o&apos; cards with a stranger.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-647ab2fd4007bedb5d255eadb557f558</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4266">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-63b71dab4c692011661f05ac1868faac</data>
      <data key="v_content">Think he was
quite glad ter get rid of it, ter be honest.&quot;
&quot;But what are you going to do with it when it&apos;s hatched?&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-63b71dab4c692011661f05ac1868faac</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4267">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d53e92fcd16a2be3e585574bf6148703</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;vebindoin&apos;,&quot;Well, I&apos;ve bin doin&apos; some readin&apos; , said Hagrid, pulling a large book
from under his pillow.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d53e92fcd16a2be3e585574bf6148703</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4268">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6d4e0e355525c91643344e6eaab63beb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Got this outta the library -- Dragon Breeding
for Pleasure and Profit -- it&apos;s a bit outta date, o&apos; course, but it&apos;s
all in here.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6d4e0e355525c91643344e6eaab63beb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4269">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b80cbdd4c0a4b105c813a0b4ec993f64</data>
      <data key="v_content">Keep the egg in the fire, &apos;cause their mothers breathe on I
em, see, an&apos; when it hatches, feed it on a bucket o&apos; brandy mixed with
chicken blood every half hour.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b80cbdd4c0a4b105c813a0b4ec993f64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4270">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8a220a250028c0f0008bd2926f9f9b42</data>
      <data key="v_content">An&apos; see here -- how ter recognize
diff&apos;rent eggs -- what I got there&apos;s a Norwegian Ridgeback.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8a220a250028c0f0008bd2926f9f9b42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4271">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ed4cc349a88065eab3153cf8dd56ef50</data>
      <data key="v_content">them.&quot;He,They&apos;re
rare, them.&quot;
He looked very pleased with himself, but Hermione didn&apos;t.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ed4cc349a88065eab3153cf8dd56ef50</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4272">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2836b35e09947a326978df27d77bcf1d</data>
      <data key="v_content">youlivein,&quot;Hagrid, you live in a wooden house,&quot; she said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2836b35e09947a326978df27d77bcf1d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4273">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7e7f001b39b4429391e7239f7b521227</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was humming merrily as he stoked the
fire.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7e7f001b39b4429391e7239f7b521227</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4274">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-53b2685bbe4167685a6a21d3beea07fb</data>
      <data key="v_content">So now they had something else to worry about: what might happen to
Hagrid if anyone found out he was hiding an illegal dragon in his hut.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-53b2685bbe4167685a6a21d3beea07fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4275">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5132ff09bbf5d792556ba976888ecd2f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Wonder what it&apos;s like to have a peaceful life,&quot; Ron sighed, as evening
after evening they struggled through all the extra homework they were
getting.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5132ff09bbf5d792556ba976888ecd2f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4276">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e642f1659c6d22e327932abcf161b78b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione had now started making study schedules for Harry and
Ron, too.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e642f1659c6d22e327932abcf161b78b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4277">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-904927dfb0053507d1ceaddb8eec9494</data>
      <data key="v_content">onebreakfast,187
Then, one breakfast time, Hedwig brought Harry another note from Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-904927dfb0053507d1ceaddb8eec9494</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4278">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d41c20cdfaa6fa9bc7c5456d1def1513</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had written only two words: It&apos;s hatching.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d41c20cdfaa6fa9bc7c5456d1def1513</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4279">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8fa81a116286473ab4a20ce316352cc1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron wanted to skip Herbology and go straight down to the hut.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8fa81a116286473ab4a20ce316352cc1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4280">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c40a36b35542c49cba54c18e7041548e</data>
      <data key="v_content">howmanytimes,&quot;Hermione, how many times in our lives are we going to see a dragon
hatching?&quot;
&quot;We&apos;ve got lessons, we&apos;ll get into trouble, and that&apos;s nothing to what
Hagrid&apos;s going to be in when someone finds out what he&apos;s doing --&quot;
&quot;Shut up!&quot; Harry whispered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c40a36b35542c49cba54c18e7041548e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4281">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-718f591ee2a8da4b29b1738809262f90</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy was only a few feet away and he had stopped dead to listen.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-718f591ee2a8da4b29b1738809262f90</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4282">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-750986a8a93855389a30b526544ae241</data>
      <data key="v_content">How
much had he heard? Harry didn&apos;t like the look on Malfoy&apos;s face at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-750986a8a93855389a30b526544ae241</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4283">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b8690bbaab90bce1d254d44ec2b5316a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron and Hermione argued all the way to Herbology and in the end,
Hermione agreed to run down to Hagrid&apos;s with the other two during
morning break.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b8690bbaab90bce1d254d44ec2b5316a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4284">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b64e01fff3caab53ff7ca6c2ed18aa0f</data>
      <data key="v_content">When the bell sounded from the castle at the end of their
lesson, the three of them dropped their trowels at once and hurried
through the grounds to the edge of the forest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b64e01fff3caab53ff7ca6c2ed18aa0f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4285">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bcab8948052cf522db30c9b540e427c3</data>
      <data key="v_content">looking,Hagrid greeted them,
looking flushed and excited.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bcab8948052cf522db30c9b540e427c3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4286">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f69d620edf685743982a6268a8ae0b84</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s nearly out.&quot; He ushered them inside.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f69d620edf685743982a6268a8ae0b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4287">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-95bfcc6430999e9aa70c5b730d0f49b0</data>
      <data key="v_content">The egg was lying on the table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-95bfcc6430999e9aa70c5b730d0f49b0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4288">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fccb007ae35756d36af2243e0faffc34</data>
      <data key="v_content">There were deep cracks in it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fccb007ae35756d36af2243e0faffc34</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4289">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7b1aa7bb8aa5eb13355864cbb92f27e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Something
was moving inside; a funny clicking noise was coming from it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7b1aa7bb8aa5eb13355864cbb92f27e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4290">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8e116b67d9443ce2112b1d1f5679f89c</data>
      <data key="v_content">They all drew their chairs up to the table and watched with bated
breath.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8e116b67d9443ce2112b1d1f5679f89c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4291">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-49be3ba51d786e39420bbfc032e35080</data>
      <data key="v_content">All at once there was a scraping noise and the egg split open.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-49be3ba51d786e39420bbfc032e35080</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4292">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-489579566d82fd9a62104d7fb9572b7c</data>
      <data key="v_content">The baby
dragon flopped onto the table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-489579566d82fd9a62104d7fb9572b7c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4293">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-35874a5ef0176e1624944df2a6d9a2c1</data>
      <data key="v_content">It wasn&apos;t exactly pretty; Harry thought
it looked like a crumpled, black umbrella.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-35874a5ef0176e1624944df2a6d9a2c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4294">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d76387fbae3e04aab6f8373039ab730c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Its spiny wings were huge
compared to its skinny jet body, it had a long snout with wide nostrils,
the stubs of horns and bulging, orange eyes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d76387fbae3e04aab6f8373039ab730c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4295">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9fd14dab6b3eff3a307591484ddc7868</data>
      <data key="v_content">A couple of sparks flew out of its snout.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9fd14dab6b3eff3a307591484ddc7868</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4296">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d6cf187b7056c1d0de370e41d9fb42f3</data>
      <data key="v_content">He reached out a hand to stroke
the dragon&apos;s head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d6cf187b7056c1d0de370e41d9fb42f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4297">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f5528c49f323339c99df12c06fdcea34</data>
      <data key="v_content">It snapped at his fingers, showing pointed fangs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f5528c49f323339c99df12c06fdcea34</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4298">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-767f3123c188c06155ab0bbcbe155e5e</data>
      <data key="v_content">look,,188
&quot;Bless him, look, he knows his mommy!&quot; said Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-767f3123c188c06155ab0bbcbe155e5e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4299">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f36f3579a438fc8fa2acdd0bc2c24296</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidHermione,&quot;how,&quot;Hagrid,&quot; said Hermione, &quot;how fast do Norwegian Ridgebacks grow,
exactly?&quot;
Hagrid was about to answer when the color suddenly drained from his face
-- he leapt to his feet and ran to the window.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f36f3579a438fc8fa2acdd0bc2c24296</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4300">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-95a5970b9f05e3840a3b87da772e90e3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What&apos;s the matter?&quot;
&quot;Someone was lookin&apos; through the gap in the curtains -- it&apos;s a kid --
he&apos;s runnin&apos; back up ter the school.&quot;
Harry bolted to the door and looked out.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-95a5970b9f05e3840a3b87da772e90e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4301">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c8c2044eb422b4fdf5337647e81d6688</data>
      <data key="v_content">Even at a distance there was no
mistaking him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c8c2044eb422b4fdf5337647e81d6688</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4302">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e8191b700084408db237a6c371ca5af0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Something about the smile lurking on Malfoy&apos;s face during the next week
made Harry, Ron, and Hermione very nervous.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e8191b700084408db237a6c371ca5af0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4303">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e3434198a93678e796c0ad03b3929fa5</data>
      <data key="v_content">They spent most of their
free time in Hagrid&apos;s darkened hut, trying to reason with him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e3434198a93678e796c0ad03b3929fa5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4304">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-50afddee3a32d4cda9fcd7a0cbb0d853</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;Just let him go,&quot; Harry urged.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-50afddee3a32d4cda9fcd7a0cbb0d853</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4305">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-05a27a98b03fc60b431971c8b47c200f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Set him free.&quot;
&quot;I can&apos;t,&quot; said Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-05a27a98b03fc60b431971c8b47c200f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4306">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e80bda14138f04bb4bc574a70467fe50</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;d die.&quot;
They looked at the dragon.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e80bda14138f04bb4bc574a70467fe50</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4307">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-76beec556e57ef8bd1a81d96e5ea2f70</data>
      <data key="v_content">It had grown three times in length in just a
week.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-76beec556e57ef8bd1a81d96e5ea2f70</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4308">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-66c867abfd4ef4b88103f42abc871318</data>
      <data key="v_content">Smoke kept furling out of its nostrils.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-66c867abfd4ef4b88103f42abc871318</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4309">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4aae9b4d433fe96ecb104b5c904c2251</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid hadn&apos;t been doing
his gamekeeping duties because the dragon was keeping him so busy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4aae9b4d433fe96ecb104b5c904c2251</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4310">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d81a35045d619b4ae5ab0f989c555c0b</data>
      <data key="v_content">There
were empty brandy bottles and chicken feathers all over the floor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d81a35045d619b4ae5ab0f989c555c0b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4311">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0664ab9b44bc1db52c5e24d611352dae</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;ve decided to call him Norbert,&quot; said Hagrid, looking at the dragon
with misty eyes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0664ab9b44bc1db52c5e24d611352dae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4312">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7a9a5fab2da794ec89471ab5a7908b89</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He really knows me now, watch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7a9a5fab2da794ec89471ab5a7908b89</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4313">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-27500370bbbf51f93c9e87d5b1f69b82</data>
      <data key="v_content">Norbert! Norbert!
Where&apos;s Mommy?&quot;
&quot;He&apos;s lost his marbles,&quot; Ron muttered in Harry&apos;s ear.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-27500370bbbf51f93c9e87d5b1f69b82</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4314">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3acf70b53f33dd4cb1a48e33d8549f75</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidHarryloudly,,&quot;Hagrid,&quot; said Harry loudly, &quot;give it two weeks and Norbert&apos;s going to
be as long as your house.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3acf70b53f33dd4cb1a48e33d8549f75</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4315">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-60a99d6db5cecad5e9153d245002daff</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy could go to Dumbledore at any moment.&quot;
Hagrid bit his lip.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-60a99d6db5cecad5e9153d245002daff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4316">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1c81e3c1c8c38c95e61000fb63c253f9</data>
      <data key="v_content">189
&quot;I -- I know I can&apos;t keep him forever, but I can&apos;t jus&apos; dump him, I
can&apos;t.&quot;
Harry suddenly turned to Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1c81e3c1c8c38c95e61000fb63c253f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4317">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cacd0732ef85c5b74e06e90a9f2a41c7</data>
      <data key="v_content">too,&quot;,&quot;You&apos;re losing it, too,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cacd0732ef85c5b74e06e90a9f2a41c7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4318">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f0c875c1695a6b275da9e0409eae5a40</data>
      <data key="v_content">remember?&quot;&quot;No,&quot;I&apos;m Ron, remember?&quot;
&quot;No -- Charlie -- your brother, Charlie.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f0c875c1695a6b275da9e0409eae5a40</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4319">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8181550db4756dac5a9c2b81ad668cb2</data>
      <data key="v_content">We could send Norbert to him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8181550db4756dac5a9c2b81ad668cb2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4320">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ea10bd68f925d0fbc59e76cf4c603104</data>
      <data key="v_content">Charlie can take care of him and then put
him back in the wild!&quot;
&quot;Brilliant!&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ea10bd68f925d0fbc59e76cf4c603104</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4321">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7770883fff85f15594925eefd2aa3093</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid?&quot;,&quot;How about it, Hagrid?&quot;
And in the end, Hagrid agreed that they could send -an owl to Charlie to
ask him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7770883fff85f15594925eefd2aa3093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4322">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fe16892e2deaf28e6061adcfd3d76d4b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Wednesday night found Hermione and Harry
sitting alone in the common room, long after everyone else had gone to
bed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fe16892e2deaf28e6061adcfd3d76d4b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4323">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5a62be588006be54d783f820b622392</data>
      <data key="v_content">The clock on the wall had just
chimed midnight when the portrait hole burst open.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5a62be588006be54d783f820b622392</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4324">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-546e0879266ebccb98535e1c3386b389</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron appeared out of
nowhere as he pulled off Harry&apos;s invisibility cloak.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-546e0879266ebccb98535e1c3386b389</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4325">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-faa3750b431a8529949bd11752f7f5fa</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had been down at
Hagrid&apos;s hut, helping him feed Norbert, who was now eating dead rats by
the crate.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-faa3750b431a8529949bd11752f7f5fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4326">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a38cec436dd7350ae9be075f5e92661f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It bit me!&quot; he said, showing them his hand, which was wrapped in a
bloody handkerchief.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a38cec436dd7350ae9be075f5e92661f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4327">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ba038105586c40a02e7e3396ba542122</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;m not going to be able to hold a quill for a
week.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ba038105586c40a02e7e3396ba542122</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4328">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c26abde7932b07ba6c85d00f84097057</data>
      <data key="v_content">that,I tell you, that dragon&apos;s the most horrible animal I&apos;ve ever met,
but the way Hagrid goes on about it, you&apos;d think it was a fluffy little
bunny rabbit.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c26abde7932b07ba6c85d00f84097057</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4329">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-041289fcd15e8c1529d23a7dc43d6112</data>
      <data key="v_content">When it bit me he told me off for frightening it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-041289fcd15e8c1529d23a7dc43d6112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4330">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-071e7e86a1f27de4daebd6583f567c32</data>
      <data key="v_content">,And when
I left, he was singing it a lullaby.&quot;
There was a tap on the dark window.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-071e7e86a1f27de4daebd6583f567c32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4331">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6b8e08f84de80fb9448622b1101a9110</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;It&apos;s Hedwig!&quot; said Harry, hurrying to let her in.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6b8e08f84de80fb9448622b1101a9110</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4332">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-85b53ce12425eb4ac625b5abb357cd83</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;She&apos;ll have
Charlie&apos;s answer!&quot;
The three of them put their heads together to read the note.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-85b53ce12425eb4ac625b5abb357cd83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4333">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a20cda5d357c2f20af96e972ae3694eb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Howare,Dear Ron,
How are you? Thanks for the letter -- I&apos;d be glad to take the Norwegian
Ridgeback, but it won&apos;t be easy getting him here.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a20cda5d357c2f20af96e972ae3694eb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4334">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca004901fb3af42378fc52fa23bacaa2</data>
      <data key="v_content">I think the best thing
190
will be to send him over with some friends of mine who are coming to
visit me next week.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca004901fb3af42378fc52fa23bacaa2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4335">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bc75cd720e189abfe7e0ce320550c052</data>
      <data key="v_content">theymustn&apos;t,Trouble is, they mustn&apos;t be seen carrying an illegal
dragon.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bc75cd720e189abfe7e0ce320550c052</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4336">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c6cd1e3363cd5265257aaa5df047dffb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Could you get the Ridgeback up the tallest tower at midnight on
Saturday? They can meet you there and take him away while it&apos;s still
dark.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c6cd1e3363cd5265257aaa5df047dffb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4337">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8aaa88a4fcb3f1dc35266a03e229c29d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Send me an answer as soon as possible.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8aaa88a4fcb3f1dc35266a03e229c29d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4338">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d8a10df85e7c4e299c12eb54b5cd2be9</data>
      <data key="v_content">CharlieTheylooked,Love,
Charlie
They looked at one another.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d8a10df85e7c4e299c12eb54b5cd2be9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4339">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4f7457698155504f29063385f4ce1e71</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;ve got the invisibility cloak,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4f7457698155504f29063385f4ce1e71</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4340">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-91535f0c47558e0e3f833ad46e4be606</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It shouldn&apos;t be too
difficult -- I think the cloaks big enough to cover two of us and
Norbert.&quot;
It was a mark of how bad the last week had been that the other two
agreed with him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-91535f0c47558e0e3f833ad46e4be606</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4341">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-103524625b965433aaa6970e11211dd7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Anything to get rid of Norbert -- and Malfoy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-103524625b965433aaa6970e11211dd7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4342">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-70e135dabc5e4c8013bc3cab7fdb7576</data>
      <data key="v_content">,By the next morning, Ron&apos;s bitten hand had swollen to
twice its usual size.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-70e135dabc5e4c8013bc3cab7fdb7576</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4343">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1b75e8396d26e400a3d6f56ac9bfe23c</data>
      <data key="v_content">He didn&apos;t know whether it was safe to go to Madam
Pomfrey -- would she recognize a dragon bite? By the afternoon, though,
he had no choice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1b75e8396d26e400a3d6f56ac9bfe23c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4344">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ad0ff15ecf5952f2eca7a6d93eaddb87</data>
      <data key="v_content">The cut had turned a nasty shade of green.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ad0ff15ecf5952f2eca7a6d93eaddb87</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4345">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e08f0e0fe4d425dee49f74202ecf75e0</data>
      <data key="v_content">It looked
as if Norbert&apos;s fangs were poisonous.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e08f0e0fe4d425dee49f74202ecf75e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4346">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0eaca34806e9716402090d429bb520e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry and Hermione rushed up to the hospital wing at the end of the day
to find Ron in a terrible state in bed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0eaca34806e9716402090d429bb520e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4347">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e3058ccdad7eb17c5be6bda46a3a04aa</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s not just my hand,&quot; he whispered, &quot;although that feels like it&apos;s
about to fall off.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e3058ccdad7eb17c5be6bda46a3a04aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4348">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e5ba1c0f2cb3d3695fc06b38347bc841</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy told Madam Pomfrey he wanted to borrow one of
my books so he could come and have a good laugh at me.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e5ba1c0f2cb3d3695fc06b38347bc841</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4349">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2468f75a60062f81a52928e7f119de62</data>
      <data key="v_content">He kept
threatening to tell her what really bit me -- I&apos;ve told her it was a
dog, but I don&apos;t think she believes me -I shouldn&apos;t have hit him at the
Quidditch match, that&apos;s why he&apos;s doing this.&quot;
Harry and Hermione tried to calm Ron down.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2468f75a60062f81a52928e7f119de62</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4350">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-238df0fe82e92fa1dd00d83d6822f05b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;ll all be over at midnight on Saturday,&quot; said Hermione, but this
didn&apos;t soothe Ron at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-238df0fe82e92fa1dd00d83d6822f05b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4351">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c2e9231d5c5adfc7329bc2be8dbb79f2</data>
      <data key="v_content">he,On the contrary, he sat bolt upright and broke
191
into a sweat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c2e9231d5c5adfc7329bc2be8dbb79f2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4352">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f6e82cb0c7b7c01bc4daaaf6065e57c0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Midnight on Saturday!&quot; he said in a hoarse voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f6e82cb0c7b7c01bc4daaaf6065e57c0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4353">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-264b5fd32f22cff71ab92caa02fde348</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Oh no oh no -- I&apos;ve
just remembered -- Charlie&apos;s letter was in that book Malfoy took, he&apos;s
going to know we&apos;re getting rid of Norbert.&quot;
Harry and Hermione didn&apos;t get a chance to answer.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-264b5fd32f22cff71ab92caa02fde348</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4354">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-98ecbcb7e04e9814525f82b469fbfa78</data>
      <data key="v_content">Madam Pomfrey came
over at that moment and made them leave, saying Ron needed sleep.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-98ecbcb7e04e9814525f82b469fbfa78</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4355">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e66c73e24e97aac92bc76319496ca99b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s too late to change the plan now,&quot; Harry told Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e66c73e24e97aac92bc76319496ca99b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4356">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-86b9049b2f265fa780460ba5780962a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We haven&apos;t
got time to send Charlie another owl, and this could be our only chance
to get rid of Norbert.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-86b9049b2f265fa780460ba5780962a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4357">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-474b82acc81f7a87e293c3a3db945cad</data>
      <data key="v_content">And we have got the
invisibility cloak, Malfoy doesn&apos;t know about that.&quot;
They found Fang, the boarhound, sitting outside with a bandaged tail
when they went to tell Hagrid, who opened a window to talk to them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-474b82acc81f7a87e293c3a3db945cad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4358">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-71715f8a70577154d07abb1cb6e78777</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I won&apos;t let you in,&quot; he puffed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-71715f8a70577154d07abb1cb6e78777</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4359">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b881f49f35f7c39ddd52b9cca376f7fb</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Norbert&apos;s at a tricky stage -- nothin&apos;
I can&apos;t handle.&quot;
When they told him about Charlie&apos;s letter, his eyes filled with tears,
although that might have been because Norbert had just bitten him on the
leg.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b881f49f35f7c39ddd52b9cca376f7fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4360">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4a723b583b991a5c088c9529844d441b</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Aargh! It&apos;s all right, he only got my boot -- jus&apos; playin&apos; -- he&apos;s only
a baby, after all.&quot;
The baby banged its tail on the wall, making the windows rattle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4a723b583b991a5c088c9529844d441b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4361">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-135238f80836656d1c341afc51df5474</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry
and Hermione walked back to the castle feeling Saturday couldn&apos;t come
quickly enough.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-135238f80836656d1c341afc51df5474</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4362">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-014355d81b7f0c1a0f613f3aad829f1b</data>
      <data key="v_content">They would have felt sorry for Hagrid when the time came for him to say
good-bye to Norbert if they hadn&apos;t been so worried about what they had
to do.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-014355d81b7f0c1a0f613f3aad829f1b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4363">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f52178fd41245ace04df91e44069dea8</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was a very dark, cloudy night, and they were a bit late
arriving at Hagrid&apos;s hut because they&apos;d had to wait for Peeves to get
out of their way in the entrance hall, where he&apos;d been playing tennis
against the wall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f52178fd41245ace04df91e44069dea8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4364">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3c9dfeb695308ec56c6cf8376a6a3141</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid had Norbert packed and ready in a large crate.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3c9dfeb695308ec56c6cf8376a6a3141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4365">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-14a40febc85b3f15062660daab1a105d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He&apos;s got lots o&apos; rats an&apos; some brandy fer the journey,&quot; said Hagrid in
a muffled voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-14a40febc85b3f15062660daab1a105d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4366">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-37c91d82c702a2387e5419c5ba56f169</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;An&apos; I&apos;ve packed his teddy bear in case he gets
lonely.&quot;
From inside the crate came ripping noises that sounded to Harry as
192
though the teddy was having his head torn off.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-37c91d82c702a2387e5419c5ba56f169</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4367">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e699ed4a9ed4b5268325651879363b78</data>
      <data key="v_content">Norbert!&quot;Hagridsobbed,,&quot;Bye-bye, Norbert!&quot; Hagrid sobbed, as Harry and Hermione covered the
crate with the invisibility cloak and stepped underneath it themselves.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e699ed4a9ed4b5268325651879363b78</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4368">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-29430747e24d10c46a20064683673db5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Mommy will never forget you!&quot;
How they managed to get the crate back up to the castle, they never
knew.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-29430747e24d10c46a20064683673db5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4369">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6c858bd2f51b9d7d11ecce7d7c9e8944</data>
      <data key="v_content">Midnight ticked nearer as they heaved Norbert up the marble
staircase in the entrance hall and along the dark corridors.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6c858bd2f51b9d7d11ecce7d7c9e8944</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4370">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2b50a5b6437baa57b62127b7e50da183</data>
      <data key="v_content">then,UP another
staircase, then another -- even one of Harry&apos;s shortcuts didn&apos;t make the
work much easier.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2b50a5b6437baa57b62127b7e50da183</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4371">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a2737951c5531cfeebb620bb08349af</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Nearly there!&quot; Harry panted as they reached the corridor beneath the
tallest tower.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a2737951c5531cfeebb620bb08349af</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4372">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ecd7170f056ae1636d4f7f7cb7922cc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then a sudden movement ahead of them made them almost drop the crate.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ecd7170f056ae1636d4f7f7cb7922cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4373">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-74b71f4f4465cd57de92dcca66c0f134</data>
      <data key="v_content">Forgetting that they were already invisible, they shrank into the
shadows, staring at the dark outlines of two people grappling with each
other ten feet away.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-74b71f4f4465cd57de92dcca66c0f134</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4374">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d3b7b3a865dc6c7e7cd22d132cded4c8</data>
      <data key="v_content">ina,Professor McGonagall, in a tartan bathrobe and a hair net, had Malfoy by
the ear.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d3b7b3a865dc6c7e7cd22d132cded4c8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4375">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2e541cff605db9e25636a23f8555953e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And twenty points from Slytherin! Wandering
around in the middle of the night, how dare you --&quot;
&quot;You don&apos;t understand, Professor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2e541cff605db9e25636a23f8555953e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4376">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-15e0cc814e15c6dbddc715c74fd32474</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry Potter&apos;s coming -- he&apos;s got a
dragon!&quot;
&quot;What utter rubbish! How dare you tell such lies! Come on -- I shall see
Professor Snape about you, Malfoy!&quot;
The steep spiral staircase up to the top of the tower seemed the easiest
thing in the world after that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-15e0cc814e15c6dbddc715c74fd32474</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4377">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2ad7c098d5fcea5e2846496f17ecb19f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Not until they&apos;d stepped out into the
cold night air did they throw off the cloak, glad to be able to breathe
properly again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2ad7c098d5fcea5e2846496f17ecb19f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4378">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f6e72b92763f048ca081408da3e48ac5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione did a sort of jig.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f6e72b92763f048ca081408da3e48ac5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4379">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3a630fc11ca34d5e80ee87ec310f2d29</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Malfoy&apos;s got detention! I could sing!&quot;
&quot;Don&apos;t,&quot; Harry advised her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3a630fc11ca34d5e80ee87ec310f2d29</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4380">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d34492f5d17afb7656bc27a22f47a0c2</data>
      <data key="v_content">they,Chuckling about Malfoy, they waited, Norbert thrashing about in his
crate.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d34492f5d17afb7656bc27a22f47a0c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4381">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-863204394e0c9054e32b9da880cab224</data>
      <data key="v_content">,About ten minutes later, four broomsticks came swooping down out
193
of the darkness.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-863204394e0c9054e32b9da880cab224</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4382">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-872b0a4c499ced0406268d9f609b3ea3</data>
      <data key="v_content">Charlie&apos;s friends were a cheery lot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-872b0a4c499ced0406268d9f609b3ea3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4383">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3f7c16f85ed8150d18ca76d8eb97cd1a</data>
      <data key="v_content">They showed Harry and Hermione the
harness they&apos;d rigged up, so they could suspend Norbert between them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3f7c16f85ed8150d18ca76d8eb97cd1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4384">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9a9e258a63d2e40b1ae90de9c0272640</data>
      <data key="v_content">They all helped buckle Norbert safely into it and then Harry and
Hermione shook hands with the others and thanked them very much.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9a9e258a63d2e40b1ae90de9c0272640</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4385">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0518291cda06f27c40d636bdc1ce8c36</data>
      <data key="v_content">They slipped back down the spiral staircase, their hearts as light as
their hands, now that Norbert was off them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0518291cda06f27c40d636bdc1ce8c36</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4386">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-175dd483a66d0c6e37c9af3d0caaa626</data>
      <data key="v_content">No more dragon -- Malfoy in
detention -- what could spoil their happiness?
The answer to that was waiting at the foot of the stairs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-175dd483a66d0c6e37c9af3d0caaa626</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4387">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-94cc7883caf1c12d4d655e94dbd315c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">As they
stepped into the corridor, Filch&apos;s face loomed suddenly out of the
darkness.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-94cc7883caf1c12d4d655e94dbd315c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4388">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-668174d2af4eb9104c1f8f879a8e665e</data>
      <data key="v_content">well,well,&quot;he,&quot;Well, well, well,&quot; he whispered, &quot;we are in trouble.&quot;
They&apos;d left the invisibility cloak on top of the tower.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-668174d2af4eb9104c1f8f879a8e665e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4389">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-56e464c74d64c574ef9aac200d040809</data>
      <data key="v_content">CHAPTER FIFTEEN
THE FORIBIDDEN FOREST
Things couldn&apos;t have been worse.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-56e464c74d64c574ef9aac200d040809</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4390">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5dbc636e196b3e4c122e536556ae4a8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Filch took them down to Professor McGonagall&apos;s study on the first floor,
where they sat and waited without saying a word to each other.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5dbc636e196b3e4c122e536556ae4a8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4391">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d41c977a1280579f0abd6cfc10abb6ea</data>
      <data key="v_content">alibis,andwild,Excuses, alibis, and wild cover- up stories chased each
other around Harry&apos;s brain, each more feeble than the last.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d41c977a1280579f0abd6cfc10abb6ea</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4392">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f953fb709399e3df99af3db5091c1556</data>
      <data key="v_content">He couldn&apos;t
see how they were going to get out of trouble this time.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f953fb709399e3df99af3db5091c1556</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4393">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d1fda69f5859002469959449fe891e62</data>
      <data key="v_content">How could they have been so stupid as to forget the cloak?
There was no reason on earth that Professor McGonagall would accept for
their being out of bed and creeping around the school in the dead of
night, let alone being up the tallest astronomy tower, which was
out-of-bounds except for classes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d1fda69f5859002469959449fe891e62</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4394">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-777039877fc33525a9b74c1b41f7711e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Add Norbert and the invisibility
cloak, and they might as well be packing their bags already.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-777039877fc33525a9b74c1b41f7711e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4395">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f467c74e79d228c0462a582e38e1cd3b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Had Harry thought that things couldn&apos;t have been worse? He was wrong.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f467c74e79d228c0462a582e38e1cd3b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4396">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a99b5fc322f2656af60091bd81526aa6</data>
      <data key="v_content">,When Professor McGonagall appeared, she was leading Neville.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a99b5fc322f2656af60091bd81526aa6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4397">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f82d5cb9ad55a09fea046a4bd63dc4e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">194
&quot;Harry!&quot; Neville burst Out, the moment he saw the other two.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f82d5cb9ad55a09fea046a4bd63dc4e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4398">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca6b7fe9f8908c3ef10c18a17e2c2ecd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I was
trying to find you to warn you, I heard Malfoy saying he was going to
catch you, he said you had a drag --&quot;
Harry shook his head violently to shut Neville up, but Professor
McGonagall had seen.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca6b7fe9f8908c3ef10c18a17e2c2ecd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4399">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f22e14e192a01c466a72b8cd82321a1e</data>
      <data key="v_content">She looked more likely to breathe fire than Norbert
as she towered over the three of them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f22e14e192a01c466a72b8cd82321a1e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4400">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ff4c133f2241c50db5600534e5386294</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I would never have believed it of any of you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ff4c133f2241c50db5600534e5386294</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4401">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dff422ce39007649beb768b24996acf9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Filch says you were
up in the astronomy tower.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dff422ce39007649beb768b24996acf9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4402">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b246eb25771a185f70dcecd3b0b059da</data>
      <data key="v_content">It&apos;s one o&apos;clock in the morning.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b246eb25771a185f70dcecd3b0b059da</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4403">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9238a7846f7940e4eb3256072439fa1a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Explain
yourselves.&quot;
It was the first time Hermione had ever failed to answer a teacher&apos;s
question.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9238a7846f7940e4eb3256072439fa1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4404">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b42738f205dffde369e896c2dec37243</data>
      <data key="v_content">She was staring at her slippers, as still as a statue.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b42738f205dffde369e896c2dec37243</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4405">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-59aaac7d0d16765f401e70829b6e42ba</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I think I&apos;ve got a good idea of what&apos;s been going on,&quot; said Professor
McGonagall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-59aaac7d0d16765f401e70829b6e42ba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4406">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2fca97cb0bddd14da1b8b405599166f1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It doesn&apos;t take a genius to work it out.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2fca97cb0bddd14da1b8b405599166f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4407">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dd04be72b6ec7ef50dd77c52defe104c</data>
      <data key="v_content">You fed Draco
Malfoy some cock-and-bull story about a dragon, trying to get him out of
bed and into trouble.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dd04be72b6ec7ef50dd77c52defe104c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4408">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6284518b73f70c906b67e8db5ce83670</data>
      <data key="v_content">I suppose you think it&apos;s
funny that Longbottom here heard the story and believed it, too?&quot;
Harry caught Neville&apos;s eye and tried to tell him without words that this
wasn&apos;t true, because Neville was looking stunned and hurt.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6284518b73f70c906b67e8db5ce83670</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4409">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-612547780e574ab2585cb276fb6a4435</data>
      <data key="v_content">blunderingNeville--,Poor,
blundering Neville -- Harry knew what it must have cost him to try and
find them in the dark, to warn them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-612547780e574ab2585cb276fb6a4435</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4410">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-18f38d4d61c7a53613e1c2f92da3c17c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Four students out of bed in
one night! I&apos;ve never heard of such a thing before! You, Miss Granger, I
thought you had more sense.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-18f38d4d61c7a53613e1c2f92da3c17c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4411">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-12edce84f6228449aeb3c7a72ec8c891</data>
      <data key="v_content">IthoughtGryffindor,Potter, I thought Gryffindor
meant more to you than this.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-12edce84f6228449aeb3c7a72ec8c891</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4412">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-251bfa6b70d0cc45f80ace8baa3905fc</data>
      <data key="v_content">All three of you will receive detentions --
yes, you too, Mr.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-251bfa6b70d0cc45f80ace8baa3905fc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4413">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e8cd292b91175b99f100f1a0d1c1ca44</data>
      <data key="v_content">nothinggivesyou,Longbottom, nothing gives you the right to walk around
school at night, especially these days, it&apos;s very dangerous -- and fifty
points will be taken from Gryffindor.&quot;
&quot;Fifty?&quot; Harry gasped -- they would lose the lead, the lead he&apos;d won in
the last Quidditch match.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e8cd292b91175b99f100f1a0d1c1ca44</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4414">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ef762390400828574ec0da7f5a0727b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;said,&quot;Fifty points each,&quot; said Professor McGonagall, breathing heavily
through her long, pointed nose.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ef762390400828574ec0da7f5a0727b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4415">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-04e852138a9e75507e70c8015b666d12</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Professor -- please
&quot;You can&apos;t --&quot;
195
&quot;Don&apos;t tell me what I can and can&apos;t do, Potter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-04e852138a9e75507e70c8015b666d12</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4416">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-250f7e1585efcccb31cbd3956daa907f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Now get back to bed, all
of you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-250f7e1585efcccb31cbd3956daa907f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4417">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-96750d366278362d57567074287b7bd7</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;ve never been more ashamed of Gryffindor students.&quot;
A hundred and fifty points lost.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-96750d366278362d57567074287b7bd7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4418">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-14c4d11d1ff48fdc3f84e9e2100e8774</data>
      <data key="v_content">That put Gryffindor in last place.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-14c4d11d1ff48fdc3f84e9e2100e8774</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4419">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7d516633ea46d68dcb404585770cea67</data>
      <data key="v_content">they&apos;d,In
one night, they&apos;d ruined any chance Gryffindor had had for the house
cup.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7d516633ea46d68dcb404585770cea67</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4420">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-236b25df310d75ca1424944aad0f982c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry felt as though the bottom had dropped out of his stomach.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-236b25df310d75ca1424944aad0f982c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4421">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d92156ef907990e5b596a9e152c6a5c0</data>
      <data key="v_content">How
could they ever make up for this?
Harry didn&apos;t sleep all night.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d92156ef907990e5b596a9e152c6a5c0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4422">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7b6a1757fdb3023d4637f4f1b1fca672</data>
      <data key="v_content">He could hear Neville sobbing into his
pillow for what seemed like hours.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7b6a1757fdb3023d4637f4f1b1fca672</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4423">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ecbc82ce7a9dcd250d7d0e6985cb4c5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry couldn&apos;t think of anything to
say to comfort him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ecbc82ce7a9dcd250d7d0e6985cb4c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4424">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b253bb2e40ffb9fea8885dc334c1edc6</data>
      <data key="v_content">like,He knew Neville, like himself, was dreading the
dawn.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b253bb2e40ffb9fea8885dc334c1edc6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4425">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9405238e4db88a140d58b0d955f0c6e8</data>
      <data key="v_content">What would happen when the rest of Gryffindor found out what
they&apos;d done?
At first, Gryffindors passing the giant hourglasses that recorded the
house points the next day thought there&apos;d been a mistake.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9405238e4db88a140d58b0d955f0c6e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4426">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e4b3c7a066bea9a6ef44c772f50980e2</data>
      <data key="v_content">How could they
suddenly have a hundred and fifty points fewer than yesterday? And then
the story started to spread: Harry Potter, the famous Harry Potter,
their hero of two Quidditch matches, had lo st them all those points,
him and a couple of other stupid first years.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e4b3c7a066bea9a6ef44c772f50980e2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4427">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b87bd88de9e5c3c9c7f8c36fe28e4f00</data>
      <data key="v_content">From being one of the most popular and admired people at the school,
Harry was suddenly the most hated.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b87bd88de9e5c3c9c7f8c36fe28e4f00</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4428">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d65aef501a07ec7ec1df890055d22b7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Even Ravenclaws and Hufflepuffs
turned on him, because everyone had been longing to see Slytherin lose
the house cup.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d65aef501a07ec7ec1df890055d22b7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4429">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9a9c025adf8753baa4f571aa7ef3c97f</data>
      <data key="v_content">people,Everywhere Harry went, people pointed and didn&apos;t trouble
to lower their voices as they insulted him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9a9c025adf8753baa4f571aa7ef3c97f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4430">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e13521de6d306a750ae2a066985173be</data>
      <data key="v_content">ontheother,Slytherins, on the other
hand, clapped as he walked past them, whistling and cheering, &quot;Thanks
Potter, we owe you one!&quot;
Only Ron stood by him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e13521de6d306a750ae2a066985173be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4431">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a33cb3ed2320da2b1c13f31ed76079c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;They&apos;ll all forget this in a few weeks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a33cb3ed2320da2b1c13f31ed76079c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4432">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ce3316966edf967d828eddb41d7f7e2b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Fred and George have lost loads
of points in all the time they&apos;ve been here, and people still like
them.&quot;
&quot;They&apos;ve never lost a hundred and fifty points in one go, though, have
they?&quot; said Harry miserably.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ce3316966edf967d828eddb41d7f7e2b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4433">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bd91a337589e369ed3bdd7304ef7201f</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was a bit late to repair the damage, but Harry swore to himself not
to meddle in things that weren&apos;t his business from now on.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bd91a337589e369ed3bdd7304ef7201f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4434">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dff0080cf94b9394f7862ab59a76d6f0</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;d had it
196
with sneaking around and spying.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dff0080cf94b9394f7862ab59a76d6f0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4435">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-86bea81afba5f8ba247586405beff68e</data>
      <data key="v_content">He felt so ashamed of himself that he
went to Wood and offered to resign from the Quidditch team.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-86bea81afba5f8ba247586405beff68e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4436">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-405e31a2a705d4a73408c13101ce2c00</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What good&apos;ll that do? How are we going to get
any points back if we can&apos;t win at Quidditch?&quot;
But even Quidditch had lost its fun.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-405e31a2a705d4a73408c13101ce2c00</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4437">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d16d6527957aa8b282b07738bb33be88</data>
      <data key="v_content">The rest of the team wouldn&apos;t speak
to Harry during practice, and if they had to speak about him, they
called him &quot;the Seeker.&quot;
Hermione and Neville were suffering, too.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d16d6527957aa8b282b07738bb33be88</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4438">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cc1973df67c49174513df0658b9b0709</data>
      <data key="v_content">They didn&apos;t have as bad a time
as Harry, because they weren&apos;t as well-known, but nobody would speak to
them, either.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cc1973df67c49174513df0658b9b0709</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4439">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dfd173d13fd7a0647f883fb47c2b12b2</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione had stopped drawing attention to herself in
class, keeping her head down and working in silence.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dfd173d13fd7a0647f883fb47c2b12b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4440">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c6601d533b809315b5b94c59fef29876</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry was almost glad that the exams weren&apos;t far away.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c6601d533b809315b5b94c59fef29876</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4441">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-60ae6e6bbe0b06ac77863ff431184f3a</data>
      <data key="v_content">All the studying
he had to do kept his mind off his misery.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-60ae6e6bbe0b06ac77863ff431184f3a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4442">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dc5288dfa70a73daa143baa19b1c68cb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron,andHermione,He, Ron, and Hermione kept to
themselves, working late into the night, trying to remember the
ingredients in complicated potions, learn charms and spells by heart,
memorize the dates of magical discoveries and goblin rebellions....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dc5288dfa70a73daa143baa19b1c68cb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4443">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-67262a08e76ce41165ec562964ce668d</data>
      <data key="v_content">aboutaweek,Then, about a week before the exams were due to start, Harry&apos;s new
resolution not to interfere in anything that didn&apos;t concern him was put
to an unexpected test.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-67262a08e76ce41165ec562964ce668d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4444">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-46bfe6eeda478fde9bbd2f95086a4ee7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Walking back from the library on his own one
afternoon, he heard somebody whimpering from a classroom up ahead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-46bfe6eeda478fde9bbd2f95086a4ee7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4445">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-87664307a721ad9e2092c3b348444132</data>
      <data key="v_content">,As he
drew closer, he heard Quirrell&apos;s voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-87664307a721ad9e2092c3b348444132</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4446">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0b1d3928af17eff8dd0118d4383c83dc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;No -- no -- not again, please --&quot;
It sounded as though someone was threatening him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0b1d3928af17eff8dd0118d4383c83dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4447">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b878289774e2b0fb73900e1ce45e3be3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;All right -- all right --&quot; he heard Quirrell sob.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b878289774e2b0fb73900e1ce45e3be3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4448">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd51e6d1791d772bb410eb1948e0528c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Quirrellcame,Next second, Quirrell came hurrying out of the classroom straightening
his turban.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd51e6d1791d772bb410eb1948e0528c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4449">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f3b267fb3140fead6ca393c656c6722e</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was pale and looked as though he was about to cry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f3b267fb3140fead6ca393c656c6722e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4450">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-91fbb6fee7f80a327dd85468f1202463</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
strode out of sight; Harry didn&apos;t think Quirrell had even noticed him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-91fbb6fee7f80a327dd85468f1202463</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4451">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a17df2d841ca2ff2af5981fb621718eb</data>
      <data key="v_content">He waited until Quirrell&apos;s footsteps had disappeared, then peered into
the classroom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a17df2d841ca2ff2af5981fb621718eb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4452">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bd7a41720e67a562a74ecb4cbf534a21</data>
      <data key="v_content">but,It was empty, but a door stood ajar at the other end.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bd7a41720e67a562a74ecb4cbf534a21</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4453">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4b47bf4566f9ca7d05bf49c021968773</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry was halfway toward it before he remembered what he&apos;d promised
himself about not meddling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4b47bf4566f9ca7d05bf49c021968773</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4454">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-daf77a0ce323f6ea2b26e3e39fe247a1</data>
      <data key="v_content">he&apos;d,All the same, he&apos;d have gambled twelve Sorcerer&apos;s Stones that Snape had
just left the room, and from what Harry had just heard, Snape would be
197
walking with a new spring in his step -- Quirrell seemed to have given
in at last.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-daf77a0ce323f6ea2b26e3e39fe247a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4455">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7d0e1e9f3496e9daef086a2ac5208b18</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry went back to the library, where Hermione was testing Ron on
Astronomy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7d0e1e9f3496e9daef086a2ac5208b18</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4456">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9a1639b5a4290d080f1d086f70682961</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry told them what he&apos;d heard.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9a1639b5a4290d080f1d086f70682961</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4457">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-624954887a75c2210ca56674684deb8a</data>
      <data key="v_content">then!&quot;,&quot;Snape&apos;s done it, then!&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-624954887a75c2210ca56674684deb8a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4458">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-67c8f1d6de030e0f372d0e3c9442095a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;If Quirrell&apos;s told him how to break
his Anti-Dark Force spell --&quot;
&quot;There&apos;s still Fluffy, though,&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-67c8f1d6de030e0f372d0e3c9442095a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4459">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1bbd6b7ba6ba8dfc8b845ef180d9cb8e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Maybe Snape&apos;s found out how to get past him without asking Hagrid,&quot;
said Ron, looking up at the thousands of books surrounding them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1bbd6b7ba6ba8dfc8b845ef180d9cb8e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4460">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5107ec5a4a0d2ae6fc699ce5bc223e46</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I bet
there&apos;s a book somewhere in here telling you how to get past a giant
three-headed dog.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5107ec5a4a0d2ae6fc699ce5bc223e46</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4461">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9a8ad4416b2ac82e9611dbb4c38a3593</data>
      <data key="v_content">So what do we do, Harry?&quot;
The light of adventure was kindling again in Ron&apos;s eyes, but Hermione
answered before Harry could.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9a8ad4416b2ac82e9611dbb4c38a3593</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4462">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4eee9b748f01f219a5bbf2efedbaeece</data>
      <data key="v_content">That&apos;s what we should have done ages ago.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4eee9b748f01f219a5bbf2efedbaeece</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4463">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8d8908441372c37a8b276362c4dc4a84</data>
      <data key="v_content">If we try
anything ourselves we&apos;ll be thrown out for sure.&quot;
&quot;But we&apos;ve got no proof!&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8d8908441372c37a8b276362c4dc4a84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4464">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-be254017b2dcb5e7ec81cee765193266</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Quirrell&apos;s too scared to back us
up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-be254017b2dcb5e7ec81cee765193266</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4465">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-11568b96767750e76fd1f9f0a786c5df</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape&apos;s only got to say he doesn&apos;t know how the troll got in at
Halloween and that he was nowhere near the third floor -- who do you
think they&apos;ll believe, him or us? It&apos;s not exactly a secret we hate him,
Dumbledore&apos;ll think we made it up to get him sacked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-11568b96767750e76fd1f9f0a786c5df</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4466">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-54532d76b8c15668ce344bee6748820b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Filch wouldn&apos;t help
us if his life depended on it, he&apos;s too friendly with Snape, and the
more students get thrown out, the better, he&apos;ll think.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-54532d76b8c15668ce344bee6748820b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4467">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-61159932f30abc8a31a4b2bbd530d0f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">we&apos;re,And don&apos;t forget,
we&apos;re not supposed to know about the Stone or Fluffy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-61159932f30abc8a31a4b2bbd530d0f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4468">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c853b9bc6ef110dea1500bf5b4036913</data>
      <data key="v_content">That&apos;ll take a lot
of explaining.&quot;
Hermione looked convinced, but Ron didn&apos;t.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c853b9bc6ef110dea1500bf5b4036913</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4469">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd1f480e30c454e94eb0af31606feeb3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;If we just do a bit of poking around --&quot;
&quot;No,&quot; said Harry flatly, &quot;we&apos;ve done enough poking around.&quot;
He pulled a map of Jupiter toward him and started to learn the names of
its moons.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd1f480e30c454e94eb0af31606feeb3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4470">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d04c475bce9edee6c10083d61ef8d203</data>
      <data key="v_content">notes,The following morning, notes were delivered to Harry, Hermione, and
Neville at the breakfast table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d04c475bce9edee6c10083d61ef8d203</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4471">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-80e6f7aec95daf2d54386ffc2f579a6e</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were all the same:
198
Your detention will take place at eleven o&apos;clock tonight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-80e6f7aec95daf2d54386ffc2f579a6e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4472">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c998ab63740e949b3e216c1e59c4edd0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall Harry had forgotten they still had detentions to do
in the furor over the points they&apos;d lost.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c998ab63740e949b3e216c1e59c4edd0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4473">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-69d8c00e3ea8fcb4a201b2c5d0ddd315</data>
      <data key="v_content">He half expected Hermione to
complain that this was a whole night of studying lost, but she didn&apos;t
say a word.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-69d8c00e3ea8fcb4a201b2c5d0ddd315</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4474">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-be839a8c4b37098f4adec089fd1184b5</data>
      <data key="v_content">shefelt,Like Harry, she felt they deserved what they&apos;d got.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-be839a8c4b37098f4adec089fd1184b5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4475">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f8eec68aec8d65f0eb8a90ee76255a48</data>
      <data key="v_content">At eleven o&apos;clock that night, they said good-bye to Ron in the common
room and went down to the entrance hall with Neville.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f8eec68aec8d65f0eb8a90ee76255a48</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4476">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9a736da2157fcfdf5ad7e5405afeaabe</data>
      <data key="v_content">Filch was already
there -- and so was Malfoy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9a736da2157fcfdf5ad7e5405afeaabe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4477">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-53c7534f358e0f9997feb8456155d5aa</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had also forgotten that Malfoy had
gotten a detention, too.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-53c7534f358e0f9997feb8456155d5aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4478">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-64b10521e5a75ff54bf6ab2f90ff2283</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidFilch,,&quot;Follow me,&quot; said Filch, lighting a lamp and leading them outside.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-64b10521e5a75ff54bf6ab2f90ff2283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4479">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-486506ada5a17701bb3c7fbcf18ef19b</data>
      <data key="v_content">I bet you&apos;ll think twice about breaking a school rule again, won&apos;t you,
eh?&quot; he said, leering at them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-486506ada5a17701bb3c7fbcf18ef19b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4480">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-096556f80a90897278a9148eeeffa63c</data>
      <data key="v_content">hard work and pain are the
best teachers if you ask me....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-096556f80a90897278a9148eeeffa63c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4481">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e535f689b38b20342b119784b5bdc050</data>
      <data key="v_content">It&apos;s just a pity they let the old
punishments die out...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e535f689b38b20342b119784b5bdc050</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4482">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a05e9000b1749ae016b4db2cb4a8f470</data>
      <data key="v_content">hang you by your wrists from the ceiling for a
few days, I&apos;ve got the chains still in my office, keep &apos;em well oiled in
case they&apos;re ever needed....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a05e9000b1749ae016b4db2cb4a8f470</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4483">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-55099694f5731f09e3245a26b63758d0</data>
      <data key="v_content">offwego,,Right, off we go, and don&apos;t think of
running off, now, it&apos;ll be worse for you if you do.&quot;
They marched off across the dark grounds.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-55099694f5731f09e3245a26b63758d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4484">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5298088e3452d604d6cd28cd670a73bd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry
wondered what their punishment was going to be.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5298088e3452d604d6cd28cd670a73bd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4485">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e4c4d5b2ab138a826ff9e2f133443865</data>
      <data key="v_content">It must be something
really horrible, or Filch wouldn&apos;t be sounding so delighted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e4c4d5b2ab138a826ff9e2f133443865</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4486">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b53d6619337f1c46a7be2055bff2c1f8</data>
      <data key="v_content">,The moon was bright, but clouds scudding across it kept throwing them
into darkness.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b53d6619337f1c46a7be2055bff2c1f8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4487">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d19f7fa506f6033be5db8bcac8c5dfaf</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harrycouldsee,Ahead, Harry could see the lighted windows of Hagrid&apos;s
hut.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d19f7fa506f6033be5db8bcac8c5dfaf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4488">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5da61ad4654ee11da5447d3dc74bf9aa</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then they heard a distant shout.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5da61ad4654ee11da5447d3dc74bf9aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4489">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5d7efda8124cc839652c6c995cf0d0c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Filch?,&quot;Is that you, Filch? Hurry up, I want ter get started.&quot;
Harry&apos;s heart rose; if they were going to be working with Hagrid it
wouldn&apos;t be so bad.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5d7efda8124cc839652c6c995cf0d0c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4490">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3d52e68fa7e0a34a1bc6e4cc4111b197</data>
      <data key="v_content">His relief must have showed in his -face, because
Filch said, &quot;I suppose you think you&apos;ll be enjoying yourself with that
oaf? Well, think again, boy -- it&apos;s into the forest you&apos;re going and I&apos;m
much mistaken if you&apos;ll all come out in one piece.&quot;
At this, Neville let out a little moan, and Malfoy stopped dead in his
tracks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3d52e68fa7e0a34a1bc6e4cc4111b197</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4491">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ac2bfac006c60c8dda58e055d7eb01cc</data>
      <data key="v_content">199
&quot;The forest?&quot; he repeated, and he didn&apos;t sound quite as cool as usual.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ac2bfac006c60c8dda58e055d7eb01cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4492">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9ae467ff3344bfa9382b6c0ebced5317</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We can&apos;t go in there at night -- there&apos;s all sorts of things in there
-- werewolves, I heard.&quot;
Neville clutched the sleeve of Harry&apos;s robe and made a choking noise.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9ae467ff3344bfa9382b6c0ebced5317</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4493">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aae7fb0a43e727038729a4a3f6bddcae</data>
      <data key="v_content">isn&apos;t,&quot;That&apos;s your problem, isn&apos;t it?&quot; said Filch, his voice cracking with
glee.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aae7fb0a43e727038729a4a3f6bddcae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4494">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7fc343bfdf3a4debdb43af09630fa2ce</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Should&apos;ve thought of them werewolves before you got in trouble,
shouldn&apos;t you?&quot;
Hagrid came striding toward them out of the dark, Fang at his heel.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7fc343bfdf3a4debdb43af09630fa2ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4495">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5e245c9aa5f0315df2a6f5da540e9c87</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
was carrying his large crossbow, and a quiver of arrows hung over his
shoulder.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5e245c9aa5f0315df2a6f5da540e9c87</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4496">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-039b16e0587a829ece1266a24f433847</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I bin waitin&apos; fer half an hour already.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-039b16e0587a829ece1266a24f433847</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4497">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-747635c27d2ecb61c1141da7e17589eb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry,Hermione?&quot;,All
right, Harry, Hermione?&quot;
&quot;I shouldn&apos;t be too friendly to them, Hagrid,&quot; said Filch coldly,
they&apos;re here to be punished, after all.&quot;
&quot;That&apos;s why yer late, is it?&quot; said Hagrid, frowning at Filch.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-747635c27d2ecb61c1141da7e17589eb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4498">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2a3fe7c7a966cb0f823cb11fbc30abd5</data>
      <data key="v_content">eh?,&quot;Bin
lecturin&apos; them, eh? &apos;Snot your place ter do that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2a3fe7c7a966cb0f823cb11fbc30abd5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4499">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-98ddf274f2139b19a52370f85d32f8d7</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Yeh&apos;ve done yer bit,
I&apos;ll take over from here.&quot;
&quot;I&apos;ll be back at dawn,&quot; said Filch, &quot;for what&apos;s left of them,&quot; he added
nastily, and he turned and started back toward the castle, his lamp
bobbing away in the darkness.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-98ddf274f2139b19a52370f85d32f8d7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4500">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-85dfa195e53e6a2c7673b9f11ce07e58</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;m not going in that forest, he said, and Harry was pleased to hear
the note of panic in his voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-85dfa195e53e6a2c7673b9f11ce07e58</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4501">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5e091826d16082014ab88207fe10ebf7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Yeh are if yeh want ter stay at Hogwarts,&quot; said Hagrid fiercely.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5e091826d16082014ab88207fe10ebf7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4502">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-78d36a645c90904a392cf95ece1f94b4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Yeh&apos;ve done wrong an&apos; now yehve got ter pay fer it.&quot;
&quot;But this is servant stuff, it&apos;s not for students to do.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-78d36a645c90904a392cf95ece1f94b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4503">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-92daf1b9ded90d35bcb5c6f3d2cb74c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">I thought we&apos;d
be copying lines or something, if my father knew I was doing this, he&apos;d
tell yer that&apos;s how it is at Hogwarts,&quot; Hagrid growled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-92daf1b9ded90d35bcb5c6f3d2cb74c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4504">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-46a264fa0cece8ad33639f619cb8fb84</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Copyin&apos; lines!
What good&apos;s that ter anyone? Yeh&apos;ll do summat useful or Yeh&apos;ll get out.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-46a264fa0cece8ad33639f619cb8fb84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4505">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-142824b48b45bd9cbbb7b40850c2d68e</data>
      <data key="v_content">If yeh think yer father&apos;d rather you were expelled, then get back off
ter the castle an&apos; pack.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-142824b48b45bd9cbbb7b40850c2d68e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4506">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8ce8ee951d8bc9d9289448387cb711ad</data>
      <data key="v_content">Go on&quot;&apos;
200
Malfoy didn&apos;t move.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8ce8ee951d8bc9d9289448387cb711ad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4507">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-055fe2c1ca84d37b9c4dcfa82d66978f</data>
      <data key="v_content">He looked at Hagrid furiously, but then dropped his
gaze.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-055fe2c1ca84d37b9c4dcfa82d66978f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4508">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2a3e86be29d5fa9d5c6c59de53f7b14</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidHagrid,,&quot;Right then,&quot; said Hagrid, &quot;now, listen carefully, &apos;cause it&apos;s dangerous
what we&apos;re gonna do tonight, an&apos; I don&apos; want no one takin&apos; risks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2a3e86be29d5fa9d5c6c59de53f7b14</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4509">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-921ca87efd7fe4e2f8a0ac8878c8bdf3</data>
      <data key="v_content">Follow
me over here a moment.&quot;
He led them to the very edge of the forest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-921ca87efd7fe4e2f8a0ac8878c8bdf3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4510">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f9e904bc4cd17af91ec97bc4065e96c7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Holding his lamp up high, he
pointed down a narrow, winding earth track that disappeared into the
thick black trees.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f9e904bc4cd17af91ec97bc4065e96c7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4511">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-72f9e1f4684a53980cbca4154561bcdf</data>
      <data key="v_content">A light breeze lifted their hair as they looked into
the forest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-72f9e1f4684a53980cbca4154561bcdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4512">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-44f37ae3ae4cef837b33da0ba98a951b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidHagrid,,&quot;Look there,&quot; said Hagrid, &quot;see that stuff shinin&apos; on the ground?
Silvery stuff? That&apos;s unicorn blood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-44f37ae3ae4cef837b33da0ba98a951b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4513">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5e5ade83aefd26e7a4822e78dacbd120</data>
      <data key="v_content">There&apos;s a unicorn in there bin hurt
badly by summat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5e5ade83aefd26e7a4822e78dacbd120</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4514">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9a0c0671e0333df06fd8961c1f0e625b</data>
      <data key="v_content">This is the second time in a week.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9a0c0671e0333df06fd8961c1f0e625b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4515">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9aae723cca19b01848a28b9461920332</data>
      <data key="v_content">I found one dead
last Wednesday.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9aae723cca19b01848a28b9461920332</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4516">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-62bdd5d214d35dfac04e98bdba6fa915</data>
      <data key="v_content">We&apos;re gonna try an&apos; find the poor thing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-62bdd5d214d35dfac04e98bdba6fa915</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4517">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d6b90d2fee088df03771ede850941eb3</data>
      <data key="v_content">We might have
ter put it out of its misery.&quot;
&quot;And what if whatever hurt the unicorn finds us first?&quot; said Malfoy,
unable to keep the fear out of his voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d6b90d2fee088df03771ede850941eb3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4518">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-39ce577c058371cadafb3822a6e42e8c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;There&apos;s nothin&apos; that lives in the forest that&apos;ll hurt yeh if yer with
me or Fang,&quot; said Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-39ce577c058371cadafb3822a6e42e8c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4519">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0291efeb20a689b1dd1e2e242b79b1bd</data>
      <data key="v_content">now,we&apos;regonna,Right, now, we&apos;re
gonna split inter two parties an&apos; follow the trail in diff&apos;rent
directions.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0291efeb20a689b1dd1e2e242b79b1bd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4520">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bd75e680ab8e9e64d4fba6982a5850b5</data>
      <data key="v_content">There&apos;s blood all over the place, it must&apos;ve bin staggerin&apos;
around since last night at least.&quot;
&quot;I want Fang,&quot; said Malfoy quickly, looking at Fang&apos;s long teeth.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bd75e680ab8e9e64d4fba6982a5850b5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4521">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6954c699c4c5322864650c3067de6765</data>
      <data key="v_content">butI,&quot;All right, but I warn yeh, he&apos;s a coward,&quot; said Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6954c699c4c5322864650c3067de6765</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4522">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-af86d034ef4afcd25757260b616907df</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry,,&quot; So me, Harry,
an&apos; Hermione&apos;ll go one way an&apos; Draco, Neville, an&apos; Fang&apos;ll go the other.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-af86d034ef4afcd25757260b616907df</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4523">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-83e60ff5e4639c3e29bd6e176fb72b4f</data>
      <data key="v_content">ifanyof,Now, if any of us finds the unicorn, we&apos;ll send up green sparks, right?
Get yer wands out an&apos; practice now -- that&apos;s it -- an&apos; if anyone gets in
trouble, send up red sparks, an&apos; we&apos;ll all come an&apos; find yeh -- so, be
careful -- let&apos;s go.&quot;
The forest was black and silent.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-83e60ff5e4639c3e29bd6e176fb72b4f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4524">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-94be4c03661af3f6e3a41a002635a3c2</data>
      <data key="v_content">A little way into it they reached a
fork in the earth path, and Harry, Hermione, and Hagrid took the left
path while Malfoy, Neville, and Fang took the right.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-94be4c03661af3f6e3a41a002635a3c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4525">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-495198370d2b667848834c473866abea</data>
      <data key="v_content">,They walked in silence, their eyes on the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-495198370d2b667848834c473866abea</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4526">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7c352df2a70f622a72c806a4c4bc8400</data>
      <data key="v_content">Every now and then a
ray of moonlight through the branches above lit a spot of silver-blue
201
blood on the fallen leaves.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7c352df2a70f622a72c806a4c4bc8400</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4527">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bcc880a78ea33f94d4a5209fe56b56cd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry saw that Hagrid looked very worried.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bcc880a78ea33f94d4a5209fe56b56cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4528">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-48d36fa969e13bd9dbec8ed141b11c60</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Could a werewolf be killing the unicorns?&quot; Harry asked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-48d36fa969e13bd9dbec8ed141b11c60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4529">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bebf9a06066859d631e23d638bc0b070</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s not easy ter catch a unicorn,
they&apos;re powerful magic creatures.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bebf9a06066859d631e23d638bc0b070</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4530">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-117311dfe7846d04b7c6803f48dad723</data>
      <data key="v_content">I never knew one ter be hurt before.&quot;
They walked past a mossy tree stump.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-117311dfe7846d04b7c6803f48dad723</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4531">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4dc2807e3d5204724873d8346fd34acb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry could hear running water;
there must be a stream somewhere close by.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4dc2807e3d5204724873d8346fd34acb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4532">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cbe48d5a3e7ce3250730bf5893e351e0</data>
      <data key="v_content">There were still spots of
unicorn blood here and there along the winding path.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cbe48d5a3e7ce3250730bf5893e351e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4533">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-39af236133e102c4eedc0642efe13b08</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione?&quot;,&quot;You all right, Hermione?&quot; Hagrid whispered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-39af236133e102c4eedc0642efe13b08</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4534">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3a6e7dea3ff6eaf0ef45427b368c4bb8</data>
      <data key="v_content">itcan&apos;t&apos;ve,&quot;Don&apos; worry, it can&apos;t&apos;ve
gone far if it&apos;s this badly hurt, an&apos; then we&apos;ll be able ter -- GET
BEHIND THAT TREE!&quot;
Hagrid seized Harry and Hermione and hoisted them off the path behind a
towering oak.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3a6e7dea3ff6eaf0ef45427b368c4bb8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4535">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-012a9188849125a38c12aa6055000018</data>
      <data key="v_content">He pulled out an arrow and fitted it into his crossbow,
raising it, ready to fire.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-012a9188849125a38c12aa6055000018</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4536">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a6d61a36adc5a8733d62a7df3c5aaf4f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Something was
slithering over dead leaves nearby: it sounded like a cloak trailing
along the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a6d61a36adc5a8733d62a7df3c5aaf4f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4537">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e34e88deec681855ba0179dd74d7df9b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid was squinting up the dark path, but after a few
seconds, the sound faded away.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e34e88deec681855ba0179dd74d7df9b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4538">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-65b0b395bb38694a4a1475836f4c0a95</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;I knew it, &quot; he murmured.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-65b0b395bb38694a4a1475836f4c0a95</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4539">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-acfd84181f75fb612cb059cc9b98a35b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;There&apos;s summat in here that shouldn&apos; be.&quot;
&quot;A werewolf?&quot; Harry suggested.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-acfd84181f75fb612cb059cc9b98a35b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4540">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f256d9395e1ad74fcfeddfb6137d0597</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;That wasn&apos; no werewolf an&apos; it wasn&apos; no unicorn, neither,&quot; said Hagrid
grimly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f256d9395e1ad74fcfeddfb6137d0597</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4541">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-19c44524e465c19575df20c22ddcb06e</data>
      <data key="v_content">followme,but,&quot;Right, follow me, but careful, now.&quot;
They walked more slowly, ears straining for the faintest sound.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-19c44524e465c19575df20c22ddcb06e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4542">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d718d6008aeb9444eb4a0c624f52ac22</data>
      <data key="v_content">inaclearing,Suddenly, in a clearing ahead, something definitely moved.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d718d6008aeb9444eb4a0c624f52ac22</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4543">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5b8a0d0d568d32d07ec36944d19f7efa</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Show yerself -- I&apos;m armed!&quot;
And into the clearing came -- was it a man, or a horse? To the waist, a
man, with red hair and beard, but below that was a horse&apos;s gleaming
chestnut body with a long, reddish tail.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5b8a0d0d568d32d07ec36944d19f7efa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4544">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-09fda381edebf2bf3301b01001bdf66e</data>
      <data key="v_content">it&apos;syou,Ronan,&quot;,&quot;Oh, it&apos;s you, Ronan,&quot; said Hagrid in relief.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-09fda381edebf2bf3301b01001bdf66e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4545">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1cc96a5eef78002c3ab9a5a13d210e9a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;How are yeh?&quot;
202
He walked forward and shook the centaur&apos;s hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1cc96a5eef78002c3ab9a5a13d210e9a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4546">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6635100fd65f949d8843c0edc1bdec6d</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Good evening to you, Hagrid,&quot; said Ronan.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6635100fd65f949d8843c0edc1bdec6d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4547">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c1b7470c527fcc8c2c51ede786955270</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He had a deep, sorrowful
voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c1b7470c527fcc8c2c51ede786955270</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4548">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-29f521332aecf71642eb078d3eb6f1c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Were you going to shoot me?&quot;
&quot;Can&apos;t be too careful, Ronan,&quot; said Hagrid, patting his crossbow.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-29f521332aecf71642eb078d3eb6f1c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4549">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fd2e104fb6d9e8d2761b463d19e27416</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;There&apos;s summat bad loose in this forest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fd2e104fb6d9e8d2761b463d19e27416</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4550">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0a73f0b32d699393360a41b5e53570f8</data>
      <data key="v_content">This is Harry Potter an&apos;
Hermione Granger, by the way.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0a73f0b32d699393360a41b5e53570f8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4551">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-06c39731fcbf93ca55c7fecb77d8c779</data>
      <data key="v_content">,An&apos; this is
Ronan, you two.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-06c39731fcbf93ca55c7fecb77d8c779</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4552">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-65dafd06ca46d3f509216afaeb2b124b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;s a centaur.))
&quot;We&apos;d noticed,&quot; said Hermione faintly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-65dafd06ca46d3f509216afaeb2b124b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4553">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8291c01b82ecbae5ccbd325748bfedd2</data>
      <data key="v_content">areyou?And,&quot;Students, are you? And do you learn much,
up at the school?&quot;
&quot;Erm --&quot;
&quot;A bit,&quot; said Hermione timidly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8291c01b82ecbae5ccbd325748bfedd2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4554">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-61197218f4b075345e668ace56e68729</data>
      <data key="v_content">He flung back his head
and stared at the sky.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-61197218f4b075345e668ace56e68729</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4555">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f55a4b5c3e38b2615fe012c02591eaf4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Mars is bright tonight.&quot;
&quot;Yeah,&quot; said Hagrid, glancing up, too.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f55a4b5c3e38b2615fe012c02591eaf4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4556">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-595c7770edcda3c9d6081b7912eeca3b</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;mgladwe&apos;ve,&quot;Listen, I&apos;m glad we&apos;ve run inter
yeh, Ronan, &apos;cause there&apos;s a unicorn bin hurt -- you seen anythin&apos;?&quot;
Ronan didn&apos;t answer immediately.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-595c7770edcda3c9d6081b7912eeca3b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4557">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d57f3e7b8c30128fcbdb27a6984fb853</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He stared unblinkingly upward, then
sighed again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d57f3e7b8c30128fcbdb27a6984fb853</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4558">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f165de0c56e7c92cc3c9d2968e18c08</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Always the innocent are the first victims,&quot; he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f165de0c56e7c92cc3c9d2968e18c08</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4559">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2ff11657ad8666bd4405058528c33bed</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So it has been
for ages past, so it is now.&quot;
&quot;Yeah,&quot; said Hagrid, &quot;but have yeh seen anythin&apos;, Ronan? Anythin&apos;
unusual?&quot;
&quot;Mars is bright tonight,&quot; Ronan repeated, while Hagrid watched him
impatiently.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2ff11657ad8666bd4405058528c33bed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4560">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-07e51d029cfc3dafa915aae1cffcec65</data>
      <data key="v_content">but,&quot;Unusually bright.&quot;
&quot;Yeah, but I was meanin&apos; anythin&apos; unusual a bit nearer home, said
Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-07e51d029cfc3dafa915aae1cffcec65</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4561">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5f8918b2448def8b9e1d5d52866091a2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So yeh haven&apos;t noticed anythin&apos; strange?&quot;
Yet again, Ronan took a while to answer.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5f8918b2448def8b9e1d5d52866091a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4562">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c8c0344fca105d359bac4af17c22f0a1</data>
      <data key="v_content">hesaid,,At last, he said, &quot;The forest
hides many secrets.&quot;
203
A movement in the trees behind Ronan made Hagrid raise his bow again,
but it was only a second centaur, black-haired and -bodied and
wilder-looking than Ronan.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c8c0344fca105d359bac4af17c22f0a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4563">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-66c1d03637c50355bc686bf73380c97d</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;All right?&quot;
&quot;Good evening, Hagrid, I hope you are well?&quot;
&quot;Well enough.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-66c1d03637c50355bc686bf73380c97d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4564">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-464897a329917fd99901984cd9cec6f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;vejus&apos;bin,Look, I&apos;ve jus&apos; bin askin&apos; Ronan, you seen anythin&apos; odd in
here lately? There&apos;s a unicorn bin injured -- would yeh know anythin&apos;
about it?&quot;
Bane walked over to stand next to Ronan.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-464897a329917fd99901984cd9cec6f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4565">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2d09cb2c78228bdc2e5bc228ed7a6ab1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;Mars is
bright tonight,&quot; he said simply.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2d09cb2c78228bdc2e5bc228ed7a6ab1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4566">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a151191eb0b2d274290f5d0a1b769838</data>
      <data key="v_content">ifeitherof,&quot;Well, if either of you do see
anythin&apos;, let me know, won&apos;t yeh? We&apos;ll be off, then.&quot;
Harry and Hermione followed him out of the clearing, staring over their
shoulders at Ronan and Bane until the trees blocked their view.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a151191eb0b2d274290f5d0a1b769838</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4567">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-537f6560ee48fd8a360e2243b163fa11</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidHagridirritably,,&quot;Never,&quot; said Hagrid irritably, &quot;try an&apos; get a straight answer out of a
centaur.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-537f6560ee48fd8a360e2243b163fa11</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4568">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c52ed49a96819fe7a97d51be4f6950a2</data>
      <data key="v_content">Not interested in anythin&apos; closer&apos;n the
moon.&quot;
&quot;Are there many of them in here?&quot; asked Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c52ed49a96819fe7a97d51be4f6950a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4569">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2401554fa3625e0c916c3838fcdb4bc5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Keep themselves to themselves mostly, but they&apos;re
good enough about turnin&apos; up if ever I want a word.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2401554fa3625e0c916c3838fcdb4bc5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4570">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-288dac39bcd098d3e13d91598704461d</data>
      <data key="v_content">jus&apos; don&apos; let on much.&quot;
&quot;D&apos;you think that was a centaur we heard earlier?&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-288dac39bcd098d3e13d91598704461d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4571">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9ed140a4fcb048fa991ad9715bb413ab</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Did that sound like hooves to you? Nah, if yeh ask me, that was what&apos;s
bin killin&apos; the unicorns -- never heard anythin&apos; like it before.&quot;
They walked on through the dense, dark trees.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9ed140a4fcb048fa991ad9715bb413ab</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4572">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6c935c5a79306e3a7f4d9d1d73b52d6e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry kept looking
nervously over his shoulder.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6c935c5a79306e3a7f4d9d1d73b52d6e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4573">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-97535142f3595f9145b54de96d48bc7c</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had the nasty feeling they were being
watched.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-97535142f3595f9145b54de96d48bc7c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4574">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d4b3844d88919f55771775418b105a98</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was very glad they had Hagrid and his crossbow with them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d4b3844d88919f55771775418b105a98</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4575">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dba914615f6a744d268ef864fb44e72b</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had just passed a bend in the path when Hermione grabbed Hagrid&apos;s
arm.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dba914615f6a744d268ef864fb44e72b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4576">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2e6bd0c0b09ae8226584ea8db6499d86</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Hagrid! Look! Red sparks, the others are in trouble!&quot;
204
&quot;You two wait here!&quot; Hagrid shouted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2e6bd0c0b09ae8226584ea8db6499d86</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4577">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-47930787c953e5d9fa9fd6e8a8b6a687</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Stay on the path, I&apos;ll come back
for yeh!&quot;
They heard him crashing away through the undergrowth and stood looking
at each other, very scared, until they couldn&apos;t hear anything but the
rustling of leaves around them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-47930787c953e5d9fa9fd6e8a8b6a687</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4578">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2a51214625b11f719d9fb304d732db28</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You don&apos;t think they&apos;ve been hurt, do you?&quot; whispered Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2a51214625b11f719d9fb304d732db28</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4579">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f8075d0af8041c9957dafeeb6cb4c3a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I don&apos;t care if Malfoy has, but if something&apos;s got Neville...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f8075d0af8041c9957dafeeb6cb4c3a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4580">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-709b74aec44e16d6c85f994be0cc76e9</data>
      <data key="v_content">it&apos;s our
fault he&apos;s here in the first place.&quot;
The minutes dragged by.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-709b74aec44e16d6c85f994be0cc76e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4581">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bca0b207d1e289444d8b87c7b905c6a6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Their ears seemed sharper than usual.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bca0b207d1e289444d8b87c7b905c6a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4582">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c8e953acf5a55861f21986116d026bbb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry&apos;s
seemed to be picking up every sigh of the wind, every cracking twig.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c8e953acf5a55861f21986116d026bbb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4583">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e5dff0bef02fc33d36ca2460a7324fce</data>
      <data key="v_content">What was going on? Where were the others?
At last, a great crunching noise announced Hagrid&apos;s return.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e5dff0bef02fc33d36ca2460a7324fce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4584">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ed48bd638c29d6e33a397be7f13f035f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville,andFang,Malfoy,
Neville, and Fang were with him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ed48bd638c29d6e33a397be7f13f035f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4585">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-972fcfe9672981ecdd604d4b78229031</data>
      <data key="v_content">itseemed,had,Malfoy, it seemed,
had sneaked up behind Neville and grabbed him as a joke.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-972fcfe9672981ecdd604d4b78229031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4586">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-421638ef1bc15a8942a33dcb688f6c50</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville had
panicked and sent up the sparks.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-421638ef1bc15a8942a33dcb688f6c50</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4587">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1d5babc123e05b7bb7514f57041acf1a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;ll be lucky ter catch anythin&apos; now, with the racket you two were
makin&apos;.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1d5babc123e05b7bb7514f57041acf1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4588">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cb92dec26bfc177230fe736b760b5f2e</data>
      <data key="v_content">we&apos;rechangin&apos;groups,Right, we&apos;re changin&apos; groups -- Neville, you stay with me an&apos;
Hermione, Harry, you go with Fang an&apos; this idiot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cb92dec26bfc177230fe736b760b5f2e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4589">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dae6d046b7afe182289ae52fb72c7e6c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Hagridadded,I&apos;m sorry,&quot; Hagrid
added in a whisper to Harry, &quot;but he&apos;ll have a harder time frightenin&apos;
you, an&apos; we&apos;ve gotta get this done.&quot;
So Harry set off into the heart of the forest with Malfoy and Fang.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dae6d046b7afe182289ae52fb72c7e6c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4590">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-56a95cdc082332520857fb1e6daf6c5f</data>
      <data key="v_content">They
walked for nearly half an hour, deeper and deeper into the forest, until
the path became almost impossible to follow because the trees were so
thick.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-56a95cdc082332520857fb1e6daf6c5f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4591">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1881b65a5b1bc04fb31faa93221e05c3</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry thought the blood seemed to be getting thicker.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1881b65a5b1bc04fb31faa93221e05c3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4592">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-90e05abd4edeb2aaef023978ee0a2842</data>
      <data key="v_content">There were
splashes on the roots of a tree, as though the poor creature had been
thrashing around in pain close by.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-90e05abd4edeb2aaef023978ee0a2842</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4593">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3e186af6021c454a262be4758a2bb7ce</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry could see a clearing ahead,
through the tangled branches of an ancient oak.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3e186af6021c454a262be4758a2bb7ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4594">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a0d01e4b1f10a967cdf746eb402b4a53</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Look --&quot; he murmured, holding out his arm to stop Malfoy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a0d01e4b1f10a967cdf746eb402b4a53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4595">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-40f5c19a706bb556d0885df89e1fba38</data>
      <data key="v_content">Something bright white was gleaming on the ground.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-40f5c19a706bb556d0885df89e1fba38</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4596">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4214b59342c338d791d7ccaaefaf9919</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was the unicorn all right, and it was dead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4214b59342c338d791d7ccaaefaf9919</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4597">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6be2aeec0c89b015cfe92aac740fd5e8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had never seen
anything so beautiful and sad.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6be2aeec0c89b015cfe92aac740fd5e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4598">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-667f422a883e31ae16cbac4b6c83c4c8</data>
      <data key="v_content">slenderlegs,Its long, slender legs were stuck out at
odd angles where it had fallen and its mane was spread pearly-white on
205
the dark leaves.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-667f422a883e31ae16cbac4b6c83c4c8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4599">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-216cfed4b3d8b80d5ccde4c05a8b354b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry had taken one step toward it when a slithering sound made him
freeze where he stood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-216cfed4b3d8b80d5ccde4c05a8b354b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4600">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2877b9f7869a10acc6766422a6121af8</data>
      <data key="v_content">A bush on the edge of the clearing quivered....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2877b9f7869a10acc6766422a6121af8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4601">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0a026ea9ca41cce68011bb739cec24bb</data>
      <data key="v_content">outofthe,Then, out of the shadows, a hooded figure came crawling across the
ground like some stalking beast.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0a026ea9ca41cce68011bb739cec24bb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4602">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e973ef9bb447aaa61afe3e63f28d076f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Malfoy,andFang,Harry, Malfoy, and Fang stood
transfixed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e973ef9bb447aaa61afe3e63f28d076f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4603">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-caa0da7b7d184927207908a9f15d816c</data>
      <data key="v_content">The cloaked figure reached the unicorn, lowered its head
over the wound in the animal&apos;s side, and began to drink its blood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-caa0da7b7d184927207908a9f15d816c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4604">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-49d2d0acd3987658aea07aa9379fc4f2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;AAAAAAAAAARGH!&quot;
Malfoy let out a terrible scream and bolted -- so did Fang.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-49d2d0acd3987658aea07aa9379fc4f2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4605">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ef0d58a9058b029dd1a9db131715370</data>
      <data key="v_content">The hooded
figure raised its head and looked right at Harry -- unicorn blood was
dribbling down its front.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ef0d58a9058b029dd1a9db131715370</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4606">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ce0029bb622736b511cc71cb8778790</data>
      <data key="v_content">It got to its feet and came swiftly toward
Harry -- he couldn&apos;t move for fear.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ce0029bb622736b511cc71cb8778790</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4607">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5a0187dcd9e5292557de592169c4823f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then a pain like he&apos;d never felt before pierced his head; it was as
though his scar were on fire.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5a0187dcd9e5292557de592169c4823f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4608">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a35b3f5afa19800a49c5bc0c312fe50</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
heard hooves behind him, galloping, and something jumped clean over
Harry, charging at the figure.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a35b3f5afa19800a49c5bc0c312fe50</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4609">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c698fc925ed16861c4819720845e00e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">The pain in Harry&apos;s head was so bad he fell to his knees.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c698fc925ed16861c4819720845e00e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4610">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d5e4d6681310ad2056210cf0ae8eb95b</data>
      <data key="v_content">It took a
minute or two to pass.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d5e4d6681310ad2056210cf0ae8eb95b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4611">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a86f7fb6f3fe1bca1cd637bc5b7b70a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">,When he looked up, the figure had gone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a86f7fb6f3fe1bca1cd637bc5b7b70a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4612">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-91188f5b55ade722c0945285e85243a7</data>
      <data key="v_content">A centaur
was standing over him, not Ronan or Bane; this one looked younger; he
had white-blond hair and a palomino body.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-91188f5b55ade722c0945285e85243a7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4613">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2e18564a205d1e6ad347f8817fc78863</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Are you all right?&quot; said the centaur, pulling Harry to his feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2e18564a205d1e6ad347f8817fc78863</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4614">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-90e38b914c4f9231e6e4df60efbfe573</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Yes -- thank you -- what was that?&quot;
The centaur didn&apos;t answer.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-90e38b914c4f9231e6e4df60efbfe573</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4615">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5fd906a03efe4a5d23995e57ad54b81a</data>
      <data key="v_content">He had astonishingly blue eyes, like pale
sapphires.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5fd906a03efe4a5d23995e57ad54b81a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4616">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-933ca5fa243184ffed27970ef0b32173</data>
      <data key="v_content">He looked carefully at Harry, his eyes lingering on the scar
that stood out, livid, on Harry&apos;s forehead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-933ca5fa243184ffed27970ef0b32173</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4617">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ff42464e4751393579ad2bdbd3bc4286</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You are the Potter boy,&quot; he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ff42464e4751393579ad2bdbd3bc4286</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4618">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bcb540c6596b7ff43a42a80a31ebeb6a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You had better get back to Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bcb540c6596b7ff43a42a80a31ebeb6a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4619">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-edf4ce6e8af29a322cd10e752b1547f5</data>
      <data key="v_content">The forest is not safe at this time -- especially for you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-edf4ce6e8af29a322cd10e752b1547f5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4620">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ee13b460d045699daab95e05bb795001</data>
      <data key="v_content">Can you ride?
It will be quicker this way.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ee13b460d045699daab95e05bb795001</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4621">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-86854879b5dc8a5a79a81e4eeac25c6c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;My name is Firenze,&quot; he added, as he lowered himself on to his front
legs so that Harry could clamber onto his back.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-86854879b5dc8a5a79a81e4eeac25c6c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4622">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1eb1d5d44d001159c89b1596233b3484</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was suddenly a sound of more galloping from the other side of the
clearing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1eb1d5d44d001159c89b1596233b3484</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4623">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f6006b31523d8990620f7417086b67b1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ronan and Bane came bursting through the trees, their flanks
206
heaving and sweaty.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f6006b31523d8990620f7417086b67b1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4624">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-39fd73abbf8dc1417253b21cdc8c6ad5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What are you doing? You have a human on your
back! Have you no shame? Are you a common mule?&quot;
&quot;Do you realize who this is?&quot; said Firenze.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-39fd73abbf8dc1417253b21cdc8c6ad5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4625">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6af56c4153e8a64bc8c82f01b14d16e9</data>
      <data key="v_content">The
quicker he leaves this forest, the better.&quot;
&quot;What have you been telling him?&quot; growled Bane.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6af56c4153e8a64bc8c82f01b14d16e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4626">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-896595e9f1ec5e0202f32ab54fdc822c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Firenze,weare,&quot;Remember, Firenze, we
are sworn not to set ourselves against the heavens.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-896595e9f1ec5e0202f32ab54fdc822c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4627">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f74d26a717670c1a07df3190fd0133f5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Have we not read
what is to come in the movements of the planets?&quot;
Ronan pawed the ground nervously.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f74d26a717670c1a07df3190fd0133f5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4628">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-40b652915320cb809cfda940bc98412d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;m sure Firenze thought he was
acting for the best, &quot; he said in his gloomy voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-40b652915320cb809cfda940bc98412d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4629">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c618a64d3fdc59745a44c8b5eb561a0e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Bane kicked his back legs in anger.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c618a64d3fdc59745a44c8b5eb561a0e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4630">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ad6cf82b7abbced66dbb2fceae3c2973</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;For the best! What is that to do with us? Centaurs are concerned with
what has been foretold! It is not our business to run around like
donkeys after stray humans in our forest!&quot;
Firenze suddenly reared on to his hind legs in anger, so that Harry had
to grab his shoulders to stay on.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ad6cf82b7abbced66dbb2fceae3c2973</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4631">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d94d5299e5f4852ed7638af1e00d095d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Do you not see that unicorn?&quot; Firenze bellowed at Bane.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d94d5299e5f4852ed7638af1e00d095d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4632">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2a09145bee354f88017d2e05457acde</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Do you not
understand why it was killed? Or have the planets not let you in on that
secret? I set myself against what is lurking in this forest, Bane, yes,
with humans alongside me if I must.&quot;
And Firenze whisked around; with Harry clutching on as best he could,
they plunged off into the trees, leaving Ronan and Bane behind them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2a09145bee354f88017d2e05457acde</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4633">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5ed5787dc5be4e610ed77bdfc605f4de</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry didn&apos;t have a clue what was going on.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5ed5787dc5be4e610ed77bdfc605f4de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4634">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9f472021a32658628df0914a42e1168b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Why&apos;s Bane so angry?&quot; he asked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9f472021a32658628df0914a42e1168b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4635">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9c0590e6321540f4039cc1c582130793</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What was that thing you saved me from,
anyway?&quot;
Firenze slowed to a walk, warned Harry to keep his head bowed in case of
low-hanging branches, but did not answer Harry&apos;s question.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9c0590e6321540f4039cc1c582130793</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4636">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e50526cdc5fde42466092adb94495d06</data>
      <data key="v_content">They made
their way through the trees in silence for so long that Harry thought
Firenze didn&apos;t want to talk to him anymore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e50526cdc5fde42466092adb94495d06</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4637">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e35fb9eded4669da97610ef4b27c5e63</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were passing through a
particularly dense patch of trees, however, when Firenze suddenly
stopped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e35fb9eded4669da97610ef4b27c5e63</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4638">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ed7b1ae9da1469a9fa795e903a5627a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">do,207
&quot;Harry Potter, do you know what unicorn blood is used -for?&quot;
&quot;No,&quot; said Harry, startled by the odd question.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ed7b1ae9da1469a9fa795e903a5627a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4639">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5048d50e697c59aeb6dc6472a8a576b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;ve only used the
horn and tail hair in Potions.&quot;
&quot;That is because it is a monstrous thing, to slay a unicorn,&quot; said
Firenze.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5048d50e697c59aeb6dc6472a8a576b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4640">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-442de359f5bf0a37e28b10c42b0bbc4d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Only one who has nothing to lose, and everything to gain,
would commit such a crime.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-442de359f5bf0a37e28b10c42b0bbc4d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4641">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b65a3a468f398609d5c7d7060bfe6106</data>
      <data key="v_content">The blood of a unicorn will keep you alive,
even if you are an inch from death, but at a terrible price.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b65a3a468f398609d5c7d7060bfe6106</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4642">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ea4c5fb1c31d905e69f70f8cc4051cfa</data>
      <data key="v_content">You have
slain something pure and defenseless to save yourself, and you will have
but a half-life, a cursed life, from the moment the blood touches your
lips.&quot;
Harry stared at the back of Firenze&apos;s head, which was dappled silver in
the moonlight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ea4c5fb1c31d905e69f70f8cc4051cfa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4643">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-16517448eb90736b92d815b1602f1f59</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But who&apos;d be that desperate?&quot; he wondered aloud.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-16517448eb90736b92d815b1602f1f59</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4644">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a306939019fab94eb4309bd3b6befe70</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;If you&apos;re going to be
cursed forever, deaths better, isn&apos;t it?&quot;
&quot;It is,&quot; Firenze agreed, &quot;unless all you need is to stay alive long
enough to drink something else -- something that will bring you back to
full strength and power -- something that will mean you can never die.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a306939019fab94eb4309bd3b6befe70</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4645">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7ba871a5ad36cf9880e6475fa72bbea4</data>
      <data key="v_content">doyouknow,Potter, do you know what is hidden in the school at this very
moment?&quot;
&quot;The Sorcerer&apos;s Stone! Of course -- the Elixir of Life! But I don&apos;t
understand who --&quot;
&quot;Can you think of nobody who has waited many years to return to power,
who has clung to life, awaiting their chance?&quot;
It was as though an iron fist had clenched suddenly around Harry&apos;s
heart.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7ba871a5ad36cf9880e6475fa72bbea4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4646">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9a15aae142470794da256943d418c303</data>
      <data key="v_content">Over the rustling of the trees, he seemed to hear once more what
Hagrid had told him on the night they had met: &quot;Some say he died.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9a15aae142470794da256943d418c303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4647">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f5d4a4f498da608a770d1347c3907e9a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dunno if he had enough human left in him to
die.&quot;
&quot;Do you mean,&quot; Harry croaked, &quot;that was Vol-&quot;
&quot;Harry! Harry, are you all right?&quot;
Hermione was running toward them down the path, Hagrid puffing along
208
behind her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f5d4a4f498da608a770d1347c3907e9a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4648">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-62eb143e8f6a1312b858e3cb2f416bd8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidHarry,,&quot;I&apos;m fine,&quot; said Harry, hardly knowing what he was saying.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-62eb143e8f6a1312b858e3cb2f416bd8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4649">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-baf95e95f6d51a18816e61bd267a16b9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid,,&quot;The
unicorn&apos;s dead, Hagrid, it&apos;s in that clearing back there.&quot;
&quot;This is where I leave you,&quot; Firenze murmured as Hagrid hurried off to
examine the unicorn.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-baf95e95f6d51a18816e61bd267a16b9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4650">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f44187fa998f041af5064ba84564e710</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You are safe now.&quot;
Harry slid off his back.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f44187fa998f041af5064ba84564e710</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4651">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f862db753ad3dff808cde2e23a323e18</data>
      <data key="v_content">HarryPotter,&quot;,&quot;Good luck, Harry Potter,&quot; said Firenze.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f862db753ad3dff808cde2e23a323e18</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4652">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b4a63283b19d434696f4550528376042</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The planets have been read
wrongly before now, even by centaurs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b4a63283b19d434696f4550528376042</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4653">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-634bdcd20d327bce07cda807d6e63e63</data>
      <data key="v_content">I hope this is one of those
times.&quot;
He turned and cantered back into the depths of the forest, leaving Harry
shivering behind him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-634bdcd20d327bce07cda807d6e63e63</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4654">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0ca201475fa97583ebbe7c2bb2458152</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron had fallen asleep in the dark common room, waiting for them to
return.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0ca201475fa97583ebbe7c2bb2458152</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4655">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-01034c872a776d78257dd8b7bdadac50</data>
      <data key="v_content">He shouted something about Quidditch fouls when Harry roughly
shook him awake.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-01034c872a776d78257dd8b7bdadac50</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4656">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aaf9a769aa9b1bd61b792e971e66f094</data>
      <data key="v_content">In a matter of seconds, though, he was wide-eyed as
Harry began to tell him and Hermione what had happened in the forest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aaf9a769aa9b1bd61b792e971e66f094</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4657">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cbf5fa2dcd0f34f54036fac231e5cef7</data>
      <data key="v_content">He paced up and down in front of the fire.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cbf5fa2dcd0f34f54036fac231e5cef7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4658">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c497d6480422fc4eb7663971ac7f2306</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Snape wants the stone for Voldemort...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c497d6480422fc4eb7663971ac7f2306</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4659">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b9c0532fbf29f0fd6f144d8dfcecd9ab</data>
      <data key="v_content">and Voldemort&apos;s waiting in the
forest...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b9c0532fbf29f0fd6f144d8dfcecd9ab</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4660">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-32567c7a6dceabae22a3684896ef97ff</data>
      <data key="v_content">and all this time we thought Snape just wanted to get
rich....&quot;
&quot;Stop saying the name!&quot; said Ron in a terrified whisper, as if he
thought Voldemort could hear them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-32567c7a6dceabae22a3684896ef97ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4661">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bd099637511f2c637d2abf3bc2109c70</data>
      <data key="v_content">but,&quot;Firenze saved me, but he shouldn&apos;t have done so....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bd099637511f2c637d2abf3bc2109c70</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4662">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-09151f11c51313333077929ba86d89e1</data>
      <data key="v_content">he was talking about interfering with what the planets say is going to
happen....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-09151f11c51313333077929ba86d89e1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4663">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-628acd99955011d2c9989c9823025e9a</data>
      <data key="v_content">They must show that Voldemort&apos;s coming back....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-628acd99955011d2c9989c9823025e9a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4664">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4b14e5dfd0e6252f38bb1d2ea37af219</data>
      <data key="v_content">Bane thinks
Firenze should have let Voldemort kill me....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4b14e5dfd0e6252f38bb1d2ea37af219</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4665">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e7d76deb2f159ab3821b85ff7a41682b</data>
      <data key="v_content">I suppose that&apos;s written
in the stars as well.&quot;
&quot;Will you stop saying the name!&quot; Ron hissed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e7d76deb2f159ab3821b85ff7a41682b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4666">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4c1731ebc67f2a4f330623bf45d02edf</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So all I&apos;ve got to wait for now is Snape to steal the Stone,&quot; Harry
209
went on feverishly, &quot;then Voldemort will be able to come and finish me
off...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4c1731ebc67f2a4f330623bf45d02edf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4667">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-59f71b44c8b8e605460ef47eb9027f3a</data>
      <data key="v_content">IsupposeBane&apos;ll,Well, I suppose Bane&apos;ll be happy.&quot;
Hermione looked very frightened, but she had a word of comfort.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-59f71b44c8b8e605460ef47eb9027f3a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4668">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d0a3c3afdf7307bc89b5f5a4e1a46d7c</data>
      <data key="v_content">everyonesaysDumbledore&apos;s,&quot;Harry, everyone says Dumbledore&apos;s the only one You-Know-Who was ever
afraid of With Dumbledore around, You-Know-Who won&apos;t touch you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d0a3c3afdf7307bc89b5f5a4e1a46d7c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4669">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1bfc096758d1bf5eef64f8cffcde03f7</data>
      <data key="v_content">whosaysthe,Anyway,
who says the centaurs are right? It sounds like fortune-telling to me,
and Professor McGonagall says that&apos;s a very imprecise branch of magic.&quot;
The sky had turned light before they stopped talking.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1bfc096758d1bf5eef64f8cffcde03f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4670">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6af72d0434549dce4eb02db2faf1a661</data>
      <data key="v_content">They went to bed
exhausted, their throats sore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6af72d0434549dce4eb02db2faf1a661</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4671">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3f90e64fba5cfa8e8bb49b6017e8069d</data>
      <data key="v_content">But the night&apos;s surprises weren&apos;t over.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3f90e64fba5cfa8e8bb49b6017e8069d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4672">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-786bcf3d8a2be44ab9641e5e724654f3</data>
      <data key="v_content">When Harry pulled back his sheets, he found his invisibility cloak
folded neatly underneath them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-786bcf3d8a2be44ab9641e5e724654f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4673">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-01e842780b583846b1cfdae30fe95793</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was a note pinned to it:
Just in case.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-01e842780b583846b1cfdae30fe95793</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4674">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-51d3adc181be3bca5e68df5c33449fa8</data>
      <data key="v_content">CHAPTER SIXTEEN
THROUGH THE TRAPDOOR
In years to come, Harry would never quite remember how he had managed to
get through his exams when he half expected Voldemort to come bursting
through the door at any moment.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-51d3adc181be3bca5e68df5c33449fa8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4675">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1cd8d606e932a755715e6725a150e897</data>
      <data key="v_content">Yet the days crept by, and there could
be no doubt that Fluffy was still alive and well behind the locked door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1cd8d606e932a755715e6725a150e897</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4676">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-46bc75fe80bec620115b961b77abecec</data>
      <data key="v_content">,It was sweltering hot, especially in the large classroom where they did
their written papers.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-46bc75fe80bec620115b961b77abecec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4677">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2698398d9f9ce88a29646852b5b7b64b</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had been given special, new quills for the
exams, which had been bewitched with an AntiCheating spell.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2698398d9f9ce88a29646852b5b7b64b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4678">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-627afbd4f7c178ecfce642cafaf268ce</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had practical exams as well.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-627afbd4f7c178ecfce642cafaf268ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4679">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2c9f7beb9939c5e332c50a2ca915d90d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor Flitwick called them one by
one into his class to see if they could make a pineapple tapdance across
a desk.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2c9f7beb9939c5e332c50a2ca915d90d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4680">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0c44ad35d04a05ed444d6685b1b8a54f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor McGonagall watched them turn a mouse into a snuffbox
-- points were given for how pretty the snuffbox was, but taken away if
it had whiskers.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0c44ad35d04a05ed444d6685b1b8a54f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4681">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f96f403550b055659f1f5dbe6ef740db</data>
      <data key="v_content">Snape made them all nervous, breathing down their necks
while they tried to remember how to make a Forgetfulness potion.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f96f403550b055659f1f5dbe6ef740db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4682">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f0caf39e3d48a3c8b81cff3672aa9e41</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry did the best he could, trying to ignore the stabbing pains in his
forehead, which had been bothering him ever since his trip into the
forest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f0caf39e3d48a3c8b81cff3672aa9e41</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4683">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5cb81a7579ba5c7dcd72f5bcfdb52949</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville thought Harry had a bad case of exam nerves because
Harry couldn&apos;t sleep, but the truth was that Harry kept being woken by
210
his old nightmare, except that it was now worse than ever because there
was a hooded figure dripping blood in it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5cb81a7579ba5c7dcd72f5bcfdb52949</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4684">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b4b3246fea1e3e007e62d35d89f56c55</data>
      <data key="v_content">Maybe it was because they hadn&apos;t seen what Harry had seen in the forest,
or because they didn&apos;t have scars burning on their foreheads, but Ron
and Hermione didn&apos;t seem as worried about the Stone as Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b4b3246fea1e3e007e62d35d89f56c55</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4685">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4e673180fec6d74dc21bde30fa93b3f7</data>
      <data key="v_content">The idea
of Voldemort certainly scared them, but he didn&apos;t keep visiting them in
dreams, and they were so busy with their studying they didn&apos;t have much
time to fret about what Snape or anyone else might be up to.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4e673180fec6d74dc21bde30fa93b3f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4686">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dcc41beb22bfb8207e0618488ca49a81</data>
      <data key="v_content">Their very last exam was History of Magic.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dcc41beb22bfb8207e0618488ca49a81</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4687">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0147d79b83facf6738fc7936bf208e1d</data>
      <data key="v_content">One hour of answering
questions about batty old wizards who&apos;d invented selfstirring cauldrons
and they&apos;d be free, free for a whole wonderful week until their exam
results came out.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0147d79b83facf6738fc7936bf208e1d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4688">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1bbf0860ac0d9f87c8a49589943db7b8</data>
      <data key="v_content">When the ghost of Professor Binns told them to put
down their quills and roll up their parchment, Harry couldn&apos;t help
cheering with the rest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1bbf0860ac0d9f87c8a49589943db7b8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4689">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e97a64fb8d6e91ae7c880354b3a4f243</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;That was far easier than I thought it would be,&quot; said Hermione as they
joined the crowds flocking out onto the sunny grounds.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e97a64fb8d6e91ae7c880354b3a4f243</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4690">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4413329d46400708253607ae1b4d5e32</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I needn&apos;t have
learned about the 1637 Werewolf Code of Conduct or the uprising of
Elfric the Eager.&quot;
Hermione always liked to go through their exam papers afterward, but Ron
said this made him feel ill, so they wandered down to the lake and
flopped under a tree.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4413329d46400708253607ae1b4d5e32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4691">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c464d88a779317a99f40dcf951c707ca</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Weasley twins and Lee Jordan were tickling the
tentacles of a giant squid, which was basking in the warm shallows.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c464d88a779317a99f40dcf951c707ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4692">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a6b6a07571e5290b7d684822cb1ddec8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ron,&quot;No
more studying,&quot; Ron sighed happily, stretching out on the grass.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a6b6a07571e5290b7d684822cb1ddec8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4693">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eede4667cd8f495cb29ac3d2010a27b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You
could look more cheerful, Harry, we&apos;ve got a week before we find out how
badly we&apos;ve done, there&apos;s no need to worry yet.&quot;
Harry was rubbing his forehead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eede4667cd8f495cb29ac3d2010a27b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4694">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-41d1a53cb6ea108dc6c25567a0095cb0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I wish I knew what this means!&quot; he burst out angrily.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-41d1a53cb6ea108dc6c25567a0095cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4695">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0e51b73606bb733224e68d8a72f72860</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;My scar keeps
hurting -- it&apos;s happened before, but never as often as this.&quot;
&quot;Go to Madam Pomfrey,&quot; Hermione suggested.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0e51b73606bb733224e68d8a72f72860</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4696">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bbd934989291a74f8701af40eafb7c56</data>
      <data key="v_content">it means danger&apos;s
coming....&quot;
Ron couldn&apos;t get worked up, it was too hot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bbd934989291a74f8701af40eafb7c56</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4697">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c3cc3bb01c508ae13ad894a40e1c7506</data>
      <data key="v_content">relax,Hermione&apos;sright,,&quot;Harry, relax, Hermione&apos;s right, the Stone&apos;s safe as long as
211
Dumbledore&apos;s around.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c3cc3bb01c508ae13ad894a40e1c7506</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4698">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0ec93db8e905cc8de8c3e1a4cce28684</data>
      <data key="v_content">we&apos;veneverhad,Anyway, we&apos;ve never had any proof Snape found out
how to get past Fluffy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0ec93db8e905cc8de8c3e1a4cce28684</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4699">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f9739b0f868ed51acaf563f8b3c219ee</data>
      <data key="v_content">He nearly had his leg ripped off once, he&apos;s not
going to try it again in a hurry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f9739b0f868ed51acaf563f8b3c219ee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4700">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0059207eebc975992a1297cb4589cb21</data>
      <data key="v_content">And Neville will play Quidditch for
England before Hagrid lets Dumbledore down.&quot;
Harry nodded, but he couldn&apos;t shake off a lurking feeling that there was
something he&apos;d forgotten to do, something important.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0059207eebc975992a1297cb4589cb21</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4701">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-64833c5a2c44357b16f20657ff3abc27</data>
      <data key="v_content">When he tried to
explain this, Hermione said, &quot;That&apos;s just the exams.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-64833c5a2c44357b16f20657ff3abc27</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4702">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-002b8a02c39d5303b74b4e74422bf011</data>
      <data key="v_content">I woke up last
night and was halfway through my Transfiguration notes before I
remembered we&apos;d done that one.&quot;
Harry was quite sure the unsettled feeling didn&apos;t have anything to do
with work, though.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-002b8a02c39d5303b74b4e74422bf011</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4703">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ebb76375dfccbf988b29c1154937cce8</data>
      <data key="v_content">He watched an owl flutter toward the school across
the bright blue sky, a note clamped in its mouth.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ebb76375dfccbf988b29c1154937cce8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4704">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0409161f50a4acd9262c551deb80414f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid was the only
one who ever sent him letters.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0409161f50a4acd9262c551deb80414f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4705">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6a38e667442177866929536a53bad587</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid would never tell anyone how to get past Fluffy...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6a38e667442177866929536a53bad587</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4706">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-97b10db527d260e67988afec22c44de1</data>
      <data key="v_content">but --
Harry suddenly jumped to his feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-97b10db527d260e67988afec22c44de1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4707">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5142fc5dbab336a52bb646b18eb718cd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Where&apos;re you going?&quot; said Ron sleepily.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5142fc5dbab336a52bb646b18eb718cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4708">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b652ee1f5e9670cf4023ead2b31e4f22</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;ve just thought of something,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b652ee1f5e9670cf4023ead2b31e4f22</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4709">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-419211efeebdcf7d13048235d168d0c8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;ve got to go and see Hagrid, now.&quot;
&quot;Why?&quot; panted Hermione, hurrying to keep up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-419211efeebdcf7d13048235d168d0c8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4710">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b42683d087a80b5cec56b30f6d44ea5b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Don&apos;t you think it&apos;s a bit odd,&quot; said Harry, scrambling up the grassy
slope, &quot;that what Hagrid wants more than anything else is a dragon, and
a stranger turns up who just happens to have an egg in his pocket? How
many people wander around with dragon eggs if it&apos;s against wizard law?
Lucky they found Hagrid, don&apos;t you think? Why didn&apos;t I see it before?&quot;
&quot;What are you talking about?&quot; said Ron, but Harry, sprinting across the
grounds toward the forest, didn&apos;t answer.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b42683d087a80b5cec56b30f6d44ea5b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4711">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c81e0255e68c1482b41c28d500ca375c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid was sitting in an armchair outside his house; his trousers and
sleeves were rolled up, and he was shelling peas into a large bowl.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c81e0255e68c1482b41c28d500ca375c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4712">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-03fba1cfeb821a66e093383e0b249e41</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Finished yer exams? Got time fer a drink?&quot;
&quot;Yes, please,&quot; said Ron, but Harry cut him off.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-03fba1cfeb821a66e093383e0b249e41</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4713">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-db9bda381eae774790222ebdea2d1c5d</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;vegotto,Hagrid, I&apos;ve got to ask you something.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-db9bda381eae774790222ebdea2d1c5d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4714">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a73cd514c47dc050c97f0c8a308f2300</data>
      <data key="v_content">You know
212
that night you won Norbert? What did the stranger you were playing cards
with look like?&quot;
&quot;Dunno,&quot; said Hagrid casually, &quot;he wouldn&apos; take his cloak off.&quot;
He saw the three of them look stunned and raised his eyebrows.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a73cd514c47dc050c97f0c8a308f2300</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4715">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7335bd7f0be716e139cde70cf4174d34</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;It&apos;s not that unusual, yeh get a lot o&apos; funny folk in the Hog&apos;s Head --
that&apos;s the pub down in the village.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7335bd7f0be716e139cde70cf4174d34</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4716">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-030d4790e79bfa6127dbe1e14f18652f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Mighta bin a dragon dealer, mightn&apos;
he? I never saw his face, he kept his hood up.&quot;
Harry sank down next to the bowl of peas.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-030d4790e79bfa6127dbe1e14f18652f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4717">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5f58d193551019e260ebea9005545922</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What did you talk to him
about, Hagrid? Did you mention Hogwarts at all?&quot;
&quot;Mighta come up,&quot; said Hagrid, frowning as he tried to remember.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5f58d193551019e260ebea9005545922</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4718">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5dd5691061073a2ec7de553a272d4833</data>
      <data key="v_content">he asked what I did, an&apos; I told him I was gamekeeper here....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5dd5691061073a2ec7de553a272d4833</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4719">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3f25f4db0a315a1d8c20ec5b1379fc3b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He asked a bit about the sorta creatures I took after...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3f25f4db0a315a1d8c20ec5b1379fc3b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4720">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-785897666830f9bb58bce93be59b83e2</data>
      <data key="v_content">an&apos; I said what I&apos;d always really wanted was a dragon...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-785897666830f9bb58bce93be59b83e2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4721">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c58d3ac7d06c8a3cda75fb807ef4b547</data>
      <data key="v_content">I can&apos; remember too well, &apos;cause he kept buyin&apos; me drinks....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c58d3ac7d06c8a3cda75fb807ef4b547</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4722">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e8dd268cc9fb39c03b00cc2dfc2e0598</data>
      <data key="v_content">thenhesaid,yeah, then he said he had the dragon egg an&apos; we could play
cards fer it if I wanted...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e8dd268cc9fb39c03b00cc2dfc2e0598</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4723">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5d48c64aafcd94da999cb61b771698d</data>
      <data key="v_content">but he had ter be sure I could handle it, he
didn&apos; want it ter go ter any old home....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5d48c64aafcd94da999cb61b771698d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4724">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dc85f804d16fab094f54f610c87bc85d</data>
      <data key="v_content">,So I told him, after Fluffy, a
dragon would be easy...&quot;
&quot;And did he -- did he seem interested in Fluffy?&quot; Harry asked, try ing
to keep his voice calm.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dc85f804d16fab094f54f610c87bc85d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4725">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa120e7dfaae7b69b9bc2003dc0ab4c8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Well -- yeah -- how many three-headed dogs d&apos;yeh meet, even around
Hogwarts? So I told him, Fluffy&apos;s a piece o&apos; cake if yeh know how to
calm him down, jus&apos; play him a bit o&apos; music an&apos; he&apos;ll go straight off
ter sleep --&quot;
Hagrid suddenly looked horrified.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa120e7dfaae7b69b9bc2003dc0ab4c8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4726">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2de993f61b8dd2261fccfe3df579992c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I shouldn&apos;ta told yeh that!&quot; he blurted out.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2de993f61b8dd2261fccfe3df579992c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4727">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3f6c46fabf9fc05182c3e0eea1f4ad35</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Forget I said it! Hey --
where&apos;re yeh goin&apos;?&quot;
Harry, Ron, and Hermione didn&apos;t speak to each other at all until they
came to a halt in the entrance hall, which seemed very cold and gloomy
after the grounds.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3f6c46fabf9fc05182c3e0eea1f4ad35</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4728">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-71a2852ded4eca24e515895dc2ed7639</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;ve got to go to Dumbledore,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-71a2852ded4eca24e515895dc2ed7639</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4729">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d6da27047c8426518c9fd0f3f206c6c3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Hagrid told that stranger
how to get past Fluffy, and it was either Snape or Voldemort under that
213
cloak -- it must&apos;ve been easy, once he&apos;d got Hagrid drunk.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d6da27047c8426518c9fd0f3f206c6c3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4730">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4699e9def625122329fc2492a4c2b110</data>
      <data key="v_content">I just hope
Dumbledore believes us.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4699e9def625122329fc2492a4c2b110</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4731">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6bd05e8fb351bfd7f8cb8146fe623631</data>
      <data key="v_content">Firenze might back us up if Bane doesn&apos;t stop
him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6bd05e8fb351bfd7f8cb8146fe623631</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4732">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-52e1e550887232b193549c3e0193593e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Where&apos;s Dumbledore&apos;s office?&quot;
They looked around, as if hoping to see a sign pointing them in the
right direction.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-52e1e550887232b193549c3e0193593e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4733">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-99230f39c7c3d5cd333ec571c09a309d</data>
      <data key="v_content">They had never been told where Dumbledore lived, nor
did they know anyone who had been sent to see him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-99230f39c7c3d5cd333ec571c09a309d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4734">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-55205204b774371312fec9a68c2622da</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;ll just have to --&quot; Harry began, but a voice suddenly rang across
the hall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-55205204b774371312fec9a68c2622da</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4735">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-385d9ad91be322f4ab6b0f9ea5d74690</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What are you three doing inside?&quot;
It was Professor McGonagall, carrying a large pile of books.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-385d9ad91be322f4ab6b0f9ea5d74690</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4736">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-45dbe5f0457200274471ca75152d98fe</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We want to see Professor Dumbledore,&quot; said Hermione, rather bravely,
Harry and Ron thought.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-45dbe5f0457200274471ca75152d98fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4737">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f6e87a6c50ec5d7369bf2dff95aa9cb6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;See Professor Dumbledore?&quot; Professor McGonagall repeated, as though
this was a very fishy thing to want to do.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f6e87a6c50ec5d7369bf2dff95aa9cb6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4738">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d3819c65fc675f88b7d67005234ea583</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Why?&quot;
Harry swallowed -- now what?
&quot;It&apos;s sort of secret,&quot; he said, but he wished at once he hadn&apos;t, because
Professor McGonagall&apos;s nostrils flared.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d3819c65fc675f88b7d67005234ea583</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4739">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c7fe77a34e0aaed6ff9475e76a2d1d98</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Professor Dumbledore left ten minutes ago,&quot; she said coldly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c7fe77a34e0aaed6ff9475e76a2d1d98</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4740">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1b5b2f56df5b47cd3719f193ce9aa3ad</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He
received an urgent owl from the Ministry of Magic and flew off for
London at once.&quot;
&quot;He&apos;s gone?&quot; said Harry frantically.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1b5b2f56df5b47cd3719f193ce9aa3ad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4741">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-53409b57afa80468226fed98565af747</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Now?&quot;
&quot;Professor Dumbledore is a very great wizard, Potter, he has many
demands on his time --
&quot;But this is important.&quot;
&quot;Something you have to say is more important than the Ministry of Magic,
Potter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-53409b57afa80468226fed98565af747</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4742">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-48009e0b0568a129ce702439182941c0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidHarry,throwing,&quot;Look,&quot; said Harry, throwing caution to the winds, &quot;Professor -- it&apos;s
about the Sorcerer&apos;s tone --&quot;
214
Whatever Professor McGonagall had expected, it wasn&apos;t that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-48009e0b0568a129ce702439182941c0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4743">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bb7e7b9cfa532438d72cba99f0674236</data>
      <data key="v_content">The books
she was carrying tumbled out of her arms, but she didn&apos;t pick them up.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bb7e7b9cfa532438d72cba99f0674236</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4744">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5190e14822e655f66f8a99eb600b6d98</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;How do you know --?&quot; she spluttered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5190e14822e655f66f8a99eb600b6d98</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4745">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-976b2505f9110ab4932a1879f92aa963</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ithink--,&quot;Professor, I think -- I know -- that Sn- that someone&apos;s going to try
and steal the Stone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-976b2505f9110ab4932a1879f92aa963</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4746">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-49e600a6268d6ba94ad2e352eeafe597</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;ve got to talk to Professor Dumbledore.&quot;
She eyed him with a mixture of shock and suspicion.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-49e600a6268d6ba94ad2e352eeafe597</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4747">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-954f75b5b1ad0fbb1dbd3c35268d148d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Professor Dumbledore will be back tomorrow,&quot; she said finally.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-954f75b5b1ad0fbb1dbd3c35268d148d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4748">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1baa4ba356f895990f3284cecb44cf85</data>
      <data key="v_content">I don&apos;t
know how you found out about the Stone, but rest assured, no one can
possibly steal it, it&apos;s too well protected.&quot;
&quot;But Professor --&quot;
&quot;Potter, I know what I&apos;m talking about,&quot; she said shortly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1baa4ba356f895990f3284cecb44cf85</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4749">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-99415cb0704718170400c4c34fc47da0</data>
      <data key="v_content">She bent down
and gathered up the fallen books.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-99415cb0704718170400c4c34fc47da0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4750">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b8102387545f24c9436378d64533e145</data>
      <data key="v_content">I suggest you all go back outside and
enjoy the sunshine.&quot;
But they didn&apos;t.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b8102387545f24c9436378d64533e145</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4751">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1be5cbe5c14c9a331e049cdd102a58da</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidHarry,,&quot;It&apos;s tonight,&quot; said Harry, once he was sure Professor McGonagall was
out of earshot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1be5cbe5c14c9a331e049cdd102a58da</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4752">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-894f85fb7739e31b89b88392e391039e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Snape&apos;s going through the trapdoor tonight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-894f85fb7739e31b89b88392e391039e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4753">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-88eb6687426f42438e099de7ee987325</data>
      <data key="v_content">He&apos;s found
out everything he needs, and now he&apos;s got Dumbledore out of the way.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-88eb6687426f42438e099de7ee987325</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4754">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a58ef824c0065162316d5cd33c35d339</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He
sent that note, I bet the Ministry of Magic will get a real shock when
Dumbledore turns up.&quot;
&quot;But what can we --&quot;
Hermione gasped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a58ef824c0065162316d5cd33c35d339</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4755">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9b1bcea5c0e2ed6a2dd939ad23c907cf</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You shouldn&apos;t be inside on a day like this,&quot; he said, with an odd,
twisted smile.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9b1bcea5c0e2ed6a2dd939ad23c907cf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4756">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-671c24b8fe15eeea8b674af44d30c305</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We were --&quot; Harry began, without any idea what he was going to say.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-671c24b8fe15eeea8b674af44d30c305</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4757">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f358f8db6da604fd6c2be1d44210200a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You want to be more careful,&quot; said Snape.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f358f8db6da604fd6c2be1d44210200a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4758">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ed831e8beee8526f25d7052550f03aec</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Hanging around
215
like this, people will think you&apos;re up to something.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ed831e8beee8526f25d7052550f03aec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4759">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d3d97b4733acc7a549c2434aaf9d4109</data>
      <data key="v_content">And Gryffindor
really can&apos;t afford to lose any more points, can it?&quot;
Harry flushed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d3d97b4733acc7a549c2434aaf9d4109</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4760">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-64ed3d9356bcd32a6ce440c64ba71500</data>
      <data key="v_content">They turned to go outside, but Snape called them back.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-64ed3d9356bcd32a6ce440c64ba71500</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4761">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2e381f2bb31805f0a43d4228592bc382</data>
      <data key="v_content">Potter--,&quot;Be warned, Potter -- any more nighttime wanderings and I will
personally make sure you are expelled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2e381f2bb31805f0a43d4228592bc382</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4762">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-396b9903c57ef3301c3560e62f3ce34f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Good day to you.&quot;
He strode off in the direction of the staffroom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-396b9903c57ef3301c3560e62f3ce34f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4763">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4b31c30480e95f7441fd940a40f3b869</data>
      <data key="v_content">Out on the stone steps, Harry turned to the others.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4b31c30480e95f7441fd940a40f3b869</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4764">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7111e6b8f1e3dac721832b30f318d606</data>
      <data key="v_content">here&apos;swhatwe&apos;ve,&quot;Right, here&apos;s what we&apos;ve got to do,&quot; he whispered urgently.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7111e6b8f1e3dac721832b30f318d606</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4765">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7be70778259c3e773ba43c3f783b6854</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;One of us
has got to keep an eye on Snape -- wait outside the staff room and
follow him if he leaves it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7be70778259c3e773ba43c3f783b6854</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4766">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4804ffbf90ae31f7b535e120579f1427</data>
      <data key="v_content">you&apos;dbetterdo,Hermione, you&apos;d better do that.&quot;
&quot;Why me?&quot;
&quot;It&apos;s obvious,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4804ffbf90ae31f7b535e120579f1427</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4767">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7ce1f231cadd3944e1e03e8e6ff30691</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You can pretend to be waiting for Professor
Flitwick, you know.&quot; He put on a high voice, &quot;&apos;Oh Professor Flitwick,
I&apos;m so worried, I think I got question fourteen b wrong....&apos;&quot;
&quot;Oh, shut up,&quot; said Hermione, but she agreed to go and watch out for
Snape.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7ce1f231cadd3944e1e03e8e6ff30691</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4768">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6bebe109c10a9f8c48463f766b38a6d8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And we&apos;d better stay outside the third-floor corridor,&quot; Harry told Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6bebe109c10a9f8c48463f766b38a6d8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4769">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aa459529a17ec8b7757964b4c4058690</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Come on.&quot;
But that part of the plan didn&apos;t work.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aa459529a17ec8b7757964b4c4058690</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4770">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c49ecac6cdabd5727228cca0d73953f9</data>
      <data key="v_content">No sooner had they reached the
door separating Fluffy from the rest of the school than Professor
McGonagall turned up again and this time, she lost her temper.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c49ecac6cdabd5727228cca0d73953f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4771">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-666a7b3e68415d74cc62cefd1c857d8c</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I suppose you think you&apos;re harder to get past than a pack of
enchantments!&quot; she stormed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-666a7b3e68415d74cc62cefd1c857d8c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4772">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2616dc5895c1b3731dce7089978582d4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Enough of this nonsense! If I hear you &apos;ve
come anywhere near here again, I&apos;ll take another fifty points from
Gryffindor! Yes, Weasley, from my own house!&quot; Harry and Ron went back to
the common room, Harry had just said, &quot;At least Hermione&apos;s on Snape&apos;s
tail,&quot; when the portrait of the Fat Lady swung open and Hermione came
in.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2616dc5895c1b3731dce7089978582d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4773">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-07e0c12d57515332975921764767ae15</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Snape came out and asked me what I was
doing, so I said I was waiting for Flitwick, and Snape went to get him,
216
and I&apos;ve only just got away, I don&apos;t know where Snape went.&quot;
&quot;Well, that&apos;s it then, isn&apos;t it?&quot; Harry said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-07e0c12d57515332975921764767ae15</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4774">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-db6a8d1520df0dba4433e9f74b881c0e</data>
      <data key="v_content">The other two stared at him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-db6a8d1520df0dba4433e9f74b881c0e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4775">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0aa0b5b5d348857b8f0dfe880e55cb0a</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was pale and his eyes were glittering.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0aa0b5b5d348857b8f0dfe880e55cb0a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4776">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-198a9a89c5e31b582bec6b99de5c21df</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;m going out of here tonight and I&apos;m going to try and get to the Stone
first.&quot;
&quot;You&apos;re mad!&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-198a9a89c5e31b582bec6b99de5c21df</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4777">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cc02d2dd15cd4f4ced4f8a1b86bce0a1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;After what McGonagall and Snape have said?
You&apos;ll be expelled!&quot;
&quot;SO WHAP&quot; Harry shouted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cc02d2dd15cd4f4ced4f8a1b86bce0a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4778">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8a1c3eddc0ac0507d598648d06784f09</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Don&apos;t you understand? If Snape gets hold of
the Stone, Voldemort&apos;s coming back! Haven&apos;t you heard what it was like
when he was trying to take over? There won&apos;t be any Hogwarts to get
expelled from! He&apos;ll flatten it, or turn it into a school for the Dark
Arts! Losing points doesn&apos;t matter anymore, can&apos;t you see? D&apos;you think
he&apos;ll leave you and your families alone if Gryffindor wins the house
cup? If I get caught before I can get to the Stone, well, I&apos;ll have to
go back to the Dursleys and wait for Voldemort to find me there, it&apos;s
only dying a bit later than I would have, because I&apos;m never going over
to the Dark Side! I&apos;m going through that trapdoor tonight and nothing
you two say is going to stop me! Voldemort killed my parents, remember?&quot;
He glared at them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8a1c3eddc0ac0507d598648d06784f09</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4779">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5cf30be60134a02fdda08aca6af09a9b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;said,&quot;You&apos;re right Harry,&quot; said Hermione in a small voice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5cf30be60134a02fdda08aca6af09a9b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4780">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-78e0b8cbda67acc4f70c7d7845fef8fa</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;ll use the invisibility cloak,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-78e0b8cbda67acc4f70c7d7845fef8fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4781">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-457df565bbf9ea8a4b95782aa889d29f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s just lucky I got it
back.&quot;
&quot;But will it cover all three of us?&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-457df565bbf9ea8a4b95782aa889d29f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4782">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b159b29b498626cde2fe28d8dde72b35</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;All -- all three of us?&quot;
&quot;Oh, come off it, you don&apos;t think we&apos;d let you go alone?&quot;
&quot;Of course not,&quot; said Hermione briskly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b159b29b498626cde2fe28d8dde72b35</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4783">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3944a99ff8b85166f5a478311d0a85cd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;How do you think you&apos;d get to
the Stone without us? I&apos;d better go and took through my books, there
might be something useful...&quot;
217
&quot;But if we get caught, you two will be expelled, too.&quot;
&quot;Not if I can help it,&quot; said Hermione grimly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3944a99ff8b85166f5a478311d0a85cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4784">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9fd53906d4cd499d2711b7dd75231ff4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Flitwick told me in
secret that I got a hundred and twelve percent on his exam.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9fd53906d4cd499d2711b7dd75231ff4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4785">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-af3f4fca4d1d3e854838370bf28f3eaa</data>
      <data key="v_content">They&apos;re not
throwing me out after that.&quot;
After dinner the three of them sat nervously apart in the common room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-af3f4fca4d1d3e854838370bf28f3eaa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4786">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6f980290c3f9049acf22cc73c714b477</data>
      <data key="v_content">Nobody bothered them; none of the Gryffindors had anything to say to
Harry any more, after all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6f980290c3f9049acf22cc73c714b477</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4787">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4315cdfcc0eaac2f027887ccdfcd8098</data>
      <data key="v_content">This was the first night he hadn&apos;t been upset
by it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4315cdfcc0eaac2f027887ccdfcd8098</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4788">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bbc34e92f2803625eaf82ee51ca4a568</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione was skimming through all her notes, hoping to come
across one of the enchantments they were about to try to break.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bbc34e92f2803625eaf82ee51ca4a568</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4789">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3761b7fa9cbece4f60667ced4f66a405</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry
and Ron didn&apos;t talk much.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3761b7fa9cbece4f60667ced4f66a405</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4790">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f3ca795dc48fddf2de197cbf7264457d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Both of them were thinking about what they
were about to do.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f3ca795dc48fddf2de197cbf7264457d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4791">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-10a603d8ece73358b8dabfc53f6c104e</data>
      <data key="v_content">theroomemptied,Slowly, the room emptied as people drifted off to bed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-10a603d8ece73358b8dabfc53f6c104e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4792">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2e62384ba6607779718c9762fa1ce37e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;Better get the cloak,&quot; Ron muttered, as Lee Jordan finally left,
stretching and yawning.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2e62384ba6607779718c9762fa1ce37e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4793">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a4f1b3f9b1477eee0a96132d8bffb4b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry ran upstairs to their dark dormitory.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a4f1b3f9b1477eee0a96132d8bffb4b6</data>
    </node>
