    </node>
    <node id="n4800">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a6a0d2123b95790af6ffc3565adeab8d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Neville stared at their guilty faces.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a6a0d2123b95790af6ffc3565adeab8d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4801">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9deb6e541450f6624ef7ce25a228c5ec</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;You&apos;re going out again,&quot; he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9deb6e541450f6624ef7ce25a228c5ec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4802">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-15ea83ee5b6b8d294f9878125784be8e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Why don&apos;t you go to bed,
Neville?&quot;
Harry looked at the grandfather clock by the door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-15ea83ee5b6b8d294f9878125784be8e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4803">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4221afb48387f8b971cd915d8ab2096f</data>
      <data key="v_content">They couldn&apos;t afford
to waste any more time, Snape might even now be playing Fluffy to sleep.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4221afb48387f8b971cd915d8ab2096f</data>
    </node>
