And he scooted off
&quot;Brilliant, Harry!&quot; whispered Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8d1cb8ca2eb05222dc58b8fc63edacc5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4842">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-985ff3e73322a7b6252e74276b8ab0db</data>
      <data key="v_content">,A few seconds later, they were there, outside the third-floor corridor
-- and the door was already ajar.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-985ff3e73322a7b6252e74276b8ab0db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4843">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3c0e1cd1dd298ce19c65938943294c51</data>
      <data key="v_content">thereyouare,&quot;,&quot;Well, there you are,&quot; Harry said quietly, &quot;Snape&apos;s already got past
Fluffy.&quot;
Seeing the open door somehow seemed to impress upon all three of them
what was facing them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3c0e1cd1dd298ce19c65938943294c51</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4844">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0f3e997b9683873af6333bb1bc22137b</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry,Underneath the cloak, Harry turned to the other
two.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0f3e997b9683873af6333bb1bc22137b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4845">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0996b3c64eeef0c6baa96f2931a1d3cf</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;If you want to go back, I won&apos;t blame you,&quot; he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0996b3c64eeef0c6baa96f2931a1d3cf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4846">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6eca18f6f966be6a4349a540a92550e6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You can take the
cloak, I won&apos;t need it now.&quot;
&quot;Don&apos;t be stupid,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6eca18f6f966be6a4349a540a92550e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4847">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-32eef9b5a823d4aaad3a86313fc628a3</data>
      <data key="v_content">,As the door creaked, low, rumbling growls met their ears.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-32eef9b5a823d4aaad3a86313fc628a3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4848">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9de3567a10db8cce8e2cbaa2d8a91727</data>
      <data key="v_content">All three of
the dog&apos;s noses sniffed madly in their direction, even though it
couldn&apos;t see them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9de3567a10db8cce8e2cbaa2d8a91727</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4849">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7f9f57f5dd8d7397f3999c24f6c2a0b5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What&apos;s that at its feet?&quot; Hermione whispered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7f9f57f5dd8d7397f3999c24f6c2a0b5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4850">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2bf76582debf1e614d5db533982f5949</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;Looks like a harp,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2bf76582debf1e614d5db533982f5949</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4851">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7651092da0e01a182cd903c41a62e811</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Snape must have left it there.&quot;
&quot;It must wake up the moment you stop playing,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7651092da0e01a182cd903c41a62e811</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4852">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c79900268e022e1c57b54ad85b1dc200</data>
      <data key="v_content">heregoes...&quot;221,&quot;Well, here
goes...&quot;
221
He put Hagrid&apos;s flute to his lips and blew.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c79900268e022e1c57b54ad85b1dc200</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4853">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bc357649267a281ef4b516e0a83cf949</data>
      <data key="v_content">It wasn&apos;t really a tune, but
from the first note the beast&apos;s eyes began to droop.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bc357649267a281ef4b516e0a83cf949</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4854">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f5956d9db2b7c5c9f42181ca4603dc5a</data>
      <data key="v_content">thedog&apos;sgrowls,Slowly, the dog&apos;s growls ceased -- it tottered on its paws and
fell to its knees, then it slumped to the ground, fast asleep.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f5956d9db2b7c5c9f42181ca4603dc5a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4855">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-48e0e40e28b5958e6051a77346c8104a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ronwarned,&quot;Keep playing,&quot; Ron warned Harry as they slipped out of the cloak and
crept toward the trapdoor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-48e0e40e28b5958e6051a77346c8104a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4856">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d67a1dff09cb73471a5b50cfd9495408</data>
      <data key="v_content">They could feel the dog&apos;s hot, smelly breath
as they approached the giant heads.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d67a1dff09cb73471a5b50cfd9495408</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4857">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec3bd90a9b3fcccbfe48e3ddeb803bee</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I think we&apos;ll be able to pull the
door open,&quot; said Ron, peering over the dog&apos;s back.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec3bd90a9b3fcccbfe48e3ddeb803bee</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4858">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-304a3acca9e50499990127a5705238e6</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Want to go first,
Hermione?&quot;
&quot;No, I don&apos;t!&quot;
&quot;All right.&quot; Ron gritted his teeth and stepped carefully over the dog&apos;s
legs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-304a3acca9e50499990127a5705238e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4859">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-357b49ee15f8848ba984bdb22137059d</data>
      <data key="v_content">He bent and pulled the ring of the trapdoor, which swung up and
open.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-357b49ee15f8848ba984bdb22137059d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4860">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-84d23407b92acbbd9c383bb26ae230e3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What can you see?&quot; Hermione said anxiously.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-84d23407b92acbbd9c383bb26ae230e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4861">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4271e27dab4a242d10f8569ef71a5a97</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Nothing -- just black -- there&apos;s no way of climbing down, we&apos;ll just
have to drop.&quot;
Harry, who was still playing the flute, waved at Ron to get his
attention and pointed at himself.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4271e27dab4a242d10f8569ef71a5a97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4862">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4aea3e0af31fcfdf6fa4075b47b26920</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You want to go first? Are you sure?&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4aea3e0af31fcfdf6fa4075b47b26920</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4863">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-701370e972f1a3c8be02e9b5beb5a35f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I don&apos;t know how deep
this thing goes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-701370e972f1a3c8be02e9b5beb5a35f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4864">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fe8f041f68cb7bdd451acaf3fcfb68f5</data>
      <data key="v_content">Give the flute to Hermione so she can keep him asleep.&quot;
Harry handed the flute over.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fe8f041f68cb7bdd451acaf3fcfb68f5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4865">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e5ef1a6499ec7264fc1b87ec2d707fb7</data>
      <data key="v_content">In the few seconds&apos; silence, the dog
growled and twitched, but the moment Hermione began to play, it fell
back into its deep sleep.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e5ef1a6499ec7264fc1b87ec2d707fb7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4866">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0b2d945926738c5ae2e566158af55ea7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry climbed over it and looked down through the trapdoor.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0b2d945926738c5ae2e566158af55ea7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4867">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-71f511c06b3e25938aad2fb35caec4b2</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was no
sign of the bottom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-71f511c06b3e25938aad2fb35caec4b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4868">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8409a779f9daecdc4660d6f60029772f</data>
      <data key="v_content">He lowered himself through the hole until he was hanging on by his
fingertips.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8409a779f9daecdc4660d6f60029772f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4869">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-052cf1c302808daefb01b5984487fe23</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then he looked up at Ron and said, &quot;If anything happens to
me, don&apos;t follow.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-052cf1c302808daefb01b5984487fe23</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4870">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-035482277775853108c7f2a226c6fc63</data>
      <data key="v_content">Go straight to the owlery and send Hedwig to
Dumbledore, right?&quot;
&quot;Right,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-035482277775853108c7f2a226c6fc63</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4871">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8af1893437205bf5ac76432d0468a4c1</data>
      <data key="v_content">222
&quot;See you in a minute, I hope...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8af1893437205bf5ac76432d0468a4c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4872">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c3f1f601f52ba782e3f92b36e3682bb5</data>
      <data key="v_content">dampairrushed,Cold, damp air rushed past him as he fell down, down,
down and -- FLUMP.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c3f1f601f52ba782e3f92b36e3682bb5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4873">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d082139f21ff123a582ae1144504925c</data>
      <data key="v_content">muffled,With a funny, muffled sort of thump he landed on
something soft.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d082139f21ff123a582ae1144504925c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4874">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c0f6aa024200c2a50683eff3c8aa7cf6</data>
      <data key="v_content">He sat up and felt around, his eyes not used to the
gloom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c0f6aa024200c2a50683eff3c8aa7cf6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4875">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dba8c933e628fe80e257c6369b0013fd</data>
      <data key="v_content">It felt as though he was sitting on some sort of plant.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dba8c933e628fe80e257c6369b0013fd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4876">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-492325ca64e935a22b3d8c4f917a42a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s okay!&quot; he called up to the light the size of a postage stamp,
which was the open trapdoor, &quot;it&apos;s a soft landing, you can jump!&quot;
Ron followed right away.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-492325ca64e935a22b3d8c4f917a42a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4877">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cb7f4d456bacc95948d8ed4bcaa5a47d</data>
      <data key="v_content">sprawlednext,He landed, sprawled next to Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cb7f4d456bacc95948d8ed4bcaa5a47d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4878">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-46e1b70db82601e7fe810c6f272b2f01</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What&apos;s this stuff?&quot; were his first words.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-46e1b70db82601e7fe810c6f272b2f01</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4879">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2a91ea1a3b70f4da00cc52aeca940270</data>
      <data key="v_content">somesortof,&quot;Dunno, some sort of plant thing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2a91ea1a3b70f4da00cc52aeca940270</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4880">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-81b1c4a46b938d0e250d541e71b5c5f0</data>
      <data key="v_content">I suppose it&apos;s here to break the fall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-81b1c4a46b938d0e250d541e71b5c5f0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4881">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-77ccfec1a2a27df71c2b1db005099503</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione!&quot;The,Come on, Hermione!&quot;
The distant music stopped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-77ccfec1a2a27df71c2b1db005099503</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4882">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8f422c2521688598ae5f8ab60f1cc1cc</data>
      <data key="v_content">There was a loud bark from the dog, but
Hermione had already jumped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8f422c2521688598ae5f8ab60f1cc1cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4883">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ed9eb49de5143f6066da15df63103c1a</data>
      <data key="v_content">She landed on Harry&apos;s other side.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ed9eb49de5143f6066da15df63103c1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4884">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8474caf3fe473ea0832900332d12aeba</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We must be miles under the school , she said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8474caf3fe473ea0832900332d12aeba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4885">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f4637f0ac80414b9af49ac2246b23dfe</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Lucky this plant thing&apos;s here, really,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f4637f0ac80414b9af49ac2246b23dfe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4886">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c3020e192222fc9acc57e8182997ba43</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Look at you both!&quot;
She leapt up and struggled toward a damp wall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c3020e192222fc9acc57e8182997ba43</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4887">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2d0b8afa738b68273e923fd67c8e5841</data>
      <data key="v_content">She had to struggle
because the moment she had landed, the plant had started to twist
snakelike tendrils around her ankles.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2d0b8afa738b68273e923fd67c8e5841</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4888">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2b52096cedb8757811cadef8539507d3</data>
      <data key="v_content">As for Harry and Ron, their legs
had already been bound tightly in long creepers without their noticing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2b52096cedb8757811cadef8539507d3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4889">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6520db4ae11c2fe1bb484c0dedc8e5f7</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hermione had managed to free herself before the plant got a firm grip on
her.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6520db4ae11c2fe1bb484c0dedc8e5f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4890">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-37f1c6a32ee0360a2511b8484184d101</data>
      <data key="v_content">Now she watched in horror as the two boys fought to pull the plant
off them, but the more they strained against it, the tighter and faster
the plant wound around them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-37f1c6a32ee0360a2511b8484184d101</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4891">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-434ec440c6b2bd002a67eee20a06f7bd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I know what this is -- it&apos;s
Devil&apos;s Snare!&quot;
&quot;Oh, I&apos;m so glad we know what it&apos;s called, that&apos;s a great help,&quot; snarled
Ron, leaning back, trying to stop the plant from curling around his
neck.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-434ec440c6b2bd002a67eee20a06f7bd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4892">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ffbb5c0cf1c63a627c8f7edda7312403</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;mtrying,&quot;Shut up, I&apos;m trying to remember how to kill it!&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ffbb5c0cf1c63a627c8f7edda7312403</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4893">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e42eae90002f271855c9990b526d7c2c</data>
      <data key="v_content">hurryup,,223
&quot;Well, hurry up, I can&apos;t breathe!&quot; Harry gasped, wrestling with it as it
curled around his chest.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e42eae90002f271855c9990b526d7c2c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4894">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-138e80cf71b2c969cc4da27409e6a744</data>
      <data key="v_content">what did Professor Sprout say? -- it
likes the dark and the damp
&quot;So light a fire!&quot; Harry choked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-138e80cf71b2c969cc4da27409e6a744</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4895">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-22eb746a5144d22afa8452e6d08bf58a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Yes -- of course -- but there&apos;s no wood!&quot; Hermione cried, wringing her
hands.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-22eb746a5144d22afa8452e6d08bf58a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4896">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-89b51e590c88f8f009e24d33e40ef70e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;HAVE YOU GONE MAD?&quot; Ron bellowed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-89b51e590c88f8f009e24d33e40ef70e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4897">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca236be0633bcbc5e6f67b67f1c23710</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;ARE YOU A WITCH OR NOT?&quot;
&quot;Oh, right!&quot; said Hermione, and she whipped out her wand, waved it,
muttered something, and sent a jet of the same bluebell flames she had
used on Snape at the plant.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca236be0633bcbc5e6f67b67f1c23710</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4898">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-86ef054d145437d91070956a9a58e190</data>
      <data key="v_content">In a matter of seconds, the two boys felt it
loosening its grip as it cringed away from the light and warmth.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-86ef054d145437d91070956a9a58e190</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4899">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2255d17460a56a58939f305ade4a2457</data>
      <data key="v_content">it,Wriggling and flailing, it unraveled itself from their bodies, and they
were able to pull free.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2255d17460a56a58939f305ade4a2457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4900">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7f7a3540e82461a34bcbe8465d66d792</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Lucky you pay attention in Herbology, Hermione,&quot; said Harry as he
joined her by the wall, wiping sweat off his face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7f7a3540e82461a34bcbe8465d66d792</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4901">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-183387e6f724b850eb4bbb78e9767ea4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidRon,&quot;and,&quot;Yeah,&quot; said Ron, &quot;and lucky Harry doesn&apos;t lose his head in a crisis --
&apos;there&apos;s no wood,&apos; honestly.&quot;
&quot;This way,&quot; said Harry, pointing down a stone passageway, which was the
only way forward.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-183387e6f724b850eb4bbb78e9767ea4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4902">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3c35f4fc24dae5bed2533467d75faa06</data>
      <data key="v_content">All they could hear apart from their footsteps was the gentle drip of
water trickling down the walls.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3c35f4fc24dae5bed2533467d75faa06</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4903">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-149575fb748c9304a00fefc099b69545</data>
      <data key="v_content">,The passageway sloped downward, and
Harry was reminded of Gringotts.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-149575fb748c9304a00fefc099b69545</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4904">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fb61c8dd48f1f45c2b1b8297961ddfba</data>
      <data key="v_content">With an unpleasant jolt of the heart,
he remembered the dragons said to be guarding vaults in the wizards&apos;
bank.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fb61c8dd48f1f45c2b1b8297961ddfba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4905">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ff99c45c4de51f4e0ec3279990dd4a27</data>
      <data key="v_content">If they met a dragon, a fully-grown dragon -- Norbert had been bad
enough...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ff99c45c4de51f4e0ec3279990dd4a27</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4906">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b7701be2f7e6480868c3896c89f4bdb9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Can you hear something?&quot; Ron whispered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b7701be2f7e6480868c3896c89f4bdb9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4907">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6110e66662456e363d2d7840832c4e70</data>
      <data key="v_content">A soft rustling and clinking seemed to be coming from up
ahead.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6110e66662456e363d2d7840832c4e70</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4908">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7ba52c689f057e21a7bc841ad6f3d4e4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Do you think it&apos;s a ghost?&quot;
224
&quot;I don&apos;t know...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7ba52c689f057e21a7bc841ad6f3d4e4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4909">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca4ea226b08c593ed82153bb870f8b4e</data>
      <data key="v_content">sounds like wings to me.&quot;
&quot;There&apos;s light ahead -- I can see something moving.&quot;
They reached the end of the passageway and saw before them a brilliantly
lit chamber, its ceiling arching high above them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca4ea226b08c593ed82153bb870f8b4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4910">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dac4d3d703272414aa13a5de41ba993a</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was full of small,
jewel-bright birds, fluttering and tumbling all around the room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dac4d3d703272414aa13a5de41ba993a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4911">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cc463dc85d2af319b26b191fa38f2a61</data>
      <data key="v_content">On the
opposite side of the chamber was a heavy wooden door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cc463dc85d2af319b26b191fa38f2a61</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4912">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b4df9405f7479e68500047dea580ae45</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Do you think they&apos;ll attack us if we cross the room?&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b4df9405f7479e68500047dea580ae45</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4913">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b2f0ef22d9a6c95c9551edcbe186811a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;They don&apos;t look very vicious, but I suppose if
they all swooped down at once...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b2f0ef22d9a6c95c9551edcbe186811a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4914">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-afb70330c6f068ad43fd266b9f550fbc</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;ll
run.&quot;
He took a deep breath, covered his face with his arms, and sprinted
across the room.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-afb70330c6f068ad43fd266b9f550fbc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4915">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b619f42fdd8636c5b32ef18dd2b77001</data>
      <data key="v_content">He expected to feel sharp beaks and claws tearing at
him any second, but nothing happened.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b619f42fdd8636c5b32ef18dd2b77001</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4916">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3073d5e2e03aa669e9ce440a2981c663</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He
pulled the handle, but it was locked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3073d5e2e03aa669e9ce440a2981c663</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4917">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-13d8823412b785ac9ab11e363e142dfb</data>
      <data key="v_content">They tugged and heaved at the door, but it
wouldn&apos;t budge, not even when Hermione tried her Alohomora charm.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-13d8823412b785ac9ab11e363e142dfb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4918">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-480c6a490405747e89ff15bc3aa0f091</data>
      <data key="v_content">they can&apos;t be here just for decoration,&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-480c6a490405747e89ff15bc3aa0f091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4919">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7631640c2973cc9fc9e0bd0c26579de4</data>
      <data key="v_content">They watched the birds soaring overhead, glittering -- glittering?
&quot;They&apos;re not birds!&quot; Harry said suddenly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7631640c2973cc9fc9e0bd0c26579de4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4920">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ed0cff91a4f254ac065fc5bb0f22dec3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;They&apos;re keys! Winged keys --
look carefully.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ed0cff91a4f254ac065fc5bb0f22dec3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4921">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d3d8932119d733bcb08f746c17e5ac07</data>
      <data key="v_content">So that must mean...&quot; he looked around the chamber while
the other two squinted up at the flock of keys.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d3d8932119d733bcb08f746c17e5ac07</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4922">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7e1d79e4bff1a7e3f26b715d1eeaeaa5</data>
      <data key="v_content">yes -- look!
Broomsticks! We&apos;ve got to catch the key to the door!&quot;
&quot;But there are hundreds of them!&quot;
Ron examined the lock on the door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7e1d79e4bff1a7e3f26b715d1eeaeaa5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4923">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5fa155606dbea21e33164f368ade3e08</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;re looking for a big, old-fashioned one -- probably silver, like the
handle.&quot;
They each seized a broomstick and kicked off into the air, soaring into
the midst of the cloud of keys.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5fa155606dbea21e33164f368ade3e08</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4924">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e257ada59b6c4d804b899ce5bc723898</data>
      <data key="v_content">,They grabbed and snatched, but the
225
bewitched keys darted and dived so quickly it was almost impossible to
catch one.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e257ada59b6c4d804b899ce5bc723898</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4925">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-75b1b29250994b823f81c1dce437b780</data>
      <data key="v_content">though,,Not for nothing, though, was Harry the youngest Seeker in a century.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-75b1b29250994b823f81c1dce437b780</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4926">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c740a9cba1f51dd79697436cff639adc</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
had a knack for spotting things other people didn&apos;t.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c740a9cba1f51dd79697436cff639adc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4927">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d9825c4c46e0aec9afbf2dc16a848dc7</data>
      <data key="v_content">After a minute&apos;s
weaving about through the whirl of rainbow feathers, he noticed a large
silver key that had a bent wing, as if it had already been caught and
stuffed roughly into the keyhole.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d9825c4c46e0aec9afbf2dc16a848dc7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4928">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6aa7ce44c1bad9b6746adced18d3eb5f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;That one!&quot; he called to the others.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6aa7ce44c1bad9b6746adced18d3eb5f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4929">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4ae528e508b6148ba85d582829e4b180</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;That big one -- there -- no, there
-- with bright blue wings -- the feathers are all crumpled on one side.&quot;
Ron went speeding in the direction that Harry was pointing, crashed into
the ceiling, and nearly fell off his broom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4ae528e508b6148ba85d582829e4b180</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4930">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-74c277e64423b4d6d353d13ddef15fe1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;ve got to close in on it!&quot; Harry called, not taking his eyes off the
key with the damaged wing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-74c277e64423b4d6d353d13ddef15fe1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4931">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c1418317865ceb46d3705615d5e58ede</data>
      <data key="v_content">youcomeat,&quot;Ron, you come at it from above -- Hermione,
stay below and stop it from going down and I&apos;ll try and catch it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c1418317865ceb46d3705615d5e58ede</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4932">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a17b42ece3b924a9aa4c02dcc5f33c0b</data>
      <data key="v_content">NOW!&quot;Rondived,,Right,
NOW!&quot;
Ron dived, Hermione rocketed upward, the key dodged them both, and Harry
streaked after it; it sped toward the wall, Harry leaned forward and
with a nasty, crunching noise, pinned it against the stone with one
hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a17b42ece3b924a9aa4c02dcc5f33c0b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4933">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c65483bcdc92d788dd65ca35b901dcb1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron and Hermione&apos;s cheers echoed around the high chamber.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c65483bcdc92d788dd65ca35b901dcb1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4934">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dcb72df5d9396a62c18ea375173a8498</data>
      <data key="v_content">and,They landed quickly, and Harry ran to the door, the key struggling in
his hand.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dcb72df5d9396a62c18ea375173a8498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4935">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e9b36df144fb609281737d9968486eb5</data>
      <data key="v_content">He rammed it into the lock and turned -- it worked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e9b36df144fb609281737d9968486eb5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4936">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ecfa1f51f6034000da3c5e146d9ea8c8</data>
      <data key="v_content">The moment
the lock had clicked open, the key took flight again, looking very
battered now that it had been caught twice.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ecfa1f51f6034000da3c5e146d9ea8c8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4937">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9737a57571306e7802c7749c4d08b388</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Ready?&quot; Harry asked the other two, his hand on the door handle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9737a57571306e7802c7749c4d08b388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4938">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-69d0e0bd4133734a6f1388169d1d0446</data>
      <data key="v_content">The next chamber was so dark they couldn&apos;t see anything at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-69d0e0bd4133734a6f1388169d1d0446</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4939">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-cea335a0146637d5ce08f2e95a203c4e</data>
      <data key="v_content">But as
they stepped into it, light suddenly flooded the room to reveal an
astonishing sight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-cea335a0146637d5ce08f2e95a203c4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4940">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-92d9e7ab483fc34070bfec85e5381752</data>
      <data key="v_content">They were standing on the edge of a huge chessboard, behind the black
chessmen, which were all taller than they were and carved from what
looked like black stone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-92d9e7ab483fc34070bfec85e5381752</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4941">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0c93884005785ba67bc22681995e27dd</data>
      <data key="v_content">wayacross,Facing them, way across the chamber, were the
white pieces.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0c93884005785ba67bc22681995e27dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4942">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-efbdfe99a078457993f9772854ab2f50</data>
      <data key="v_content">RonandHermione,Harry, Ron and Hermione shivered slightly -- the towering
white chessmen had no faces.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-efbdfe99a078457993f9772854ab2f50</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4943">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-747a4cb7dbbc0a6dd71786e50ec84374</data>
      <data key="v_content">226
&quot;Now what do we do?&quot; Harry whispered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-747a4cb7dbbc0a6dd71786e50ec84374</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4944">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec23c946c9d06bda191dea939c17ec99</data>
      <data key="v_content">isn&apos;tit?&quot;,&quot;It&apos;s obvious, isn&apos;t it?&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec23c946c9d06bda191dea939c17ec99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4945">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b90f54f08ac44bfff6d7b98e9f892546</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;We&apos;ve got to play our way across
the room.&quot;
Behind the white pieces they could see another door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b90f54f08ac44bfff6d7b98e9f892546</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4946">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-81110ebca0633785a7581f07a2dee147</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidRon,,&quot;I think,&quot; said Ron, &quot;we&apos;re going to have to be chessmen.&quot;
He walked up to a black knight and put his hand out to touch the
knight&apos;s horse.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-81110ebca0633785a7581f07a2dee147</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4947">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a90169c95bad56bd74e369a642e45e5e</data>
      <data key="v_content">thestone,At once, the stone sprang to life.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a90169c95bad56bd74e369a642e45e5e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4948">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3a43d82c29d850baa5f6d6247dca7cfe</data>
      <data key="v_content">The horse pawed the
ground and the knight turned his helmeted head to look down at Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3a43d82c29d850baa5f6d6247dca7cfe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4949">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-72dac88d0537fed329c9b53fcd2ae486</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Do we -- er -- have to join you to get across?&quot; The black knight
nodded.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-72dac88d0537fed329c9b53fcd2ae486</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4950">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-eeaa5825942feab33af56a9e79f93056</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron turned to the other two.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-eeaa5825942feab33af56a9e79f93056</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4951">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3ae45e8caa700798a84b212af171fe64</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;This needs thinking about he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3ae45e8caa700798a84b212af171fe64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4952">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-474aa1d8eaeb00ca2f7795f2f8a5785b</data>
      <data key="v_content">I suppose we&apos;ve got to take the
place of three of the black pieces....&quot;
Harry and Hermione stayed quiet, watching Ron think.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-474aa1d8eaeb00ca2f7795f2f8a5785b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4953">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d9fb8b3f1e6b418086cf1a9100736ca7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Now,,Finally he said,
&quot;Now, don&apos;t be offended or anything, but neither of you are that good at
chess --&quot;
&quot;We&apos;re not offended,&quot; said Harry quickly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d9fb8b3f1e6b418086cf1a9100736ca7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4954">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5b80a2bcfeb4d61a488a46d73eea0b7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Just tell us what to do.&quot;
&quot;Well, Harry, you take the place of that bishop, and Hermione, YOU 90
next to him instead of that castle.&quot;
&quot;What about you?&quot;
&quot;I&apos;m going to be a knight,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5b80a2bcfeb4d61a488a46d73eea0b7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4955">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4bc25c53814954a95168a7971eb5c9a9</data>
      <data key="v_content">The chessmen seemed to have been listening, because at these words a
knight, a bishop, and a castle turned their backs on the white pieces
and walked off the board, leaving three empty squares that Harry, Ron,
and Hermione took.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4bc25c53814954a95168a7971eb5c9a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4956">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9bd3b847cadb4951ad61ddae5fa31406</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;White always plays first in chess,&quot; said Ron, peering across the board.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9bd3b847cadb4951ad61ddae5fa31406</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4957">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7fa8c9f892847e5c4cf08f9207e56367</data>
      <data key="v_content">look...&quot;
A white pawn had moved forward two squares.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7fa8c9f892847e5c4cf08f9207e56367</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4958">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c1fdc5e98c036d105ea11ad4f0325cc9</data>
      <data key="v_content">227
Ron started to direct the black pieces.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c1fdc5e98c036d105ea11ad4f0325cc9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4959">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-665c4e6fc0dd3c9e84961bdec360ddae</data>
      <data key="v_content">They moved silently wherever he
sent them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-665c4e6fc0dd3c9e84961bdec360ddae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4960">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a9b1702d8e0f66948453554f84da5c17</data>
      <data key="v_content">What if they lost?
&quot;Harry -- move diagonally four squares to the right.&quot;
Their first real shock came when their other knight was taken.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a9b1702d8e0f66948453554f84da5c17</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4961">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4ff589f6ed681023fe25d155f75824d7</data>
      <data key="v_content">The white
queen smashed him to the floor and dragged him off the board, where he
lay quite still, facedown.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4ff589f6ed681023fe25d155f75824d7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4962">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-44d46c40ac6dd9b825e509260fa35f42</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Had to let that happen,&quot; said Ron, looking shaken.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-44d46c40ac6dd9b825e509260fa35f42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4963">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-adfff04d5f444e2bc0ab3c70c50719c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Leaves you free to
take that bishop, Hermione, go on.&quot;
Every time one of their men was lost, the white pieces showed no mercy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-adfff04d5f444e2bc0ab3c70c50719c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4964">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-868f9d60c6f5b1d325628706e85b29aa</data>
      <data key="v_content">Soon there was a huddle of limp black players slumped along the wall.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-868f9d60c6f5b1d325628706e85b29aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4965">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-667402fe05af9be1d8c8cbdc5e739d19</data>
      <data key="v_content">Rononlyjust,Twice, Ron only just noticed in time that Harry and Hermione were in
danger.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-667402fe05af9be1d8c8cbdc5e739d19</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4966">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-35c80efa7060d8f9e222206f957ac227</data>
      <data key="v_content">He himself darted around the board, taking almost as many white
pieces as they had lost black ones.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-35c80efa7060d8f9e222206f957ac227</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4967">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bfb20c5203f0c251cdea4aba8870d1a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;he,&quot;We&apos;re nearly there,&quot; he muttered suddenly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bfb20c5203f0c251cdea4aba8870d1a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4968">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-920755ae57a87641d9a97a8e3c8ca800</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Let me think let me
think...&quot;
The white queen turned her blank face toward him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-920755ae57a87641d9a97a8e3c8ca800</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4969">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e6c84b7aac90f24d64b0915339d24706</data>
      <data key="v_content">,&quot;Yes...&quot; said Ron softly, &quot;It&apos;s the only way...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e6c84b7aac90f24d64b0915339d24706</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4970">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2d5c9fcbb8afe06e5efacaac29fedd03</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;ve got to be taken.&quot;
&quot;NOF Harry and Hermione shouted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2d5c9fcbb8afe06e5efacaac29fedd03</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4971">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f1b7acafcd124f3786c1f30ff10f6900</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;ve got to make some sacrifices! I take
one step forward and she&apos;ll take me -- that leaves you free to checkmate
the king, Harry!&quot;
&quot;But --&quot;
&quot;Do you want to stop Snape or not?&quot;
&quot;Ron --&quot;
&quot;Look, if you don&apos;t hurry up, he&apos;ll already have the Stone!&quot;
There was no alternative.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f1b7acafcd124f3786c1f30ff10f6900</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4972">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4b9a142ed13b506dda8a7a6a6da1b56b</data>
      <data key="v_content">his,&quot;Ready?&quot; Ron called, his face pale but determined.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4b9a142ed13b506dda8a7a6a6da1b56b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4973">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-df83f5076717e04e972f766b17681587</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Here I go - now,
228
don&apos;t hang around once you&apos;ve won.&quot;
He stepped forward, and the white queen pounced.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-df83f5076717e04e972f766b17681587</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4974">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-80ca9fd576f0cee4057304221fe6ddff</data>
      <data key="v_content">She struck Ron hard
across the head with her stone arm, and he crashed to the floor -
Hermione screamed but stayed on her square - the white queen dragged Ron
to one side.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-80ca9fd576f0cee4057304221fe6ddff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4975">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9c42ed1cc6b19565147781ee387328ca</data>
      <data key="v_content">He looked as if he&apos;d been knocked out.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9c42ed1cc6b19565147781ee387328ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4976">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d5cb271c918374f917655a8d0ec86047</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harrymovedthree,Shaking, Harry moved three spaces to the left.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d5cb271c918374f917655a8d0ec86047</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4977">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d1b8d5781bbe86961b318e4496e8f745</data>
      <data key="v_content">The white king took off his crown and threw it at Harry&apos;s feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d1b8d5781bbe86961b318e4496e8f745</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4978">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-894b43bd82511dc7a4a9577c8abb2125</data>
      <data key="v_content">The chessmen parted and bowed, leaving the door ahead clear.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-894b43bd82511dc7a4a9577c8abb2125</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4979">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fc80c498bb732ac8d669fbc0e1995c62</data>
      <data key="v_content">With
one last desperate look back at Ron, Harry and Hermione charged through
the door and up the next passageway.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fc80c498bb732ac8d669fbc0e1995c62</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4980">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9bdae88873682e264e3a71238e697e8b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What if he&apos;s --?&quot;
&quot;He&apos;ll be all right,&quot; said Harry, trying to convince himself.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9bdae88873682e264e3a71238e697e8b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4981">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-39e0d99c57c5da85f2619cc872bc91c8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What do
you reckon&apos;s next?&quot;
&quot;We&apos;ve had Sprout&apos;s, that was the Devil&apos;s Snare; Flitwick must&apos;ve put
charms on the keys; McGonagall transfigured the chessmen to make them
alive; that leaves Quirrell&apos;s spell, and Snape&apos;s.&quot;
They had reached another door.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-39e0d99c57c5da85f2619cc872bc91c8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4982">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-30304f46167dd839f6ad37a30f9f883a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Go on.&quot;
Harry pushed it open.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-30304f46167dd839f6ad37a30f9f883a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4983">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ce36ff5e0dd04d4d2f11379038f2185a</data>
      <data key="v_content">A disgusting smell filled their nostrils, making both of them pull their
robes up over their noses.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ce36ff5e0dd04d4d2f11379038f2185a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4984">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-13592f21ecc95288bbc63fe116fd74d3</data>
      <data key="v_content">theysaw,,Eyes watering, they saw, flat on the floor in
front of them, a troll even larger than the one they had tackled, out
cold with a bloody lump on its head.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-13592f21ecc95288bbc63fe116fd74d3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4985">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8e3adaee0ce58c170c95907639d5dcfd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;m glad we didn&apos;t have to fight that one,&quot; Harry whispered as they
stepped carefully over one of its massive legs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8e3adaee0ce58c170c95907639d5dcfd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4986">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-624c933d85315285ded27f0493f4a6a4</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ican&apos;t,&quot;Come on, I can&apos;t
breathe.&quot;
He pulled open the next door, both of them hardly daring to look at what
came next - but there was nothing very frightening in here, just a table
with seven differently shaped bottles standing on it in a line.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-624c933d85315285ded27f0493f4a6a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4987">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b1f50eb24ab0c72b48597bc7ea8e220f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What do we have to do?&quot;
They stepped over the threshold, and immediately a fire sprang up behind
them in the doorway.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b1f50eb24ab0c72b48597bc7ea8e220f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4988">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a0436c9bda90e77cddef8b4c34a295a0</data>
      <data key="v_content">It wasn&apos;t ordinary fire either; it was purple.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a0436c9bda90e77cddef8b4c34a295a0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4989">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5c5703483761527cd468e937ffb709f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">,At
the same instant, black flames shot up in the doorway leading onward.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5c5703483761527cd468e937ffb709f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4990">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b57ebf8853749b1ff4dde380756aaf7a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Look!&quot; Hermione seized a roll of paper lying next to the bottles.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b57ebf8853749b1ff4dde380756aaf7a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4991">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5d4bb2e4c11d42446e4318dd162e9d0c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry
looked over her shoulder to read it:
Danger lies before you, while safety lies behind,
Two of us will help you, which ever you would find,
One among us seven will let you move ahead,
Another will transport the drinker back instead,
Two among our number hold only nettle wine,
Three of us are killers, waiting bidden in line.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5d4bb2e4c11d42446e4318dd162e9d0c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4992">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-404e1d05c638019aafe241bf95fe27f7</data>
      <data key="v_content">unlessyouwish,Choose, unless you wish to stay here forevermore,
To help you in your choice, we give you these clues four:
First, however slyly the poison tries to hide
You will always find some on nettle wine&apos;s left side;
Second, different are those who stand at either end,
But if you would move onward, neither is your friend;
Third, as you see clearly, all are different size,
Neither dwarf nor giant holds death in their insides;
Fourth, the second left and the second on the right
Are twins once you taste them, though different at first sight.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-404e1d05c638019aafe241bf95fe27f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4993">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4ddea06da56e8133ccd15b5c0e683623</data>
      <data key="v_content">230
Hermione let out a great sigh and Harry, amazed, saw that she was
smiling, the very last thing he felt like doing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4ddea06da56e8133ccd15b5c0e683623</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4994">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d4376ccca5616f526d7fa98b4085f39f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;This isn&apos;t magic -- it&apos;s logic -- a puzzle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d4376ccca5616f526d7fa98b4085f39f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4995">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b27298f5672ad2671c2864e1dd80a033</data>
      <data key="v_content">A lot of the greatest wizards haven&apos;t got an ounce of logic, they&apos;d be
stuck in here forever.&quot;
&quot;But so will we, won&apos;t we?&quot; &quot;Of course not,&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b27298f5672ad2671c2864e1dd80a033</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4996">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-427c28e3288879385d380ab3c478a7ec</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Everything
we need is here on this paper.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-427c28e3288879385d380ab3c478a7ec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4997">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2062dc8d17a99b553157578e0e1a0c9</data>
      <data key="v_content">Seven bottles: three are poison; two are
wine; one will get us safely through the black fire, and one will get us
back through the purple.&quot;
&quot;But how do we know which to drink?&quot;
&quot;Give me a minute.&quot;
Hermione read the paper several times.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2062dc8d17a99b553157578e0e1a0c9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4998">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1474fd88f4942b27c1e7fe291a175d46</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then she walked up and down the
line of bottles, muttering to herself and pointing at them.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1474fd88f4942b27c1e7fe291a175d46</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n4999">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-391f4dc4457632daf8a9f2eec4a6d9b2</data>
      <data key="v_content">sheclapped,At last, she
clapped her hands.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-391f4dc4457632daf8a9f2eec4a6d9b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5000">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7e4cb06448428f4feeabaa2c28ea6ba8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;The smallest bottle will get us through the black
fire -- toward the Stone.&quot;
Harry looked at the tiny bottle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7e4cb06448428f4feeabaa2c28ea6ba8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5001">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5426bfe1f0386ba0ef9f630914a5524d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;There&apos;s only enough there for one of us,&quot; he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5426bfe1f0386ba0ef9f630914a5524d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5002">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-48d43a3ffab8218e75e2d08160ee3238</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;That&apos;s hardly one
swallow.&quot;
They looked at each other.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-48d43a3ffab8218e75e2d08160ee3238</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5003">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-273ed59e3c6a3eface44a5ee749bc3b8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Which one will get you back through the purple flames?&quot;
Hermione pointed at a rounded bottle at the right end of the line.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-273ed59e3c6a3eface44a5ee749bc3b8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5004">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-94551610bcc01a390def6c37af8c651d</data>
      <data key="v_content">listen,getback,&quot;No, listen, get back and get Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-94551610bcc01a390def6c37af8c651d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5005">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-99862938fac264710db4c965257cf34a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Grab
brooms from the flying- key room, they&apos;ll get you out of the trapdoor
and past Fluffy -- go straight to the owlery and send Hedwig to
Dumbledore, we need him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-99862938fac264710db4c965257cf34a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5006">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9908ca01a4b77a05509df9631ec7e8db</data>
      <data key="v_content">I might be able to hold Snape off for a while,
but I&apos;m no match for him, really.&quot;
&quot;But Harry -- what if You-Know-Who&apos;s with him?&quot;
&quot;Well -- I was lucky once, wasn&apos;t I?&quot; said Harry, pointing at his scar.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9908ca01a4b77a05509df9631ec7e8db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5007">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0d07bb600fbb7d362a964509d4297cd4</data>
      <data key="v_content">231
&quot;I might get lucky again.&quot;
Hermione&apos;s lip trembled, and she suddenly dashed at Harry and threw her
arms around him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0d07bb600fbb7d362a964509d4297cd4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5008">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-337bfde90b12802f4290718e792364f6</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Hermione!&quot;
&quot;Harry -- you&apos;re a great wizard, you know.&quot;
&quot;I&apos;m not as good as you,&quot; said Harry, very embarrassed, as she let go of
him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-337bfde90b12802f4290718e792364f6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5009">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-06a822c7b80b2b1500bf7b2f42382fef</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Books! And cleverness! There are more important
things -- friendship and bravery and -- oh Harry -- be careful!&quot;
&quot;You drink first,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-06a822c7b80b2b1500bf7b2f42382fef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5010">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a1ef973d7c7c0ac1d561b1422e9c2424</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You are sure which is which, aren&apos;t
you?&quot;
&quot;Positive,&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a1ef973d7c7c0ac1d561b1422e9c2424</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5011">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9ae217ecc5ea3388b01019b3ec8596b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">She took a long drink from the round bottle
at the end, and shuddered.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9ae217ecc5ea3388b01019b3ec8596b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5012">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f887b28b3b1f57e28633c6222c55e04d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s not poison?&quot; said Harry anxiously.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f887b28b3b1f57e28633c6222c55e04d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5013">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1158e353f4dc174f0c9b2595e12f2685</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;No -- but it&apos;s like ice.&quot;
&quot;Quick, go, before it wears off.&quot;
&quot;Good luck -- take care.&quot;
&quot;GO!&quot;
Hermione turned and walked straight through the purple fire.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1158e353f4dc174f0c9b2595e12f2685</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5014">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-53f9e6e9cb1830289e7150d7be309cf6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry took a deep breath and picked up the smallest bottle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-53f9e6e9cb1830289e7150d7be309cf6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5015">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f0673d10c4615003a3ba0ebde63170bd</data>
      <data key="v_content">He turned to
face the black flames.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f0673d10c4615003a3ba0ebde63170bd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5016">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-13edc668447ae1649f7f98cdf307480d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;he,&quot;Here I come,&quot; he said, and he drained the little bottle in one gulp.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-13edc668447ae1649f7f98cdf307480d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5017">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-229d6a453dc935a6c764eb4e08c07070</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was indeed as though ice was flooding his body.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-229d6a453dc935a6c764eb4e08c07070</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5018">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-28ad4eb517c758cc9668c31146415b37</data>
      <data key="v_content">He put the bottle
down and walked forward; he braced himself, saw the black flames licking
his body, but couldn&apos;t feel them -- for a moment he could see nothing
but dark fire -- then he was on the other side, in the last chamber.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-28ad4eb517c758cc9668c31146415b37</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5019">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8a8e72dbb77c692f4cc11c475d454246</data>
      <data key="v_content">232
There was already someone there -- but it wasn&apos;t Snape.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8a8e72dbb77c692f4cc11c475d454246</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5020">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fb691a7879054e1c107f7d6c00e1f1aa</data>
      <data key="v_content">CHAPTER SEVENTEEN
THE MAN WITH TWO FACES
It was Quirrell.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fb691a7879054e1c107f7d6c00e1f1aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5021">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c4f784639ce8e630e40e1135a9f38850</data>
      <data key="v_content">His face wasn&apos;t twitching at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c4f784639ce8e630e40e1135a9f38850</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5022">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e6356397bd499300809f0d041b3a46fa</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I wondered whether I&apos;d be meeting you here,
Potter.&quot;
&quot;But I thought -- Snape --&quot;
&quot;Severus?&quot; Quirrell laughed, and it wasn&apos;t his usual quivering treble,
either, but cold and sharp.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e6356397bd499300809f0d041b3a46fa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5023">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5950d3f83d5d5a3807381060265c20ea</data>
      <data key="v_content">Severusdoesseem,&quot;Yes, Severus does seem the type, doesn&apos;t
he? So useful to have him swooping around like an overgrown bat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5950d3f83d5d5a3807381060265c20ea</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5024">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-973cbb276418f868ea2f80541508af3d</data>
      <data key="v_content">who,Next to
him, who would suspect p-p-poor, st-stuttering P-Professor Quirrell?&quot;
Harry couldn&apos;t take it in.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-973cbb276418f868ea2f80541508af3d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5025">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-233c5320d5ca737a3bff17c755877578</data>
      <data key="v_content">,This couldn&apos;t be true, it couldn&apos;t.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-233c5320d5ca737a3bff17c755877578</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5026">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d9852f9044b3273e54750fd84edc15f5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But Snape tried to kill me!&quot;
&quot;No, no, no.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d9852f9044b3273e54750fd84edc15f5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5027">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e650ff95625e7fb84971f19ecbc714b1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Your friend Miss Granger accidentally
knocked me over as she rushed to set fire to Snape at that Quidditch
match.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e650ff95625e7fb84971f19ecbc714b1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5028">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a200be026d31d791cd93585892cc4ce1</data>
      <data key="v_content">She broke my eye contact with you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a200be026d31d791cd93585892cc4ce1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5029">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7cfe8e0875b6add5d8483c3de71bf0d0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Another few seconds and I&apos;d
have got you off that broom.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7cfe8e0875b6add5d8483c3de71bf0d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5030">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-23dd7065c2501356686a514719186a62</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;d have managed it before then if Snape
hadn&apos;t been muttering a countercurse, trying to save you.&quot;
&quot;Snape was trying to save me?&quot;
&quot;Of course,&quot; said Quirrell coolly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-23dd7065c2501356686a514719186a62</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5031">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-93f3aa7c259816f79d6c54b5382bab4e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;\Why do you think he wanted to
referee your next match? He was trying to make sure I didn&apos;t do it
again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-93f3aa7c259816f79d6c54b5382bab4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5032">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e13b0397d5bd7aa18f496ddd22dbe3d5</data>
      <data key="v_content">I couldn&apos;t do anything
with Dumbledore watching.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e13b0397d5bd7aa18f496ddd22dbe3d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5033">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ce7a452cf2e95c8efc3ada82e387ffb9</data>
      <data key="v_content">All the other teachers thought Snape was
trying to stop Gryffindor from winning, he did make himself unpopular...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ce7a452cf2e95c8efc3ada82e387ffb9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5034">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f3b97109ea3bf09907a9d6e83709e537</data>
      <data key="v_content">and what a waste of time, when after all that, I&apos;m going to kill you
tonight.&quot;
233
Quirrell snapped his fingers.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f3b97109ea3bf09907a9d6e83709e537</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5035">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ab21fec6c4678e3391219ccccc0305bc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ropes sprang out of thin air and wrapped
themselves tightly around Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ab21fec6c4678e3391219ccccc0305bc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5036">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a44d2a81bffbb36de028a5794cd9ec7d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;re too nosy to live, Potter.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a44d2a81bffbb36de028a5794cd9ec7d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5037">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-310808640dd0a8c19bc56922eb8878fc</data>
      <data key="v_content">Scurrying around the school on
Halloween like that, for all I knew you&apos;d seen me coming to look at what
was guarding the Stone.&quot;
&quot;You let the troll in?&quot;
&quot;Certainly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-310808640dd0a8c19bc56922eb8878fc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5038">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0c69b74e565adf4a6da6749ee83dfb3c</data>
      <data key="v_content">I have a special gift with trolls -- you must have seen what
I did to the one in the chamber back there? Unfortunately, while
everyone else was running around looking for it, Snape, who already
suspected me, went straight to the third floor to head me off -- and not
only did my troll fail to beat you to death, that three-headed dog
didn&apos;t even manage to bite Snape&apos;s leg off properly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0c69b74e565adf4a6da6749ee83dfb3c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5039">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6c2e40fde78b9602ac92b0794478cfe0</data>
      <data key="v_content">I need to examine this interesting mirror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6c2e40fde78b9602ac92b0794478cfe0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5040">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-759f70e7bf8533ce7009829c9c91281a</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was only then that Harry realized what was standing behind Quirrell.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-759f70e7bf8533ce7009829c9c91281a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5041">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-13e7a81914d3f5c228a8d35a6d4103f4</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was the Mirror of Erised.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-13e7a81914d3f5c228a8d35a6d4103f4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5042">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-58e94d6d540dd46d14fe2870c4b33a2d</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;This mirror is the key to finding the Stone,&quot; Quirrell murmured,
tapping his way around the frame.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-58e94d6d540dd46d14fe2870c4b33a2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5043">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e14ca35208aaf7ec0829eb2253499585</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Trust Dumbledore to come up with
something like this...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e14ca35208aaf7ec0829eb2253499585</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5044">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-656a3af8ae0e8e874c52ea04bb1a5709</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;ll be far away by the
time he gets back....&quot;
All Harry could think of doing was to keep Quirrell talking and stop him
from concentrating on the mirror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-656a3af8ae0e8e874c52ea04bb1a5709</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5045">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9042f4c9f5a5f78f8c91226401aa8216</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I saw you and Snape in the forest --&quot; he blurted out.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9042f4c9f5a5f78f8c91226401aa8216</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5046">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5773889ba485813965e8a0b746040ca8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;saidQuirrellidly,,&quot;Yes,&quot; said Quirrell idly, walking around the mirror to look at the
back.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5773889ba485813965e8a0b746040ca8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5047">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1a7845b5a98d9141ffedca5f9c210cbc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He was on to me by that time, trying to find out how far I&apos;d got.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1a7845b5a98d9141ffedca5f9c210cbc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5048">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-67bafc681a289f29426eaa5dda51bb60</data>
      <data key="v_content">Tried to frighten me - as though he could,
when I had Lord Voldemort on my side....&quot;
Quirrell came back out from behind the mirror and stared hungrily into
it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-67bafc681a289f29426eaa5dda51bb60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5049">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1f5e674004da924ade3fc6ffbd3a7cab</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;m presenting it to my master...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1f5e674004da924ade3fc6ffbd3a7cab</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5050">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7f02b78ad85e6915addf85ff975c4695</data>
      <data key="v_content">but where is it?&quot;
Harry struggled against the ropes binding him, but they didn&apos;t give.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7f02b78ad85e6915addf85ff975c4695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5051">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-31b90cd2ed31946dbaf82da9be96918b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
234
had to keep Quirrell from giving his whole attention to the mirror.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-31b90cd2ed31946dbaf82da9be96918b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5052">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-43caa1a32784b6a197bdcd6cfc4ce126</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But Snape always seemed to hate me so much.&quot;
&quot;Oh, he does,&quot; said Quirrell casually, &quot;heavens, yes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-43caa1a32784b6a197bdcd6cfc4ce126</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5053">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9aaf046bbee0350599fc2dc011af7a92</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was at Hogwarts
with your father, didn&apos;t you know? They loathed each other.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9aaf046bbee0350599fc2dc011af7a92</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5054">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-08a4b25999a7fdfbf00a42822906a01d</data>
      <data key="v_content">But he never
wanted you dead.&quot;
&quot;But I heard you a few days ago, sobbing -- I thought Snape was
threatening you....&quot;
For the first time, a spasm of fear flitted across Quirrell&apos;s face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-08a4b25999a7fdfbf00a42822906a01d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5055">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-163f680fb59c5f60e837dd2ee35e0cc9</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;hesaid,&quot;I,&quot;Sometimes,&quot; he said, &quot;I find it hard to follow my master&apos;s instructions
-- he is a great wizard and I am weak --&quot;
&quot;You mean he was there in the classroom with you?&quot; Harry gasped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-163f680fb59c5f60e837dd2ee35e0cc9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5056">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-20eca01b3e2a83577d8f1df833835a37</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He is with me wherever I go,&quot; said Quirrell quietly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-20eca01b3e2a83577d8f1df833835a37</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5057">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-62e88c7b89a3e814115602d0a4929002</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I met him when I
traveled around the world.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-62e88c7b89a3e814115602d0a4929002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5058">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-180480e7bb1adf9e8a948514f9a53d8a</data>
      <data key="v_content">A foolish young man I was then, full of
ridiculous ideas about good and evil.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-180480e7bb1adf9e8a948514f9a53d8a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5059">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c0ad5ac2d7ad56e40ebdda4b5f8390a3</data>
      <data key="v_content">Lord Voldemort showed me how wrong
I was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c0ad5ac2d7ad56e40ebdda4b5f8390a3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5060">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ec54b324ed11088dca7db62e9bb65080</data>
      <data key="v_content">There is no good and evil, there is only power, and those too
weak to seek it....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ec54b324ed11088dca7db62e9bb65080</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5061">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0ad5a666601bdc0d5c74e5e512bf566f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ihave,Since then, I have served him faithfully, although I
have let him down many times.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0ad5a666601bdc0d5c74e5e512bf566f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5062">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3f171126f6159c7e6deafe10901beb55</data>
      <data key="v_content">He has had to be very hard on me.&quot;
Quirrell shivered suddenly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3f171126f6159c7e6deafe10901beb55</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5063">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-be17bb5a313a5c610cdf2be1aaab4af5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;He does not forgive mistakes easily.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-be17bb5a313a5c610cdf2be1aaab4af5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5064">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1289f29eabef97aaf05ce967075cfe8a</data>
      <data key="v_content">When I
failed to steal the stone from Gringotts, he was most displeased.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1289f29eabef97aaf05ce967075cfe8a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5065">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b988087559ce3edcf7b014ebce7d175b</data>
      <data key="v_content">decided he would have to keep a closer watch on me....&quot;
Quirrell&apos;s voice trailed away.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b988087559ce3edcf7b014ebce7d175b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5066">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-53b28a86864247c8cd3ec467e4e66efb</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry was remembering his trip to Diagon
Alley -how could he have been so stupid? He&apos;d seen Quirrell there that
very day, shaken hands with him in the Leaky Cauldron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-53b28a86864247c8cd3ec467e4e66efb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5067">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3dc3fd2e18e2acca601f2f0198d21e73</data>
      <data key="v_content">is the Stone inside the mirror? Should I break
it?&quot;
Harry&apos;s mind was racing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3dc3fd2e18e2acca601f2f0198d21e73</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5068">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a4cc1236f6f14ea0088516fa86ff92e8</data>
      <data key="v_content">What I want more than anything else in the world at the moment, he
thought, is to find the Stone before Quirrell does.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a4cc1236f6f14ea0088516fa86ff92e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5069">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6b60dc0966dfbacc535b718c1cec90d5</data>
      <data key="v_content">So if I look in the
mirror, I should see myseff finding it -- which means I&apos;ll see where
it&apos;s hidden! But how can I look without Quirrell realizing what I&apos;m up
235
to?
He tried to edge to the left, to get in front of the glass without
Quirrell noticing, but the ropes around his ankles were too tight: he
tripped and fell over.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6b60dc0966dfbacc535b718c1cec90d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5070">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1b6c0f29cdd66d51c5b323c423c53b01</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was still talking to
himself.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1b6c0f29cdd66d51c5b323c423c53b01</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5071">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d33aba8e8bd8300504c172eb57113cd7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What does this mirror do? How does it work? Help me, Master!&quot;
And to Harry&apos;s horror, a voice answered, and the voice seemed to come
from Quirrell himself
&quot;Use the boy...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d33aba8e8bd8300504c172eb57113cd7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5072">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-20669c0db3122ee3e6ea49fed05cf2a6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Use the boy...&quot;
Quirrell rounded on Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-20669c0db3122ee3e6ea49fed05cf2a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5073">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-24849e9465496d9b9d6cd2bf48868034</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Yes -- Potter -- come here.&quot;
He clapped his hands once, and the ropes binding Harry fell off.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-24849e9465496d9b9d6cd2bf48868034</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5074">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6e203d7d8589d4561ae8a626f02b67e0</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry
got slowly to his feet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6e203d7d8589d4561ae8a626f02b67e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5075">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dc9ef8c2c9f5f50f3bbcae8a02900e37</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Look in the mirror and tell me what you
see.&quot;
Harry walked toward him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dc9ef8c2c9f5f50f3bbcae8a02900e37</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5076">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-04a9929326db275a8052a9cd1b508c32</data>
      <data key="v_content">he,I must lie, he thought desperately.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-04a9929326db275a8052a9cd1b508c32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5077">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2a58258c229afd6dbcbc10c30aa0fbe7</data>
      <data key="v_content">I must look and lie about what I
see, that&apos;s all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2a58258c229afd6dbcbc10c30aa0fbe7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5078">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-45a2c4fc2e891cf10977446dc5ba49b8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry breathed in the funny smell that
seemed to come from Quirrell&apos;s turban.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-45a2c4fc2e891cf10977446dc5ba49b8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5079">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5421fdbd03e7dd23504a22e50db98f63</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He closed his eyes, stepped in
front of the mirror, and opened them again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5421fdbd03e7dd23504a22e50db98f63</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5080">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dbfce247ebc7dd4129bbeda5d26fbbf1</data>
      <data key="v_content">,He saw his reflection, pale and scared-looking at first.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dbfce247ebc7dd4129bbeda5d26fbbf1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5081">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b3073c6764d2c4eae56277a2044ca410</data>
      <data key="v_content">,But a moment
later, the reflection smiled at him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b3073c6764d2c4eae56277a2044ca410</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5082">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-af9e88ca453d6cc9e7c9f79a269d10d5</data>
      <data key="v_content">It put its hand into its pocket and
pulled out a blood-red stone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-af9e88ca453d6cc9e7c9f79a269d10d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5083">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa843a457df850807539e6d86d0de684</data>
      <data key="v_content">It winked and put the Stone back in its
pocket -- and as it did so, Harry felt something heavy drop into his
real pocket.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa843a457df850807539e6d86d0de684</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5084">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5673de24c2df96a45a4edc89b9768799</data>
      <data key="v_content">Somehow -- incredibly -- he&apos;d gotten the Stone.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5673de24c2df96a45a4edc89b9768799</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5085">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9be76016ab08566cb5b77f1e3a6037ec</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What do you see?&quot;
Harry screwed up his courage.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9be76016ab08566cb5b77f1e3a6037ec</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5086">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d4fc090d57ef2d2e6c3bf27732c05570</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I see myself shaking hands with Dumbledore,&quot; he invented.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d4fc090d57ef2d2e6c3bf27732c05570</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5087">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a286b9198aeca761c72f3840344c164b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I -- I&apos;ve
won the house cup for Gryffindor.&quot;
236
Quirrell cursed again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a286b9198aeca761c72f3840344c164b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5088">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a1dbc23f5cf769a10903c46394629c86</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Get out of the way,&quot; he said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a1dbc23f5cf769a10903c46394629c86</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5089">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6960e40fc92027776211e3f6a49a3e63</data>
      <data key="v_content">,As Harry moved aside, he felt the
Sorcerer&apos;s Stone against his leg.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6960e40fc92027776211e3f6a49a3e63</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5090">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-801e1cde88fcf63cb4377734d2214e4f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dare he make a break for it?
But he hadn&apos;t walked five paces before a high voice spoke, though
Quirrell wasn&apos;t moving his lips.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-801e1cde88fcf63cb4377734d2214e4f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5091">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-539a769f0e1754a64a5a98f6ba56e9ca</data>
      <data key="v_content">come,He lies...&quot;
&quot;Potter, come back here!&quot; Quirrell shouted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-539a769f0e1754a64a5a98f6ba56e9ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5092">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-470b651b7be871d392846ef0364c5fa0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Tell me the truth! What did
you just see?&quot;
The high voice spoke again.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-470b651b7be871d392846ef0364c5fa0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5093">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-28f81e7077bdf90288438b3e9d496645</data>
      <data key="v_content">youare,face-to-face...&quot;
&quot;Master, you are not strong enough!&quot;
&quot;I have strength enough...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-28f81e7077bdf90288438b3e9d496645</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5094">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-640867e055e5012ad34785847ee337a9</data>
      <data key="v_content">for this....&quot;
Harry felt as if Devil&apos;s Snare was rooting him to the spot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-640867e055e5012ad34785847ee337a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5095">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e948c372f4f82d244049fcf0cd4e0c56</data>
      <data key="v_content">hewatchedas,Petrified, he watched as Quirrell reached up and began to
unwrap his turban.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e948c372f4f82d244049fcf0cd4e0c56</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5096">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7f6296c43a23e868cb922340fb072a28</data>
      <data key="v_content">What was going on? The turban fell away.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7f6296c43a23e868cb922340fb072a28</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5097">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e9c2cc7166d14b89917aa4a95e754471</data>
      <data key="v_content">Quirrell&apos;s
head looked strangely small without it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e9c2cc7166d14b89917aa4a95e754471</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5098">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bc7a4008c83ffc505fd8c0a56b49d5d8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then he turned slowly on the
spot.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bc7a4008c83ffc505fd8c0a56b49d5d8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5099">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6932e5db078c9c359d434c1f0c357018</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Harry would have screamed, but he couldn&apos;t make a sound.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6932e5db078c9c359d434c1f0c357018</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5100">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-48cf3cff3aff8fd5e0fe306af97ec15e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Where there
should have been a back to Quirrell&apos;s head, there was a face, the most
terrible face Harry had ever seen.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-48cf3cff3aff8fd5e0fe306af97ec15e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5101">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b152641ee3227fa2be46d3363476472f</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was chalk white with glaring red
eyes and slits for nostrils, like a snake.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b152641ee3227fa2be46d3363476472f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5102">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9c7015682d8cde9d7db02d9cf66f2a14</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry tried to take a step backward but his legs wouldn&apos;t move.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9c7015682d8cde9d7db02d9cf66f2a14</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5103">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3701007dd557830cfb42b02a2b800b40</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;See what I have become?&quot; the face said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3701007dd557830cfb42b02a2b800b40</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5104">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-09bb842970a689ee5f037b4dea0fe16f</data>
      <data key="v_content">I
have form only when I can share another&apos;s body...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-09bb842970a689ee5f037b4dea0fe16f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5105">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-553895857a1161904f1139ded6f62af7</data>
      <data key="v_content">but there have always
been those willing to let me into their hearts and minds....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-553895857a1161904f1139ded6f62af7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5106">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9f2d3a17297779df2aae38e9d7863a0c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Unicorn
blood has strengthened me, these past weeks...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9f2d3a17297779df2aae38e9d7863a0c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5107">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7964f16b9f6997b8ba5f631091c8da45</data>
      <data key="v_content">you saw faithful Quirrell
drinking it for me in the forest...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7964f16b9f6997b8ba5f631091c8da45</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5108">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-83f7434f5d47239588e0a642499ee416</data>
      <data key="v_content">and once I have the Elixir of Life,
I will be able to create a body of my own....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-83f7434f5d47239588e0a642499ee416</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5109">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-066041fd45e78c238c2ff43d769aaebb</data>
      <data key="v_content">why don&apos;t you give
237
me that Stone in your pocket?&quot;
So he knew.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-066041fd45e78c238c2ff43d769aaebb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5110">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1bab757c14c1567776d4bf266a561ecc</data>
      <data key="v_content">The feeling suddenly surged back into Harry&apos;s legs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1bab757c14c1567776d4bf266a561ecc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5111">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5e03efeb44bd9f31acc084fc39fef640</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;,&quot;Don&apos;t be a fool,&quot; snarled the face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5e03efeb44bd9f31acc084fc39fef640</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5112">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e007770038c6ac139bdcca83bee8089b</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Better save your own life and join
me...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e007770038c6ac139bdcca83bee8089b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5113">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e6b1271b98e25e7bf0720b27bab5fa79</data>
      <data key="v_content">or you&apos;ll meet the same end as your parents....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e6b1271b98e25e7bf0720b27bab5fa79</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5114">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a7b41035a6ba8f1c1d9d64b3500afe3c</data>
      <data key="v_content">They died begging
me for mercy...&quot;
&quot;LIAR!&quot; Harry shouted suddenly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a7b41035a6ba8f1c1d9d64b3500afe3c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5115">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3315194259fd8834107ded8d21f78d05</data>
      <data key="v_content">Quirrell was walking backward at him, so that Voldemort could still see
him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3315194259fd8834107ded8d21f78d05</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5116">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-af431f7d5ffab8b20d04f0a6259b21cc</data>
      <data key="v_content">The evil face was now smiling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-af431f7d5ffab8b20d04f0a6259b21cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5117">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a27be7f84fd0759b4eee1bdbd88dc3b9</data>
      <data key="v_content">boy,yourparents,Yes, boy, your
parents were brave....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a27be7f84fd0759b4eee1bdbd88dc3b9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5118">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7f0cae8ca18a4c0400f91cdf04338112</data>
      <data key="v_content">I killed your father first; and he put up a
courageous fight...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7f0cae8ca18a4c0400f91cdf04338112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5119">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ce9ce9029f521a962dbf35be5da3a842</data>
      <data key="v_content">but your mother needn&apos;t have died...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ce9ce9029f521a962dbf35be5da3a842</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5120">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-57ce0f5a1bfea6f252945ac5b80f106b</data>
      <data key="v_content">she was trying
to protect you....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-57ce0f5a1bfea6f252945ac5b80f106b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5121">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7509ff92a7aef7f4bcfd17f7ef45789d</data>
      <data key="v_content">Now give me the Stone, unless you want her to have
died in vain.&quot;
&quot;NEVER!&quot;
Harry sprang toward the flame door, but Voldemort screamed &quot;SEIZE HIM!&quot;
and the next second, Harry felt Quirrell&apos;s hand close on his wrist.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7509ff92a7aef7f4bcfd17f7ef45789d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5122">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3c064dd3adab290b6e024875d8e22f75</data>
      <data key="v_content">aneedle-sharp,At
once, a needle-sharp pain seared across Harry&apos;s scar; his head felt as
though it was about to split in two; he yelled, struggling with all his
might, and to his surprise, Quirrell let go of him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3c064dd3adab290b6e024875d8e22f75</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5123">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-31b1a467616f1f987994387bec1c64ce</data>
      <data key="v_content">The pain in his head
lessened -- he looked around wildly to see where Quirrell had gone, and
saw him hunched in pain, looking at his fingers -- they were blistering
before his eyes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-31b1a467616f1f987994387bec1c64ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5124">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4873a092f0d0835df6df0b73962c5a6f</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Seize him! SEIZE HIM!&quot; shrieked Voldemort again, and Quirrell lunged,
knocking Harry clean off his feet&apos; landing on top of him, both hands
around Harry&apos;s neck -- Harry&apos;s scar was almost blinding him with pain,
yet he could see Quirrell howling in agony.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4873a092f0d0835df6df0b73962c5a6f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5125">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e2bea7587dd7bda9a0573d1a805765db</data>
      <data key="v_content">Icannothold,&quot;Master, I cannot hold him -- my hands -- my hands!&quot;
And Quirrell, though pinning Harry to the ground with his knees, let go
of his neck and stared, bewildered, at his own palms -- Harry could see
they looked burned, raw, red, and shiny.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e2bea7587dd7bda9a0573d1a805765db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5126">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c1541684ba1ffec677ec7953850c1952</data>
      <data key="v_content">fool,,&quot;Then kill him, fool, and be done!&quot; screeched Voldemort.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c1541684ba1ffec677ec7953850c1952</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5127">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2cc5c11e75a7c046065040ee9cf42325</data>
      <data key="v_content">238
Quirrell raised his hand to perform a deadly curse, but Harry, by
instinct, reached up and grabbed Quirrell&apos;s face --
&quot;AAAARGH!&quot;
Quirrell rolled off him, his face blistering, too, and then Harry knew:
Quirrell couldn&apos;t touch his bare skin, not without suffering terrible
pain -- his only chance was to keep hold of Quirrell, keep him in enough
pain to stop him from doing a curse.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2cc5c11e75a7c046065040ee9cf42325</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5128">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d9f0ac472fd39815b6dcc4b4c33f25d1</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry jumped to his feet, caught Quirrell by the arm, and hung on as
tight as he could.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d9f0ac472fd39815b6dcc4b4c33f25d1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5129">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2b5dcb19134843034bb6fff7c8171c3f</data>
      <data key="v_content">Quirrell screamed and tried to throw Harry off -- the
pain in Harry&apos;s head was building -- he couldn&apos;t see -- he could only
hear Quirrell&apos;s terrible shrieks and Voldemort&apos;s yells of, &quot;KILL HIM!
KILL HIM!&quot; and other voices, maybe in Harry&apos;s own head, crying, &quot;Harry!
Harry!&quot;
He felt Quirrell&apos;s arm wrenched from his grasp, knew all was lost, and
fell into blackness, down ...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2b5dcb19134843034bb6fff7c8171c3f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5130">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d1d7af861f38b23cff887a0262d6b722</data>
      <data key="v_content">Something gold was glinting just above him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d1d7af861f38b23cff887a0262d6b722</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5131">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-240b317b7ad979ed7b70712564fc770d</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Snitch! He tried to
catch it, but his arms were too heavy.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-240b317b7ad979ed7b70712564fc770d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5132">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-06b75442ad85445548eac055320a7c05</data>
      <data key="v_content">It wasn&apos;t the Snitch at all.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-06b75442ad85445548eac055320a7c05</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5133">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a1b8f386481707c3e5d1df39729ae3ce</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was a pair of glasses.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a1b8f386481707c3e5d1df39729ae3ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5134">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3b6cfcc70d345eeeeae37eb2931c2044</data>
      <data key="v_content">The smiling face of Albus Dumbledore swam into view
above him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3b6cfcc70d345eeeeae37eb2931c2044</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5135">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-34cf51f495b4dd142bbfbba85ef2b0d2</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then he
remembered: &quot;Sir! The Stone! It was Quirrell! He&apos;s got the Stone! Sir,
quick --&quot;
&quot;Calm yourself, dear boy, you are a little behind the times,&quot; said
Dumbledore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-34cf51f495b4dd142bbfbba85ef2b0d2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5136">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a60c15aa2192584b201db1629cbc9dc0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Quirrell does not have the Stone.&quot;
&quot;Then who does? Sir, I --&quot;
&quot;Harry, please relax, or Madam Pomfrey will have me thrown out.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a60c15aa2192584b201db1629cbc9dc0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5137">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e23a51fa8ff383e1054c237bab36bfcd</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry swallowed and looked around him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e23a51fa8ff383e1054c237bab36bfcd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5138">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-86b7c7bdf727845a15f638ee117ddfdb</data>
      <data key="v_content">He realized he must be in the
hospital wing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-86b7c7bdf727845a15f638ee117ddfdb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5139">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9110a4141495362e017d8f4c75d5e3af</data>
      <data key="v_content">He was lying in a bed with white linen sheets, and next
239
to him was a table piled high with what looked like half the candy shop.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9110a4141495362e017d8f4c75d5e3af</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5140">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0d398697e4878ff3d7d1dad137a23191</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Tokens from your friends and admirers,&quot; said Dumbledore, beaming.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0d398697e4878ff3d7d1dad137a23191</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5141">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-af571ea54e93cf591b6aef9279bf0cf8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What
happened down in the dungeons between you and Professor Quirrell is a
complete secret, so, naturally, the whole school knows.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-af571ea54e93cf591b6aef9279bf0cf8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5142">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-de2ada88b7111cc8c1078142a5d44a08</data>
      <data key="v_content">I believe your
friends Misters Fred and George Weasley were responsible for trying to
send you a toilet seat.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-de2ada88b7111cc8c1078142a5d44a08</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5143">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0133b27c0548bd0afdadaa804cda53ca</data>
      <data key="v_content">No doubt they thought it would amuse you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0133b27c0548bd0afdadaa804cda53ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5144">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d2e0ef635ccc93fe436f262d2f3833b8</data>
      <data key="v_content">however,felt,Madam
Pomfrey, however, felt it might not be very hygienic, and confiscated
it.&quot;
&quot;How long have I been in here?&quot;
&quot;Three days.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d2e0ef635ccc93fe436f262d2f3833b8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5145">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c36b7673d7bfa0a88f55b3dfc6aee08c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ronald Weasley and Miss Granger will be most relieved
you have come round, they have been extremely worried.&quot;
&quot;But sit, the Stone
I see you are not to be distracted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c36b7673d7bfa0a88f55b3dfc6aee08c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5146">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-36ae92bc26c4ff6c37e59f10df4184fe</data>
      <data key="v_content">Professor
Quirrell did not manage to take it from you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-36ae92bc26c4ff6c37e59f10df4184fe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5147">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b1b6c7c095dd920c45fd0e86518e46c6</data>
      <data key="v_content">I arrived in time to
prevent that, although you were doing very well on your own, I must say.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b1b6c7c095dd920c45fd0e86518e46c6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5148">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-612db04e93b06c893d8e257eee5dab7e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You got there? You got Hermione&apos;s owl?&quot;
&quot;We must have crossed in midair.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-612db04e93b06c893d8e257eee5dab7e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5149">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8dbb5546f3361219b0d3aef97d180d9a</data>
      <data key="v_content">No sooner had I reached London than it
became clear to me that the place I should be was the one I had just
left.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8dbb5546f3361219b0d3aef97d180d9a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5150">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7f845b4d8feddc1b59e1587c04faddc3</data>
      <data key="v_content">I arrived just in time to pull Quirrell off you.&quot;
&quot;It was you.&quot;
&quot;I feared I might be too late.&quot;
&quot;You nearly were, I couldn&apos;t have kept him off the Stone much longer --&quot;
&quot;Not the Stone, boy, you -- the effort involved nearly killed you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7f845b4d8feddc1b59e1587c04faddc3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5151">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2aafe2bd7ca48ad4250d8d575be42091</data>
      <data key="v_content">For
one terrible moment there, I was afraid it had.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2aafe2bd7ca48ad4250d8d575be42091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5152">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-33381cd225b988a4e8468649ec037203</data>
      <data key="v_content">,As for the Stone, it has
been destroyed.&quot;
&quot;Destroyed?&quot; said Harry blankly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-33381cd225b988a4e8468649ec037203</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5153">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-42866fa3fac7150cbeecbdd32cd6a35a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But your friend -- Nicolas Flamel --&quot;
&quot;Oh, you know about Nicolas?&quot; said Dumbledore, sounding quite delighted.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-42866fa3fac7150cbeecbdd32cd6a35a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5154">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-240e7c22cebec89de56aa525c02890f3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You did do the thing properly, didn&apos;t you? Well, Nicolas and I have had
a little chat, and agreed it&apos;s all for the best.&quot;
240
&quot;But that means he and his wife will die, won&apos;t they?&quot;
&quot;They have enough Elixir stored to set their affairs in order and then,
yes, they will die.&quot;
Dumbledore smiled at the look of amazement on Harry&apos;s face.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-240e7c22cebec89de56aa525c02890f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5155">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c6fdb9c348383087417ed760362744b1</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;To one as young as you, I&apos;m sure it seems incredible, but to Nicolas
and Perenelle, it really is like going to bed after a very, very long
day.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c6fdb9c348383087417ed760362744b1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5156">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5724465077180ecffe2ead8702820dd7</data>
      <data key="v_content">tothe,After all, to the well-organized mind, death is but the next great
adventure.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5724465077180ecffe2ead8702820dd7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5157">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a21941edaa8e9d513e552268286245b5</data>
      <data key="v_content">theStone,You know, the Stone was really not such a wonderful thing.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a21941edaa8e9d513e552268286245b5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5158">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f81333dd64f06e0117d129b75096daae</data>
      <data key="v_content">As
much money and life as you could want! The two things most human beings
would choose above all -- the trouble is, humans do have a knack of
choosing precisely those things that are worst for them.&quot; Harry lay
there, lost for words.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f81333dd64f06e0117d129b75096daae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5159">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ccbf1366265706894e53d32b0686642a</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dumbledore hummed a little and smiled at the
ceiling.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ccbf1366265706894e53d32b0686642a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5160">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-f5ab861308e98d7b7a74356c516f43ba</data>
      <data key="v_content">sir -- even if the Stone&apos;s
gone, Vol-, I mean, You-Know- Who --&quot;
&quot;Call him Voldemort, Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-f5ab861308e98d7b7a74356c516f43ba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5161">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-943b4e877f8780abd498526d880b7fba</data>
      <data key="v_content">Always use the proper name for things.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-943b4e877f8780abd498526d880b7fba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5162">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1051fc2d15828215855fd05f3e20e882</data>
      <data key="v_content">Fear
of a name increases fear of the thing itself.&quot;
&quot;Yes, sir.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1051fc2d15828215855fd05f3e20e882</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5163">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-836dcee68ba0d295bf9bc4f0d1959099</data>
      <data key="v_content">Voldemort&apos;sgoingto,Well, Voldemort&apos;s going to try other ways of coming back,
isn&apos;t he? I mean, he hasn&apos;t gone, has he?&quot;
&quot;No, Harry, he has not.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-836dcee68ba0d295bf9bc4f0d1959099</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5164">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3b99f4200df86e74f83ac9082354a26b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He is still out there somewhere, perhaps looking
for another body to share...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3b99f4200df86e74f83ac9082354a26b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5165">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-97fb849cd8920609d02ebcb115c5e83f</data>
      <data key="v_content">,not being truly alive, he cannot be killed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-97fb849cd8920609d02ebcb115c5e83f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5166">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d18862a129183c131294b6277ab5800b</data>
      <data key="v_content">He left Quirrell to die; he shows just as little mercy to his followers
as his enemies.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d18862a129183c131294b6277ab5800b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5167">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c6a166de9d28578745fe4b216b3ae610</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry,whileyou,Nevertheless, Harry, while you may only have delayed his
return to power, it will merely take someone else who is prepared to
fight what seems a losing battle next time -- and if he is delayed
again, and again, why, he may never return to power.&quot;
Harry nodded, but stopped quickly, because it made his head hurt.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c6a166de9d28578745fe4b216b3ae610</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5168">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b0a4d463ffaa6e5f06cb1d49442761dd</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Sir,,Then
he said, &quot;Sir, there are some other things I&apos;d like to know, if you can
tell me...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b0a4d463ffaa6e5f06cb1d49442761dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5169">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2f7b6d55df990099067caaaa7da9a414</data>
      <data key="v_content">things I want to know the truth about....&quot;
&quot;The truth.&quot; Dumbledore sighed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2f7b6d55df990099067caaaa7da9a414</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5170">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5deca0e9d16f3d278615e8e0bd8ba0b7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It is a beautiful and terrible thing,
and should therefore be treated with great caution.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5deca0e9d16f3d278615e8e0bd8ba0b7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5171">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8aa5a19d8cc5e1c2f7a7ec1f0062da4e</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ishallanswer,However, I shall
answer your questions unless I have a very good reason not to, in which
case I beg you&apos;ll forgive me.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8aa5a19d8cc5e1c2f7a7ec1f0062da4e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5172">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-59fb6b8da1be3f2dd202ff746b8f84b2</data>
      <data key="v_content">of,I shall not, of course, lie.&quot;
241
&quot;Well...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-59fb6b8da1be3f2dd202ff746b8f84b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5173">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b4bda12fcacbf58ab6b3a1dc864323a2</data>
      <data key="v_content">Voldemort said that he only killed my mother because she tried
to stop him from killing me.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b4bda12fcacbf58ab6b3a1dc864323a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5174">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-481614dd738babd708f4ee83cfc8ad79</data>
      <data key="v_content">But why would he want to kill me in the
first place?&quot;
Dumbledore sighed very deeply this time.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-481614dd738babd708f4ee83cfc8ad79</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5175">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-db2c18235a795079f06a071cc922eb6e</data>
      <data key="v_content">thefirstthing,&quot;Alas, the first thing you ask me, I cannot tell you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-db2c18235a795079f06a071cc922eb6e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5176">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c8a45d695a9bde0c09c50717509cecb3</data>
      <data key="v_content">put it from your mind for now, Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c8a45d695a9bde0c09c50717509cecb3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5177">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9735a4677a30dbba787bf90a87a30554</data>
      <data key="v_content">I know you hate to hear this...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9735a4677a30dbba787bf90a87a30554</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5178">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-272661d124ceb38b8b2059cc4c48bec2</data>
      <data key="v_content">,when you are
ready, you will know.&quot;
And Harry knew it would be no good to argue.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-272661d124ceb38b8b2059cc4c48bec2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5179">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0c2ce50ddb46fc29e398dadb4f390ec5</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But why couldn&apos;t Quirrell touch me?&quot;
&quot;Your mother died to save you.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0c2ce50ddb46fc29e398dadb4f390ec5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5180">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dba7efb440af496ede575d500661201f</data>
      <data key="v_content">If there is one thing Voldemort cannot
understand, it is love.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dba7efb440af496ede575d500661201f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5181">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-668902a72df8d7ff1304057b42feadf8</data>
      <data key="v_content">He didn&apos;t realize that love as powerful as your
mother&apos;s for you leaves its own mark.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-668902a72df8d7ff1304057b42feadf8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5182">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e9addeabb53ac8ff067a471d689f8553</data>
      <data key="v_content">no,Not a scar, no visible sign...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e9addeabb53ac8ff067a471d689f8553</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5183">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-de886c9b5bae653b4fe4e6e0091489c2</data>
      <data key="v_content">to
have been loved so deeply, even though the person who loved us is gone,
will give us some protection forever.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-de886c9b5bae653b4fe4e6e0091489c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5184">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e181eacbb2d9622c47caf4c6995ea78d</data>
      <data key="v_content">It is in your very skin.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e181eacbb2d9622c47caf4c6995ea78d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5185">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9cbd6db3c147aa09828f3523f52b3da2</data>
      <data key="v_content">fullofhatred,,Quirrell,
full of hatred, greed, and ambition, sharing his soul with Voldemort,
could not touch you for this reason.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9cbd6db3c147aa09828f3523f52b3da2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5186">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-920f41837c30287092f4eb9c2dd75066</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was agony to touch a person
marked by something so good.&quot;
Dumbledore now became very interested in a bird out on the windowsill,
which gave Harry time to dry his eyes on the sheet.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-920f41837c30287092f4eb9c2dd75066</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5187">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3216d28cd7c0f02157a2e4d4612ce3bd</data>
      <data key="v_content">When he had found
his voice again, Harry said, &quot;And the invisibility cloak - do you know
who sent it to me?&quot;
&quot;Ah - your father happened to leave it in my possession, and I thought
you might like it.&quot; Dumbledore&apos;s eyes twinkled.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3216d28cd7c0f02157a2e4d4612ce3bd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5188">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-05a2f7918a6c1ed8d837b408a899272a</data>
      <data key="v_content">your
father used it mainly for sneaking off to the kitchens to steal food
when he was here.&quot;
&quot;And there&apos;s something else...&quot;
&quot;Fire away.&quot;
&quot;Quirrell said Snape --&quot;
&quot;Professor Snape, Harry.&quot; &quot;Yes, him -- Quirrell said he hates me because
he hated my father.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-05a2f7918a6c1ed8d837b408a899272a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5189">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-caa51efcbd73ff9fba7924b0c692da15</data>
      <data key="v_content">Is that true?&quot;
242
&quot;Well, they did rather detest each other.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-caa51efcbd73ff9fba7924b0c692da15</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5190">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e2244918f1c64b2ae92f491448b5453c</data>
      <data key="v_content">yourfather,And then, your father did something Snape could never forgive.&quot;
&quot;What?&quot;
&quot;He saved his life.&quot;
&quot;What?&quot;
&quot;Yes...&quot; said Dumbledore dreamily.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e2244918f1c64b2ae92f491448b5453c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5191">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-064b2d7a877d642758212da54af660f1</data>
      <data key="v_content">thewaypeople&apos;s,&quot;Funny, the way people&apos;s minds work,
isn&apos;t it? Professor Snape couldn&apos;t bear being in your father&apos;s debt....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-064b2d7a877d642758212da54af660f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5192">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1979a6730c3142935a7e73e18fa24bb4</data>
      <data key="v_content">I do believe he worked so hard to protect you this year because he felt
that would make him and your father even.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1979a6730c3142935a7e73e18fa24bb4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5193">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b06ad3ed24e9e16d01114a3ddee0a2aa</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then he could go back to
hating your father&apos;s memory in peace....&quot;
Harry tried to understand this but it made his head pound, so he
stopped.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b06ad3ed24e9e16d01114a3ddee0a2aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5194">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d8d93007c71f0abcf6b16940fb08894b</data>
      <data key="v_content">there&apos;sone,&quot;And sir, there&apos;s one more thing...&quot;
&quot;Just the one?&quot;
&quot;How did I get the Stone out of the mirror?&quot;
&quot;Ah, now, I&apos;m glad you asked me that.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d8d93007c71f0abcf6b16940fb08894b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5195">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-058c7a04c81c1a198d6084c4b9bdf4e2</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was one of my more brilliant
ideas, and between you and me, that&apos;s saying something.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-058c7a04c81c1a198d6084c4b9bdf4e2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5196">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1bc1f0efceec541a878e409f158a51bf</data>
      <data key="v_content">onlyone,You see, only
one who wanted to find the Stone -- find it, but not use it -- would be
able to get it, otherwise they&apos;d just see themselves making gold or
drinking Elixir of Life.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1bc1f0efceec541a878e409f158a51bf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5197">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6659d537e494ca442b044f48ad00f589</data>
      <data key="v_content">My brain surprises even me sometimes....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6659d537e494ca442b044f48ad00f589</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5198">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0be73c9ea6ac0e44257740d409a86744</data>
      <data key="v_content">I suggest you make a start on these sweets.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0be73c9ea6ac0e44257740d409a86744</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5199">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-e0c4ce0913f1c9c07ba89970f3866f5c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ah! Bettie
Bott&apos;s Every Flavor Beans! I was unfortunate enough in my youth to come
across a vomitflavored one, and since then I&apos;m afraid I&apos;ve rather lost
my liking for them -- but I think I&apos;ll be safe with a nice toffee, don&apos;t
you?&quot;
He smiled and popped the golden-brown bean into his mouth.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-e0c4ce0913f1c9c07ba89970f3866f5c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5200">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ca76fea8ce7fd6c24e88d89d00237171</data>
      <data key="v_content">Then he
choked and said, &quot;Alas! Ear wax!&quot;
Madam Pomfrey, the nurse, was a nice woman, but very strict.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ca76fea8ce7fd6c24e88d89d00237171</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5201">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-faa19f43560d5c18d3b2fedc12c2cadc</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Absolutely not.&quot;
243
&quot;You let Professor Dumbledore in...&quot;
&quot;Well, of course, that was the headmaster, quite different.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-faa19f43560d5c18d3b2fedc12c2cadc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5202">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d81c358e33fd0814cae83ca5ea09e90a</data>
      <data key="v_content">You need
rest.&quot;
&quot;I am resting, look, lying down and everything.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-d81c358e33fd0814cae83ca5ea09e90a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5203">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bfb7619e95abf91e93ca635d370dc5f7</data>
      <data key="v_content">goon,Madam,Oh, go on, Madam
Pomfrey...&quot;
&quot;Oh, very well,&quot; she said.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bfb7619e95abf91e93ca635d370dc5f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5204">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b8d67f4ee05a3a193100a521019fb5a2</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;But five minutes only.&quot;
And she let Ron and Hermione in.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b8d67f4ee05a3a193100a521019fb5a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5205">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-9ea00505e7b685f100f467e9c3db339a</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Harry!&quot;
Hermione looked ready to fling her arms around him again, but Harry was
glad she held herself in as his head was still very sore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-9ea00505e7b685f100f467e9c3db339a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5206">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-71587934a8223be86f8b6451f0f41531</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry,wewere,&quot;Oh, Harry, we were sure you were going to -- Dumbledore was so worried
--&quot;
&quot;The whole school&apos;s talking about it,&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-71587934a8223be86f8b6451f0f41531</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5207">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-27d0649535f366c7bc37fa9eabaedcce</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;What really happened?&quot;
It was one of those rare occasions when the true story is even more
strange and exciting than the wild rumors.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-27d0649535f366c7bc37fa9eabaedcce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5208">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bc5b2add9e671679754e90bee3d725e3</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry told them everything:
Quirrell; the mirror; the Stone; and Voldemort.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bc5b2add9e671679754e90bee3d725e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5209">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1396f373d3040aa556985a627363be30</data>
      <data key="v_content">Ron and Hermione were a
very good audience; they gasped in all the right places, and when Harry
told them what was under Quirrell&apos;s turban, Hermione screamed out loud.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1396f373d3040aa556985a627363be30</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5210">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-b9c912ac55b8ebd2e98c5829db6f5851</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So the Stone&apos;s gone?&quot; said Ron finally.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-b9c912ac55b8ebd2e98c5829db6f5851</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5211">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5931c74087ad178765f535544a44a085</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Flamel&apos;s just going to die?&quot;
&quot;That&apos;s what I said, but Dumbledore thinks that -- what was it? -- &apos;to
the well-organized mind, death is but the next great adventure.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5931c74087ad178765f535544a44a085</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5212">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4e6b9f3e948f8f2d426c641e263cffb7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I always said he was off his rocker,&quot; said Ron, looking quite impressed
at how crazy his hero was.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4e6b9f3e948f8f2d426c641e263cffb7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5213">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-dd56ba234416a47345fc281560d62a65</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;So what happened to you two?&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-dd56ba234416a47345fc281560d62a65</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5214">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-db67db04b499fc9c0848095dc29f92d8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Igotback,&quot;Well, I got back all right,&quot; said Hermione.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-db67db04b499fc9c0848095dc29f92d8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5215">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-775b5e266ad6fa5cb0f8e5d12bfc77f8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I brought Ron round --
that took a while -- and we were dashing up to the owlery to contact
Dumbledore when we met him in the entrance hall -- he already knew -- he
just said, &apos;Harry&apos;s gone after him, hasn&apos;t he?&apos; and hurtled off to the
244
third floor.&quot;
&quot;D&apos;you think he meant you to do it?&quot; said Ron.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-775b5e266ad6fa5cb0f8e5d12bfc77f8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5216">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c69211df7389b37f06ff1a41c99912e7</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Sending you your
father&apos;s cloak and everything?&quot;
&quot;Well, &quot; Hermione exploded, &quot;if he did -- I mean to say that&apos;s terrible
-- you could have been killed.&quot;
&quot;No, it isn&apos;t,&quot; said Harry thoughtfully.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c69211df7389b37f06ff1a41c99912e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5217">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c4940219940e95885fde78f030f255c6</data>
      <data key="v_content">I think he sort of wanted to give me a chance.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c4940219940e95885fde78f030f255c6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5218">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-84cc213738fb02d7a187955debabc767</data>
      <data key="v_content">I think he knows more or
less everything that goes on here, you know.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-84cc213738fb02d7a187955debabc767</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5219">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-270fadf4747bb90789fd2085fda20c37</data>
      <data key="v_content">I reckon he had a pretty
good idea we were going to try, and instead of stopping us, he just
taught us enough to help.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-270fadf4747bb90789fd2085fda20c37</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5220">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3d229d83861ee45915d55c53735f407d</data>
      <data key="v_content">I don&apos;t think it was an accident he let me
find out how the mirror worked.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3d229d83861ee45915d55c53735f407d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5221">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fa253784759350c085fe13236022dcaf</data>
      <data key="v_content">It&apos;s almost like he thought I had the
right to face Voldemort if I could....&quot;
&quot;Yeah, Dumbledore&apos;s off his rocker, all right,&quot; said Ron proudly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fa253784759350c085fe13236022dcaf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5222">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-4fc284fa366325c69163b7299034d50a</data>
      <data key="v_content">you&apos;vegotto,&quot;Listen, you&apos;ve got to be up for the end-of-year feast tomorrow.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-4fc284fa366325c69163b7299034d50a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5223">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-842f174230c784dfec2159aec9c94c95</data>
      <data key="v_content">The
points are all in and Slytherin won, of course -- you missed the last
Quidditch match, we were steamrollered by Ravenclaw without you -- but
the food&apos;ll be good.&quot;
At that moment, Madam Pomfrey bustled over.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-842f174230c784dfec2159aec9c94c95</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5224">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-8c9f0fde000ea0826584c850fcef48c8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;You&apos;ve had nearly fifteen minutes, now OUT&quot; she said firmly.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-8c9f0fde000ea0826584c850fcef48c8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5225">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-aab84248cb4bd5d5df15522de695c2a6</data>
      <data key="v_content">After a good night&apos;s sleep, Harry felt nearly back to normal.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-aab84248cb4bd5d5df15522de695c2a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5226">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c5e55c32d7be97b45ffc54dc3b7e7abf</data>
      <data key="v_content">I want to go to the feast,&quot; he told Madam Pomfrey as she straightened
his many candy boxes.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c5e55c32d7be97b45ffc54dc3b7e7abf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5227">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1b918b26e1f8a11db89356a38963662c</data>
      <data key="v_content">can&apos;tI?&quot;,I can, can&apos;t I?&quot;
&quot;Professor Dumbledore says you are to be allowed to go,&quot; she said
stiffily, as though in her opinion Professor Dumbledore didn&apos;t realize
how risky feasts could be.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1b918b26e1f8a11db89356a38963662c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5228">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-081a500231249f25406d9c246dbca5b3</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And you have another visitor.&quot;
&quot;Oh, good,&quot; said Harry.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-081a500231249f25406d9c246dbca5b3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5229">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-37ad32c1c38ba580f6ea24f9c501b7a4</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Who is it?&quot;
Hagrid sidled through the door as he spoke.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-37ad32c1c38ba580f6ea24f9c501b7a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5230">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ecccca966ebc11443c9be96100810498</data>
      <data key="v_content">As usual when he was
indoors, Hagrid looked too big to be allowed.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ecccca966ebc11443c9be96100810498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5231">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-ef9baf2985153c60e0b7bc9701e67bbd</data>
      <data key="v_content">He sat down next to Harry,
took one look at him, and burst into tears.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-ef9baf2985153c60e0b7bc9701e67bbd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5232">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-bb30af1e6b6d49b707042c82d99f1d2e</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;It&apos;s -- all -- my -- ruddy -- fault!&quot; he sobbed, his face in his hands.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-bb30af1e6b6d49b707042c82d99f1d2e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5233">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-20a64241ff25679abd5cf8be320c9133</data>
      <data key="v_content">I told the evil git how ter get past Fluffy! I told him! It was the only
245
thing he didn&apos;t know, an&apos; I told him! Yeh could&apos;ve died! All fer a
dragon egg! I&apos;ll never drink again! I should be chucked out an&apos; made ter
live as a Muggle!&quot;
&quot;Hagrid!&quot; said Harry, shocked to see Hagrid shaking with grief and
remorse, great tears leaking down into his beard.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-20a64241ff25679abd5cf8be320c9133</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5234">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7e7176937ec2ad4b967d4a55b9112418</data>
      <data key="v_content">he&apos;dhavefound,&quot;Hagrid, he&apos;d have
found out somehow, this is Voldemort we&apos;re talking about, he&apos;d have
found out even if you hadn&apos;t told him.&quot;
&quot;Yeh could&apos;ve died!&quot; sobbed Hagrid.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7e7176937ec2ad4b967d4a55b9112418</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5235">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-63a610ce09d84dfb8308fc3b7b7898c0</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;An&apos; don&apos; say the name!&quot;
&quot;VOLDEMORT!&quot; Harry bellowed, and Hagrid was so shocked, he stopped
crying.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-63a610ce09d84dfb8308fc3b7b7898c0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5236">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-fe10c94e771fea0c00da84489ddd8cd8</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;I&apos;ve met him and I&apos;m calling him by his name.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-fe10c94e771fea0c00da84489ddd8cd8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5237">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a05c4fc4aab1ef2019b66ba4a0cc3424</data>
      <data key="v_content">Hagrid,,Please cheer up,
Hagrid, we saved the Stone, it&apos;s gone, he can&apos;t use it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a05c4fc4aab1ef2019b66ba4a0cc3424</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5238">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-95c715e099580d4f26db939dbe38c1f1</data>
      <data key="v_content">,Have a Chocolate
Frog, I&apos;ve got loads....&quot;
Hagrid wiped his nose on the back of his hand and said, &quot;That reminds
me.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-95c715e099580d4f26db939dbe38c1f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5239">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0e2fbd313cbf39bc35269f9dd3e00395</data>
      <data key="v_content">I&apos;ve got yeh a present.&quot;
&quot;It&apos;s not a stoat sandwich, is it?&quot; said Harry anxiously, and at last
Hagrid gave a weak chuckle.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0e2fbd313cbf39bc35269f9dd3e00395</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5240">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-2a4d521a62a7ba3ba39f091b8a1cea8c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Dumbledore gave me the day off
yesterday ter fix it.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-2a4d521a62a7ba3ba39f091b8a1cea8c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5241">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1677ad0e039427c694034e203d6de0c1</data>
      <data key="v_content">heshouldasacked,&apos;Course, he shoulda sacked me instead -- anyway,
got yeh this...&quot;
It seemed to be a handsome, leather-covered book.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1677ad0e039427c694034e203d6de0c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5242">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6908a50df8f4f52ad4db003ab3083de1</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was full of wizard photographs.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6908a50df8f4f52ad4db003ab3083de1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5243">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-58ed161f3b9c01481d9ce1754d58ed65</data>
      <data key="v_content">Smiling and waving at him
from every page were his mother and father.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-58ed161f3b9c01481d9ce1754d58ed65</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5244">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-859dadf1857a0739629db81d30cec818</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Sent owls off ter all yer parents&apos; old school friends, askin&apos; fer
photos...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-859dadf1857a0739629db81d30cec818</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5245">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-09b39c15c2e07afe134a1e017d393bbc</data>
      <data key="v_content">d&apos;yeh like it?&quot;
Harry couldn&apos;t speak, but Hagrid understood.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-09b39c15c2e07afe134a1e017d393bbc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5246">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-6d7b0825876aa6d4e79531b8ebdf9b14</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry made his way down to the end-of-year feast alone that night.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-6d7b0825876aa6d4e79531b8ebdf9b14</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5247">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5eb8f9f5aca599ffc815d99e90800f9</data>
      <data key="v_content">He
had been held up by Madam Pomfrey&apos;s fussing about, insisting on giving
him one last checkup, so the Great Hall was already full.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5eb8f9f5aca599ffc815d99e90800f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5248">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-1aef868fd8b0b3d5a2c20417bd8e2450</data>
      <data key="v_content">It was decked
out in the Slytherin colors of green and silver to celebrate Slytherin&apos;s
winning the house cup for the seventh year in a row.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-1aef868fd8b0b3d5a2c20417bd8e2450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5249">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-51d79e15fef3efddf96a93f334c24208</data>
      <data key="v_content">A huge banner
showing the Slytherin serpent covered the wall behind the High Table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-51d79e15fef3efddf96a93f334c24208</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5250">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-5424c2a6f697171dd3c5228e2d348d77</data>
      <data key="v_content">When Harry walked in there was a sudden hush, and then everybody started
talking loudly at once.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-5424c2a6f697171dd3c5228e2d348d77</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5251">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c792644e90ddec2105fb7f67005e0c15</data>
      <data key="v_content">He slipped into a seat between Ron and Hermione
at the Gryffindor table and tried to ignore the fact that people were
246
standing up to look at him.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c792644e90ddec2105fb7f67005e0c15</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5252">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-48a9e6ea2ff74f47f485e162d61b3773</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;Another year gone!&quot; Dumbledore said cheerfully.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-48a9e6ea2ff74f47f485e162d61b3773</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5253">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-76650b21d30017df56e429630104ec27</data>
      <data key="v_content">&quot;And I must trouble you
with an old man&apos;s wheezing waffle before we sink our teeth into our
delicious feast.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-76650b21d30017df56e429630104ec27</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5254">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-91e07ca2c3b5c0f611ecfbe3930c9a29</data>
      <data key="v_content">What a year it has been! Hopefully your heads are all a
little fuller than they were...</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-91e07ca2c3b5c0f611ecfbe3930c9a29</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5255">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-7a2c17d31d46388fe9deb84459112fbc</data>
      <data key="v_content">you have the whole summer ahead to get
them nice and empty before next year starts....</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-7a2c17d31d46388fe9deb84459112fbc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5256">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-c021fd56e4cc8f87ffe1f8154e52e317</data>
      <data key="v_content">asIunderstand,&quot;Now, as I understand it, the house cup here needs awarding, and the
points stand thus: In fourth place, Gryffindor, with three hundred and
twelve points; in third, Hufflepuff, with three hundred and fifty-two;
Ravenclaw has four hundred and twenty-six and Slytherin, four hundred
and seventy- two.&quot;
A storm of cheering and stamping broke out from the Slytherin table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-c021fd56e4cc8f87ffe1f8154e52e317</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5257">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-0d705c0428c1e288c240912445f72d3c</data>
      <data key="v_content">Harry could see Draco Malfoy banging his goblet on the table.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-0d705c0428c1e288c240912445f72d3c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5258">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-3977e9a941d84aa24aeacae34b1c1ec8</data>
      <data key="v_content">Yes,welldone,,&quot;Yes, Yes, well done, Slytherin,&quot; said Dumbledore.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-3977e9a941d84aa24aeacae34b1c1ec8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5259">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-a5924dbbe1ff51ffa098b430b901c367</data>
      <data key="v_content">recenteventsmust,&quot;However, recent
events must be taken into account.&quot;
The room went very still.</data>
      <data key="v_name">chunk-a5924dbbe1ff51ffa098b430b901c367</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n5260">
      <data key="v_hash_id">chunk-d7fa4fdb2e59d48fe72b2dc960f84555</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Slytherins&apos; smiles faded a little.</data>
