    <node id="n5981">
      <data key="v_hash_id">summary-c08ade88c4851d26de8fe43e345d01ab</data>
      <data key="v_content">### Summary: Chapter Twelve

#### Title: Chapter Twelve  
#### Author: J.K. Rowling  
#### Setting:
- The story takes place during the Christmas season.
- It is set in a cozy, festive atmosphere.

#### Festive Atmosphere:
- The walls are adorned with holly and mistletoe, creating an enchanting winter wonderland setting.
- Twelve towering Christmas trees stand tall, each one filled with icicles and candles, adding to the magical ambiance.

#### Characters Involved</data>
      <data key="v_name">summary-c08ade88c4851d26de8fe43e345d01ab</data>
    </node>
