      <data key="v_hash_id">summary-b9602ef39c77f34a8cf1f0f1d00fb850</data>
      <data key="v_content">The passage describes a scenario involving a small village near a lake. The main characters are John, a farmer, and his daughter Sarah. An unknown stranger arrives at the farm, claiming to have discovered a magical map buried beneath the lake. This discovery leads them to a hidden cave filled with valuable treasures.

They set out on a quest to retrieve these treasures, facing various obstacles such as navigating through treacherous terrain and overcoming supernatural challenges. Along the way, they encounter other villagers who assist them or pose</data>
      <data key="v_name">summary-b9602ef39c77f34a8cf1f0f1d00fb850</data>
